// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — 國中小基礎2000字
window.J_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"Months / Days / Time Units / Seasons (月份/星期/時間單位/季節)","cards":[{"w":"January","p":"n.","d":"the first month of the year","c":"一月","s":"My family always visits my grandparents in January because we celebrate New Year together and eat a big dinner.","t":"我家總是在一月拜訪我的祖父母，因為我們會一起慶祝新年並吃一頓豐盛的晚餐。"},{"w":"February","p":"n.","d":"the second month of the year","c":"二月","s":"Valentine's Day falls in February, so my brother always buys flowers for his girlfriend that month.","t":"情人節在二月，所以我哥哥那個月總是會買花給他的女朋友。"},{"w":"March","p":"n.","d":"the third month of the year","c":"三月","s":"The weather starts to get warmer in March, so people begin to take off their heavy winter coats.","t":"天氣在三月開始變暖，所以人們開始脫掉他們厚重的冬天大衣。"},{"w":"April","p":"n.","d":"the fourth month of the year","c":"四月","s":"It often rains a lot in April, so I always carry an umbrella with me when I leave home.","t":"四月常常下很多雨，所以我離家時總是隨身帶著一把雨傘。"},{"w":"May","p":"n.","d":"the fifth month of the year","c":"五月","s":"School trips are usually planned for May because the weather is nice and not too hot yet.","t":"校外教學通常安排在五月，因為天氣很好而且還不會太熱。"},{"w":"June","p":"n.","d":"the sixth month of the year","c":"六月","s":"Most students in Taiwan finish their final exams in June and then start their long summer vacation.","t":"台灣大部分的學生在六月考完期末考，然後就開始放他們的長暑假。"},{"w":"July","p":"n.","d":"the seventh month of the year","c":"七月","s":"My family usually goes to the beach in July because the weather is hot and the water feels great.","t":"我家通常在七月去海邊，因為天氣很熱，海水感覺很棒。"},{"w":"August","p":"n.","d":"the eighth month of the year","c":"八月","s":"Many typhoons hit Taiwan in August, so people often need to prepare food and water at home.","t":"許多颱風在八月侵襲台灣，所以人們常常需要在家準備食物和水。"},{"w":"September","p":"n.","d":"the ninth month of the year","c":"九月","s":"The new school year starts in September, so students need to buy new books and uniforms.","t":"新學年在九月開始，所以學生們需要買新的書和制服。"},{"w":"October","p":"n.","d":"the tenth month of the year","c":"十月","s":"The weather becomes cool and comfortable in October, which makes it a great time for outdoor activities.","t":"天氣在十月變得涼爽又舒適，這讓它成為從事戶外活動的好時機。"},{"w":"November","p":"n.","d":"the eleventh month of the year","c":"十一月","s":"My uncle's birthday is in November, so we always plan a small party for him near the end of that month.","t":"我叔叔的生日在十一月，所以我們總是在那個月底為他計劃一個小派對。"},{"w":"December","p":"n.","d":"the twelfth month of the year","c":"十二月","s":"Many shops put up colorful lights and decorations in December to celebrate Christmas with their customers.","t":"許多商店在十二月掛上色彩鮮豔的燈飾和裝飾品，來和顧客一起慶祝聖誕節。"},{"w":"Sunday","p":"n.","d":"the first day of the week","c":"星期日","s":"My whole family stays home and relaxes together on Sunday before a new busy week begins.","t":"在新的忙碌一週開始之前，我全家人會在星期日待在家裡一起放鬆。"},{"w":"Monday","p":"n.","d":"the day after Sunday","c":"星期一","s":"I always feel a little tired on Monday because the weekend break is already over.","t":"我在星期一總是覺得有點累，因為週末的假期已經結束了。"},{"w":"Tuesday","p":"n.","d":"the day after Monday","c":"星期二","s":"Our English class meets every Tuesday afternoon, so I need to bring my textbook on that day.","t":"我們的英文課每星期二下午上課，所以我那天需要帶課本。"},{"w":"Wednesday","p":"n.","d":"the day after Tuesday","c":"星期三","s":"The school cafeteria usually serves noodles on Wednesday, which is one of my favorite lunches.","t":"學校餐廳通常在星期三供應麵食，那是我最喜歡的午餐之一。"},{"w":"Thursday","p":"n.","d":"the day after Wednesday","c":"星期四","s":"My basketball practice is held every Thursday evening, right after I finish my homework.","t":"我的籃球練習在每星期四晚上舉行，就在我做完功課之後。"},{"w":"Friday","p":"n.","d":"the day after Thursday","c":"星期五","s":"Everyone in my class feels excited on Friday because the weekend is finally about to start.","t":"我班上每個人在星期五都感到很興奮，因為週末終於要開始了。"},{"w":"Saturday","p":"n.","d":"the last day of the week","c":"星期六","s":"My parents take me to visit my grandmother every Saturday morning before we eat lunch together.","t":"我父母每星期六早上都會帶我去拜訪我的奶奶，然後我們再一起吃午餐。"},{"w":"week","p":"n.","d":"a period of seven days","c":"星期；週","s":"We have an English test every week, so I need to study a little bit every single day.","t":"我們每星期都有一次英文考試，所以我每一天都需要稍微讀一點書。"},{"w":"weekday","p":"n.","d":"any day except Saturday and Sunday","c":"平日；週間","s":"I usually wake up at six thirty on a weekday because my first class starts very early.","t":"我平日通常六點半起床，因為我的第一堂課開始得很早。"},{"w":"weekend","p":"n.","d":"Saturday and Sunday","c":"週末","s":"My family often goes hiking together on the weekend when the weather is sunny and clear.","t":"我家人常常在天氣晴朗的週末一起去爬山。"},{"w":"season","p":"n.","d":"one of the four parts of the year","c":"季節","s":"Summer is my favorite season because I can go swimming and eat cold desserts every day.","t":"夏天是我最喜歡的季節，因為我可以每天去游泳並吃冰涼的甜點。"},{"w":"spring","p":"n.","d":"the season after winter, when plants grow","c":"春天","s":"Many beautiful flowers start to bloom in spring, which makes the whole park look colorful and lively.","t":"許多美麗的花朵在春天開始綻放，這讓整個公園看起來色彩繽紛又生氣勃勃。"},{"w":"summer","p":"n.","d":"the warmest season of the year","c":"夏天","s":"The weather gets extremely hot in summer, so most people turn on their air conditioners all day.","t":"天氣在夏天變得非常炎熱，所以大部分的人整天都開著冷氣。"},{"w":"autumn","p":"n.","d":"the season after summer, before winter","c":"秋天","s":"The leaves on the trees turn yellow and red in autumn before they slowly fall to the ground.","t":"樹上的葉子在秋天會變成黃色和紅色，然後才慢慢掉落到地上。"},{"w":"winter","p":"n.","d":"the coldest season of the year","c":"冬天","s":"It gets very cold in winter, so we need to wear thick coats and warm gloves outside.","t":"天氣在冬天變得非常冷，所以我們在外面需要穿厚重的大衣和溫暖的手套。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"Weather & Climate (天氣與氣候)","cards":[{"w":"weather","p":"n.","d":"the condition of the sky and temperature outside","c":"天氣","s":"The weather has been changing a lot recently, so I always check my phone before leaving for school.","t":"天氣最近變化很大，所以我出門上學前總是會看一下手機。"},{"w":"climate","p":"n.","d":"the usual weather pattern of a place over many years","c":"氣候","s":"Taiwan has a warm, humid climate, which is why so many tropical fruits grow well here all year.","t":"台灣擁有溫暖潮濕的氣候，這就是為什麼這裡整年都能種出許多熱帶水果。"},{"w":"temperature","p":"n.","d":"how hot or cold something is","c":"溫度","s":"The temperature dropped suddenly last night, so I had to find an extra blanket before going to sleep.","t":"昨晚溫度突然下降，所以我睡前必須找一條額外的毯子。"},{"w":"air","p":"n.","d":"the mixture of gases we breathe","c":"空氣","s":"The air felt fresh and clean after the rain, so we decided to take a long walk outside.","t":"雨後的空氣感覺清新乾淨，所以我們決定到外面散一段長長的步。"},{"w":"typhoon","p":"n.","d":"a very strong storm with heavy rain and wind","c":"颱風","s":"A strong typhoon is expected to hit Taiwan this weekend, so schools may be closed on Monday.","t":"一個強烈的颱風預計這個週末會侵襲台灣，所以星期一學校可能會停課。"},{"w":"lightning","p":"n.","d":"a sudden bright flash of light in a storm","c":"閃電","s":"A sudden flash of lightning lit up the dark sky, and then we heard loud thunder a few seconds later.","t":"一道突然的閃電照亮了黑暗的天空，幾秒鐘後我們就聽到了巨大的雷聲。"},{"w":"rainbow","p":"n.","d":"an arc of colors in the sky after rain","c":"彩虹","s":"After the rain finally stopped, a beautiful rainbow appeared in the sky, and everyone took out their phones to take photos.","t":"雨終於停了之後，天空出現了一道美麗的彩虹，大家都拿出手機拍照。"},{"w":"snowman","p":"n.","d":"a figure made of snow shaped like a person","c":"雪人","s":"The children worked together all afternoon to build a tall snowman in the front yard before it melted.","t":"孩子們整個下午一起合作，在前院蓋了一個高大的雪人，趁它還沒融化。"},{"w":"cloud","p":"n.","d":"a white or gray shape floating in the sky","c":"雲","s":"There is not a single cloud in the sky today, so it should be perfect weather for our picnic.","t":"今天天空中沒有一片雲，所以應該是適合我們野餐的完美天氣。"},{"w":"cloudy","p":"adj.","d":"covered with clouds","c":"多雲的","s":"The sky looked cloudy all morning, so we decided to bring an umbrella just in case it rained.","t":"整個早上天空看起來多雲，所以我們決定帶把雨傘以防下雨。"},{"w":"fog","p":"n.","d":"a thick cloud of tiny water drops near the ground","c":"霧","s":"Thick fog covered the whole mountain road this morning, so the bus driver had to slow down a lot.","t":"今天早上濃霧覆蓋了整條山路，所以公車司機必須大幅減速。"},{"w":"foggy","p":"adj.","d":"full of fog","c":"有濃霧的","s":"The morning was so foggy that we could barely see the school gate from across the street.","t":"早上的霧濃到我們幾乎看不到對街的校門，天氣非常多霧。"},{"w":"rain","p":"n.","d":"water that falls from clouds","c":"雨水","s":"The rain outside sounded so heavy that we decided to stay inside and watch a movie instead.","t":"外面的雨聲聽起來非常大，所以我們決定待在室內看電影。"},{"w":"rain","p":"v.","d":"when water falls from the clouds","c":"下雨","s":"It started to rain heavily right after we left the house, so we had to run back for an umbrella.","t":"我們離開家後不久就開始下大雨，所以我們必須跑回去拿一把雨傘。"},{"w":"rainy","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of rain","c":"下雨的","s":"On rainy days, my little brother likes to stay home and build things with his colorful blocks.","t":"在下雨的日子裡，我弟弟喜歡待在家裡用他色彩繽紛的積木蓋東西。"},{"w":"snow","p":"n.","d":"soft white frozen water that falls in winter","c":"雪","s":"Soft white snow covered the entire mountain top, making it look like a beautiful winter painting.","t":"柔軟的白雪覆蓋了整座山頂，讓它看起來像一幅美麗的冬天畫作。"},{"w":"snowy","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of snow","c":"下雪的","s":"We packed thick coats and warm boots because the mountain town is famous for its snowy winters.","t":"我們打包了厚重的大衣和保暖的靴子，因為那個山城以多雪的冬天著名。"},{"w":"storm","p":"v.","d":"to attack suddenly and with force","c":"突襲","s":"Dark clouds began to storm the small fishing boats just as the fishermen were heading back to shore.","t":"就在漁夫們正要返回岸邊時，烏雲開始突襲那些小漁船。"},{"w":"storm","p":"n.","d":"very bad weather with strong wind and rain","c":"暴風雨","s":"A powerful storm knocked down several trees along our street, so the road was blocked for two days.","t":"一場強烈的暴風雨擊倒了我們街上的好幾棵樹，所以道路被封閉了兩天。"},{"w":"stormy","p":"adj.","d":"having storms, with strong wind and rain","c":"暴風雨的","s":"The captain decided not to sail because the ocean looked far too stormy for a small boat.","t":"船長決定不出海，因為海面看起來對一艘小船來說太暴風雨了。"},{"w":"wind","p":"n.","d":"air that moves quickly outside","c":"風","s":"A strong wind blew all of the leaves off the trees in just one single afternoon.","t":"一陣強風在短短一個下午就把樹上所有的葉子都吹落了。"},{"w":"windy","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of wind","c":"有風的","s":"It was so windy on the beach today that we couldn't keep our towels flat on the sand.","t":"今天海灘上風很大，我們的毛巾根本沒辦法平鋪在沙子上。"},{"w":"cold","p":"adj.","d":"having a low temperature","c":"冷的","s":"The water in the mountain stream felt incredibly cold, so none of us wanted to put our feet in.","t":"山間溪流裡的水感覺非常冰冷，所以我們都不想把腳放進去。"},{"w":"cool","p":"adj.","d":"a little cold, in a pleasant way","c":"涼爽的","s":"After the sun went down, the night air became pleasantly cool, so we finally turned off the fan.","t":"太陽下山後，夜晚的空氣變得舒適涼爽，所以我們終於把電風扇關掉了。"},{"w":"freezing","p":"adj.","d":"extremely cold","c":"酷寒的","s":"My hands felt completely freezing after building a snowman outside without wearing any gloves at all.","t":"在外面不戴手套蓋雪人之後，我的手感覺完全凍僵了。"},{"w":"hot","p":"adj.","d":"having a high temperature","c":"熱的","s":"The metal playground slide gets so hot in summer that nobody can sit on it without getting burned.","t":"夏天時遊樂場的金屬滑梯會變得非常熱，沒有人可以坐上去而不被燙到。"},{"w":"humid","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of water in the air","c":"潮濕的","s":"Summer afternoons in Taiwan can feel extremely humid, so most people carry a small towel to wipe off sweat.","t":"台灣夏天的午後感覺非常潮濕，所以大部分人都會隨身帶一條小毛巾擦汗。"},{"w":"sunny","p":"adj.","d":"bright with sunshine","c":"晴朗的","s":"It was such a sunny day that everyone at the beach needed sunglasses and plenty of sunscreen.","t":"那天天氣非常晴朗，海灘上每個人都需要太陽眼鏡和大量的防曬乳。"},{"w":"warm","p":"adj.","d":"having a comfortably high temperature","c":"溫暖的","s":"The soup tasted wonderfully warm after we came inside from playing in the cold winter wind.","t":"我們從外面寒冷的冬風中進來後，這碗湯喝起來感覺非常溫暖。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"Directions / Universe / Geography & Nature (方向/宇宙/地理與大自然)","cards":[{"w":"direction","p":"n.","d":"the way something faces or moves toward","c":"方向；說明","s":"I forgot which direction the library was in, so I had to ask a teacher for help finding my way.","t":"我忘記圖書館在哪個方向，所以我必須請老師幫忙指路。"},{"w":"east","p":"n.","d":"the direction where the sun rises","c":"東方","s":"The sun always rises in the east, so our classroom gets very bright light every single morning.","t":"太陽總是從東方升起，所以我們的教室每天早上都會有非常明亮的光線。"},{"w":"north","p":"n.","d":"the direction to your left when facing the sunrise","c":"北方","s":"Snow falls almost every winter in the north of Taiwan, especially on the tall mountains there.","t":"台灣北方幾乎每個冬天都會下雪，尤其是在那裡的高山上。"},{"w":"south","p":"n.","d":"the direction to your right when facing the sunrise","c":"南方","s":"My grandparents live in the south, where the weather stays warm even during the coldest months.","t":"我的祖父母住在南方，那裡即使在最冷的月份天氣也保持溫暖。"},{"w":"south","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing the south","c":"南方的","s":"We took a long train ride to visit a small south village famous for its delicious seafood.","t":"我們搭了很長的火車去拜訪一個以美味海鮮聞名的南方小村莊。"},{"w":"west","p":"n.","d":"the direction where the sun sets","c":"西方","s":"The beautiful sunset always appears in the west, painting the whole sky orange and pink.","t":"美麗的夕陽總是出現在西方，把整個天空染成橘色和粉紅色。"},{"w":"west","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing the west","c":"西邊的","s":"Our school trip included a visit to a historic town located on the west coast of the island.","t":"我們的校外教學包括參觀一個位於島上西邊海岸的歷史古鎮。"},{"w":"universe","p":"n.","d":"everything that exists, including all stars and space","c":"宇宙","s":"My science teacher explained that the universe contains billions of stars, planets, and galaxies.","t":"我的科學老師解釋說，宇宙包含數十億顆星星、行星和星系。"},{"w":"planet","p":"n.","d":"a large round object in space that orbits a star","c":"行星","s":"Mars is often called the red planet because its surface looks reddish from far away in space.","t":"火星常被稱為紅色行星，因為它的表面從太空遠處看起來是紅色的。"},{"w":"sun","p":"n.","d":"the star that gives Earth light and heat","c":"太陽","s":"We wore hats and sunglasses because the sun was extremely bright during our afternoon hike.","t":"我們戴了帽子和太陽眼鏡，因為我們午後健行時太陽非常刺眼。"},{"w":"moon","p":"n.","d":"the round object that orbits the Earth and shines at night","c":"月亮","s":"The moon looked huge and bright last night, so we sat outside and watched it for an hour.","t":"昨晚月亮看起來又大又亮，所以我們坐在外面看了它一個小時。"},{"w":"star","p":"n.","d":"a bright point of light seen in the night sky","c":"星星","s":"Far away from the city lights, every single star in the night sky seemed clear and sparkling.","t":"遠離城市的燈光，夜空中的每一顆星星看起來都清晰又閃亮。"},{"w":"earth","p":"n.","d":"the planet we live on","c":"地球","s":"Our teacher showed us a photo of the earth taken from space, and it looked like a blue and white ball.","t":"我們的老師給我們看了一張從太空拍攝的地球照片，它看起來像一個藍白色的球。"},{"w":"world","p":"n.","d":"all the countries and people on Earth","c":"世界","s":"My older sister wants to travel around the world and visit every single country before she turns thirty.","t":"我姊姊想要環遊世界，在她三十歲之前拜訪每一個國家。"},{"w":"island","p":"n.","d":"a piece of land surrounded completely by water","c":"島嶼","s":"Taiwan is a beautiful island surrounded by ocean on every side, with mountains in the middle.","t":"台灣是一個美麗的島嶼，四面環海，中間有山脈。"},{"w":"land","p":"n.","d":"the solid dry part of the Earth's surface","c":"陸地","s":"After many days at sea, the sailors finally saw land appear on the distant horizon.","t":"在海上度過許多天之後，水手們終於看到陸地出現在遙遠的地平線上。"},{"w":"coast","p":"n.","d":"the land next to the sea","c":"海岸","s":"My family enjoys driving along the coast on weekends because the ocean view is always so relaxing.","t":"我家人喜歡週末沿著海岸開車，因為海景總是讓人很放鬆。"},{"w":"ocean","p":"n.","d":"a very large area of salt water","c":"海洋","s":"The ocean stretched out endlessly in front of us, with waves crashing gently against the sandy shore.","t":"海洋在我們面前無盡地延伸，海浪輕輕拍打著沙岸。"},{"w":"sea","p":"n.","d":"a large area of salt water, smaller than an ocean","c":"海","s":"We could smell the salty sea air long before we actually arrived at the beach that afternoon.","t":"那天下午我們在真正抵達海灘之前，就已經能聞到鹹鹹的海風了。"},{"w":"lake","p":"n.","d":"a large area of fresh water surrounded by land","c":"湖","s":"The water in the lake was so still and clear that it perfectly reflected the mountains around it.","t":"湖裡的水非常平靜清澈，完美地映照出周圍的山。"},{"w":"pond","p":"n.","d":"a small area of still water, smaller than a lake","c":"池塘","s":"There is a small pond behind our school where students like to feed the ducks after class.","t":"我們學校後面有一個小池塘，學生們喜歡下課後在那裡餵鴨子。"},{"w":"pool","p":"n.","d":"a small area of water, often man-made, for swimming","c":"水池","s":"My little cousin splashed happily in the shallow pool while the adults relaxed nearby in the shade.","t":"我的小表弟在淺水池裡開心地玩水，大人們則在旁邊的陰影下休息。"},{"w":"river","p":"n.","d":"a large natural flow of fresh water","c":"河","s":"The river flows down from the mountains and passes right through the center of our busy little town.","t":"這條河從山上流下來，正好穿過我們這個忙碌小鎮的中心。"},{"w":"stream","p":"n.","d":"a small narrow river","c":"溪流","s":"We followed the narrow stream through the forest until it led us to a beautiful hidden waterfall.","t":"我們沿著狹窄的溪流穿過森林，一直走到一個美麗的隱藏瀑布。"},{"w":"waterfalls","p":"n.","d":"water falling from a high place, like off a cliff","c":"瀑布","s":"Tourists travel from all over the world just to see the famous waterfalls crashing down the cliffs.","t":"遊客們從世界各地前來，只為了看著名的瀑布從懸崖上傾瀉而下。"},{"w":"desert","p":"v.","d":"to leave a person or place completely, abandoning it","c":"遺棄","s":"The soldiers had to desert their broken truck in the middle of the road and continue walking on foot.","t":"士兵們必須遺棄他們在路中間故障的卡車，繼續徒步前進。"},{"w":"desert","p":"n.","d":"a large area of land that is very dry with little rain","c":"沙漠","s":"It almost never rains in this desert, so very few plants are able to survive in the dry sand.","t":"這個沙漠幾乎從不下雨，所以很少有植物能在乾燥的沙地中存活。"},{"w":"rock","p":"n.","d":"a hard solid piece of stone","c":"岩石","s":"A large rock blocked the narrow hiking trail, so we had to climb carefully around it.","t":"一塊大岩石擋住了狹窄的健行步道，所以我們必須小心地繞過它。"},{"w":"stone","p":"n.","d":"a small hard piece of rock","c":"石頭","s":"The old bridge was built entirely out of gray stone more than a hundred years ago.","t":"這座古老的橋完全是用灰色石頭建造的，已經超過一百年了。"},{"w":"sand","p":"n.","d":"tiny grains found on beaches and deserts","c":"沙子","s":"The children spent the whole afternoon building a tall castle out of wet sand near the water.","t":"孩子們整個下午都在水邊用濕沙子蓋一座高高的城堡。"},{"w":"forest","p":"n.","d":"a large area covered with many trees","c":"森林","s":"Thick green trees covered the entire forest, making it almost impossible to see the sky above.","t":"茂密的綠樹覆蓋了整片森林，讓人幾乎看不到上方的天空。"},{"w":"valley","p":"n.","d":"a low area of land between hills or mountains","c":"山谷","s":"Our bus drove slowly through a quiet green valley surrounded by tall mountains on both sides.","t":"我們的巴士緩慢地穿過一個被高山環繞的安靜綠色山谷。"},{"w":"mountain","p":"n.","d":"a very high area of land, higher than a hill","c":"山","s":"Climbing to the top of the mountain took us nearly six hours, but the view was absolutely worth it.","t":"爬到山頂花了我們將近六個小時，但是那景色絕對值得。"},{"w":"hill","p":"n.","d":"a small high area of land, smaller than a mountain","c":"小山坡","s":"We rolled an old tire down the grassy hill behind our house just for fun every weekend.","t":"我們每個週末為了好玩，把一個舊輪胎從我們家後面長滿草的小山坡上滾下去。"},{"w":"sky","p":"n.","d":"the space above the Earth where clouds and stars are seen","c":"天空","s":"Not a single cloud appeared in the bright blue sky during our entire outdoor field trip.","t":"在我們整個戶外校外教學期間，明亮的藍天空中完全沒有出現一片雲。"},{"w":"thunder","p":"n.","d":"the loud sound that follows lightning","c":"雷","s":"Loud thunder shook the windows of our house right after the bright flash of lightning appeared.","t":"在明亮的閃電出現之後，巨大的雷聲立刻震動了我們家的窗戶。"},{"w":"fire","p":"n.","d":"the hot bright flames produced by burning something","c":"火","s":"We sat around the warm fire and told scary stories during our camping trip last summer.","t":"去年夏天露營時，我們圍坐在溫暖的火堆旁講恐怖故事。"},{"w":"ice","p":"n.","d":"water that has frozen solid","c":"冰","s":"The pond froze completely overnight, so thick ice now covers the entire surface of the water.","t":"池塘整夜完全凍住了，所以現在厚厚的冰覆蓋了整個水面。"},{"w":"nature","p":"n.","d":"everything in the world not made by people, like plants and animals","c":"大自然；性質","s":"Spending time in nature always makes me feel calmer, especially after a long and stressful week at school.","t":"待在大自然中總是讓我感覺更平靜，尤其是在學校度過漫長又有壓力的一週之後。"},{"w":"natural","p":"adj.","d":"existing in nature, not made by people","c":"自然的","s":"My grandmother prefers using natural ingredients like honey and lemon instead of medicine when she has a cold.","t":"我奶奶感冒時比較喜歡使用天然的食材，像是蜂蜜和檸檬，而不是吃藥。"},{"w":"shine","p":"v.","d":"to give off bright light","c":"發光；照耀","s":"The stars always seem to shine the brightest on clear nights far away from the bright city lights.","t":"在遠離明亮城市燈光的晴朗夜晚，星星似乎總是發光得最明亮。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"Plants / Birds / Farm & Pet Animals (植物/鳥類/農場與寵物動物)","cards":[{"w":"plant","p":"n.","d":"a living thing that grows in soil, like a flower or tree","c":"植物","s":"My mother waters every plant on our balcony each morning before she leaves for work.","t":"我媽媽每天早上出門上班前，都會幫陽台上的每一株植物澆水。"},{"w":"plant","p":"v.","d":"to put a seed in the ground so it can grow","c":"栽種","s":"We worked together in the garden to plant tomato seeds along the back fence last weekend.","t":"上週末我們一起在花園裡合作，沿著後面的籬笆栽種番茄種子。"},{"w":"grass","p":"n.","d":"short green plants that cover the ground","c":"青草","s":"The soft green grass in the park felt cool under our bare feet during the summer afternoon.","t":"公園裡柔軟的青草在夏日午後讓我們的赤腳感覺很涼爽。"},{"w":"flower","p":"n.","d":"the colorful part of a plant that often smells nice","c":"花","s":"My grandmother grows a different colorful flower in every corner of her small front garden.","t":"我奶奶在她小小的前院花園的每個角落都種了不同顏色的花。"},{"w":"cotton","p":"n.","d":"a soft white material from a plant, used to make cloth","c":"棉花","s":"This soft white shirt is made entirely of cotton, so it feels gentle against your skin.","t":"這件柔軟的白色襯衫完全是用棉花製成的，所以穿在身上感覺很舒服。"},{"w":"rose","p":"n.","d":"a flower with a sweet smell, often red or pink","c":"玫瑰花","s":"He picked a single red rose from the garden to give to his mother on her birthday.","t":"他從花園裡摘了一朵紅玫瑰花，要在媽媽生日那天送給她。"},{"w":"tree","p":"n.","d":"a tall plant with a trunk and branches","c":"樹","s":"We planted a small tree in our backyard last spring, and it has already grown much taller.","t":"我們去年春天在後院種了一棵小樹，它現在已經長高了很多。"},{"w":"leaf","p":"n.","d":"a flat green part of a plant or tree","c":"樹葉","s":"A single yellow leaf slowly fell from the branch and landed quietly on the wet ground.","t":"一片黃色的樹葉緩緩地從樹枝上落下，靜靜地落在潮濕的地面上。"},{"w":"seed","p":"n.","d":"a small hard part of a plant that grows into a new plant","c":"種子","s":"My little brother planted a tiny seed in a paper cup and watched it grow every single day.","t":"我弟弟在紙杯裡種了一顆小小的種子，每天都看著它生長。"},{"w":"root","p":"n.","d":"the part of a plant that grows underground","c":"根","s":"The old tree's thick root had grown so deep that it cracked the sidewalk near our school.","t":"那棵老樹粗壯的根長得很深，把我們學校附近的人行道弄裂了。"},{"w":"woods","p":"n.","d":"a large area covered with many trees","c":"樹林","s":"We followed a narrow trail deep into the woods until we finally found the hidden campsite.","t":"我們沿著一條狹窄的步道深入樹林，終於找到了那個隱藏的營地。"},{"w":"grow","p":"v.","d":"to become bigger over time","c":"成長；種植","s":"My father says tomatoes grow best when they get plenty of sunlight and water every day.","t":"我爸爸說番茄在每天得到充足的陽光和水分時長得最好，生長得最好。"},{"w":"bird","p":"n.","d":"an animal with feathers and wings that can fly","c":"鳥","s":"Every morning, a small bird sings cheerfully outside my bedroom window before my alarm even rings.","t":"每天早上，在我的鬧鐘響起之前，一隻小鳥總會在我臥室窗外開心地唱歌。"},{"w":"duck","p":"n.","d":"a water bird with webbed feet and a flat beak","c":"鴨子","s":"A mother duck led her five fluffy babies across the pond behind our elementary school.","t":"一隻鴨子媽媽帶著她五隻毛茸茸的寶寶穿過我們小學後面的池塘。"},{"w":"goose","p":"n.","d":"a large water bird, bigger than a duck","c":"鵝","s":"A loud, angry goose chased us across the farmyard when we got too close to her nest.","t":"當我們靠近牠的窩太近時，一隻憤怒又大聲的鵝把我們追著趕出了農場。"},{"w":"chicken","p":"n.","d":"a common farm bird raised for its eggs and meat","c":"小雞；雞肉","s":"My grandmother feeds her chicken fresh corn every morning before collecting eggs from the small wooden coop.","t":"我奶奶每天早上餵她的雞吃新鮮玉米，然後再從那個小木雞舍裡收集雞蛋。"},{"w":"hen","p":"n.","d":"an adult female chicken","c":"母雞","s":"The brown hen sat quietly on her nest, waiting patiently for her eggs to finally hatch.","t":"那隻棕色的母雞安靜地坐在窩裡，耐心地等待她的蛋終於孵化。"},{"w":"turkey","p":"n.","d":"a large farm bird often eaten at holiday dinners","c":"火雞","s":"My family always cooks a large turkey together every year for our special holiday dinner.","t":"我家每年都會一起烹煮一隻大火雞，作為我們特別節日晚餐的菜色。"},{"w":"eagle","p":"n.","d":"a large, powerful bird that hunts other animals","c":"老鷹","s":"A powerful eagle circled high above the mountains, searching the valley below for its next meal.","t":"一隻強壯的老鷹在山上高空盤旋，搜尋著下方山谷裡的下一頓食物。"},{"w":"parrot","p":"n.","d":"a colorful bird that can copy human speech","c":"鸚鵡","s":"My uncle's colorful pet parrot can repeat almost every single word that he says to it.","t":"我叔叔的彩色寵物鸚鵡幾乎能重複他對牠說的每一句話。"},{"w":"pigeon","p":"n.","d":"a common gray city bird","c":"鴿子","s":"A gray pigeon landed on the windowsill and pecked curiously at the bread crumbs we left there.","t":"一隻灰色的鴿子停在窗台上，好奇地啄食我們留在那裡的麵包屑。"},{"w":"swallow","p":"v.","d":"to make food or drink go down your throat","c":"吞嚥","s":"My little sister had to swallow her medicine quickly because she didn't like its bitter taste at all.","t":"我妹妹必須很快地吞下她的藥，因為她一點都不喜歡那苦苦的味道。"},{"w":"swallow","p":"n.","d":"a small bird with pointed wings and a forked tail","c":"燕子","s":"Every spring, a pair of small swallow build their nest under the roof of our front porch.","t":"每年春天，一對小燕子都會在我們前門廊的屋頂下築巢。"},{"w":"swan","p":"n.","d":"a large graceful white water bird with a long neck","c":"天鵝","s":"A graceful white swan glided silently across the calm lake as visitors watched from the shore.","t":"一隻優雅的白天鵝靜靜地滑過平靜的湖面，遊客們在岸邊觀看著。"},{"w":"pet","p":"n.","d":"an animal kept at home for company","c":"寵物","s":"My family adopted a small pet from the animal shelter last month, and we love her already.","t":"我家上個月從動物收容所領養了一隻小寵物，我們已經非常愛她了。"},{"w":"bat","p":"n.","d":"a small flying mammal that is active at night","c":"蝙蝠","s":"Every evening at sunset, dozens of small bat fly out from the dark cave near our village.","t":"每天傍晚太陽下山時，數十隻小蝙蝠會從我們村莊附近的黑暗洞穴飛出來。"},{"w":"bear","p":"n.","d":"a large, strong wild animal with thick fur","c":"熊","s":"Campers are warned to store their food carefully so a hungry bear won't wander into the campsite.","t":"露營者被警告要小心保存食物，這樣飢餓的熊就不會閒逛進入營地。"},{"w":"koala","p":"n.","d":"a furry Australian animal that lives in trees","c":"無尾熊","s":"This sleepy koala spends most of the day resting quietly among the branches of tall eucalyptus trees.","t":"這隻愛睡覺的無尾熊大部分時間都安靜地待在高大的尤加利樹枝間休息。"},{"w":"panda","p":"n.","d":"a large black-and-white bear from China that eats bamboo","c":"貓熊","s":"The zoo's newest baby panda spends almost the entire day eating fresh bamboo leaves and napping.","t":"動物園最新的貓熊寶寶幾乎整天都在吃新鮮的竹葉和打瞌睡。"},{"w":"cow","p":"n.","d":"a large farm animal kept for milk or meat","c":"母牛；奶牛","s":"Every morning before sunrise, the farmer walks out to milk his cow in the old wooden barn.","t":"每天日出之前，農夫都會走到那間老舊的木造穀倉去擠他的母牛的奶。"},{"w":"ox","p":"n.","d":"a large male farm animal used for pulling heavy loads","c":"公牛","s":"In the old painting, a strong ox pulled a heavy wooden cart slowly along the muddy village road.","t":"在那幅古老的畫作中，一頭強壯的公牛緩緩地拉著一台沉重的木製推車走在泥濘的村莊道路上。"},{"w":"cat","p":"n.","d":"a small furry animal often kept as a pet","c":"貓","s":"Our gray cat sleeps on the warmest windowsill in the house almost every single afternoon.","t":"我們家的灰貓幾乎每天下午都睡在家裡最溫暖的窗台上。"},{"w":"kitten","p":"n.","d":"a baby cat","c":"小貓","s":"The tiny kitten could barely climb out of the cardboard box without falling over completely.","t":"那隻小貓幾乎沒辦法從紙箱裡爬出來而不完全摔倒。"},{"w":"deer","p":"n.","d":"a graceful wild animal with thin legs, often with antlers","c":"鹿","s":"A young deer stepped quietly out of the forest and stared at us before running away quickly.","t":"一隻年輕的鹿靜靜地從森林裡走出來，盯著我們看了一會兒後就很快地跑走了。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"Mammals / Reptiles / Sea Creatures / Insects (哺乳類/爬蟲類/海洋生物/昆蟲)","cards":[{"w":"ant","p":"n.","d":"a tiny insect that lives and works together in large groups","c":"螞蟻","s":"A long line of tiny ant marched across the kitchen floor, carrying small pieces of bread.","t":"一長排小小的螞蟻排隊走過廚房地板，搬著小小的麵包屑。"},{"w":"bee","p":"n.","d":"a small flying insect that makes honey and can sting","c":"蜜蜂","s":"A busy bee flew from flower to flower in the garden, collecting sweet nectar on a sunny morning.","t":"一隻忙碌的蜜蜂在晴朗的早晨於花園裡飛來飛去，採集甜美的花蜜。"},{"w":"bug","p":"n.","d":"a small insect or creeping creature","c":"蟲子","s":"My little brother found a strange green bug crawling slowly along the edge of his bedroom window.","t":"我弟弟發現一隻奇怪的綠色蟲子正沿著他臥室窗邊緩慢地爬行。"},{"w":"butterfly","p":"n.","d":"a colorful insect with large wings that flies among flowers","c":"蝴蝶","s":"A beautiful orange butterfly landed gently on the flower right in front of the excited little girl.","t":"一隻美麗的橘色蝴蝶輕輕地停在那位興奮小女孩面前的花朵上。"},{"w":"cockroach","p":"n.","d":"a brown insect that often hides in kitchens at night","c":"蟑螂","s":"Everyone in the kitchen screamed when a large brown cockroach suddenly ran out from behind the refrigerator.","t":"當一隻大蟑螂突然從冰箱後面跑出來時，廚房裡的每個人都驚叫了起來。"},{"w":"crab","p":"n.","d":"a sea animal with a hard shell and two big claws","c":"螃蟹","s":"At low tide, my father and I found a small orange crab hiding under a wet rock.","t":"退潮時，我和爸爸在一塊濕濕的石頭下發現了一隻橘色的小螃蟹。"},{"w":"dinosaur","p":"n.","d":"a huge animal that lived millions of years ago and no longer exists","c":"恐龍","s":"At the museum, my son stood frozen in awe beneath the enormous skeleton of a real dinosaur.","t":"在博物館裡，我兒子站在一具真正的恐龍骨架下方，看得目瞪口呆。"},{"w":"dog","p":"n.","d":"a common animal that people often keep as a pet","c":"狗","s":"Every afternoon after school, my little brother takes our dog for a walk around the park.","t":"每天放學後，我弟弟都會帶我們的狗去公園散步。"},{"w":"dolphin","p":"n.","d":"a smart sea animal that swims fast and is known for being friendly","c":"海豚","s":"During the boat tour, a group of gray dolphin jumped happily beside the boat for several minutes.","t":"在乘船遊覽時，一群灰色的海豚開心地在船邊跳躍了好幾分鐘。"},{"w":"donkey","p":"n.","d":"an animal that looks like a small horse with long ears","c":"驢子","s":"On the mountain trail, tourists rode a patient donkey slowly up the steep and rocky path.","t":"在山路上，遊客們騎著一隻耐心的驢子緩緩走上陡峭的石頭小路。"},{"w":"elephant","p":"n.","d":"a very large gray animal with a long nose called a trunk","c":"大象","s":"At the zoo, the children were amazed at how gently the huge elephant picked up the peanuts.","t":"在動物園裡，孩子們對那隻巨大的大象輕輕拿起花生感到驚訝。"},{"w":"fish","p":"n.","d":"an animal that lives in water and breathes through gills","c":"魚","s":"My grandfather wakes up early every Sunday to catch fish at the quiet river near his house.","t":"我爺爺每個星期天都會早起去他家附近那條安靜的河邊釣魚。"},{"w":"fox","p":"n.","d":"a wild animal that looks like a dog with red fur and a pointed face","c":"狐狸","s":"Late at night, a clever fox crept quietly across the farmer's field, looking for food.","t":"深夜裡，一隻聰明的狐狸悄悄地穿過農夫的田地，想找東西吃。"},{"w":"frog","p":"n.","d":"a small green animal that lives near water and can jump far","c":"青蛙","s":"After the heavy rain, a small green frog hopped across the wet path near our classroom window.","t":"大雨過後，一隻綠色的小青蛙跳過我們教室窗外那條濕濕的小路。"},{"w":"goat","p":"n.","d":"a farm animal with horns that likes to eat grass and leaves","c":"山羊","s":"Behind the old farmhouse, a curious white goat chewed quietly on the leaves of a low bush.","t":"在那間老農舍後面，一隻好奇的白山羊正安靜地嚼著矮叢上的葉子。"},{"w":"hippo","p":"n.","d":"a huge gray animal that spends most of its time in rivers","c":"河馬","s":"At the zoo, a massive gray hippo floated lazily in the pool, showing only its eyes above the water.","t":"在動物園裡，一隻巨大的灰色河馬懶洋洋地浮在水池裡，只露出眼睛在水面上。"},{"w":"horse","p":"n.","d":"a large strong animal that people can ride","c":"馬","s":"My cousin learned to ride a horse last summer at her grandparents' farm in the countryside.","t":"我表姐去年夏天在她祖父母的鄉間農場學會了騎馬。"},{"w":"insect","p":"n.","d":"a small animal with six legs, like an ant or a bee","c":"昆蟲","s":"For her science project, my sister collected several kinds of insect in a small glass jar.","t":"為了科學作業，我姐姐用一個小玻璃罐收集了好幾種昆蟲。"},{"w":"kangaroo","p":"n.","d":"an Australian animal that jumps on its strong back legs","c":"袋鼠","s":"We watched in delight as a young kangaroo hopped across the open field at the wildlife park.","t":"我們開心地看著一隻小袋鼠在野生動物園的空地上跳來跳去。"},{"w":"lamb","p":"n.","d":"a baby sheep","c":"小羊","s":"Every spring, a fluffy white lamb follows its mother closely across the green hillside near the farm.","t":"每年春天，一隻毛茸茸的白色小羊都會緊跟著媽媽走過農場旁的綠色山坡。"},{"w":"lion","p":"n.","d":"a large wild cat with a loud roar, often called the king of animals","c":"獅子","s":"During the safari trip, our guide warned us never to get out of the car near a lion.","t":"在野生動物之旅中，導遊警告我們絕對不要在獅子附近下車。"},{"w":"monkey","p":"n.","d":"an animal that can climb trees well and looks a little like a small person","c":"猴子","s":"A playful monkey jumped from branch to branch, trying to steal a banana from a tourist's bag.","t":"一隻愛玩的猴子在樹枝間跳來跳去，想從遊客的包包裡偷香蕉。"},{"w":"mosquito","p":"n.","d":"a tiny flying insect that bites people and can spread disease","c":"蚊子","s":"On the hot summer night, a single annoying mosquito kept buzzing loudly around my head while I tried to sleep.","t":"在炎熱的夏夜，一隻討厭的蚊子在我頭邊嗡嗡作響，讓我難以入睡。"},{"w":"mouse","p":"n.","d":"a very small animal with a long tail that likes cheese","c":"老鼠","s":"Late one night, my mother screamed when a tiny gray mouse ran quickly across the kitchen floor.","t":"某天深夜，當一隻灰色的小老鼠迅速跑過廚房地板時，我媽媽嚇得叫了起來。"},{"w":"pig","p":"n.","d":"a farm animal with pink skin that people raise for meat","c":"豬","s":"Every morning, the farmer feeds his pig fresh vegetables before he goes to work in the fields.","t":"每天早上，農夫會在去田裡工作前先餵豬吃新鮮的蔬菜。"},{"w":"puppy","p":"n.","d":"a baby dog","c":"小狗","s":"For her birthday, my niece received an adorable little puppy that she immediately named Cookie.","t":"我姪女的生日禮物是一隻可愛的小狗，她馬上就把它取名叫Cookie。"},{"w":"rabbit","p":"n.","d":"a small soft animal with long ears that likes to eat carrots","c":"兔子","s":"My sister keeps a white rabbit in a small cage on our balcony and feeds it carrots daily.","t":"我姐姐在我們的陽台上養了一隻白兔，每天都餵它吃紅蘿蔔。"},{"w":"rat","p":"n.","d":"a small animal with a long tail, larger than a mouse, often found in dirty places","c":"老鼠","s":"The restaurant was shut down for a week after an inspector found a rat hiding behind the stove.","t":"餐廳因為稽查員在爐子後面發現一隻老鼠而被停業一週。"},{"w":"shark","p":"n.","d":"a large strong fish in the ocean with sharp teeth","c":"鯊魚","s":"The lifeguard quickly told all the swimmers to leave the water after spotting a shark near the shore.","t":"救生員發現岸邊有鯊魚出現後，立刻要所有泳客離開海水。"},{"w":"sheep","p":"n.","d":"a farm animal with thick wool, often kept in large groups","c":"綿羊","s":"On the hillside farm, dozens of woolly white sheep grazed quietly under the warm afternoon sun.","t":"在山坡上的農場裡，數十隻毛茸茸的白色綿羊在溫暖的午後陽光下安靜地吃草。"},{"w":"shrimp","p":"n.","d":"a small sea animal with a curved body, often eaten as food","c":"蝦子","s":"At the night market, my favorite stall sells grilled shrimp on a stick for only fifty dollars.","t":"在夜市裡，我最喜歡的攤位只賣五十元一串的烤蝦。"},{"w":"snail","p":"n.","d":"a small slow animal with a round shell on its back","c":"蝸牛","s":"After the rain, a tiny snail slowly left a shiny trail across the wet garden path.","t":"下雨後，一隻小蝸牛緩緩地在濕濕的花園小路上留下一道閃亮的痕跡。"},{"w":"snake","p":"n.","d":"a long thin animal with no legs that moves by sliding on the ground","c":"蛇","s":"Everyone screamed and ran away when a long snake suddenly appeared on the path during our hike.","t":"在我們健行的路上，一條長長的蛇突然出現，大家都嚇得邊叫邊跑開。"},{"w":"spider","p":"n.","d":"a small creature with eight legs that makes webs to catch insects","c":"蜘蛛","s":"When she opened the old box in the garage, a large spider quickly ran out and disappeared.","t":"當她打開車庫裡那個舊箱子時，一隻大蜘蛛迅速跑出來消失了。"},{"w":"tiger","p":"n.","d":"a large wild cat with orange fur and black stripes","c":"老虎","s":"The little boy was both scared and excited when he saw a real tiger for the first time.","t":"那個小男孩第一次看到真正的老虎時，又害怕又興奮。"},{"w":"turtle","p":"n.","d":"an animal with a hard round shell that moves very slowly","c":"烏龜","s":"We watched a slow turtle crawl across the sand and disappear quietly into the calm ocean water.","t":"我們看著一隻緩慢的烏龜爬過沙地，靜靜地消失在平靜的海水中。"},{"w":"whale","p":"n.","d":"the largest animal that lives in the ocean","c":"鯨魚","s":"Far out at sea, the passengers cheered as a giant whale rose slowly and sprayed water into the air.","t":"在遠方的海面上，一隻巨大的鯨魚緩緩浮出水面並噴出水柱，乘客們都歡呼起來。"},{"w":"wolf","p":"n.","d":"a wild animal that looks like a large dog and often hunts in groups","c":"野狼","s":"Deep in the snowy forest, a lone gray wolf howled loudly under the bright full moon.","t":"在雪林深處，一隻孤獨的灰狼在皎潔的滿月下大聲嚎叫。"},{"w":"worm","p":"n.","d":"a small long soft animal with no legs that lives in soil","c":"蠕蟲","s":"After the rain stopped, my little cousin found a wet pink worm wriggling on the garden path.","t":"雨停後，我的小表弟在花園小路上發現一隻濕濕的粉紅色蠕蟲在蠕動。"},{"w":"zebra","p":"n.","d":"an African animal that looks like a horse with black and white stripes","c":"斑馬","s":"At the safari park, a herd of striped zebra grazed peacefully beside a small group of giraffes.","t":"在野生動物園裡，一群有條紋的斑馬正和一小群長頸鹿一起安靜地吃草。"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"Meals & Common Foods (三餐/肉類/麵包/點心甜點)","cards":[{"w":"breakfast","p":"n.","d":"the first meal of the day, usually eaten in the morning","c":"早餐","s":"Every morning, my mother makes a warm breakfast for the whole family before school.","t":"每天早上，我媽媽都會在上學前為全家人準備一份溫暖的早餐。"},{"w":"brunch","p":"n.","d":"a meal eaten late in the morning that combines breakfast and lunch","c":"早午餐","s":"On Sunday, my sister and I went to a café downtown to enjoy a relaxing brunch.","t":"星期天，我和姐姐去市區的咖啡廳享用了一頓悠閒的早午餐。"},{"w":"lunch","p":"n.","d":"a meal eaten in the middle of the day","c":"午餐","s":"At noon, all the students line up in the cafeteria to get their lunch.","t":"中午時，所有學生都會在餐廳排隊領取午餐。"},{"w":"dinner","p":"n.","d":"the main meal of the day, usually eaten in the evening","c":"晚餐","s":"My whole family sits together at the table every night to eat dinner.","t":"我們全家人每天晚上都會一起坐在餐桌前吃晚餐。"},{"w":"supper","p":"n.","d":"a light meal eaten in the evening","c":"晚餐","s":"After the late movie, we stopped by a small shop for a quick supper.","t":"看完晚場電影後，我們到一家小店吃了簡單的晚餐。"},{"w":"meal","p":"n.","d":"the food eaten at one particular time, such as breakfast or dinner","c":"一餐","s":"After the long hike, everyone was hungry and ready for a big meal.","t":"健行了很久之後，大家都餓了，準備好要吃一頓大餐。"},{"w":"buffet","p":"n.","d":"a meal where guests serve themselves from many dishes","c":"自助餐","s":"For her birthday, my aunt booked a hotel buffet so everyone could choose their own food.","t":"我阿姨為了她的生日訂了一間飯店自助餐，這樣大家都可以自己挑選食物。"},{"w":"menu","p":"n.","d":"a list of food and drinks you can order in a restaurant","c":"菜單","s":"Before ordering, the waiter handed each of us a colorful menu to look at.","t":"點餐前，服務生給了我們每個人一份色彩鮮豔的菜單。"},{"w":"delicious","p":"adj.","d":"having a very pleasant taste","c":"美味的","s":"Everyone agreed that the soup my grandmother made was absolutely delicious.","t":"大家都同意我奶奶煮的湯非常美味。"},{"w":"yummy","p":"adj.","d":"tasting very good, often used by children","c":"好吃的","s":"The little boy smiled and said the chocolate cake was so yummy.","t":"那個小男孩笑著說那塊巧克力蛋糕真的很好吃。"},{"w":"diet","p":"n.","d":"the usual food and drink a person eats","c":"飲食","s":"The doctor told my father to follow a healthier diet after his checkup.","t":"醫生在健康檢查後建議我爸爸要採取更健康的飲食。"},{"w":"food","p":"n.","d":"anything that people or animals eat to stay alive","c":"食物","s":"After the typhoon, volunteers brought boxes of fresh food to the families nearby.","t":"颱風過後，志工們帶了好幾箱新鮮的食物給附近的家庭。"},{"w":"meat","p":"n.","d":"the flesh of an animal eaten as food","c":"肉","s":"My uncle grills different kinds of meat every time we visit his backyard.","t":"每次我們去拜訪我叔叔的後院，他都會烤各種不同的肉。"},{"w":"barbecue","p":"n.","d":"meat or food cooked over an open fire outdoors","c":"烤肉","s":"Every Mid-Autumn Festival, our whole neighborhood gathers outside for a big barbecue.","t":"每年中秋節，我們整個社區都會聚在外面舉辦一場大型烤肉活動。"},{"w":"beef","p":"n.","d":"meat that comes from a cow","c":"牛肉","s":"My father ordered a bowl of beef noodle soup at the small shop near the station.","t":"我爸爸在車站附近的小店點了一碗牛肉麵。"},{"w":"steak","p":"n.","d":"a thick flat piece of meat, often grilled or fried","c":"牛排","s":"For his birthday dinner, my brother chose a juicy steak with mashed potatoes on the side.","t":"為了他的生日晚餐，我哥哥選了一塊多汁的牛排配馬鈴薯泥。"},{"w":"pork","p":"n.","d":"meat that comes from a pig","c":"豬肉","s":"The night market stall is famous for its crispy fried pork chops with sweet sauce.","t":"那個夜市攤位以酥脆的炸豬排配甜醬聞名。"},{"w":"ham","p":"n.","d":"meat from a pig's leg, usually smoked or salted","c":"火腿","s":"My mother always adds a few slices of ham to my sandwich before school.","t":"我媽媽在上學前總會在我的三明治裡夾幾片火腿。"},{"w":"hot dog","p":"n.","d":"a long sausage served inside a long soft bun","c":"熱狗","s":"At the baseball game, my father bought us each a hot dog with mustard on top.","t":"在棒球比賽現場，我爸爸給我們每人買了一個塗上黃芥末的熱狗。"},{"w":"dumpling","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of dough filled with meat or vegetables, often boiled or steamed","c":"餃子","s":"Every Chinese New Year, our whole family sits together folding dumpling for hours.","t":"每年過年，我們全家人都會坐在一起包好幾個小時的餃子。"},{"w":"seafood","p":"n.","d":"fish and other sea animals eaten as food","c":"海鮮","s":"The restaurant near the harbor serves the freshest seafood in the whole city.","t":"港口附近的那家餐廳供應全市最新鮮的海鮮。"},{"w":"egg","p":"n.","d":"an oval food laid by a hen, often eaten for breakfast","c":"蛋","s":"My father cracked an egg into the hot pan and started making breakfast.","t":"我爸爸打了一顆蛋進熱鍋裡，開始準備早餐。"},{"w":"bread","p":"n.","d":"a common food made from baked flour dough","c":"麵包","s":"The smell of fresh bread from the bakery filled the whole street every morning.","t":"每天早上，麵包店傳出的新鮮麵包香氣瀰漫了整條街。"},{"w":"bun","p":"n.","d":"a small round piece of bread, often sweet or used for sandwiches","c":"小圓麵包","s":"The vendor placed a hot pork bun into a paper bag for the customer.","t":"攤販把一個熱熱的豬肉小圓麵包裝進紙袋給顧客。"},{"w":"sandwich","p":"n.","d":"two slices of bread with food placed between them","c":"三明治","s":"My mother packs a simple sandwich in my lunch box almost every single day.","t":"我媽媽幾乎每天都會在我的便當盒裡放一個簡單的三明治。"},{"w":"toast","p":"n.","d":"a slice of bread that has been heated until brown and crisp","c":"烤土司","s":"I always spread a thin layer of butter on my toast before eating it.","t":"我吃烤土司前總會先抹上一層薄薄的奶油。"},{"w":"burger","p":"n.","d":"a round bread roll filled with a meat patty and other toppings","c":"漢堡","s":"After the swim meet, our coach treated the whole team to a cheese burger.","t":"游泳比賽結束後，教練請全隊吃了起司漢堡。"},{"w":"hamburger","p":"n.","d":"a sandwich made with a round bun and a beef patty inside","c":"漢堡","s":"The new restaurant downtown is famous for serving the biggest hamburger in town.","t":"市區那家新開的餐廳以供應全鎮最大的漢堡而聞名。"},{"w":"French fries","p":"n.","d":"thin strips of potato that are fried until crispy","c":"薯條","s":"My little brother always asks for extra ketchup with his French fries.","t":"我弟弟吃薯條時總是會多要一些番茄醬。"},{"w":"pizza","p":"n.","d":"a flat round bread topped with cheese, sauce, and other toppings, then baked","c":"披薩","s":"On Friday nights, our family usually orders a large pizza and watches a movie.","t":"每個星期五晚上，我們家通常會訂一個大披薩，然後一起看電影。"},{"w":"spaghetti","p":"n.","d":"long thin strings of pasta, usually served with sauce","c":"義大利麵","s":"My mother spent the whole afternoon cooking a rich tomato sauce for the spaghetti.","t":"我媽媽花了整個下午煮一份濃郁的番茄醬汁來搭配義大利麵。"},{"w":"noodle","p":"n.","d":"a long thin strip of food made from flour, often served in soup","c":"麵","s":"On cold winter nights, my grandmother always makes a hot bowl of noodle soup.","t":"在寒冷的冬夜，我奶奶總會煮一碗熱騰騰的湯麵。"},{"w":"rice","p":"n.","d":"small white grains that are cooked and eaten as a main food","c":"飯（米）","s":"In many Asian countries, people eat rice with almost every meal of the day.","t":"在許多亞洲國家，人們幾乎每一餐都會吃飯。"},{"w":"soup","p":"n.","d":"a liquid food often made by cooking meat or vegetables in water","c":"湯","s":"When I have a cold, my mother always makes me a bowl of warm soup.","t":"每次我感冒時，我媽媽總會煮一碗熱湯給我喝。"},{"w":"salad","p":"n.","d":"a cold dish of mixed vegetables, often eaten with dressing","c":"沙拉","s":"Before the main course arrived, the waiter brought us a fresh green salad.","t":"在主餐上桌之前，服務生先端來了一份新鮮的綠色沙拉。"},{"w":"tofu","p":"n.","d":"a soft white food made from soybeans","c":"豆腐","s":"My grandmother adds soft cubes of tofu to almost every soup she cooks.","t":"我奶奶幾乎每次煮湯都會加入軟嫩的豆腐塊。"},{"w":"pie","p":"n.","d":"a baked dish with a pastry crust and a filling, often fruit","c":"派","s":"Every Thanksgiving, my aunt bakes a delicious apple pie for the whole family.","t":"每年感恩節，我阿姨都會烤一個美味的蘋果派給全家人吃。"},{"w":"cake","p":"n.","d":"a sweet baked food, often eaten on birthdays","c":"蛋糕","s":"We all sang together as my little sister blew out the candles on her birthday cake.","t":"當我妹妹吹熄生日蛋糕上的蠟燭時，我們大家一起唱歌。"},{"w":"candy","p":"n.","d":"a small sweet food made mostly of sugar","c":"糖果","s":"On Halloween night, the children walked from house to house collecting candy.","t":"在萬聖節的夜晚，孩子們挨家挨戶地去收集糖果。"},{"w":"cereal","p":"n.","d":"a breakfast food made from grain, often eaten with milk","c":"麥片","s":"Most mornings, I am in a hurry, so I just eat a bowl of cereal.","t":"大多數早晨我都很趕時間，所以只吃一碗麥片。"},{"w":"cheese","p":"n.","d":"a solid food made from milk, often pale yellow or white","c":"乳酪","s":"My favorite kind of pizza has extra melted cheese on top.","t":"我最喜歡的披薩上面有額外的融化乳酪。"},{"w":"chocolate","p":"n.","d":"a sweet brown food made from cacao beans","c":"巧克力","s":"For Valentine's Day, my boyfriend gave me a small box of chocolate.","t":"情人節那天，我男朋友送了我一小盒巧克力。"},{"w":"cookie","p":"n.","d":"a small flat sweet baked food","c":"餅乾","s":"The kitchen smelled wonderful while my mother baked a fresh batch of cookie.","t":"我媽媽烤了一批新鮮餅乾時，整個廚房聞起來都很香。"},{"w":"dessert","p":"n.","d":"a sweet food eaten at the end of a meal","c":"甜點","s":"After dinner, the waiter asked if we wanted to order any dessert.","t":"晚餐後，服務生問我們要不要點甜點。"},{"w":"doughnut","p":"n.","d":"a small round sweet food with a hole in the middle","c":"甜甜圈","s":"On the way to school, my father always stops to buy a warm doughnut for me.","t":"去上學的路上，我爸爸總會停下來幫我買一個溫熱的甜甜圈。"},{"w":"ice cream","p":"n.","d":"a frozen sweet food made from cream and sugar","c":"冰淇淋","s":"On the hottest day of summer, we all walked to the shop for some cold ice cream.","t":"在夏天最熱的那一天，我們都走去那家店買冰淇淋吃。"},{"w":"popcorn","p":"n.","d":"a snack made from corn that pops open when heated","c":"爆米花","s":"Before the movie started, we bought a large bag of buttery popcorn.","t":"電影開始前，我們買了一大袋塗有奶油的爆米花。"},{"w":"nut","p":"n.","d":"a hard-shelled seed that can be eaten","c":"堅果","s":"My grandmother always keeps a small bowl of mixed nut on the coffee table.","t":"我奶奶總是在咖啡桌上放一小碗混合堅果。"},{"w":"snack","p":"n.","d":"a small amount of food eaten between meals","c":"點心","s":"After school, my little brother always wants a quick snack before doing his homework.","t":"放學後，我弟弟總是想先吃一個小點心再做作業。"}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"Fruits / Vegetables / Drinks / Condiments (水果/蔬菜/飲料/調味料)","cards":[{"w":"fruit","p":"n.","d":"the sweet part of a plant that you can eat, like an apple or banana","c":"水果","s":"My mother always keeps a bowl of fresh fruit on the kitchen table.","t":"我媽媽總是在廚房餐桌上放一碗新鮮水果。"},{"w":"apple","p":"n.","d":"a round fruit with red, yellow, or green skin","c":"蘋果","s":"Every day, my father packs a shiny red apple in my lunch box.","t":"每天我爸爸都會在我的便當盒裡放一顆閃亮的紅蘋果。"},{"w":"banana","p":"n.","d":"a long yellow fruit with soft sweet flesh","c":"香蕉","s":"Before her morning run, my sister always eats a banana for quick energy.","t":"我姐姐在晨跑前總會吃一根香蕉來補充快速能量。"},{"w":"grape","p":"n.","d":"a small round fruit that grows in bunches, used to make wine and juice","c":"葡萄","s":"At the night market, a vendor sold sweet purple grape by the bag.","t":"在夜市裡，一位攤販以一袋一袋的方式賣著甜美的紫葡萄。"},{"w":"guava","p":"n.","d":"a round green tropical fruit with crunchy white flesh","c":"芭樂","s":"My grandfather grows several guava trees in the small garden behind his house.","t":"我爺爺在他家後面的小花園裡種了好幾棵芭樂樹。"},{"w":"lemon","p":"n.","d":"a sour yellow fruit often used to flavor drinks and food","c":"檸檬","s":"On a hot afternoon, nothing tastes better than a cold glass of lemon tea.","t":"在炎熱的午後，沒有什麼比一杯冰涼的檸檬茶更好喝了。"},{"w":"mango","p":"n.","d":"a sweet orange tropical fruit with a large seed inside","c":"芒果","s":"During the summer, my aunt makes a refreshing shaved ice topped with ripe mango.","t":"在夏天，我阿姨會做一份清爽的剉冰，上面鋪滿成熟的芒果。"},{"w":"orange","p":"n.","d":"a round citrus fruit with orange skin and juicy segments","c":"柳橙","s":"My mother squeezes a fresh orange every morning to make us juice.","t":"我媽媽每天早上都會榨一顆新鮮柳橙幫我們做果汁。"},{"w":"papaya","p":"n.","d":"a soft orange tropical fruit with small black seeds inside","c":"木瓜","s":"The fruit stand near my school always sells sliced papaya in small plastic bags.","t":"我學校附近的水果攤總是賣裝在小塑膠袋裡的木瓜切片。"},{"w":"peach","p":"n.","d":"a soft round fruit with fuzzy pink-orange skin","c":"桃子","s":"My grandmother's garden produces the juiciest peach every summer without fail.","t":"我奶奶的花園每年夏天都會結出最多汁的桃子。"},{"w":"pear","p":"n.","d":"a sweet fruit that is rounder at the bottom and narrow at the top","c":"梨子","s":"For dessert, the restaurant served a small dish of sliced pear with honey.","t":"餐廳上的甜點是一小盤淋上蜂蜜的梨子切片。"},{"w":"pineapple","p":"n.","d":"a tropical fruit with rough yellow-brown skin and a sweet juicy inside","c":"鳳梨","s":"The chef placed a thin slice of pineapple on top of the grilled pork.","t":"主廚在烤豬肉上放了一片薄薄的鳳梨切片。"},{"w":"strawberry","p":"n.","d":"a small red fruit with seeds on the outside","c":"草莓","s":"Every spring, families visit the farm to pick fresh strawberry themselves.","t":"每年春天，許多家庭都會到農場親自採摘新鮮的草莓。"},{"w":"tangerine","p":"n.","d":"a small sweet orange fruit that is easy to peel","c":"橘子","s":"During Chinese New Year, my grandmother gives every child a small tangerine for good luck.","t":"過年期間，我奶奶會給每個小孩一顆小橘子來祝福好運。"},{"w":"watermelon","p":"n.","d":"a large round fruit with green skin and juicy red flesh","c":"西瓜","s":"On the hottest day of August, we cut open a giant watermelon to share.","t":"在八月最熱的那一天，我們切開一顆巨大的西瓜來分享。"},{"w":"vegetable","p":"n.","d":"a plant or part of a plant that people eat, like carrots or lettuce","c":"蔬菜","s":"The doctor told my brother to eat more vegetable and less fried food.","t":"醫生告訴我哥哥要多吃蔬菜，少吃油炸食物。"},{"w":"bean","p":"n.","d":"a small seed from certain plants, often cooked and eaten","c":"豆","s":"My grandmother boils a pot of sweet red bean soup every winter morning.","t":"每年冬天的早晨，我奶奶都會煮一鍋甜甜的紅豆湯。"},{"w":"cabbage","p":"n.","d":"a round vegetable with thick green or purple leaves","c":"高麗菜","s":"The chef chopped a fresh head of cabbage for the side salad.","t":"主廚切了一顆新鮮的高麗菜來做配菜沙拉。"},{"w":"carrot","p":"n.","d":"a long orange vegetable that grows underground","c":"紅蘿蔔","s":"My little sister only eats her vegetable soup if it has carrot in it.","t":"我妹妹只有在蔬菜湯裡有紅蘿蔔的時候才會喝。"},{"w":"corn","p":"n.","d":"a tall yellow vegetable with many small kernels on a cob","c":"玉米","s":"At the summer festival, the smell of grilled corn filled the entire street.","t":"在夏季慶典上，烤玉米的香味瀰漫了整條街。"},{"w":"lettuce","p":"n.","d":"a green leafy vegetable often used in salads and sandwiches","c":"萵苣","s":"The waiter added a few crisp leaves of lettuce to the sandwich.","t":"服務生在三明治裡加了幾片脆脆的萵苣葉。"},{"w":"onion","p":"n.","d":"a round vegetable with a strong smell and taste, often used in cooking","c":"洋蔥","s":"Whenever my father chops an onion, the whole kitchen makes us cry a little.","t":"每次我爸爸切洋蔥時，整個廚房都會讓我們流一點眼淚。"},{"w":"potato","p":"n.","d":"a round vegetable that grows underground and is often boiled or fried","c":"馬鈴薯","s":"On Sunday nights, my mother bakes a large potato for each of us.","t":"每個星期天晚上，我媽媽都會幫我們每個人烤一顆大馬鈴薯。"},{"w":"pumpkin","p":"n.","d":"a large round orange vegetable, often used in autumn dishes","c":"南瓜","s":"Every October, my neighbor carves a giant pumpkin and places it by the door.","t":"每年十月，我的鄰居都會雕刻一顆巨大的南瓜放在門邊。"},{"w":"tomato","p":"n.","d":"a soft round red fruit usually eaten as a vegetable","c":"番茄","s":"My father grows juicy red tomato in pots on our small balcony.","t":"我爸爸在我們家的小陽台用盆栽種了多汁的紅番茄。"},{"w":"drink","p":"n.","d":"any liquid that you swallow, such as water or juice","c":"飲料","s":"The waiter asked what kind of drink we wanted with our meal.","t":"服務生問我們用餐時想要喝什麼飲料。"},{"w":"beer","p":"n.","d":"a yellow alcoholic drink made from grain","c":"啤酒","s":"At the summer festival, the food stalls sold cold beer alongside grilled meat.","t":"在夏季慶典上，攤位除了賣烤肉，也賣冰涼的啤酒。"},{"w":"coffee","p":"n.","d":"a dark hot drink made from roasted beans","c":"咖啡","s":"Every morning before work, my father stops at the same shop for a hot coffee.","t":"每天上班前，我爸爸都會在同一家店買一杯熱咖啡。"},{"w":"cola","p":"n.","d":"a sweet brown carbonated soft drink","c":"可樂","s":"At the movie theater, my brother always orders a large cola with his popcorn.","t":"在電影院裡，我哥哥總是會點一杯大杯可樂配他的爆米花。"},{"w":"juice","p":"n.","d":"a liquid drink made by pressing fruit or vegetables","c":"果汁","s":"For breakfast, my mother gives me a small glass of fresh orange juice.","t":"早餐時，我媽媽會給我一小杯新鮮的柳橙汁。"},{"w":"milk","p":"n.","d":"a white drink that comes from cows and is good for your bones","c":"牛奶","s":"Before bed, my little brother always drinks a warm glass of milk.","t":"睡前，我弟弟總是會喝一杯溫熱的牛奶。"},{"w":"soda","p":"n.","d":"a sweet bubbly soft drink","c":"汽水","s":"The bubbles in the cold soda tickled my nose as I drank it quickly.","t":"我快速喝汽水時，冰涼的氣泡讓我的鼻子覺得有點癢。"},{"w":"soft drink","p":"n.","d":"a sweet, non-alcoholic drink, often with bubbles","c":"汽水","s":"The vending machine outside our classroom only sells water and one kind of soft drink.","t":"我們教室外面的販賣機只賣水和一種汽水。"},{"w":"tea","p":"n.","d":"a hot or cold drink made by soaking dried leaves in water","c":"茶","s":"My grandmother drinks a cup of warm tea every afternoon at exactly three o'clock.","t":"我奶奶每天下午三點整都會喝一杯溫熱的茶。"},{"w":"butter","p":"n.","d":"a soft yellow food made from cream, spread on bread","c":"奶油","s":"My mother melts a small piece of butter on top of the hot pancakes.","t":"我媽媽會在熱熱的鬆餅上融化一小塊奶油。"},{"w":"cream","p":"n.","d":"the thick rich part of milk, often used to top desserts","c":"鮮奶油","s":"The waiter added a swirl of whipped cream on top of my hot chocolate.","t":"服務生在我的熱巧克力上加了一圈打發鮮奶油。"},{"w":"flour","p":"n.","d":"a fine white powder made from grain, used to make bread and cakes","c":"麵粉","s":"Before baking, my mother sifted the flour carefully into a large mixing bowl.","t":"烘焙前，我媽媽小心地把麵粉過篩到一個大攪拌碗裡。"},{"w":"honey","p":"n.","d":"a sweet sticky golden liquid made by bees","c":"蜂蜜","s":"My grandmother always adds a spoonful of honey to her morning tea.","t":"我奶奶每天早上喝茶時都會加一勺蜂蜜。"},{"w":"ketchup","p":"n.","d":"a thick red sauce made from tomatoes, often eaten with fries","c":"番茄醬","s":"My little cousin pours far too much ketchup on his French fries every time.","t":"我表弟每次吃薯條都會倒太多番茄醬。"},{"w":"oil","p":"n.","d":"a thick liquid used for cooking food","c":"油","s":"The chef heated a small amount of oil in the pan before adding the vegetables.","t":"主廚在加入蔬菜之前先在鍋裡熱了少量的油。"},{"w":"pepper","p":"n.","d":"a spice with small black or white grains, used to add a sharp taste","c":"胡椒","s":"My father always shakes a little black pepper onto his fried eggs.","t":"我爸爸吃煎蛋時總會撒一點黑胡椒。"},{"w":"salt","p":"n.","d":"a white substance used to add flavor to food","c":"鹽","s":"The soup tasted a little plain, so I added a small pinch of salt.","t":"這碗湯味道有點淡，所以我加了一小撮鹽。"},{"w":"soy-sauce","p":"n.","d":"a dark salty sauce made from soybeans, common in Asian cooking","c":"醬油","s":"My mother dips the dumplings into a small bowl of dark soy-sauce before eating.","t":"我媽媽吃餃子前會先沾一小碗深色的醬油。"},{"w":"sugar","p":"n.","d":"a sweet white substance used to make food and drinks taste sweet","c":"糖","s":"My brother always adds two spoonfuls of sugar to his coffee every morning.","t":"我哥哥每天早上喝咖啡時都會加兩勺糖。"},{"w":"vinegar","p":"n.","d":"a sour liquid used to add flavor or to pickle food","c":"醋","s":"My grandmother mixes a splash of vinegar into the salad dressing for extra flavor.","t":"我奶奶會在沙拉醬裡加一點醋來增添風味。"}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"Family / People / Age / Titles (家庭成員/人物/年齡/稱謂)","cards":[{"w":"family","p":"n.","d":"a group of people who are related, such as parents and children","c":"家庭","s":"Every Sunday evening, my whole family gathers together for a big dinner.","t":"每個星期天晚上，我們全家人都會聚在一起吃一頓豐盛的晚餐。"},{"w":"aunt","p":"n.","d":"the sister of your father or mother","c":"阿姨","s":"My aunt always brings homemade cookies whenever she visits us.","t":"我阿姨每次來看我們時，都會帶自己做的餅乾。"},{"w":"uncle","p":"n.","d":"the brother of your father or mother","c":"叔叔","s":"My uncle taught me how to ride a bicycle in the park.","t":"我叔叔在公園裡教我怎麼騎自行車。"},{"w":"brother","p":"n.","d":"a boy or man who has the same parents as you","c":"兄弟","s":"My older brother helps me with my math homework every night.","t":"我哥哥每天晚上都會幫我做數學作業。"},{"w":"sister","p":"n.","d":"a girl or woman who has the same parents as you","c":"姊妹","s":"My little sister always borrows my clothes without asking first.","t":"我妹妹總是不問就借穿我的衣服。"},{"w":"cousin","p":"n.","d":"the child of your aunt or uncle","c":"表(堂)兄弟姊妹","s":"During summer vacation, my cousin from Taipei comes to stay with us.","t":"暑假期間，我從台北來的表哥會來我們家住。"},{"w":"daughter","p":"n.","d":"a person's female child","c":"女兒","s":"My neighbor's daughter just started learning the piano this year.","t":"我鄰居的女兒今年剛開始學鋼琴。"},{"w":"son","p":"n.","d":"a person's male child","c":"兒子","s":"Their son wants to become a doctor when he grows up.","t":"他們的兒子長大後想當醫生。"},{"w":"father","p":"n.","d":"a male parent","c":"爸爸","s":"My father drives me to school every morning before work.","t":"我爸爸每天早上上班前都會載我去上學。"},{"w":"mother","p":"n.","d":"a female parent","c":"媽媽","s":"My mother always packs an extra snack in my school bag.","t":"我媽媽總是會在我的書包裡多放一份點心。"},{"w":"parent","p":"n.","d":"a father or mother","c":"雙親","s":"Each parent signed the school form before the trip on Friday.","t":"每位家長都在星期五的旅行前簽好了學校的表格。"},{"w":"granddaughter","p":"n.","d":"the daughter of someone's son or daughter","c":"孫女","s":"My grandmother proudly shows photos of her granddaughter to all her friends.","t":"我奶奶總是驕傲地把孫女的照片給所有朋友看。"},{"w":"grandson","p":"n.","d":"the son of someone's son or daughter","c":"孫子","s":"Every Lunar New Year, my grandfather gives his grandson a red envelope.","t":"每年農曆新年，我爺爺都會給他的孫子一個紅包。"},{"w":"grandfather","p":"n.","d":"the father of your father or mother","c":"祖父（外公）","s":"My grandfather tells the same funny story every time we visit him.","t":"我爺爺每次我們去看他時都會講同一個有趣的故事。"},{"w":"grandmother","p":"n.","d":"the mother of your father or mother","c":"祖母（外婆）","s":"My grandmother taught me how to make dumplings when I was little.","t":"我奶奶在我小時候教我怎麼包餃子。"},{"w":"husband","p":"n.","d":"a married man, in relation to his wife","c":"丈夫","s":"Her husband cooks dinner for the whole family every Wednesday night.","t":"她的丈夫每個星期三晚上都會幫全家人做晚餐。"},{"w":"wife","p":"n.","d":"a married woman, in relation to her husband","c":"妻子","s":"My uncle's wife runs a small flower shop near the train station.","t":"我叔叔的妻子在火車站附近經營一家小花店。"},{"w":"nephew","p":"n.","d":"the son of your brother or sister","c":"侄子","s":"My nephew just turned five and loves playing with toy trains.","t":"我的姪子剛滿五歲，很喜歡玩玩具火車。"},{"w":"niece","p":"n.","d":"the daughter of your brother or sister","c":"侄女","s":"I gave my niece a storybook for her birthday last month.","t":"上個月我送了我的姪女一本故事書當生日禮物。"},{"w":"relative","p":"n.","d":"a person in your family, such as an aunt or cousin","c":"親戚","s":"Many of our relative traveled from other cities to attend the wedding.","t":"我們的許多親戚都從其他城市來參加這場婚禮。"},{"w":"human","p":"adj.","d":"relating to people rather than animals or machines","c":"人類的","s":"Scientists say that this kind of memory is a uniquely human ability.","t":"科學家說這種記憶力是人類獨有的能力。"},{"w":"person","p":"n.","d":"a single human being","c":"個人","s":"Only one person can sit in the front seat of the small car.","t":"這輛小車的前座只能坐一個人。"},{"w":"people","p":"n.","d":"more than one person","c":"人們","s":"Hundreds of people lined up outside the store before it even opened.","t":"商店還沒開門，外面就已經排了好幾百人。"},{"w":"adult","p":"n.","d":"a fully grown person","c":"成人","s":"Children under twelve must be accompanied by an adult on this ride.","t":"十二歲以下的兒童搭乘這項遊樂設施必須有成人陪同。"},{"w":"baby","p":"n.","d":"a very young child who cannot yet walk or talk","c":"嬰孩","s":"The new baby next door cries loudly almost every single night.","t":"隔壁那個新生的嬰兒幾乎每晚都會大聲哭鬧。"},{"w":"child","p":"n.","d":"a young person, not yet an adult","c":"小孩子","s":"Every child in the class received a small gift from the teacher.","t":"班上的每個孩子都收到了老師送的小禮物。"},{"w":"kid","p":"n.","d":"a child, used in a casual way","c":"孩子","s":"The kid next door always wants to play basketball after school.","t":"隔壁那個孩子放學後總是想打籃球。"},{"w":"teenager","p":"n.","d":"a young person between thirteen and nineteen years old","c":"青少年","s":"Most teenager in my neighborhood spend their weekends at the shopping mall.","t":"我家附近的大多數青少年週末都會去逛購物中心。"},{"w":"boy","p":"n.","d":"a young male person","c":"男孩","s":"The boy sitting next to me forgot to bring his pencil case today.","t":"坐在我旁邊的那個男孩今天忘了帶他的鉛筆盒。"},{"w":"girl","p":"n.","d":"a young female person","c":"女孩","s":"A girl from my class won first prize in the singing contest.","t":"我班上的一個女孩在歌唱比賽中得到了第一名。"},{"w":"gentleman","p":"n.","d":"a polite and well-mannered man","c":"紳士","s":"The old gentleman kindly held the door open for everyone entering the building.","t":"那位老紳士很有禮貌地幫每個進入大樓的人開門。"},{"w":"lady","p":"n.","d":"a polite way to refer to a woman","c":"淑女","s":"An elderly lady asked the driver to stop near the post office.","t":"一位年長的女士請司機在郵局附近停車。"},{"w":"ma'am","p":"n.","d":"a polite way to address a woman","c":"女士","s":"Excuse me, ma'am, could you please tell me where the exit is?","t":"不好意思，女士，可以請您告訴我出口在哪裡嗎？"},{"w":"sir","p":"n.","d":"a polite way to address a man","c":"先生","s":"Excuse me, sir, you dropped your wallet near the entrance.","t":"先生，不好意思，您的錢包掉在入口附近了。"},{"w":"Miss","p":"n.","d":"a polite title used before the name of a young woman","c":"小姐","s":"Miss Chen will be our new English teacher starting next week.","t":"陳小姐下星期開始將成為我們新的英文老師。"},{"w":"Mr.","p":"n.","d":"a polite title used before a man's name","c":"先生","s":"Mr. Wang welcomed every new student warmly on the first day.","t":"王先生在開學第一天熱情地歡迎每位新生。"},{"w":"Mrs.","p":"n.","d":"a polite title used before a married woman's name","c":"夫人","s":"Mrs. Lin organized the entire school fair by herself this year.","t":"林夫人今年獨自籌辦了整個學校的園遊會。"},{"w":"Ms.","p":"n.","d":"a polite title used before a woman's name","c":"女士","s":"Ms. Huang answered every question patiently during the meeting.","t":"黃女士在會議中耐心地回答了每個問題。"},{"w":"man","p":"n.","d":"an adult male person","c":"男人","s":"A tall man in a gray coat asked us for directions downtown.","t":"一位穿著灰色外套的高個子男人向我們問市區的方向。"},{"w":"woman","p":"n.","d":"an adult female person","c":"女人","s":"The woman sitting across from me on the bus was reading a thick novel.","t":"坐在公車上我對面的那位女人正在讀一本厚厚的小說。"},{"w":"female","p":"adj.","d":"relating to women or girls","c":"女性的","s":"This year, more female students joined the school's robotics club than ever before.","t":"今年比以往有更多女學生加入學校的機器人社團。"},{"w":"male","p":"adj.","d":"relating to men or boys","c":"男性的","s":"The coach is looking for a few more male players to join the soccer team.","t":"教練正在尋找幾位男學生加入足球隊。"}]},{"unit":9,"theme":"Jobs / Professions (職業)","cards":[{"w":"job","p":"n.","d":"the work a person does regularly to earn money","c":"職業","s":"My father has a new job at a company close to our apartment.","t":"我爸爸在離我們公寓很近的一家公司找到了一份新工作。"},{"w":"actor","p":"n.","d":"a man who performs in movies, plays, or TV shows","c":"男演員","s":"The famous actor signed autographs for fans outside the theater after the show.","t":"那位知名男演員在演出後在劇院外為粉絲簽名。"},{"w":"actress","p":"n.","d":"a woman who performs in movies, plays, or TV shows","c":"女演員","s":"The young actress practiced her lines every night before the big audition.","t":"那位年輕女演員在重要試鏡前每晚都會練習她的台詞。"},{"w":"model","p":"n.","d":"a person who wears clothes for photos or shows to sell products","c":"模特兒","s":"The fashion model walked confidently down the runway in a bright red dress.","t":"那位時尚模特兒穿著一條鮮紅色洋裝，自信地走在天橋上。"},{"w":"magician","p":"n.","d":"a person who performs tricks that seem like magic","c":"魔術師","s":"At the birthday party, a magician pulled a white rabbit out of his hat.","t":"在生日派對上，一位魔術師從帽子裡拉出一隻白兔。"},{"w":"artist","p":"n.","d":"a person who creates paintings, drawings, or other works of art","c":"藝術家","s":"The artist spent the whole afternoon painting a colorful mural on the school wall.","t":"那位藝術家花了整個下午在學校牆上畫了一幅色彩鮮豔的壁畫。"},{"w":"musician","p":"n.","d":"a person who plays a musical instrument professionally","c":"音樂家","s":"The street musician played his violin beautifully near the entrance of the park.","t":"那位街頭音樂家在公園入口附近優美地演奏著小提琴。"},{"w":"scientist","p":"n.","d":"a person who studies and does research in science","c":"科學家","s":"The scientist carefully recorded every result during the long laboratory experiment.","t":"那位科學家在這場漫長的實驗室實驗中仔細記錄了每一個結果。"},{"w":"writer","p":"n.","d":"a person who writes books, articles, or stories as a job","c":"作家","s":"The famous writer spent three years working on her newest novel.","t":"那位知名作家花了三年時間創作她最新的小說。"},{"w":"president","p":"n.","d":"the leader of a country or organization","c":"總統","s":"The president gave an important speech about education on national television.","t":"總統在全國電視上發表了一場關於教育的重要演說。"},{"w":"diplomat","p":"n.","d":"a person who represents their country in talks with other countries","c":"外交官","s":"The diplomat traveled to several countries to discuss the new trade agreement.","t":"那位外交官前往多個國家討論新的貿易協定。"},{"w":"officer","p":"n.","d":"a person who holds a position of command, such as in the army or police","c":"軍官","s":"A police officer helped the lost tourist find her way back to the hotel.","t":"一位警官幫助那位迷路的遊客找到回飯店的路。"},{"w":"guard","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to protect people or places","c":"警衛","s":"The guard checked every visitor's bag before allowing them into the museum.","t":"那位警衛在讓每位訪客進入博物館之前都會檢查他們的包包。"},{"w":"judge","p":"n.","d":"a person who decides cases in a court of law","c":"法官","s":"The judge listened carefully to both sides before making a final decision.","t":"那位法官在做出最終判決之前仔細聽取了雙方的說法。"},{"w":"lawyer","p":"n.","d":"a person trained to give advice about laws and represent people in court","c":"律師","s":"My cousin hired a lawyer to help her understand the rental contract.","t":"我表姐請了一位律師幫她了解租屋合約的內容。"},{"w":"doctor","p":"n.","d":"a person trained to treat sick or injured people","c":"醫生","s":"The doctor carefully examined the little boy's broken arm before wrapping it.","t":"那位醫生在包紮之前仔細檢查了那個小男孩骨折的手臂。"},{"w":"dentist","p":"n.","d":"a person trained to treat teeth and gums","c":"牙醫","s":"My little sister was nervous before her first visit to the dentist.","t":"我妹妹第一次看牙醫前感到非常緊張。"},{"w":"nurse","p":"n.","d":"a person trained to care for sick or injured people, often in a hospital","c":"護士","s":"The kind nurse checked on every patient in the room every hour.","t":"那位親切的護士每小時都會去查看病房裡的每位病人。"},{"w":"journalist","p":"n.","d":"a person who writes news stories for newspapers, magazines, or websites","c":"新聞記者","s":"The journalist interviewed several witnesses right after the accident happened.","t":"那位新聞記者在事故發生後立刻採訪了幾位目擊者。"},{"w":"reporter","p":"n.","d":"a person who collects and presents news, often on TV or radio","c":"記者","s":"A reporter stood outside the building, waiting to ask the mayor a question.","t":"一位記者站在大樓外面，等著向市長提問。"},{"w":"principal","p":"n.","d":"the person in charge of a school","c":"校長","s":"Our principal welcomed all the new students during the morning assembly.","t":"我們的校長在早會時歡迎所有新生。"},{"w":"professor","p":"n.","d":"a senior teacher at a college or university","c":"教授","s":"The professor explained the difficult theory using a simple, clear example.","t":"那位教授用一個簡單清楚的例子解釋了那個困難的理論。"},{"w":"teacher","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to help students learn","c":"老師","s":"Our English teacher always makes grammar lessons fun with games.","t":"我們的英文老師總是用遊戲讓文法課變得很有趣。"},{"w":"engineer","p":"n.","d":"a person who designs or builds machines, structures, or systems","c":"工程師","s":"The engineer checked every part of the bridge before it opened to traffic.","t":"那位工程師在橋樑開放通行前檢查了每一個部件。"},{"w":"priest","p":"n.","d":"a religious leader who performs ceremonies in a church","c":"牧師","s":"The priest spoke gently to comfort the family during the quiet ceremony.","t":"那位牧師在這場安靜的儀式中溫和地安慰著那個家庭。"},{"w":"coach","p":"n.","d":"a person who trains an athlete or sports team","c":"教練","s":"Our basketball coach made the whole team practice for two extra hours.","t":"我們的籃球教練讓全隊額外練習了兩個小時。"},{"w":"sailor","p":"n.","d":"a person who works on a ship","c":"水手","s":"The old sailor told us exciting stories about his years at sea.","t":"那位老水手跟我們講述了他多年航海生活的精彩故事。"},{"w":"singer","p":"n.","d":"a person who sings, especially as a profession","c":"歌手","s":"The young singer performed her first concert in front of thousands of fans.","t":"那位年輕歌手在數千名粉絲面前舉辦了她的第一場演唱會。"},{"w":"businessman","p":"n.","d":"a man who works in business, often running a company","c":"商人","s":"The successful businessman started his first small shop when he was only twenty.","t":"那位成功的商人在二十歲時就開了他第一間小店。"},{"w":"boss","p":"n.","d":"the person who is in charge at work","c":"老闆","s":"My boss praised our whole team for finishing the project early.","t":"我老闆稱讚我們整個團隊提早完成了這個專案。"},{"w":"secretary","p":"n.","d":"a person who organizes schedules, letters, and other office tasks","c":"秘書","s":"The busy secretary answered the phone and scheduled three meetings before lunch.","t":"那位忙碌的秘書接了電話，並在午餐前安排了三場會議。"},{"w":"manager","p":"n.","d":"a person who is in charge of a department, store, or team","c":"經理","s":"The store manager trained the new employees on their very first day.","t":"那家店的經理在新員工的第一天就對他們進行了培訓。"},{"w":"clerk","p":"n.","d":"a person who works in an office or store handling records or sales","c":"職員","s":"The clerk at the front desk politely explained how to fill out the form.","t":"前台的那位職員很有禮貌地解釋了如何填寫這份表格。"},{"w":"assistant","p":"n.","d":"a person who helps someone else with their work","c":"助理","s":"The doctor's assistant called to remind me about my appointment tomorrow.","t":"那位醫生的助理打電話來提醒我明天的預約。"}]},{"unit":10,"theme":"Roles / Characters / Personality (角色/人物/個性)","cards":[{"w":"character","p":"n.","d":"a person in a story, movie, or play","c":"角色","s":"My favorite character in the movie was the brave young girl who saved her village.","t":"我在這部電影裡最喜歡的角色是那位拯救村莊的勇敢女孩。"},{"w":"role","p":"n.","d":"the part a person plays in a movie, play, or situation","c":"角色","s":"She practiced for weeks before finally winning the lead role in the school play.","t":"她練習了好幾個星期，終於在學校的話劇中贏得了主角這個角色。"},{"w":"angel","p":"n.","d":"a spiritual being often shown with wings, believed to help people","c":"天使","s":"In the old painting, a small angel floats gently above the sleeping baby.","t":"在這幅古老的畫作中，一個小天使輕輕地飄浮在熟睡的嬰兒上方。"},{"w":"dragon","p":"n.","d":"a large imaginary creature that can fly and breathe fire","c":"龍","s":"In the story, a brave knight finally defeated the fierce dragon guarding the castle.","t":"在這個故事裡，一位勇敢的騎士終於打敗了守護城堡的兇猛巨龍。"},{"w":"ghost","p":"n.","d":"the spirit of a dead person, believed to appear to the living","c":"鬼","s":"My little brother was too scared to watch the ghost movie alone at night.","t":"我弟弟太害怕了，晚上不敢獨自看那部鬼片。"},{"w":"god","p":"n.","d":"a powerful being worshipped in a religion","c":"神","s":"In ancient Greek stories, every god controlled a different part of nature.","t":"在古希臘的故事裡，每位神都掌控著自然界的不同部分。"},{"w":"monster","p":"n.","d":"a large, frightening imaginary creature","c":"怪物","s":"The little boy hid under his blanket, afraid a monster was hiding in his closet.","t":"那個小男孩躲在被子下面，害怕衣櫃裡藏著怪物。"},{"w":"customer","p":"n.","d":"a person who buys goods or services from a shop or business","c":"顧客","s":"The shop owner greeted every customer with a warm smile at the door.","t":"店主在門口用溫暖的笑容迎接每一位顧客。"},{"w":"guest","p":"n.","d":"a person who is invited to visit or stay somewhere","c":"客人","s":"My mother prepared extra food because we were expecting several guest for dinner.","t":"我媽媽多準備了一些食物，因為我們晚餐預計會有好幾位客人。"},{"w":"passenger","p":"n.","d":"a person traveling in a vehicle who is not driving it","c":"乘客","s":"Every passenger on the plane was asked to fasten their seatbelt before landing.","t":"飛機上的每位乘客在降落前都被要求繫好安全帶。"},{"w":"enemy","p":"n.","d":"a person who is against you or wants to harm you","c":"敵人","s":"In the video game, players must defeat every enemy to reach the final level.","t":"在這款電玩遊戲中，玩家必須打敗每一個敵人才能進入最後一關。"},{"w":"neighbor","p":"n.","d":"a person who lives near you","c":"鄰居","s":"Our friendly neighbor always waters our plants whenever we go on vacation.","t":"我們友善的鄰居每次我們去旅行時都會幫忙澆花。"},{"w":"friend","p":"n.","d":"a person you know well and like","c":"朋友","s":"My best friend and I have known each other since elementary school.","t":"我最好的朋友和我從小學就認識了。"},{"w":"partner","p":"n.","d":"a person who works together with you on something","c":"夥伴","s":"For the science project, my partner and I built a small model volcano.","t":"為了這個科學作業，我的夥伴和我做了一個小型的火山模型。"},{"w":"stranger","p":"n.","d":"a person you do not know","c":"陌生人","s":"My parents always tell me never to get into a car with a stranger.","t":"我父母總是告訴我絕對不要上陌生人的車。"},{"w":"visitor","p":"n.","d":"a person who comes to see a place or person","c":"訪客","s":"Every visitor must sign in at the front desk before entering the building.","t":"每位訪客在進入大樓前都必須在櫃台登記。"},{"w":"fool","p":"n.","d":"a person who does something silly or unwise","c":"傻瓜","s":"He felt like a complete fool after forgetting his own birthday party.","t":"他忘了自己的生日派對，覺得自己像個十足的傻瓜。"},{"w":"genius","p":"n.","d":"a person with extremely high intelligence or talent","c":"天才","s":"Everyone in class called her a genius after she solved the hardest math problem instantly.","t":"她瞬間解出了最難的數學題，全班都稱她為天才。"},{"w":"giant","p":"n.","d":"an imaginary very large person in stories","c":"巨人","s":"In the old fairy tale, a friendly giant helped the small village build a new bridge.","t":"在這個古老的童話故事裡，一位友善的巨人幫助小村莊建造了一座新橋。"},{"w":"hero","p":"n.","d":"a person admired for great courage or brave actions","c":"英雄","s":"The firefighter became a local hero after rescuing the family from the burning building.","t":"那位消防員救出燃燒大樓裡的家庭後，成為了當地的英雄。"},{"w":"hunter","p":"n.","d":"a person who hunts wild animals for food or sport","c":"獵人","s":"The experienced hunter moved silently through the forest, following the deer's tracks.","t":"那位經驗豐富的獵人在森林中悄悄前行，跟著鹿的足跡。"},{"w":"host","p":"n.","d":"a person who welcomes and takes care of guests","c":"主人","s":"As the host of the party, my aunt made sure everyone had enough food.","t":"作為派對的主人，我阿姨確保每個人都有足夠的食物。"},{"w":"leader","p":"n.","d":"a person who guides or is in charge of a group","c":"領導者","s":"Our class chose a new leader to organize the trip to the science museum.","t":"我們班選出了一位新的領導者來籌辦去科學博物館的旅行。"},{"w":"player","p":"n.","d":"a person who takes part in a game or sport","c":"選手","s":"The youngest player on the team scored the winning goal in the last minute.","t":"隊上最年輕的選手在最後一分鐘踢進了致勝的一球。"},{"w":"thief","p":"n.","d":"a person who steals things from others","c":"小偷","s":"The thief ran quickly down the alley after grabbing the woman's purse.","t":"那個小偷搶走那位女士的錢包後迅速沿著巷子跑走了。"},{"w":"king","p":"n.","d":"a male ruler of a country, usually inheriting the position","c":"國王","s":"In the old story, the king ruled the kingdom wisely for over forty years.","t":"在這個古老的故事中，國王明智地統治王國長達四十多年。"},{"w":"queen","p":"n.","d":"a female ruler of a country, or the wife of a king","c":"皇后","s":"The queen wore a beautiful golden crown during the entire ceremony.","t":"皇后在整個典禮中都戴著一頂美麗的金色皇冠。"},{"w":"prince","p":"n.","d":"the son of a king or queen","c":"王子","s":"The young prince learned how to ride a horse before his tenth birthday.","t":"那位年輕的王子在十歲生日前學會了騎馬。"},{"w":"princess","p":"n.","d":"the daughter of a king or queen","c":"公主","s":"In the fairy tale, the princess escaped from the tall tower using a long rope.","t":"在這個童話故事裡，公主用一條長繩子從高塔逃了出來。"},{"w":"servant","p":"n.","d":"a person who works in someone's home, helping with daily tasks","c":"僕人","s":"In the old castle, a loyal servant brought food to the king every evening.","t":"在這座古老的城堡裡，一位忠誠的僕人每天晚上都會為國王送上食物。"},{"w":"polite","p":"adj.","d":"having good manners; respectful toward others","c":"有禮貌的","s":"The new student was so polite that all the teachers liked him immediately.","t":"那位新學生非常有禮貌，所有老師都立刻喜歡上他。"},{"w":"impolite","p":"adj.","d":"not having good manners; rude","c":"沒禮貌的","s":"It is considered impolite to talk loudly on your phone during a quiet meal.","t":"在安靜的用餐時間大聲講電話被認為是沒禮貌的行為。"},{"w":"rude","p":"adj.","d":"not polite; showing no respect for others","c":"無禮的","s":"Everyone was shocked when the customer spoke in such a rude way to the waiter.","t":"當那位顧客對服務生說話如此無禮時，大家都感到很驚訝。"},{"w":"intelligent","p":"adj.","d":"able to think, learn, and understand things well","c":"明智的","s":"Even as a young child, she was clearly very intelligent and curious about everything.","t":"即使在小時候，她也明顯非常明智且對一切都充滿好奇心。"},{"w":"clever","p":"adj.","d":"able to think quickly and find smart solutions","c":"聰明的","s":"The clever fox found a clever way to escape from the trap.","t":"那隻聰明的狐狸找到了一個巧妙的方法逃出陷阱。"},{"w":"smart","p":"adj.","d":"intelligent; quick to learn or understand","c":"聰明的","s":"My older sister is very smart and always finishes her homework in record time.","t":"我姐姐非常聰明，總是能以最快的速度完成作業。"},{"w":"wise","p":"adj.","d":"having good judgment based on knowledge and experience","c":"有智慧的","s":"The wise old teacher always gave us thoughtful advice when we were confused.","t":"那位有智慧的老老師總是在我們困惑時給予我們深思熟慮的建議。"},{"w":"foolish","p":"adj.","d":"lacking good sense; unwise","c":"愚蠢的","s":"It was foolish of him to leave his bike unlocked outside the busy station.","t":"他把自行車沒鎖就放在繁忙的車站外面，這樣做真是愚蠢。"},{"w":"silly","p":"adj.","d":"behaving in a way that is not serious or sensible","c":"傻的","s":"We all laughed at his silly joke about the talking banana.","t":"我們都被他那個關於會說話的香蕉的傻笑話逗笑了。"},{"w":"stupid","p":"adj.","d":"showing a lack of good judgment or intelligence","c":"愚笨的","s":"Forgetting my umbrella on the rainiest day of the year felt like a stupid mistake.","t":"在這一年最多雨的日子忘記帶傘，這真是個愚笨的錯誤。"},{"w":"shy","p":"adj.","d":"nervous or uncomfortable around other people","c":"害羞的","s":"My little cousin is too shy to speak in front of the whole class.","t":"我的表弟太害羞了，不敢在全班面前說話。"},{"w":"talkative","p":"adj.","d":"liking to talk a lot","c":"愛說話的","s":"My uncle is so talkative that family dinners never have a single quiet moment.","t":"我叔叔非常愛說話，家庭聚餐時從來沒有一刻是安靜的。"},{"w":"goodness","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being kind and morally good","c":"善良","s":"The old man's goodness was clear to everyone who watched him help the stray dog.","t":"看到那位老人幫助流浪狗的人都能感受到他的善良。"},{"w":"honesty","p":"n.","d":"the quality of telling the truth and being sincere","c":"誠實","s":"My parents always remind me that honesty is more important than getting a perfect score.","t":"我父母總是提醒我，誠實比得到滿分更重要。"},{"w":"humor","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being funny or amusing","c":"幽默","s":"Even during the stressful exam week, my friend's humor always made us laugh.","t":"即使在壓力很大的考試週，我朋友的幽默感總是能讓我們笑出來。"}]},{"unit":11,"theme":"Jobs / Office / Technology / Communication (職業/辦公室/科技/通訊)","cards":[{"w":"student","p":"n.","d":"a person who is studying at a school or college","c":"學生","s":"Every student in the class received a new textbook on the first day.","t":"班上的每個學生在開學第一天都收到了一本新的課本。"},{"w":"police","p":"n.","d":"the official group of people who keep order and enforce laws","c":"警察","s":"When the alarm went off, someone immediately called the police for help.","t":"警報響起時，有人立刻打電話叫警察來幫忙。"},{"w":"soldier","p":"n.","d":"a person who serves in an army","c":"士兵","s":"The young soldier wrote a letter home to his family every single week.","t":"那位年輕的士兵每個星期都會寫一封信給家人。"},{"w":"driver","p":"n.","d":"a person who operates a vehicle, such as a car or bus","c":"司機","s":"The bus driver stopped at every corner to let passengers get on and off.","t":"公車司機在每個轉角都停車，讓乘客上下車。"},{"w":"captain","p":"n.","d":"the leader of a team or a ship","c":"隊長","s":"Our basketball team's captain called everyone together before the championship game.","t":"我們籃球隊的隊長在冠軍賽前把大家叫到一起。"},{"w":"cowboy","p":"n.","d":"a man who works with cattle on a ranch, often riding a horse","c":"牛仔","s":"In the old movie, a brave cowboy rode across the desert on his horse.","t":"在那部老電影裡，一位勇敢的牛仔騎著馬穿越沙漠。"},{"w":"farmer","p":"n.","d":"a person who grows crops or raises animals for a living","c":"農夫","s":"The farmer woke up before sunrise to feed the animals on his farm.","t":"那位農夫在日出前就起床去餵農場裡的動物。"},{"w":"fisherman","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to catch fish","c":"漁夫","s":"The old fisherman sailed out to sea every morning before the sun rose.","t":"那位老漁夫每天早上太陽升起前就出海了。"},{"w":"barber","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to cut men's hair","c":"理髮師","s":"My father visits the same barber every month for a haircut.","t":"我爸爸每個月都會去同一位理髮師那裡剪頭髮。"},{"w":"hairdresser","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to cut and style hair","c":"美髮師","s":"The hairdresser gave my sister a new haircut before her graduation ceremony.","t":"那位美髮師在我姐姐的畢業典禮前幫她剪了新髮型。"},{"w":"shopkeeper","p":"n.","d":"a person who owns or manages a small shop","c":"店主","s":"The friendly shopkeeper always remembers what each regular customer likes to buy.","t":"那位友善的店主總是記得每位常客喜歡買什麼東西。"},{"w":"vendor","p":"n.","d":"a person who sells things, often outdoors or on the street","c":"小販","s":"A street vendor sold fresh fruit from a small cart near the school gate.","t":"一位街頭小販在學校門口附近用小推車賣新鮮水果。"},{"w":"salesman","p":"n.","d":"a man whose job is to sell products","c":"推銷員","s":"The salesman explained every feature of the new phone patiently to the customer.","t":"那位推銷員耐心地向顧客解釋了新手機的每個功能。"},{"w":"waiter","p":"n.","d":"a man who serves food in a restaurant","c":"服務生","s":"The waiter recommended the seafood pasta as the restaurant's most popular dish.","t":"那位服務生推薦海鮮義大利麵，說那是這家餐廳最受歡迎的菜。"},{"w":"waitress","p":"n.","d":"a woman who serves food in a restaurant","c":"女服務生","s":"The waitress brought our drinks quickly and smiled warmly at every table.","t":"那位女服務生很快就送來我們的飲料，並對每一桌都熱情微笑。"},{"w":"mail carrier","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to deliver letters and packages","c":"郵差","s":"The mail carrier delivers packages to our neighborhood every afternoon around three o'clock.","t":"郵差每天下午大約三點都會把包裹送到我們的社區。"},{"w":"mailman","p":"n.","d":"a man whose job is to deliver letters and packages","c":"郵差","s":"Our friendly mailman always waves and says hello when he passes our house.","t":"我們友善的郵差每次經過我們家時都會揮手打招呼。"},{"w":"worker","p":"n.","d":"a person who works, especially at a job that involves physical effort","c":"工人","s":"A construction worker carefully carried the heavy bricks up the tall ladder.","t":"一位建築工人小心地把沉重的磚塊搬上高高的梯子。"},{"w":"mechanic","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to repair machines, especially cars","c":"技工","s":"The mechanic quickly found the problem and fixed our car's engine that afternoon.","t":"那位技工很快就找到問題，並在那天下午修好了我們汽車的引擎。"},{"w":"painter","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to paint walls, houses, or buildings","c":"油漆工","s":"The painter spent three days giving our entire house a fresh coat of white paint.","t":"那位油漆工花了三天時間幫我們整個房子重新刷上白色油漆。"},{"w":"baby sitter","p":"n.","d":"a person who is paid to take care of children for a short time","c":"保母","s":"My parents hired a baby sitter so they could go out for dinner on Saturday night.","t":"我父母請了一位保母，這樣他們星期六晚上就能出去吃晚餐。"},{"w":"housewife","p":"n.","d":"a woman who manages the home and family instead of having an outside job","c":"家庭主婦","s":"As a busy housewife, she cooks, cleans, and takes care of three young children every day.","t":"作為一位忙碌的家庭主婦，她每天都要做飯、打掃，並照顧三個年幼的孩子。"},{"w":"office","p":"n.","d":"a room or building where people do business work","c":"辦公室","s":"My mother works in a tall building with her office on the twentieth floor.","t":"我媽媽在一棟高樓裡工作，她的辦公室在二十樓。"},{"w":"department","p":"n.","d":"a part of a large organization that handles a specific area of work","c":"部門","s":"My uncle works in the sales department of a large electronics company.","t":"我叔叔在一家大型電子公司的銷售部門工作。"},{"w":"chart","p":"n.","d":"a drawing that shows information using lines, bars, or shapes","c":"圖表","s":"The teacher drew a colorful chart on the board to explain the weather patterns.","t":"老師在黑板上畫了一張色彩鮮豔的圖表來解釋天氣的模式。"},{"w":"form","p":"n.","d":"a document with blank spaces for writing in information","c":"表格","s":"Before the trip, every student had to fill out a permission form.","t":"在這次旅行之前，每位學生都必須填寫一份許可表格。"},{"w":"list","p":"n.","d":"a set of names, numbers, or items written one after another","c":"清單","s":"My mother wrote a shopping list before we went to the supermarket together.","t":"我媽媽在我們一起去超市之前寫了一份購物清單。"},{"w":"copy","p":"n.","d":"a version of something made to look exactly like the original","c":"副本","s":"The teacher gave each student a copy of the worksheet before the quiz.","t":"老師在小考前給每位學生一份練習卷的副本。"},{"w":"e-mail","p":"n.","d":"a message sent electronically over the Internet","c":"電子郵件","s":"My teacher sent an e-mail to remind everyone about tomorrow's field trip.","t":"我老師發了一封電子郵件來提醒大家明天的校外教學。"},{"w":"mail","p":"n.","d":"letters and packages sent through the postal service","c":"郵件","s":"We checked the mailbox every afternoon, hoping for a letter from grandma.","t":"我們每天下午都會檢查信箱，希望能收到奶奶寄來的信。"},{"w":"letter","p":"n.","d":"a written message sent to a person, usually by mail","c":"信件","s":"She wrote a long letter to her best friend who had moved overseas.","t":"她寫了一封長信給搬到國外的最好朋友。"},{"w":"message","p":"n.","d":"a short piece of information sent to someone","c":"口信","s":"My mother left a message on the kitchen table telling me dinner was in the fridge.","t":"我媽媽在廚房餐桌上留了一張口信，告訴我晚餐在冰箱裡。"},{"w":"file","p":"n.","d":"a folder or collection of documents kept together","c":"文件夾","s":"The secretary organized every important paper into a labeled file.","t":"秘書把每份重要文件都整理進有標籤的文件夾裡。"},{"w":"information","p":"n.","d":"facts or details that someone learns or is told","c":"資訊","s":"The librarian helped me find useful information for my history report.","t":"圖書館員幫我找到了寫歷史報告所需的有用資訊。"},{"w":"knowledge","p":"n.","d":"the things a person knows from learning or experience","c":"知識","s":"My grandfather has deep knowledge about plants from years of gardening.","t":"我爺爺因為多年的園藝經驗，對植物有很深的知識。"},{"w":"Internet","p":"n.","d":"a global system that connects computers so people can share information","c":"網路","s":"We searched the Internet for information about ancient Egypt for our project.","t":"我們在網路上搜尋了關於古埃及的資訊來做我們的專案。"},{"w":"link","p":"n.","d":"something that connects one webpage or piece of information to another","c":"連結","s":"My teacher shared a link to the online quiz in our class group chat.","t":"我老師在我們的班級群組裡分享了線上小考的連結。"},{"w":"computer","p":"n.","d":"an electronic machine used to store and process information","c":"電腦","s":"My brother uses his computer every night to finish his online homework.","t":"我哥哥每天晚上都用他的電腦完成線上作業。"},{"w":"screen","p":"n.","d":"the flat surface on a device where images and text appear","c":"螢幕","s":"The screen on my old laptop cracked after it fell off the desk.","t":"我那台舊筆電的螢幕在掉下桌子後裂開了。"},{"w":"printer","p":"n.","d":"a machine that puts text or images from a computer onto paper","c":"印表機","s":"The office printer ran out of ink right before the important meeting.","t":"辦公室的印表機在重要會議前剛好沒墨水了。"}]},{"unit":12,"theme":"School Life (學校生活)","cards":[{"w":"school","p":"n.","d":"a place where children go to learn","c":"學校","s":"Every morning, my little brother walks to school with his best friend from next door.","t":"每天早上，我弟弟都和隔壁的好朋友一起走去學校。"},{"w":"campus","p":"n.","d":"the land and buildings of a school or university","c":"校園","s":"On the first day, new students took a tour around the whole campus.","t":"開學第一天，新生們在整個校園裡參觀了一圈。"},{"w":"semester","p":"n.","d":"one of the two main periods that a school year is divided into","c":"學期","s":"Our final exams are usually held during the last week of the semester.","t":"我們的期末考通常在這個學期的最後一週舉行。"},{"w":"grade","p":"n.","d":"a score or mark given for schoolwork showing how well a student did","c":"成績","s":"She studied hard all week and finally earned a perfect grade on her math test.","t":"她整週用功學習，終於在數學考試中得到了滿分的成績。"},{"w":"course","p":"n.","d":"a series of lessons on a particular subject","c":"課程","s":"My sister signed up for an art course at the community center this summer.","t":"我姐姐這個暑假在社區中心報名了一門美術課程。"},{"w":"lesson","p":"n.","d":"a period of time spent learning or teaching one subject","c":"功課","s":"Today's lesson was about how plants grow from tiny seeds into tall trees.","t":"今天的課程是關於植物如何從小小的種子長成高大的樹木。"},{"w":"exam","p":"n.","d":"a formal test of knowledge or skill","c":"考試","s":"All the students felt nervous while waiting outside for the big exam to begin.","t":"所有學生在外面等待這場重要考試開始時都感到很緊張。"},{"w":"quiz","p":"n.","d":"a short, informal test on a small amount of material","c":"測驗","s":"Our teacher gives a short vocabulary quiz at the start of every Friday class.","t":"我們老師每週五上課一開始都會出一個簡短的單字測驗。"},{"w":"test","p":"n.","d":"a set of questions used to check knowledge or ability","c":"測試","s":"He forgot his pencil case on the morning of the important science test.","t":"他在重要的科學測試那天早上忘記帶他的鉛筆盒了。"},{"w":"homework","p":"n.","d":"school work that students do at home","c":"功課","s":"I always finish my homework before dinner so I can relax in the evening.","t":"我總是在晚餐前完成功課，這樣晚上就能放鬆休息。"},{"w":"degree","p":"n.","d":"a qualification given by a university after completing a course of study","c":"學位","s":"My older cousin worked for six years to earn her degree in engineering.","t":"我的表姐花了六年時間才取得她的工程學位。"},{"w":"beginner","p":"n.","d":"a person who is just starting to learn or do something","c":"初學者","s":"Even though he was a complete beginner, he learned to swim within just two weeks.","t":"雖然他是個完全的初學者，但他在短短兩週內就學會了游泳。"},{"w":"group","p":"n.","d":"a number of people who work or are gathered together","c":"小組","s":"For the science project, our teacher divided the whole class into small group.","t":"為了這個科學作業，我們老師把全班分成了好幾個小組。"},{"w":"club","p":"n.","d":"a group of people who meet because they share an interest","c":"社團","s":"My older brother joined the robotics club after school every Tuesday and Thursday.","t":"我哥哥每週二和週四放學後都會參加機器人社團。"},{"w":"bell","p":"n.","d":"a metal object that makes a ringing sound","c":"鈴","s":"As soon as the bell rang, every student rushed out to the playground.","t":"鈴聲一響，每個學生都立刻衝到操場上。"},{"w":"blackboard","p":"n.","d":"a dark board that teachers write on with chalk","c":"黑板","s":"The teacher wrote today's homework assignment neatly on the blackboard.","t":"老師把今天的作業整整齊齊地寫在黑板上。"},{"w":"chair","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture for one person to sit on","c":"椅子","s":"My desk and chair are right next to the classroom window.","t":"我的桌子和椅子就在教室窗邊。"},{"w":"chalk","p":"n.","d":"a soft white or colored stick used for writing on a blackboard","c":"粉筆","s":"The art teacher handed out colored chalk for our outdoor drawing activity.","t":"美術老師發給我們彩色粉筆來進行戶外繪畫活動。"},{"w":"textbook","p":"n.","d":"a book that contains information about a school subject","c":"教科書","s":"Please open your history textbook to page forty and read the chapter quietly.","t":"請翻開你的歷史教科書到第四十頁，並安靜地閱讀這一章。"},{"w":"workbook","p":"n.","d":"a book with exercises and spaces for students to write answers","c":"作業簿","s":"We finish two pages of our math workbook for homework every single night.","t":"我們每天晚上都會完成兩頁的數學作業簿當作功課。"},{"w":"learn","p":"v.","d":"to get knowledge or a skill through study or experience","c":"學習","s":"My grandmother decided to learn how to use a smartphone last year.","t":"我奶奶去年決定要學習如何使用智慧型手機。"},{"w":"study","p":"v.","d":"to spend time learning about a subject","c":"學習；研究","s":"My brother likes to study quietly in the library after school every day.","t":"我哥哥每天放學後都喜歡在圖書館安靜地學習。"},{"w":"review","p":"v.","d":"to look at or study something again carefully","c":"複習","s":"Before the final exam, we spent an entire weekend reviewing the lessons together.","t":"在期末考前，我們花了整個週末一起複習這些課程內容。"},{"w":"subject","p":"n.","d":"an area of knowledge studied in school, such as math or science","c":"科目","s":"Out of all my classes, science is by far my favorite subject this year.","t":"在我所有的課程中，科學是我今年最喜歡的科目。"},{"w":"art","p":"n.","d":"the subject in which students learn to draw, paint, or create things","c":"美術","s":"In art class today, we painted colorful pictures of our favorite animals.","t":"今天的美術課上，我們畫了色彩鮮豔的動物圖畫。"},{"w":"biology","p":"n.","d":"the science that studies living things, such as plants and animals","c":"生物學","s":"In biology class, we learned how a caterpillar slowly changes into a butterfly.","t":"在生物學課上，我們學到了毛毛蟲如何慢慢變成蝴蝶。"},{"w":"chemistry","p":"n.","d":"the science that studies what things are made of and how they react","c":"化學","s":"During the chemistry experiment, the clear liquid suddenly turned a bright shade of blue.","t":"在這次化學實驗中，透明的液體突然變成了鮮藍色。"},{"w":"Chinese","p":"n.","d":"the language spoken in China and Taiwan","c":"中文","s":"In Chinese class, we practiced writing new characters in our notebooks.","t":"在中文課上，我們在筆記本上練習寫新的字。"},{"w":"English","p":"n.","d":"the language originally from England, now spoken in many countries","c":"英文","s":"Our English teacher always plays fun games to help us remember new words.","t":"我們的英文老師總是用有趣的遊戲幫我們記住新單字。"},{"w":"geography","p":"n.","d":"the study of countries, rivers, mountains, and other features of the earth","c":"地理學","s":"Our geography teacher showed us a large map of the world's oceans and continents.","t":"我們的地理老師給我們看了一張世界海洋和大陸的大地圖。"},{"w":"history","p":"n.","d":"the study of events that happened in the past","c":"歷史","s":"We are studying the history of ancient Egypt and its famous pyramids this month.","t":"這個月我們在研究古埃及的歷史及其著名的金字塔。"},{"w":"mathematics","p":"n.","d":"the study of numbers, shapes, and quantities, often shortened to math","c":"數學","s":"Solving difficult mathematics problems gets much easier with a little daily practice.","t":"只要每天稍微練習，解決困難的數學問題就會變得容易許多。"},{"w":"physical","p":"adj.","d":"relating to exercise and sport, often shortened to PE in school","c":"體育的","s":"Everyone loves physical education class because we get to play basketball outside.","t":"大家都很喜歡體育課，因為我們可以到外面打籃球。"},{"w":"physics","p":"n.","d":"the science that studies matter, energy, and how things move","c":"物理學","s":"In physics class, we used a small ball to learn about gravity and motion.","t":"在物理課上，我們用一個小球來學習重力和運動。"},{"w":"science","p":"n.","d":"the study of the natural world through observation and experiments","c":"科學","s":"Our science teacher brought a real telescope to class for our astronomy lesson.","t":"我們的科學老師帶了一個真正的望遠鏡來上天文學的課。"}]},{"unit":13,"theme":"Work / Business / Money (工作/商業/金錢)","cards":[{"w":"work","p":"n.","d":"activity done to earn money or achieve a result","c":"工作","s":"My father always finishes his work before he comes home for dinner.","t":"我爸爸總是在回家吃晚餐前完成他的工作。"},{"w":"interview","p":"n.","d":"a formal meeting where someone is asked questions about a job","c":"面試","s":"She wore her best suit to the job interview on Monday morning.","t":"她星期一早上穿著最好的套裝去參加工作面試。"},{"w":"project","p":"n.","d":"a planned piece of work with a specific goal","c":"專案","s":"Our team spent three weeks finishing the new website project on time.","t":"我們的團隊花了三個星期準時完成了新的網站專案。"},{"w":"matter","p":"n.","d":"a subject or situation that needs attention or discussion","c":"事情","s":"The manager said it was an urgent matter that needed to be solved today.","t":"經理說這是一件緊急的事情，今天必須解決。"},{"w":"problem","p":"n.","d":"a difficult situation that needs to be solved","c":"問題","s":"The engineer found the problem with the machine after checking it carefully.","t":"工程師仔細檢查後找到了機器的問題所在。"},{"w":"method","p":"n.","d":"a particular way of doing something","c":"方法","s":"The teacher tried a new method to help students remember new vocabulary.","t":"老師嘗試了一種新方法來幫助學生記住新單字。"},{"w":"plan","p":"n.","d":"a set of steps decided in advance to achieve something","c":"計畫","s":"We made a plan to finish all our chores before the weekend.","t":"我們訂了一個計畫，要在週末前完成所有的家事。"},{"w":"meeting","p":"n.","d":"a gathering of people to discuss something","c":"會議","s":"The meeting started late because two managers were stuck in traffic.","t":"因為兩位經理被困在車流中，這場會議晚了才開始。"},{"w":"report","p":"n.","d":"a written or spoken account of facts or findings","c":"報告","s":"My sister stayed up late finishing her science report for tomorrow's class.","t":"我姐姐熬夜完成了明天上課要用的科學報告。"},{"w":"member","p":"n.","d":"a person who belongs to a group or organization","c":"成員","s":"Each new member of the club received a free t-shirt and a name tag.","t":"社團的每位新成員都收到了一件免費的T恤和名牌。"},{"w":"team","p":"n.","d":"a group of people who work together toward a common goal","c":"團隊","s":"Our sales team celebrated together after reaching this year's biggest goal.","t":"我們的銷售團隊在達成今年最大的目標後一起慶祝。"},{"w":"call","p":"v.","d":"to telephone someone","c":"打電話","s":"Please call me as soon as you arrive at the airport tonight.","t":"請你今晚一到機場就打電話給我。"},{"w":"dial","p":"v.","d":"to press buttons on a phone to make a call","c":"撥號","s":"She tried to dial the customer service number three times before someone answered.","t":"她撥了三次客服電話才有人接聽。"},{"w":"employ","p":"v.","d":"to give someone a paid job","c":"僱用","s":"The new restaurant plans to employ ten more workers before it opens next month.","t":"這家新餐廳計畫在下個月開幕前再僱用十名員工。"},{"w":"hire","p":"v.","d":"to give someone a job after an interview","c":"僱用","s":"After three interviews, the company decided to hire the friendly young graduate.","t":"經過三次面試後，公司決定僱用那位友善的年輕畢業生。"},{"w":"quit","p":"v.","d":"to stop doing a job or activity","c":"辭職","s":"He decided to quit his job and travel around the world for a year.","t":"他決定辭職並花一年時間環遊世界。"},{"w":"interrupt","p":"v.","d":"to stop someone while they are speaking or doing something","c":"打斷","s":"It is impolite to interrupt someone while they are still talking.","t":"在別人說話時打斷他們是不禮貌的。"},{"w":"business","p":"n.","d":"the activity of buying and selling goods or services","c":"生意","s":"My aunt started a small business selling handmade candles online last year.","t":"我阿姨去年開始在網路上經營一家賣手工蠟燭的小生意。"},{"w":"trade","p":"n.","d":"the buying and selling of goods between people or countries","c":"貿易","s":"The two countries signed a new trade agreement to lower import taxes.","t":"這兩個國家簽署了一份新的貿易協定，降低進口稅。"},{"w":"contract","p":"n.","d":"a written agreement between two or more people that is legally binding","c":"合約","s":"Before starting the job, every employee must sign an official contract.","t":"在開始工作之前，每位員工都必須簽署一份正式合約。"},{"w":"duty","p":"n.","d":"something a person is required to do because of their job or position","c":"義務","s":"It is the lifeguard's duty to watch every swimmer carefully at all times.","t":"救生員的義務就是隨時仔細看顧每位泳客。"},{"w":"income","p":"n.","d":"the money a person earns from work or other sources","c":"收入","s":"After getting the promotion, her monthly income increased by a noticeable amount.","t":"升職後，她每月的收入明顯增加了。"},{"w":"rent","p":"v.","d":"to pay money regularly to use something that belongs to someone else","c":"出租；租用","s":"We decided to rent a small apartment near the university for the school year.","t":"我們決定在這個學年租一間靠近大學的小公寓。"},{"w":"bill","p":"n.","d":"a piece of paper showing how much money is owed for something","c":"帳單","s":"My mother pays the electricity bill online at the start of every month.","t":"我媽媽每個月初都會在網上付電費帳單。"},{"w":"fee","p":"n.","d":"an amount of money paid for a particular service","c":"費用","s":"There is a small entrance fee to visit the museum on weekends.","t":"週末參觀這座博物館需要支付一筆小額的入場費用。"},{"w":"price","p":"n.","d":"the amount of money needed to buy something","c":"價格","s":"The price of the toy dropped a lot during the holiday sale.","t":"這個玩具的價格在假期特賣期間降了很多。"},{"w":"credit card","p":"n.","d":"a small plastic card used to pay for things and pay back the money later","c":"信用卡","s":"He paid for the new laptop using his credit card instead of cash.","t":"他用信用卡付了新筆電的錢，而不是用現金。"},{"w":"cash","p":"n.","d":"money in the form of coins or paper bills","c":"現金","s":"The small food stall near the school only accepts cash, not cards.","t":"學校附近那家小吃攤只收現金，不收卡。"},{"w":"coin","p":"n.","d":"a small round piece of metal used as money","c":"硬幣","s":"My little brother collects old coin from different countries in a special box.","t":"我弟弟用一個特別的盒子收集來自不同國家的舊硬幣。"},{"w":"money","p":"n.","d":"coins and paper bills used to buy things","c":"錢","s":"She has been saving her money to buy a new bicycle for months.","t":"她已經存了好幾個月的錢，想買一台新的自行車。"},{"w":"cent","p":"n.","d":"a small unit of money, one hundredth of a dollar","c":"一分錢","s":"The candy at the old shop only cost fifty cent when I was young.","t":"我小時候那家老店的糖果只要五十分錢。"},{"w":"dollar","p":"n.","d":"the basic unit of money used in the United States and other countries","c":"元","s":"He found a five dollar bill on the sidewalk near the park.","t":"他在公園附近的人行道上發現了一張五元的紙鈔。"},{"w":"pound","p":"n.","d":"the basic unit of money used in the United Kingdom","c":"英鎊","s":"She exchanged her dollars for British pound before flying to London.","t":"她在飛往倫敦前把美元換成了英鎊。"},{"w":"sell","p":"v.","d":"to give something to someone in exchange for money","c":"出售","s":"Every weekend, my neighbor likes to sell fresh vegetables at the local market.","t":"我的鄰居每個週末都喜歡在當地市場出售新鮮蔬菜。"},{"w":"buy","p":"v.","d":"to get something by paying money for it","c":"購買","s":"We plan to buy a birthday present for grandma this weekend.","t":"我們這個週末打算買一份生日禮物給奶奶。"},{"w":"pay","p":"v.","d":"to give money to someone for goods or services","c":"支付","s":"Could you please pay for the bus tickets while I find our seats?","t":"你能幫忙付公車票錢嗎？我先去找我們的座位。"},{"w":"charge","p":"v.","d":"to ask someone to pay a certain amount of money","c":"收費","s":"The parking garage will charge an extra fee if you stay past midnight.","t":"如果你停留超過午夜，這個停車場會額外收費。"},{"w":"cost","p":"v.","d":"to have a particular price","c":"花費","s":"The new smartphone will cost much more than the older model.","t":"這款新智慧型手機的價格會比舊款貴很多。"},{"w":"spend","p":"v.","d":"to use money to pay for something","c":"花（錢、時間）","s":"My brother tends to spend too much money on video games every month.","t":"我哥哥每個月都會在電玩遊戲上花太多錢。"},{"w":"cheap","p":"adj.","d":"low in price; not expensive","c":"便宜的","s":"The clothes at that small shop are cheap but still good quality.","t":"那家小店的衣服很便宜，但品質還是很好。"},{"w":"expensive","p":"adj.","d":"costing a lot of money","c":"昂貴的","s":"The hotel near the beach was too expensive for our small budget.","t":"海邊那家飯店對我們有限的預算來說太貴了。"},{"w":"free","p":"adj.","d":"costing no money","c":"免費的","s":"Admission to the city park is completely free for all visitors.","t":"進入這座市立公園對所有遊客來說都是完全免費的。"}]},{"unit":14,"theme":"Media / Entertainment / Time & Eras (媒體/娛樂/時代)","cards":[{"w":"advertisement","p":"n.","d":"a public message that tries to sell a product or service","c":"廣告","s":"During the show, a long advertisement for a new phone played before the next scene.","t":"節目播放期間，下一個場景前播了一則新手機的長廣告。"},{"w":"broadcast","p":"v.","d":"to send out a program on television or radio","c":"廣播","s":"The station will broadcast the basketball final live tonight at eight o'clock.","t":"電視台今晚八點將現場直播這場籃球決賽。"},{"w":"cable","p":"n.","d":"a thick wire used to carry electricity or send television signals","c":"電纜","s":"After the storm, a fallen tree damaged the cable connected to our television.","t":"暴風雨後，一棵倒下的樹弄壞了連接我們電視的電纜線。"},{"w":"cartoon","p":"n.","d":"a funny drawn film, often made for children","c":"卡通","s":"Every Saturday morning, my little cousin watches the same cartoon before breakfast.","t":"每個星期六早上，我的小表弟都會在早餐前看同一部卡通。"},{"w":"drama","p":"n.","d":"a serious play or show, often about emotional situations","c":"戲劇","s":"My mother never misses an episode of her favorite evening drama on television.","t":"我媽媽從不錯過她最喜歡的那部晚間電視劇的任何一集。"},{"w":"news","p":"n.","d":"information about recent events, often shown on TV or in papers","c":"新聞","s":"My grandfather watches the evening news every night before going to bed.","t":"我爺爺每天晚上睡前都會看晚間新聞。"},{"w":"movie","p":"n.","d":"a story shown using moving pictures, usually in a theater","c":"電影","s":"We waited in a long line to buy tickets for the new superhero movie.","t":"我們排了很長的隊伍買新上映超級英雄電影的票。"},{"w":"channel","p":"n.","d":"a specific station on television that shows certain programs","c":"頻道","s":"My father always switches to the sports channel as soon as he gets home.","t":"我爸爸一回家就會立刻轉到體育頻道。"},{"w":"program","p":"n.","d":"a show broadcast on television or radio","c":"節目","s":"This cooking program teaches viewers how to make simple dishes at home.","t":"這個烹飪節目教觀眾如何在家做簡單的菜。"},{"w":"camera","p":"n.","d":"a device used to take photos or record video","c":"相機","s":"My uncle brought his new camera to take pictures at the family reunion.","t":"我叔叔帶了他的新相機去家庭聚會拍照。"},{"w":"film","p":"n.","d":"a movie, or the material used to record images in an old-style camera","c":"影片","s":"The director spent two years working on this powerful film about ocean life.","t":"這位導演花了兩年時間製作這部關於海洋生物的精彩影片。"},{"w":"tape","p":"n.","d":"a strip of plastic used to record sound or video","c":"錄音帶；錄影帶","s":"My mother still keeps an old tape of our family's first trip to the beach.","t":"我媽媽還保留著一捲我們家第一次去海邊旅行的舊錄影帶。"},{"w":"photo","p":"n.","d":"a picture taken with a camera","c":"相片","s":"She printed a photo of her dog and put it on the refrigerator.","t":"她把一張她的狗的相片印出來，貼在冰箱上。"},{"w":"picture","p":"n.","d":"an image, drawing, or photo of something","c":"圖片","s":"He drew a picture of his house for the art class assignment.","t":"他為美術課的作業畫了一張他家的圖片。"},{"w":"video","p":"n.","d":"a recording of moving images, often watched on a screen","c":"影片","s":"My sister uploaded a short video of her new puppy playing in the yard.","t":"我姐姐上傳了一段她的新小狗在院子裡玩耍的短影片。"},{"w":"scene","p":"n.","d":"a part of a movie or play that happens in one place or time","c":"場景","s":"Everyone in the theater gasped during the most exciting scene of the film.","t":"電影最精彩的場景出現時，劇院裡的每個人都驚呼了起來。"},{"w":"live","p":"adj.","d":"happening and being shown at the same time it occurs","c":"現場的","s":"We watched the singer's live performance on a huge outdoor stage downtown.","t":"我們在市中心的一個巨大戶外舞台上觀看了那位歌手的現場表演。"},{"w":"record","p":"v.","d":"to save sound or video so it can be played later","c":"錄音；錄影","s":"My brother used his phone to record the entire school concert for our parents.","t":"我哥哥用他的手機錄下了整場學校音樂會，給我們的父母看。"},{"w":"ago","p":"adv.","d":"in the past, counted back from now","c":"以前","s":"My grandparents moved to this small town more than forty years ago.","t":"我祖父母在四十多年前搬到了這個小鎮。"},{"w":"ever","p":"adv.","d":"at any time","c":"曾經","s":"Have you ever tried durian, the famous fruit with a very strong smell?","t":"你曾經試過榴槤這種有著強烈氣味的著名水果嗎？"},{"w":"now","p":"adv.","d":"at the present moment","c":"現在","s":"Right now, my brother is finishing his homework before dinner.","t":"現在，我哥哥正在完成他的作業準備吃晚餐。"},{"w":"ancient","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a time very long ago","c":"古代的","s":"We visited an ancient temple that was built more than a thousand years ago.","t":"我們參觀了一座一千多年前建造的古代寺廟。"},{"w":"current","p":"adj.","d":"happening or existing right now","c":"現行的","s":"Our teacher asked us to write a short report about a current news event.","t":"老師要我們寫一篇關於現行新聞事件的短報告。"},{"w":"modern","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the present time, not the past","c":"現代的","s":"The new art museum downtown displays only modern paintings and sculptures.","t":"市中心新開的美術館只展出現代的繪畫和雕塑作品。"},{"w":"traditional","p":"adj.","d":"following customs that have existed for a long time","c":"傳統的","s":"For the festival, my grandmother always cooks several traditional dishes from her hometown.","t":"每逢節日，我奶奶總是會做幾道她家鄉的傳統菜。"},{"w":"present","p":"adj.","d":"existing or happening now","c":"現在的","s":"Compared to the present situation, prices were much lower ten years ago.","t":"與現在的情況相比，十年前的物價便宜許多。"},{"w":"past","p":"adj.","d":"having happened before now","c":"過去的","s":"In past years, this quiet street used to be full of small shops.","t":"在過去的幾年裡，這條安靜的街道曾經滿是小商店。"},{"w":"century","p":"n.","d":"a period of one hundred years","c":"世紀","s":"This old bridge was first built in the early twentieth century.","t":"這座老橋最初建於二十世紀初。"},{"w":"period","p":"n.","d":"a length of time with a particular start and end","c":"時期","s":"During the rainy period, the river near our village often rises quickly.","t":"在雨季期間，我們村莊附近的河流經常會迅速上漲。"},{"w":"childhood","p":"n.","d":"the time of a person's life when they are a child","c":"童年","s":"My father often tells stories about his childhood growing up on a small farm.","t":"我爸爸經常講述他在一個小農場長大的童年故事。"},{"w":"youth","p":"n.","d":"the period of a person's life when they are young","c":"青年時期","s":"During her youth, my grandmother traveled to many countries before settling down.","t":"我奶奶在青年時期去過許多國家旅行，後來才定居下來。"}]},{"unit":15,"theme":"Personality Traits / Emotions (個性/情緒)","cards":[{"w":"careful","p":"adj.","d":"paying close attention to avoid mistakes or danger","c":"仔細的","s":"Please be careful when you cross the busy street near the school.","t":"在學校附近過那條繁忙的街道時，請小心一點。"},{"w":"careless","p":"adj.","d":"not paying enough attention; making mistakes easily","c":"粗心的","s":"He made a careless mistake on the test by forgetting to check his answers.","t":"他因為忘記檢查答案，在考試中犯了一個粗心的錯誤。"},{"w":"childish","p":"adj.","d":"behaving in a silly way that is not appropriate for an adult","c":"幼稚的","s":"Everyone thought it was childish of him to cry over losing a board game.","t":"大家都覺得他因為輸了一場桌遊就哭，這樣很幼稚。"},{"w":"childlike","p":"adj.","d":"having the innocent or simple qualities of a child","c":"天真的","s":"My grandmother still has a childlike sense of wonder whenever she sees the ocean.","t":"我奶奶每次看到海洋時，仍然帶著一種天真的驚奇感。"},{"w":"evil","p":"adj.","d":"morally very bad or wrong","c":"邪惡的","s":"In the story, the evil witch tried to trap the children in her cottage.","t":"在這個故事裡，邪惡的女巫試圖把孩子們困在她的小屋裡。"},{"w":"friendly","p":"adj.","d":"kind and pleasant toward other people","c":"親切的","s":"Our new neighbor is very friendly and always says hello when we see her.","t":"我們的新鄰居非常親切，每次見到我們都會打招呼。"},{"w":"kind","p":"adj.","d":"caring and gentle toward others","c":"親切的","s":"It was kind of you to help that old man carry his heavy bags.","t":"你幫那位老人提重重的袋子，這樣很親切。"},{"w":"funny","p":"adj.","d":"causing laughter; amusing","c":"好笑的","s":"The comedian told such a funny joke that everyone in the room laughed out loud.","t":"那位喜劇演員講了一個很好笑的笑話，讓全場的人都笑了出來。"},{"w":"naughty","p":"adj.","d":"behaving badly, often used for children","c":"頑皮的","s":"The naughty puppy chewed up my favorite shoes while I was at school.","t":"那隻頑皮的小狗在我上學時把我最喜歡的鞋子咬爛了。"},{"w":"generous","p":"adj.","d":"willing to give freely to others","c":"慷慨的","s":"My uncle is so generous that he always pays for the whole family's dinner.","t":"我叔叔非常慷慨，總是幫全家人付晚餐的錢。"},{"w":"stingy","p":"adj.","d":"unwilling to spend or share money","c":"小氣的","s":"He is too stingy to buy a birthday gift, even for his own brother.","t":"他太小氣了，連自己的弟弟生日都不肯買禮物。"},{"w":"selfish","p":"adj.","d":"caring only about yourself, not about others","c":"自私的","s":"It seemed selfish of him to eat the last slice of pizza without asking anyone.","t":"他沒問任何人就吃掉了最後一片披薩，這樣顯得很自私。"},{"w":"gentle","p":"adj.","d":"kind, calm, and not rough or harsh","c":"溫和的","s":"The nurse spoke in a gentle voice to calm the crying child.","t":"護士用溫和的聲音安慰那個哭泣的孩子。"},{"w":"good","p":"adj.","d":"having positive or pleasant qualities","c":"好的","s":"She always gets good grades because she studies hard every night.","t":"她每天晚上都用功學習，所以總是得到好成績。"},{"w":"bad","p":"adj.","d":"having negative or unpleasant qualities","c":"壞的","s":"Eating too much candy before bedtime is a bad habit for your teeth.","t":"睡前吃太多糖果對牙齒是個壞習慣。"},{"w":"diligent","p":"adj.","d":"working hard and carefully on something","c":"勤勉的","s":"The diligent student reviewed her notes every single evening before the big exam.","t":"那位勤勉的學生在大考前每天晚上都會複習筆記。"},{"w":"hard-working","p":"adj.","d":"putting a lot of effort into work or study","c":"勤勉的","s":"My father is a hard-working farmer who wakes up before sunrise every single day.","t":"我爸爸是一位勤勞的農夫，每天都在日出前起床。"},{"w":"lazy","p":"adj.","d":"not willing to work or make an effort","c":"懶惰的","s":"My brother felt too lazy to clean his room, so it stayed messy all weekend.","t":"我哥哥太懶了不想打掃房間，所以整個週末房間都亂糟糟的。"},{"w":"honest","p":"adj.","d":"telling the truth; not lying or cheating","c":"誠實的","s":"Even though it was difficult, she gave an honest answer about what happened.","t":"雖然很困難，她還是誠實地說出了發生的事情。"},{"w":"dishonest","p":"adj.","d":"telling lies or trying to deceive someone","c":"不誠實的","s":"The shopkeeper was caught being dishonest about the price of the broken toy.","t":"那位店主被發現對那個壞掉的玩具的價格不誠實。"},{"w":"sincere","p":"adj.","d":"genuine and honest in feelings or words","c":"真誠的","s":"He wrote a sincere letter to thank his teacher for years of patient support.","t":"他寫了一封真誠的信，感謝老師多年來的耐心支持。"},{"w":"responsible","p":"adj.","d":"able to be trusted to do what is expected","c":"負責任的","s":"As the oldest child, she felt responsible for taking care of her younger siblings.","t":"作為最大的孩子，她覺得自己有責任照顧弟妹。"},{"w":"humble","p":"adj.","d":"not proud; modest about one's own abilities","c":"謙虛的","s":"Even after winning the competition, the young singer remained surprisingly humble.","t":"即使贏得了比賽，那位年輕歌手依然出乎意料地謙虛。"},{"w":"proud","p":"adj.","d":"feeling pleased about something you or others have achieved","c":"驕傲的","s":"My parents looked so proud when I received my diploma on stage.","t":"當我在台上領取畢業證書時，我父母看起來非常驕傲。"},{"w":"humorous","p":"adj.","d":"funny and entertaining","c":"幽默的","s":"The teacher told a humorous story that made the whole class smile.","t":"老師講了一個幽默的故事，讓全班都露出了笑容。"},{"w":"afraid","p":"adj.","d":"feeling fear about something","c":"害怕的","s":"My little sister is afraid of thunderstorms and hides under her blanket.","t":"我妹妹很怕打雷，每次都躲在毯子下面。"},{"w":"angry","p":"adj.","d":"feeling strong displeasure","c":"生氣的","s":"My mother was angry when she found out I had broken her favorite vase.","t":"我媽媽發現我打破了她最喜歡的花瓶時非常生氣。"},{"w":"mad","p":"adj.","d":"very angry","c":"生氣的","s":"He got so mad when his little brother erased his homework by accident.","t":"當他弟弟不小心擦掉他的作業時，他非常生氣。"},{"w":"bored","p":"adj.","d":"feeling tired and uninterested because there is nothing to do","c":"感到厭煩的","s":"The students looked completely bored during the long, slow lecture.","t":"在這場又長又無聊的課程中，學生們看起來非常厭煩。"},{"w":"excited","p":"adj.","d":"feeling very happy and full of energy about something","c":"感到興奮的","s":"We were all so excited when we heard about the surprise trip to the zoo.","t":"我們聽到要去動物園的驚喜旅行時都非常興奮。"},{"w":"jealous","p":"adj.","d":"feeling unhappy because someone else has something you want","c":"嫉妒的","s":"She felt a little jealous when her friend got a brand-new bicycle for her birthday.","t":"當她朋友生日收到一台全新的自行車時，她有點嫉妒。"},{"w":"lonely","p":"adj.","d":"feeling sad because you are alone","c":"寂寞的","s":"After moving to a new city, he felt lonely until he made some new friends.","t":"搬到新城市後，他在交到新朋友之前感到很寂寞。"},{"w":"nervous","p":"adj.","d":"worried or afraid about what might happen","c":"緊張的","s":"I always feel nervous right before giving a speech in front of the class.","t":"每次在班上演講前我總是覺得很緊張。"},{"w":"glad","p":"adj.","d":"feeling pleased about something","c":"高興的","s":"I was so glad to hear that my cousin had passed her driving test.","t":"聽到我表姐通過了駕照考試，我感到非常高興。"},{"w":"happy","p":"adj.","d":"feeling joy or pleasure","c":"快樂的","s":"The whole family looked happy as they opened their presents together on Christmas morning.","t":"聖誕節早上全家人一起打開禮物時看起來都很快樂。"},{"w":"pleased","p":"adj.","d":"feeling satisfied or happy about something","c":"滿意的","s":"The coach was very pleased with how hard the team practiced this week.","t":"教練對球隊這週的努力練習感到非常滿意。"},{"w":"sad","p":"adj.","d":"feeling unhappy, often because of a loss","c":"悲傷的","s":"Everyone felt sad when the beloved old teacher retired at the end of the year.","t":"當這位深受喜愛的老教師在年底退休時，大家都感到很悲傷。"},{"w":"sorry","p":"adj.","d":"feeling regret about something you did","c":"抱歉的","s":"He said he was sorry for accidentally stepping on his classmate's foot.","t":"他說他很抱歉不小心踩到了同學的腳。"},{"w":"unhappy","p":"adj.","d":"not feeling pleased or satisfied","c":"不快樂的","s":"The customer looked unhappy after waiting nearly an hour for his food.","t":"那位顧客等了將近一小時才拿到食物，看起來很不開心。"},{"w":"surprised","p":"adj.","d":"feeling shock at something unexpected","c":"感到驚訝的","s":"We were completely surprised when all our relatives jumped out for the party.","t":"當所有親戚都跳出來為派對驚喜時，我們都感到非常驚訝。"},{"w":"feel","p":"v.","d":"to experience an emotion or physical sensation","c":"感覺","s":"After the long hike, my legs began to feel very tired and sore.","t":"經過長時間的健行後，我的腿開始覺得非常疲倦和痠痛。"},{"w":"admire","p":"v.","d":"to respect and approve of someone or something","c":"欽佩","s":"Many students admire their teacher's patience and kindness toward everyone.","t":"許多學生都欽佩老師對每個人的耐心和親切。"},{"w":"anger","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel angry","c":"激怒","s":"It seemed to anger him whenever someone interrupted his story.","t":"每次有人打斷他講故事時，似乎都會激怒他。"},{"w":"envy","p":"v.","d":"to wish you had what someone else has","c":"羨慕","s":"I have to admit I envy my friend's ability to learn languages so quickly.","t":"我必須承認我很羨慕我朋友能這麼快學會語言的能力。"},{"w":"fear","p":"v.","d":"to feel afraid of something","c":"畏懼","s":"Many small children fear the dark and need a night light to sleep.","t":"許多小孩都害怕黑暗，需要小夜燈才能睡覺。"},{"w":"hate","p":"v.","d":"to dislike something or someone very strongly","c":"厭惡","s":"My little brother says he absolutely hate eating vegetables of any kind.","t":"我弟弟說他非常厭惡吃任何種類的蔬菜。"},{"w":"regret","p":"v.","d":"to feel sorry about something you did or did not do","c":"懊悔","s":"She will always regret not telling her grandfather how much she loved him.","t":"她將永遠懊悔沒有告訴爺爺她有多愛他。"},{"w":"respect","p":"v.","d":"to have a high opinion of someone","c":"尊敬","s":"Students should respect their teachers by listening quietly during class.","t":"學生應該在課堂上安靜聆聽，以尊敬老師。"},{"w":"worry","p":"v.","d":"to feel anxious or troubled about something","c":"擔心","s":"My mother always starts to worry if I come home later than expected.","t":"如果我比預期的時間晚回家，我媽媽總是會開始擔心。"}]},{"unit":16,"theme":"Difficulty / Quality / Judgment (難易/真假/品質)","cards":[{"w":"difficult","p":"adj.","d":"not easy to do or understand","c":"困難的","s":"The final question on the math exam was so difficult that nobody finished it.","t":"數學考試的最後一題太難了，沒有人能做完。"},{"w":"hard","p":"adj.","d":"not easy; requiring a lot of effort","c":"困難的","s":"Learning to play the violin is hard at first, but it gets easier with practice.","t":"一開始學小提琴很困難，但練習久了就會變容易。"},{"w":"easy","p":"adj.","d":"not difficult; simple to do","c":"容易的","s":"Once you understand the rule, this grammar pattern is actually quite easy.","t":"一旦你理解了規則，這個文法句型其實相當容易。"},{"w":"simple","p":"adj.","d":"easy to understand or do; not complicated","c":"簡單的","s":"The teacher explained the new idea using a simple example everyone could follow.","t":"老師用一個簡單的例子解釋新概念，讓大家都能理解。"},{"w":"real","p":"adj.","d":"actually existing, not imagined or fake","c":"真正的","s":"At first I thought the spider on the wall was a toy, but it was real.","t":"我一開始以為牆上的蜘蛛是玩具，但它是真的。"},{"w":"true","p":"adj.","d":"in agreement with fact; not false","c":"真的","s":"It is true that drinking enough water every day is good for your health.","t":"每天喝足夠的水對健康有益，這是真的。"},{"w":"false","p":"adj.","d":"not true or correct","c":"假的","s":"She quickly realized that the rumor about the school closing was completely false.","t":"她很快就意識到關於學校要關閉的謠言完全是假的。"},{"w":"correct","p":"adj.","d":"free from mistakes; accurate","c":"正確的","s":"Out of twenty questions, she got nineteen correct answers on the quiz.","t":"在二十題中，她在這次測驗裡答對了十九題。"},{"w":"fantastic","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good; wonderful","c":"極好的","s":"The fireworks show on New Year's Eve looked absolutely fantastic from the rooftop.","t":"在屋頂上看的新年煙火表演看起來棒極了。"},{"w":"fine","p":"adj.","d":"good; satisfactory or pleasant","c":"美好的","s":"After resting for a few days, my grandmother said she felt fine again.","t":"休息了幾天後，我奶奶說她又感覺好多了。"},{"w":"great","p":"adj.","d":"very good; impressive or important","c":"很棒的","s":"We had a great time at the amusement park, riding every roller coaster twice.","t":"我們在遊樂園玩得很愉快，每個雲霄飛車都坐了兩次。"},{"w":"nice","p":"adj.","d":"pleasant or agreeable","c":"不錯的","s":"It was nice of the neighbors to bring soup when our family was sick.","t":"我們家人生病時，鄰居送湯來，這真是貼心。"},{"w":"perfect","p":"adj.","d":"complete and without any mistakes or flaws","c":"完美的","s":"She practiced the piano piece for months until it sounded almost perfect.","t":"她練習這首鋼琴曲好幾個月，直到聽起來幾乎完美。"},{"w":"wonderful","p":"adj.","d":"extremely pleasing or impressive","c":"極好的","s":"The view from the top of the mountain was simply wonderful.","t":"從山頂上看到的風景簡直太美好了。"},{"w":"terrific","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good or enjoyable","c":"非常好的","s":"Everyone said the school's spring concert was absolutely terrific this year.","t":"大家都說學校今年的春季音樂會非常精彩。"},{"w":"terrible","p":"adj.","d":"very bad or unpleasant","c":"糟糕的","s":"We had terrible weather during our camping trip, with rain every single day.","t":"我們露營旅行時天氣很糟糕，每天都下雨。"}]},{"unit":17,"theme":"Size / State / Safety / Comparison (大小/狀態/安全/比較)","cards":[{"w":"large","p":"adj.","d":"big in size or amount","c":"巨大的","s":"We needed a large table to fit all twelve guests at the dinner.","t":"我們需要一張大桌子才能讓十二位客人都坐下吃晚餐。"},{"w":"big","p":"adj.","d":"of considerable size; not small","c":"大的","s":"My little brother got a big surprise when he opened his birthday present.","t":"我弟弟打開生日禮物時得到了一個很大的驚喜。"},{"w":"small","p":"adj.","d":"not large in size or amount","c":"小的","s":"She keeps her jewelry in a small wooden box on her dresser.","t":"她把她的珠寶放在梳妝台上的一個小木盒裡。"},{"w":"least","p":"adj.","d":"the smallest amount or degree","c":"最小的","s":"Out of all the desserts, the chocolate cake received the least attention from guests.","t":"在所有甜點中，巧克力蛋糕得到客人最少的關注。"},{"w":"little","p":"adj.","d":"small in size or amount","c":"一點點的","s":"There was only a little bit of milk left in the carton this morning.","t":"今天早上紙盒裡只剩下一點點牛奶了。"},{"w":"primary","p":"adj.","d":"main or most important","c":"首要的","s":"The primary reason she joined the team was to make new friends.","t":"她加入這個隊伍的主要原因是想交新朋友。"},{"w":"secondary","p":"adj.","d":"less important than the main thing","c":"次要的","s":"Winning the trophy felt like a secondary goal compared to having fun with her teammates.","t":"對她來說，贏得獎杯似乎是次要的目標，比起和隊友玩得開心更不重要。"},{"w":"alive","p":"adj.","d":"living; not dead","c":"活著的","s":"The little bird looked hurt at first, but it was still alive and breathing.","t":"那隻小鳥起初看起來受傷了，但牠仍然活著並有呼吸。"},{"w":"dead","p":"adj.","d":"no longer alive","c":"死的","s":"We found a dead insect on the windowsill while cleaning the classroom.","t":"我們打掃教室時在窗台上發現了一隻死掉的昆蟲。"},{"w":"bright","p":"adj.","d":"giving off a lot of light; easy to see","c":"明亮的","s":"The bright morning sun made it hard for him to see the road ahead.","t":"明亮的早晨陽光讓他很難看清前方的路。"},{"w":"dark","p":"adj.","d":"having little or no light","c":"黑暗的","s":"The basement was so dark that we needed a flashlight to find the boxes.","t":"地下室太暗了，我們需要手電筒才能找到那些箱子。"},{"w":"forward","p":"adj.","d":"directed toward the front","c":"向前的","s":"The coach told the players to keep moving in a forward direction toward the goal.","t":"教練告訴球員要持續朝球門的方向往前移動。"},{"w":"backward","p":"adj.","d":"directed toward the back","c":"向後的","s":"He took one backward step and accidentally bumped into the table behind him.","t":"他向後退了一步，結果不小心撞到了身後的桌子。"},{"w":"safe","p":"adj.","d":"free from danger or risk","c":"安全的","s":"My parents always remind me to wear a helmet to stay safe while biking.","t":"我父母總是提醒我騎自行車時要戴安全帽以保持安全。"},{"w":"dangerous","p":"adj.","d":"likely to cause harm or injury","c":"危險的","s":"Swimming alone in the deep ocean at night can be extremely dangerous.","t":"晚上獨自在深海游泳可能非常危險。"},{"w":"same","p":"adj.","d":"exactly alike; not different","c":"相同的","s":"My sister and I were born on the same day, exactly one year apart.","t":"我和姐姐在同一天出生，相差整整一年。"},{"w":"different","p":"adj.","d":"not the same; unlike each other","c":"不同的","s":"Each student in the art class chose a completely different color for their painting.","t":"美術課上每位學生都為自己的畫選了完全不同的顏色。"},{"w":"early","p":"adj.","d":"happening before the usual or expected time","c":"早的","s":"We caught an early train to avoid the crowds at the station.","t":"我們搭了一班早班車以避開車站的人群。"},{"w":"late","p":"adj.","d":"happening after the usual or expected time","c":"遲到的","s":"He arrived late to class because his bus broke down on the way.","t":"他因為公車在路上故障而上課遲到了。"},{"w":"fancy","p":"adj.","d":"decorated and elegant; not plain","c":"花俏的","s":"She wore a fancy dress with sparkling beads to the wedding party.","t":"她穿了一件鑲著閃亮珠子的華麗禮服去參加婚禮。"},{"w":"plain","p":"adj.","d":"simple in style, without decoration","c":"樸素的","s":"He prefers a plain white t-shirt over one with loud patterns.","t":"他比較喜歡樸素的白色T恤，而不是花樣花俏的。"},{"w":"fast","p":"adj.","d":"moving or able to move quickly","c":"快的","s":"The fast runner finished the race almost a full minute before everyone else.","t":"那位快速的跑者比其他人提早將近一分鐘完成比賽。"},{"w":"quick","p":"adj.","d":"happening or done with speed","c":"迅速的","s":"She gave a quick answer to the question without even pausing to think.","t":"她不假思索地給了一個迅速的答案。"},{"w":"slow","p":"adj.","d":"not moving or happening quickly","c":"慢的","s":"The traffic was so slow that we arrived twenty minutes later than planned.","t":"車流非常緩慢，我們比預計時間晚了二十分鐘才到。"},{"w":"impossible","p":"adj.","d":"not able to happen or be done","c":"不可能的","s":"It seemed impossible to finish all the homework in just one hour.","t":"在一個小時內完成所有作業似乎是不可能的。"},{"w":"possible","p":"adj.","d":"able to happen or be done","c":"可能的","s":"With a little extra practice, it is definitely possible to improve your grade.","t":"只要多一點練習，提升成績絕對是有可能的。"},{"w":"likely","p":"adj.","d":"probable; expected to happen","c":"有可能的","s":"According to the weather report, it is likely to rain later this afternoon.","t":"根據氣象報告，今天下午稍後很有可能會下雨。"},{"w":"distant","p":"adj.","d":"far away in space or time","c":"遙遠的","s":"From the hilltop, we could see a distant mountain covered in snow.","t":"從山頂上，我們能看到一座覆蓋著雪的遙遠山峰。"},{"w":"near","p":"adj.","d":"not far away in distance","c":"近的","s":"Our new apartment is near enough to the school that I can walk there.","t":"我們的新公寓離學校很近，近到我可以走路去上學。"},{"w":"new","p":"adj.","d":"recently made, bought, or arrived","c":"新的","s":"Everyone wanted to try out the new computers in the school's tech lab.","t":"大家都想試用學校科技教室裡的新電腦。"},{"w":"old","p":"adj.","d":"having existed for a long time; not new","c":"舊的；老的","s":"My grandfather still drives the same old truck he bought thirty years ago.","t":"我爺爺仍然開著他三十年前買的那台舊卡車。"},{"w":"wrong","p":"adj.","d":"not correct; incorrect","c":"錯誤的","s":"He realized halfway through the test that he had written the wrong answer.","t":"他在考試進行到一半時意識到自己寫了錯誤的答案。"},{"w":"right","p":"adj.","d":"correct, or located on the opposite side from left","c":"右邊的；正確的","s":"Turn right at the next traffic light to reach the museum.","t":"在下一個紅綠燈右轉就能到達博物館。"},{"w":"left","p":"adj.","d":"located on the side opposite from right","c":"左邊的","s":"She broke her left arm after falling off her bicycle last weekend.","t":"她上週末從自行車上摔下來，摔斷了左手臂。"},{"w":"major","p":"adj.","d":"important or significant; large in scale","c":"主要的","s":"Losing electricity for a whole week was a major problem for the village.","t":"整整一週沒有電對村莊來說是一個重大的問題。"},{"w":"minor","p":"adj.","d":"small or not very important","c":"次要的","s":"Luckily, he only suffered a minor injury after the small bicycle accident.","t":"幸運的是，他在這次小自行車事故後只受了輕微的傷。"},{"w":"maximum","p":"adj.","d":"the greatest amount or level possible","c":"最大限度的","s":"The elevator has a maximum weight limit of one thousand pounds.","t":"這座電梯的最大重量限制是一千磅。"},{"w":"medium","p":"adj.","d":"average in size, amount, or degree","c":"中等的","s":"I usually order a medium cup of coffee, not too big and not too small.","t":"我通常會點一杯中杯咖啡，不會太大也不會太小。"},{"w":"middle","p":"adj.","d":"in the center; neither at the start nor the end","c":"中間的","s":"Our family always sits in the middle row of seats at the movie theater.","t":"我們家在電影院總是坐在中間那一排座位。"},{"w":"negative","p":"adj.","d":"expressing disagreement, doubt, or a lack of something","c":"否定的","s":"Try not to use such negative words when talking about your own mistakes.","t":"在談論自己的錯誤時，盡量不要使用這麼負面的詞語。"},{"w":"positive","p":"adj.","d":"expressing agreement, hope, or a good attitude","c":"正面的","s":"Her coach always stays positive and encourages the team even after a loss.","t":"她的教練即使在輸球後也總是保持正面，並鼓勵球隊。"},{"w":"noisy","p":"adj.","d":"making a lot of loud, unpleasant sound","c":"喧鬧的","s":"The construction site next door has been incredibly noisy since early this morning.","t":"隔壁的工地從今天一大早就非常吵鬧。"},{"w":"peaceful","p":"adj.","d":"calm and quiet; free from disturbance","c":"寧靜的","s":"Early mornings in the countryside feel so peaceful compared to the busy city.","t":"鄉村的清晨比起繁忙的城市感覺寧靜許多。"},{"w":"quiet","p":"adj.","d":"making little or no noise","c":"安靜的","s":"Please be quiet in the library so other students can concentrate on studying.","t":"請在圖書館保持安靜，讓其他學生能專心學習。"},{"w":"silent","p":"adj.","d":"completely quiet; making no sound at all","c":"寂靜的","s":"The whole classroom stayed silent while the teacher read out the test results.","t":"老師宣布考試結果時，整間教室都鴉雀無聲。"},{"w":"rich","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of money or valuable things","c":"富有的","s":"The rich businessman donated a huge sum of money to the local hospital.","t":"那位富有的商人捐了一大筆錢給當地醫院。"},{"w":"poor","p":"adj.","d":"having very little money","c":"貧困的","s":"The charity collects warm clothes every winter for poor families in the area.","t":"這個慈善機構每年冬天都會為當地的貧困家庭收集保暖衣物。"},{"w":"private","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a particular person, not shared with others","c":"私人的","s":"She keeps a private diary that she never shows to anyone else.","t":"她寫了一本私人日記，從不讓任何人看。"},{"w":"public","p":"adj.","d":"open to or shared by everyone","c":"公共的","s":"Our neighborhood built a new public park where families can play and relax.","t":"我們社區建了一座新的公共公園，供家庭遊玩和休息。"}]},{"unit":18,"theme":"General Adjectives Part 1 (一般形容詞 一)","cards":[{"w":"able","p":"adj.","d":"having the skill or power to do something","c":"有能力的","s":"After months of practice, she finally felt able to swim across the entire pool.","t":"經過幾個月的練習，她終於覺得自己有能力游完整個泳池。"},{"w":"absent","p":"adj.","d":"not present; missing from a place","c":"缺席的","s":"Three students were absent from class today because of the flu going around school.","t":"今天有三位學生因為學校流行的感冒而缺席。"},{"w":"active","p":"adj.","d":"doing things regularly; full of energy and movement","c":"活躍的","s":"My grandmother stays active by gardening and walking every single morning.","t":"我奶奶每天早上靠園藝和散步保持活躍。"},{"w":"available","p":"adj.","d":"able to be used or obtained","c":"可用的","s":"The library checked, but no copies of that popular novel were available right now.","t":"圖書館查了一下，但那本熱門小說目前沒有任何一本可借。"},{"w":"boring","p":"adj.","d":"not interesting; dull","c":"令人乏味的","s":"He thought the documentary about rocks would be boring, but it surprised him.","t":"他原以為這部關於岩石的紀錄片會很無聊，但結果讓他很驚訝。"},{"w":"born","p":"adj.","d":"having come into life","c":"出生的","s":"My little cousin was born on the same day as my grandfather's birthday.","t":"我的小表弟出生的那天正好是我爺爺的生日。"},{"w":"brave","p":"adj.","d":"showing no fear when facing danger","c":"勇敢的","s":"The brave firefighter ran into the burning building to rescue the trapped family.","t":"那位勇敢的消防員跑進燃燒的大樓裡救出受困的家庭。"},{"w":"busy","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of things to do","c":"忙碌的","s":"My mother has been so busy this week that she hasn't had time to cook.","t":"我媽媽這週非常忙碌，沒有時間做飯。"},{"w":"central","p":"adj.","d":"in or near the middle of something; most important","c":"中心的","s":"The new shopping mall is built in a central location near the train station.","t":"這座新購物中心建在靠近車站的中心位置。"},{"w":"certain","p":"adj.","d":"sure about something; without doubt","c":"確定的","s":"I am certain that I left my umbrella on the bus this morning.","t":"我很確定我今天早上把雨傘留在公車上了。"},{"w":"classical","p":"adj.","d":"relating to traditional styles of music, art, or literature","c":"古典的","s":"My piano teacher wants me to learn a classical piece by a famous composer.","t":"我的鋼琴老師要我學一首著名作曲家的古典樂曲。"},{"w":"clear","p":"adj.","d":"easy to see, hear, or understand","c":"清楚的","s":"The teacher gave very clear instructions, so nobody had any questions afterward.","t":"老師給的指示非常清楚，所以後來沒有人提問。"},{"w":"comfortable","p":"adj.","d":"providing physical ease and relaxation","c":"舒適的","s":"We bought a new comfortable sofa for the living room last weekend.","t":"我們上週末買了一張新的舒適沙發放在客廳。"},{"w":"convenient","p":"adj.","d":"easy or useful for a particular purpose","c":"方便的","s":"Living near the subway station is very convenient for getting to school quickly.","t":"住在捷運站附近對快速到達學校來說非常方便。"},{"w":"crazy","p":"adj.","d":"acting in a strange or wild way","c":"瘋狂的","s":"It sounds crazy, but my uncle once swam across the entire lake before breakfast.","t":"這聽起來很瘋狂，但我叔叔曾在早餐前游過整個湖。"},{"w":"crowded","p":"adj.","d":"full of people or things, with little space","c":"擁擠的","s":"The night market gets so crowded on weekends that we can barely move.","t":"夜市在週末變得非常擁擠，我們幾乎無法移動。"},{"w":"cruel","p":"adj.","d":"causing pain or suffering to others on purpose","c":"殘忍的","s":"It was cruel of the older boys to laugh at him for falling down.","t":"那些年長的男孩因為他跌倒而嘲笑他，這樣很殘忍。"},{"w":"curious","p":"adj.","d":"eager to learn or know about something","c":"好奇的","s":"My little sister is always curious about how machines work inside.","t":"我妹妹總是對機器內部如何運作感到好奇。"},{"w":"dear","p":"adj.","d":"loved very much; precious to someone","c":"親愛的","s":"She begins every letter to her grandmother with the words, \"My dear Grandma.\"","t":"她寫給奶奶的每封信都以「親愛的奶奶」開頭。"},{"w":"deep","p":"adj.","d":"going far down from the top or surface","c":"深的","s":"The lifeguard warned swimmers that the water near the rocks was very deep.","t":"救生員警告泳客，岩石附近的水非常深。"},{"w":"double","p":"adj.","d":"twice as much or as many; having two parts","c":"雙重的","s":"Because he worked overtime, my father earned double pay for the holiday shift.","t":"因為加班，我爸爸這次假日班拿到了雙倍的薪水。"},{"w":"electric","p":"adj.","d":"powered by or relating to electricity","c":"電的","s":"My family bought an electric car last year to help protect the environment.","t":"我家去年買了一台電動車來幫助保護環境。"},{"w":"energetic","p":"adj.","d":"full of energy and enthusiasm","c":"精力充沛的","s":"Even after a long school day, my little brother is still incredibly energetic.","t":"即使上了一整天的學，我弟弟依然精力充沛。"},{"w":"enough","p":"adj.","d":"as much as is needed","c":"充足的","s":"We didn't have enough chairs for everyone, so two people had to stand.","t":"我們沒有足夠的椅子給每個人坐，所以有兩個人必須站著。"},{"w":"exciting","p":"adj.","d":"causing strong feelings of interest or eagerness","c":"令人興奮的","s":"The last few minutes of the soccer match were absolutely exciting.","t":"這場足球比賽的最後幾分鐘真是令人興奮。"},{"w":"extra","p":"adj.","d":"more than what is usual or expected","c":"額外的","s":"My mother always packs an extra sandwich in case I get hungry later.","t":"我媽媽總是多帶一個三明治，以防我之後餓了。"},{"w":"fair","p":"adj.","d":"treating people equally; not favoring one side","c":"公平的","s":"The referee tried to be fair and gave both teams the same number of warnings.","t":"裁判試圖保持公平，給兩隊相同次數的警告。"},{"w":"famous","p":"adj.","d":"known by many people","c":"著名的","s":"Our town became famous after a movie was filmed at the old lighthouse.","t":"自從一部電影在那座老燈塔拍攝後，我們的小鎮就變得有名了。"},{"w":"favorite","p":"adj.","d":"liked more than any others","c":"最喜歡的","s":"Chocolate ice cream has always been my favorite dessert since I was little.","t":"從小到大，巧克力冰淇淋一直是我最喜歡的甜點。"},{"w":"final","p":"adj.","d":"happening at the end; last","c":"最終的","s":"Everyone held their breath during the final round of the spelling competition.","t":"在拼字比賽的最後一輪，大家都緊張地不敢呼吸。"},{"w":"formal","p":"adj.","d":"following accepted rules and traditions; not casual","c":"正式的","s":"Students were asked to wear formal clothes for the graduation ceremony photos.","t":"畢業典禮拍照時，學生被要求穿正式服裝。"},{"w":"former","p":"adj.","d":"having been something in the past, but not now","c":"前任的","s":"My former teacher still sends me a card every year on my birthday.","t":"我以前的老師每年生日都還會寄卡片給我。"},{"w":"frank","p":"adj.","d":"honest and direct in what you say","c":"坦白的","s":"I appreciate how frank my coach is when giving feedback after every game.","t":"我很欣賞我的教練在每場比賽後給予回饋時的坦白態度。"},{"w":"fresh","p":"adj.","d":"recently made, grown, or obtained; not old","c":"新鮮的","s":"My grandmother always uses fresh vegetables from her garden in her cooking.","t":"我奶奶煮菜總是用她花園裡新鮮的蔬菜。"},{"w":"full","p":"adj.","d":"containing as much as possible; not empty","c":"充滿的","s":"The water bottle was completely full when I left it on the counter.","t":"我把水壺放在櫥檯上時它是裝滿的。"},{"w":"gold","p":"adj.","d":"made of or colored like gold","c":"金色的；金製的","s":"She received a gold medal for finishing first in the swimming race.","t":"她因為在游泳比賽中拿到第一名而獲得了一枚金牌。"},{"w":"greedy","p":"adj.","d":"wanting more money, food, or things than you need","c":"貪婪的","s":"The greedy dog tried to eat all the treats before the other puppies could have any.","t":"那隻貪心的狗想在其他小狗有機會吃之前把所有零食都吃掉。"},{"w":"homesick","p":"adj.","d":"feeling sad because you miss your home","c":"想家的","s":"During her first week studying abroad, she felt very homesick and called her parents daily.","t":"她出國留學的第一週感到非常想家，每天都會打電話給父母。"},{"w":"horrible","p":"adj.","d":"very bad or unpleasant","c":"可怕的","s":"The smell coming from the garbage can was absolutely horrible.","t":"從垃圾桶傳出的氣味實在很可怕。"},{"w":"independent","p":"adj.","d":"able to do things by yourself without help","c":"獨立的","s":"After moving away for college, he became much more independent than before.","t":"搬出去上大學後，他變得比以前更獨立了。"},{"w":"instant","p":"adj.","d":"happening immediately, without any delay","c":"即時的","s":"She felt an instant connection with her new puppy the moment they met.","t":"她和新養的小狗第一次見面就立刻產生了連結。"}]},{"unit":19,"theme":"General Adjectives Part 2 (一般形容詞 二)","cards":[{"w":"next","p":"adj.","d":"coming immediately after this one","c":"下一個的","s":"Please get off the bus at the next stop near the library.","t":"請在下一站靠近圖書館的地方下車。"},{"w":"last","p":"adj.","d":"coming after all others; final","c":"最後的","s":"She was the last student to leave the classroom after the bell rang.","t":"鐘聲響起後，她是最後一個離開教室的學生。"},{"w":"latest","p":"adj.","d":"most recent; newest","c":"最新的","s":"My brother waited in line for hours to buy the latest phone model.","t":"我哥哥排隊等了好幾個小時才買到最新款的手機。"},{"w":"latter","p":"adj.","d":"referring to the second of two things mentioned","c":"後者的","s":"Between pizza and noodles, we chose the latter option for dinner tonight.","t":"在披薩和麵之間，我們今晚晚餐選擇了後者，也就是麵。"},{"w":"long","p":"adj.","d":"having great length in distance or time","c":"長的","s":"We waited in a long line for almost an hour to enter the museum.","t":"我們排了將近一個小時的長隊才進入博物館。"},{"w":"loud","p":"adj.","d":"making a lot of noise","c":"大聲的","s":"The music at the party was so loud that we could barely hear each other talk.","t":"派對上的音樂太大聲了，我們幾乎聽不到彼此說話。"},{"w":"lucky","p":"adj.","d":"having good things happen by chance","c":"幸運的","s":"He felt lucky to find a parking spot right in front of the building.","t":"他覺得自己很幸運能在大樓正前方找到停車位。"},{"w":"magic","p":"adj.","d":"having special powers that seem impossible","c":"魔法的","s":"In the story, the old man owned a magic lamp that granted three wishes.","t":"在這個故事裡，那位老人擁有一個能實現三個願望的魔法神燈。"},{"w":"mass","p":"adj.","d":"involving a large number of people or things","c":"大量的","s":"The factory uses mass production to make thousands of toys every single day.","t":"這家工廠採用大量生產的方式，每天製造數千個玩具。"},{"w":"married","p":"adj.","d":"having a husband or wife","c":"已婚的","s":"My aunt has been married to my uncle for almost twenty years now.","t":"我阿姨已經和我叔叔結婚將近二十年了。"},{"w":"not","p":"adv.","d":"used to make a statement negative","c":"不","s":"I am not sure whether the store closes at nine or ten tonight.","t":"我不確定這家店今晚是九點還是十點關門。"},{"w":"off","p":"adj.","d":"not turned on or operating","c":"關閉的","s":"Before leaving the classroom, please make sure all the lights are turned off.","t":"離開教室前，請確保所有的燈都已經關閉。"},{"w":"pale","p":"adj.","d":"having less color than usual, especially in the face","c":"蒼白的","s":"After being sick all week, she still looked quite pale at school today.","t":"她整週生病後，今天在學校看起來仍然很蒼白。"},{"w":"patient","p":"adj.","d":"able to wait calmly without becoming upset","c":"有耐心的","s":"The kindergarten teacher stayed patient even when the children would not stop talking.","t":"即使孩子們一直講話不停，那位幼稚園老師依然保持耐心。"},{"w":"personal","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to or relating to a particular person","c":"私人的","s":"She keeps her personal diary locked in a small box under her bed.","t":"她把私人日記鎖在床下的一個小盒子裡。"},{"w":"pleasant","p":"adj.","d":"enjoyable or friendly; nice","c":"愉悅的","s":"We had a pleasant afternoon walking through the park and feeding the ducks.","t":"我們度過了一個愉快的午後，在公園裡散步並餵食鴨子。"},{"w":"precious","p":"adj.","d":"very valuable or important; treasured","c":"珍貴的","s":"The necklace was a precious gift passed down from her great-grandmother.","t":"這條項鍊是從她曾祖母那裡傳下來的珍貴禮物。"},{"w":"ready","p":"adj.","d":"fully prepared for something","c":"準備好的","s":"Are you ready to leave for school, or do you need a few more minutes?","t":"你準備好要去上學了嗎，還是還需要幾分鐘？"},{"w":"scared","p":"adj.","d":"feeling fear about something","c":"受驚嚇的","s":"My little cousin was too scared to walk past the dark basement alone.","t":"我的小表弟太害怕了，不敢獨自走過那個黑暗的地下室。"},{"w":"serious","p":"adj.","d":"important and needing careful thought; not joking","c":"嚴重的；嚴肅的","s":"The doctor looked serious while explaining the results of the medical test.","t":"醫生在解釋醫療檢查結果時表情嚴肅。"},{"w":"sharp","p":"adj.","d":"having a thin edge or point that can cut easily","c":"鋒利的","s":"Be careful with that sharp knife when you slice the vegetables.","t":"切蔬菜時要小心那把鋒利的刀。"},{"w":"skillful","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing great ability at something","c":"有技術的","s":"The skillful carpenter built a beautiful wooden table in just two days.","t":"那位有技術的木工師傅在短短兩天內就做出了一張漂亮的木桌。"},{"w":"sneaky","p":"adj.","d":"doing something secretly or dishonestly","c":"鬼鬼祟祟的","s":"My cat is so sneaky that she always finds a way to steal food from the table.","t":"我的貓非常鬼鬼祟祟，總是能找到方法從餐桌上偷食物。"},{"w":"social","p":"adj.","d":"relating to people spending time together; friendly","c":"社會的；社交的","s":"My sister is very social and makes new friends wherever she goes.","t":"我姐姐非常善於社交，無論到哪裡都能交到新朋友。"},{"w":"straight","p":"adj.","d":"without a curve or bend","c":"直的","s":"Draw a straight line from one corner of the paper to the other.","t":"從紙的一個角畫一條直線到另一個角。"},{"w":"strange","p":"adj.","d":"unusual or unexpected; not familiar","c":"奇怪的","s":"We heard a strange noise coming from the attic late last night.","t":"我們昨晚很晚的時候聽到閣樓傳來一個奇怪的聲音。"},{"w":"successful","p":"adj.","d":"having achieved a desired goal or result","c":"成功的","s":"After years of hard work, she finally became a successful writer with many fans.","t":"經過多年的努力，她終於成為一位擁有許多粉絲的成功作家。"},{"w":"such","p":"adj.","d":"used to emphasize a quality or degree","c":"如此的","s":"I have never seen such a beautiful sunset over the ocean before.","t":"我從來沒見過海上如此美麗的日落。"},{"w":"sudden","p":"adj.","d":"happening quickly and without warning","c":"突然的","s":"A sudden rainstorm forced everyone at the picnic to run for shelter.","t":"一場突然的暴雨讓野餐的每個人都跑去躲雨。"},{"w":"super","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good or great","c":"超級的","s":"The new roller coaster at the amusement park was absolutely super exciting.","t":"遊樂園裡的新雲霄飛車真是超級刺激。"},{"w":"sure","p":"adj.","d":"having no doubt about something","c":"有把握的","s":"Are you sure that you locked the front door before we left the house?","t":"你確定我們離開家之前鎖了前門嗎？"},{"w":"thick","p":"adj.","d":"having a large distance between opposite sides","c":"厚的","s":"She wrapped herself in a thick blanket to stay warm during the cold night.","t":"她裹著一條厚毯子，在寒冷的夜晚保暖。"},{"w":"tidy","p":"adj.","d":"neat and well organized","c":"整齊的","s":"My roommate always keeps his side of the room tidy and clean.","t":"我的室友總是把房間自己那一邊保持整齊乾淨。"},{"w":"tiny","p":"adj.","d":"extremely small","c":"微小的","s":"A tiny kitten was hiding quietly underneath the porch steps.","t":"一隻微小的小貓靜靜地躲在門廊階梯下面。"},{"w":"touch","p":"v.","d":"to put your hand or fingers on something","c":"觸摸","s":"The museum guard reminded visitors not to touch any of the old paintings.","t":"博物館的警衛提醒參觀者不要觸摸任何一幅老畫作。"},{"w":"upper","p":"adj.","d":"higher in position than something else","c":"較高的；上方的","s":"Our classroom is located on the upper floor of the old school building.","t":"我們的教室位於那座老校舍的較高樓層。"},{"w":"valuable","p":"adj.","d":"worth a lot of money or very useful","c":"有價值的","s":"The old painting turned out to be far more valuable than the family expected.","t":"這幅老畫比這家人預期的還要珍貴許多。"},{"w":"welcome","p":"adj.","d":"gladly received or accepted","c":"受歡迎的","s":"All new students are welcome to join the after-school chess club anytime.","t":"所有新生隨時都歡迎加入課後的棋藝社團。"},{"w":"wet","p":"adj.","d":"covered or soaked with water or another liquid","c":"潮濕的","s":"His shoes were completely wet after walking through the puddles in the rain.","t":"他在雨中走過水坑後，鞋子完全濕透了。"},{"w":"wild","p":"adj.","d":"living or growing in a natural state, not tamed or controlled","c":"野生的","s":"A group of wild deer wandered through the campsite early in the morning.","t":"一群野生的鹿在早晨時穿過了營地。"}]},{"unit":20,"theme":"Body Parts (身體部位)","cards":[{"w":"body","p":"n.","d":"the whole physical structure of a person or animal","c":"身體","s":"After the long swim, her whole body felt tired and relaxed.","t":"游了很久之後，她全身感到疲倦又放鬆。"},{"w":"head","p":"n.","d":"the top part of the body that contains the brain, eyes, and mouth","c":"頭","s":"He bumped his head on the low doorway as he walked into the room.","t":"他走進房間時頭撞到了低矮的門框。"},{"w":"face","p":"n.","d":"the front part of the head, from forehead to chin","c":"臉","s":"She washed her face with cold water to feel more awake.","t":"她用冷水洗臉，讓自己更清醒一點。"},{"w":"eye","p":"n.","d":"the organ used for seeing","c":"眼睛","s":"He closed one eye to look carefully through the small telescope.","t":"他閉上一隻眼睛，仔細地透過小型望遠鏡觀看。"},{"w":"ear","p":"n.","d":"the organ used for hearing","c":"耳朵","s":"She put her ear against the door to listen for any noise inside.","t":"她把耳朵貼在門上，聽聽裡面有沒有聲音。"},{"w":"nose","p":"n.","d":"the organ used for smelling and breathing","c":"鼻子","s":"The smell of fresh bread filled his nose as he walked past the bakery.","t":"他走過麵包店時，新鮮麵包的香味飄入了他的鼻子。"},{"w":"lip","p":"n.","d":"one of the two soft edges around the mouth","c":"嘴唇","s":"Her lip was sunburned after spending the whole afternoon at the beach.","t":"她在海邊待了整個下午後，嘴唇被曬傷了。"},{"w":"mouth","p":"n.","d":"the opening in the face used for eating and speaking","c":"嘴巴","s":"He covered his mouth politely whenever he started to yawn in class.","t":"他在課堂上想打哈欠時都會有禮貌地遮住嘴巴。"},{"w":"chin","p":"n.","d":"the part of the face below the mouth","c":"下巴","s":"The doctor gently lifted the boy's chin to check his throat.","t":"醫生輕輕抬起男孩的下巴來檢查他的喉嚨。"},{"w":"neck","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body connecting the head to the shoulders","c":"脖子","s":"She wrapped a warm scarf around her neck before stepping outside in the cold.","t":"她在寒冷的天氣外出前，在脖子上圍了一條溫暖的圍巾。"},{"w":"shoulder","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body where the arm joins the body","c":"肩膀","s":"He carried his little sister on his shoulder so she could see the parade.","t":"他讓小妹妹坐在他的肩膀上，這樣她就能看到遊行。"},{"w":"arm","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body from the shoulder to the hand","c":"手臂","s":"She broke her arm after falling off her bicycle last weekend.","t":"她上週末從自行車上摔下來，摔斷了手臂。"},{"w":"hand","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body at the end of the arm, used for holding things","c":"手","s":"He raised his hand quickly to answer the teacher's question.","t":"他迅速舉手回答老師的問題。"},{"w":"wrist","p":"n.","d":"the joint connecting the hand to the arm","c":"手腕","s":"She wears a silver bracelet on her wrist every single day.","t":"她每天都在手腕上戴著一個銀色手環。"},{"w":"finger","p":"n.","d":"one of the five thin parts at the end of the hand","c":"手指","s":"He accidentally cut his finger while slicing vegetables for dinner.","t":"他切晚餐用的蔬菜時不小心割到了手指。"},{"w":"thumb","p":"n.","d":"the short thick finger next to the first finger","c":"拇指","s":"The baby happily sucked her thumb while falling asleep in the car seat.","t":"嬰兒在汽車安全座椅上快樂地吸著拇指入睡。"},{"w":"back","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body from the neck to the bottom of the spine","c":"背部","s":"He hurt his back while lifting the heavy box off the floor.","t":"他從地上抬起那個沉重的箱子時傷到了背部。"},{"w":"waist","p":"n.","d":"the narrow part of the body between the ribs and the hips","c":"腰","s":"She tied a thin belt around her waist to complete her outfit.","t":"她在腰上繫了一條細皮帶來搭配她的穿著。"},{"w":"hip","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body where the leg joins the body at the side","c":"臀部","s":"He placed his hands on his hip while waiting for the bus to arrive.","t":"他等公車時雙手放在臀部上。"},{"w":"leg","p":"n.","d":"one of the two long parts of the body used for walking","c":"腿","s":"Her leg felt sore after running five kilometers in the park this morning.","t":"今天早上在公園跑了五公里後，她的腿感覺很痠痛。"},{"w":"knee","p":"n.","d":"the joint in the middle of the leg","c":"膝蓋","s":"He scraped his knee when he fell while skateboarding near the park.","t":"他在公園附近玩滑板時跌倒，擦傷了膝蓋。"},{"w":"ankle","p":"n.","d":"the joint connecting the foot to the leg","c":"腳踝","s":"She twisted her ankle while running on the uneven trail.","t":"她在不平的小路上跑步時扭傷了腳踝。"},{"w":"foot","p":"n.","d":"the part of the leg below the ankle","c":"腳","s":"He stepped on a sharp rock and hurt his bare foot.","t":"他踩到一塊尖石頭，弄傷了光著的腳。"},{"w":"toe","p":"n.","d":"one of the five parts at the end of the foot","c":"腳趾","s":"She accidentally stubbed her toe on the corner of the bed in the dark.","t":"她在黑暗中不小心踢到床角，傷到了腳趾。"},{"w":"beard","p":"n.","d":"the hair that grows on a man's chin and cheeks","c":"落腮鬍","s":"My grandfather has had a thick white beard for as long as I can remember.","t":"在我有記憶以來，我爺爺一直留著一把濃密的白色落腮鬍。"},{"w":"hair","p":"n.","d":"the thin strands that grow on the head and body","c":"頭髮","s":"She tied her long hair into a ponytail before starting her morning run.","t":"她開始晨跑前把長髮綁成了馬尾。"},{"w":"nail","p":"n.","d":"the hard covering at the tip of a finger or toe","c":"指甲","s":"She painted her nail a bright shade of pink before the party.","t":"派對前她把指甲塗成了鮮豔的粉紅色。"},{"w":"skin","p":"n.","d":"the outer covering of the body","c":"皮膚","s":"He always wears sunscreen to protect his skin at the beach.","t":"他在海邊總是擦防曬乳來保護皮膚。"},{"w":"blood","p":"n.","d":"the red liquid that flows through the body","c":"血液","s":"The nurse took a small sample of blood for the doctor to test.","t":"護士抽取了一小份血液樣本供醫生檢驗。"},{"w":"bone","p":"n.","d":"one of the hard parts that make up the body's skeleton","c":"骨頭","s":"The doctor took an X-ray to check if the bone in his arm was broken.","t":"醫生照了X光來檢查他手臂的骨頭是否骨折。"},{"w":"tooth","p":"n.","d":"one of the hard white parts in the mouth used for biting","c":"牙齒","s":"He felt a sharp pain in his tooth after eating something very cold.","t":"他吃了很冰的東西後牙齒感到一陣劇痛。"},{"w":"heart","p":"n.","d":"the organ in the chest that pumps blood through the body","c":"心臟","s":"Her heart beat quickly with excitement just before the race began.","t":"比賽開始前，她的心臟因興奮而跳得很快。"},{"w":"tongue","p":"n.","d":"the soft movable part inside the mouth used for tasting and speaking","c":"舌頭","s":"He accidentally bit his tongue while eating dinner too quickly.","t":"他吃晚餐吃得太快，不小心咬到了自己的舌頭。"},{"w":"throat","p":"n.","d":"the passage at the back of the mouth leading to the stomach and lungs","c":"喉嚨","s":"Her throat felt sore after cheering loudly at the basketball game.","t":"她在籃球比賽中大聲歡呼後喉嚨感到痛。"},{"w":"stomach","p":"n.","d":"the organ in the body where food is digested","c":"胃","s":"His stomach growled loudly during class because he had skipped breakfast.","t":"他因為沒吃早餐，上課時肚子餓得咕咕叫。"}]},{"unit":21,"theme":"Health / Illness / Senses / Speech (健康/疾病/感官/說話)","cards":[{"w":"health","p":"n.","d":"the condition of a person's body or mind","c":"健康","s":"Eating plenty of vegetables every day is good for your overall health.","t":"每天多吃蔬菜對整體健康有益。"},{"w":"cancer","p":"n.","d":"a serious disease in which cells grow out of control","c":"癌症","s":"Doctors caught the cancer early, so the treatment worked very well.","t":"醫生早期就發現了癌症，所以治療效果非常好。"},{"w":"flu","p":"n.","d":"a common illness that causes fever, coughing, and body aches","c":"流感","s":"Half the class stayed home with the flu during the cold winter week.","t":"在那個寒冷的冬週裡，班上有一半的學生因為流感請假在家。"},{"w":"cough","p":"n.","d":"a sudden noisy push of air out of the lungs, often from being sick","c":"咳嗽","s":"His cough kept him awake most of the night.","t":"他的咳嗽讓他幾乎整夜都無法入睡。"},{"w":"fever","p":"n.","d":"a body temperature that is higher than normal, often from illness","c":"發燒","s":"The doctor said her fever should go down within a day or two.","t":"醫生說她的發燒應該在一兩天內就會退。"},{"w":"wound","p":"n.","d":"an injury to the body, especially a cut","c":"傷口","s":"The nurse carefully cleaned the wound on his knee before wrapping it.","t":"護士在包紮之前小心地清理了他膝蓋上的傷口。"},{"w":"headache","p":"n.","d":"a pain felt inside the head","c":"頭痛","s":"Staring at the computer screen all day gave her a terrible headache.","t":"整天盯著電腦螢幕讓她頭痛得很厲害。"},{"w":"stomachache","p":"n.","d":"a pain felt in the stomach","c":"胃痛","s":"He got a stomachache after eating three bowls of ice cream too fast.","t":"他太快吃了三碗冰淇淋後就胃痛了。"},{"w":"toothache","p":"n.","d":"a pain felt in or around a tooth","c":"牙痛","s":"A bad toothache kept her up all night until she finally saw the dentist.","t":"嚴重的牙痛讓她整夜無法入睡，直到她終於去看了牙醫。"},{"w":"pain","p":"n.","d":"an unpleasant feeling caused by injury or illness","c":"疼痛","s":"He felt a sharp pain in his leg after twisting his ankle.","t":"他扭傷腳踝後，腿上感到一陣劇痛。"},{"w":"dizzy","p":"adj.","d":"feeling like everything is spinning around you","c":"暈眩的","s":"She felt dizzy after standing up too quickly from the chair.","t":"她從椅子上太快站起來後感到暈眩。"},{"w":"healthy","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing good health","c":"健康的","s":"Regular exercise and good sleep help keep your body healthy.","t":"規律運動和充足睡眠有助於保持身體健康。"},{"w":"well","p":"adj.","d":"in good health; not sick","c":"健康的","s":"After a week of rest, she finally felt well enough to return to school.","t":"休息一週後，她終於感覺好到可以回學校了。"},{"w":"ill","p":"adj.","d":"not feeling well; sick","c":"生病的","s":"He looked so ill this morning that his mother kept him home from school.","t":"他今天早上看起來很不舒服，所以媽媽讓他留在家裡沒去上學。"},{"w":"sick","p":"adj.","d":"feeling unwell or having an illness","c":"生病的","s":"My little brother felt too sick to eat dinner last night.","t":"我弟弟昨晚生病到吃不下晚餐。"},{"w":"painful","p":"adj.","d":"causing pain or hurting","c":"疼痛的","s":"Walking on the broken ankle was extremely painful for the young athlete.","t":"對這位年輕運動員來說，用骨折的腳踝走路非常疼痛。"},{"w":"sore","p":"adj.","d":"painful, especially from being used too much","c":"痠痛的","s":"Her legs were sore for days after running her very first marathon.","t":"她跑完第一次馬拉松後，雙腿痠痛了好幾天。"},{"w":"strong","p":"adj.","d":"having a lot of physical power","c":"強壯的","s":"Years of swimming every morning made him incredibly strong.","t":"多年每天早上游泳讓他變得非常強壯。"},{"w":"weak","p":"adj.","d":"lacking physical strength or power","c":"虛弱的","s":"After being sick for a whole week, his legs felt weak when he finally stood up.","t":"生病一整週後，他終於站起來時雙腿感覺虛弱。"},{"w":"cure","p":"v.","d":"to make a sick person well again","c":"治癒","s":"Scientists are working hard to cure many diseases that once had no treatment.","t":"科學家正努力研發方法來治癒許多以前無法治療的疾病。"},{"w":"hurt","p":"v.","d":"to cause pain or injury","c":"傷害；疼痛","s":"She hurt her wrist while trying to catch the falling vase.","t":"她想接住掉落的花瓶時傷到了手腕。"},{"w":"jam","p":"v.","d":"to press or squeeze tightly into a space","c":"擠；卡住","s":"Hundreds of people tried to jam into the small subway car during rush hour.","t":"上班尖峰時間，數百人想擠進那輛小小的地鐵車廂裡。"},{"w":"treat","p":"v.","d":"to try to cure or care for someone who is sick","c":"治療","s":"The doctor used a new medicine to treat the unusual skin condition.","t":"醫生用一種新藥來治療這個罕見的皮膚狀況。"},{"w":"operation","p":"n.","d":"a medical procedure to fix or remove something in the body","c":"手術","s":"The surgeon explained that the operation would take about three hours to complete.","t":"外科醫生解釋這場手術大約需要三個小時才能完成。"},{"w":"sense","p":"n.","d":"one of the ways the body experiences the world, like sight or hearing","c":"感官","s":"Dogs have a much stronger sense of smell than humans do.","t":"狗的嗅覺比人類強得多。"},{"w":"sight","p":"n.","d":"the ability to see","c":"視力","s":"Her grandmother's sight has gotten weaker over the past few years.","t":"她奶奶的視力在過去幾年裡變弱了。"},{"w":"voice","p":"n.","d":"the sound a person makes when speaking or singing","c":"聲音","s":"He recognized his best friend's voice immediately, even over the noisy phone line.","t":"即使在嘈雜的電話線上，他也立刻認出了他最好朋友的聲音。"},{"w":"blind","p":"adj.","d":"unable to see","c":"看不見的","s":"The blind man used his cane to carefully find his way down the busy sidewalk.","t":"那位看不見的男士用他的拐杖小心地在繁忙的人行道上找路。"},{"w":"deaf","p":"adj.","d":"unable to hear","c":"聽不見的","s":"Since he is deaf, he learned to communicate using sign language.","t":"因為他聽不見，所以他學會了用手語溝通。"},{"w":"dumb","p":"adj.","d":"unable to speak","c":"不能說話的","s":"The character in the play pretended to be dumb so nobody would ask him questions.","t":"劇中的角色假裝不能說話，這樣就沒人會問他問題了。"},{"w":"hear","p":"v.","d":"to notice sound using your ears","c":"聽見","s":"Can you hear the birds singing outside the window this morning?","t":"你今天早上能聽到窗外鳥兒唱歌的聲音嗎？"},{"w":"listen","p":"v.","d":"to pay attention to sound on purpose","c":"聆聽","s":"Please listen carefully to the instructions before starting the test.","t":"請在開始測驗前仔細聆聽指示。"},{"w":"see","p":"v.","d":"to notice something using your eyes","c":"看見","s":"From the top of the tower, we could see the entire city below.","t":"從塔頂上，我們能看到整座城市。"},{"w":"look","p":"v.","d":"to turn your eyes toward something on purpose","c":"看","s":"Please look both ways carefully before crossing the busy street.","t":"過繁忙的街道前，請小心地向左右看。"},{"w":"speak","p":"v.","d":"to say words out loud","c":"說話","s":"She felt nervous the first time she had to speak in front of the whole class.","t":"她第一次必須在全班面前說話時感到很緊張。"},{"w":"say","p":"v.","d":"to express something in words","c":"說","s":"He didn't know what to say when his friend started crying suddenly.","t":"當他的朋友突然哭起來時，他不知道該說什麼。"},{"w":"talk","p":"v.","d":"to speak with someone; to have a conversation","c":"說話","s":"My parents like to talk about their day together over dinner every evening.","t":"我父母每天晚餐時都喜歡一起聊聊他們這一天的事。"},{"w":"tell","p":"v.","d":"to give information to someone using words","c":"告訴","s":"Could you tell me what time the movie starts tonight?","t":"你可以告訴我今晚電影幾點開始嗎？"},{"w":"smell","p":"v.","d":"to notice something using your nose","c":"聞","s":"I could smell fresh cookies baking from all the way down the hallway.","t":"我在走廊另一端就能聞到新鮮餅乾正在烘烤的味道。"},{"w":"taste","p":"v.","d":"to notice the flavor of food using your tongue","c":"嚐","s":"She wanted to taste the soup before adding any more salt to it.","t":"她想先嚐嚐湯的味道，再決定要不要加更多鹽。"},{"w":"bitter","p":"adj.","d":"having a sharp, unpleasant taste, like black coffee","c":"苦的","s":"The medicine tasted so bitter that she needed water right after swallowing it.","t":"那藥嚐起來非常苦，她吞下去後馬上需要喝水。"},{"w":"sour","p":"adj.","d":"having a sharp taste, like a lemon","c":"酸的","s":"The green apple was much more sour than he expected.","t":"這顆青蘋果比他預期的酸多了。"},{"w":"sweet","p":"adj.","d":"having the taste of sugar","c":"甜的","s":"The cake was so sweet that she could only finish half a slice.","t":"這個蛋糕太甜了，她只能吃完半片。"},{"w":"hungry","p":"adj.","d":"feeling like you need to eat","c":"飢餓的","s":"By the time dinner was ready, the children were extremely hungry.","t":"晚餐準備好的時候，孩子們已經非常飢餓了。"},{"w":"thirsty","p":"adj.","d":"feeling like you need to drink something","c":"口渴的","s":"After running in the hot sun for an hour, he felt incredibly thirsty.","t":"在炎熱的陽光下跑了一個小時後，他感到非常口渴。"}]},{"unit":22,"theme":"Clothing Items / Care & Fashion (服飾/服裝保養與時尚)","cards":[{"w":"shirt","p":"n.","d":"a piece of clothing worn on the upper body, often with buttons and a collar","c":"襯衫","s":"He ironed his white shirt carefully before the job interview.","t":"他在面試前小心地把那件白襯衫燙好。"},{"w":"T-shirt","p":"n.","d":"a simple short-sleeved shirt with no collar or buttons","c":"T恤","s":"She bought a new T-shirt with her favorite band's logo printed on the front.","t":"她買了一件印有她最喜歡樂團標誌的新T恤。"},{"w":"sweater","p":"n.","d":"a warm knitted piece of clothing worn over the upper body","c":"毛衣","s":"My grandmother knitted me a cozy sweater for my birthday this year.","t":"我奶奶今年生日織了一件舒適的毛衣送我。"},{"w":"dress","p":"n.","d":"a one-piece piece of clothing worn by women or girls","c":"洋裝","s":"She wore a beautiful blue dress to her cousin's wedding last weekend.","t":"她上週末穿了一件漂亮的藍色洋裝去參加表姐的婚禮。"},{"w":"skirt","p":"n.","d":"a piece of clothing that hangs from the waist and covers the legs","c":"裙子","s":"The school requires girls to wear a navy blue skirt as part of the uniform.","t":"學校規定女生要穿深藍色的裙子作為制服的一部分。"},{"w":"jeans","p":"n.","d":"casual pants made from a thick blue cotton fabric called denim","c":"牛仔褲","s":"He wore his favorite pair of jeans to the weekend barbecue.","t":"他穿著他最喜歡的那條牛仔褲去參加週末的烤肉聚會。"},{"w":"pants","p":"n.","d":"a piece of clothing covering the body from the waist to the ankles, with two legs","c":"長褲","s":"He needed to buy new pants after he grew two inches taller this year.","t":"他今年長高了兩英吋，所以需要買新長褲。"},{"w":"trousers","p":"n.","d":"another word for pants, more common in British English","c":"長褲","s":"The waiter wore black trousers and a crisp white shirt at the formal restaurant.","t":"服務生在這家正式的餐廳裡穿著黑色長褲和一件整潔的白襯衫。"},{"w":"shorts","p":"n.","d":"pants that end above or at the knee","c":"短褲","s":"He packed a pair of swim shorts for the trip to the beach.","t":"他為這次海邊旅行打包了一條泳褲。"},{"w":"vest","p":"n.","d":"a sleeveless piece of clothing worn over a shirt","c":"背心","s":"He wore a fancy vest under his suit jacket for the formal dinner.","t":"他在正式晚宴的西裝外套下穿了一件講究的背心。"},{"w":"coat","p":"n.","d":"a long piece of outer clothing worn for warmth","c":"大衣","s":"She buttoned up her warm winter coat before stepping outside into the snow.","t":"她踏出門進入雪地前把溫暖的冬季大衣扣好。"},{"w":"jacket","p":"n.","d":"a short coat, often worn outdoors","c":"夾克","s":"He grabbed his denim jacket on the way out in case it got cold later.","t":"他出門時拿了他的牛仔夾克，以防晚一點變冷。"},{"w":"suit","p":"n.","d":"a matching jacket and pants or skirt worn for formal occasions","c":"套裝","s":"He wore a dark gray suit to his sister's graduation ceremony.","t":"他穿了一套深灰色的套裝去參加姐姐的畢業典禮。"},{"w":"uniform","p":"n.","d":"special clothing worn by everyone in a school, team, or job","c":"制服","s":"Every student at this school must wear the same blue uniform on weekdays.","t":"這所學校的每位學生在平日都必須穿同樣的藍色制服。"},{"w":"pajamas","p":"n.","d":"loose, comfortable clothing worn for sleeping","c":"睡衣","s":"He changed into his favorite striped pajamas before climbing into bed.","t":"他爬上床前換上了他最喜歡的條紋睡衣。"},{"w":"underwear","p":"n.","d":"clothing worn under your other clothes, next to your skin","c":"內衣","s":"She always packs extra underwear whenever she goes on a long trip.","t":"她每次長途旅行都會多帶一些內衣。"},{"w":"swimsuit","p":"n.","d":"clothing worn for swimming","c":"泳裝","s":"She packed her favorite swimsuit for the family trip to the water park.","t":"她為這次全家去水上樂園的旅行打包了她最喜歡的泳裝。"},{"w":"socks","p":"n.","d":"soft coverings worn on the feet, inside shoes","c":"襪子","s":"He could never find two matching socks in his messy drawer.","t":"他在亂糟糟的抽屜裡總是找不到兩隻一樣的襪子。"},{"w":"shoes","p":"n.","d":"items worn to cover and protect the feet outdoors","c":"鞋子","s":"She bought a new pair of shoes for the first day of school.","t":"她為開學第一天買了一雙新鞋。"},{"w":"slippers","p":"n.","d":"soft, comfortable shoes worn indoors","c":"拖鞋","s":"He slipped on his warm slippers as soon as he got out of bed.","t":"他一下床就立刻穿上他溫暖的拖鞋。"},{"w":"sneakers","p":"n.","d":"comfortable sports shoes used for running or exercise","c":"運動鞋","s":"She wore her newest sneakers for the school's annual track and field day.","t":"她穿著最新的運動鞋參加學校的年度田徑運動會。"},{"w":"fit","p":"v.","d":"to be the right size or shape for someone","c":"合身","s":"The shirt was too small and did not fit him anymore.","t":"這件襯衫太小了，已經不適合他穿了。"},{"w":"iron","p":"v.","d":"to make clothes smooth using a heated tool","c":"熨燙","s":"She likes to iron her school uniform every Sunday evening for the week ahead.","t":"她喜歡每個星期天晚上熨燙她下週要穿的學校制服。"},{"w":"wear","p":"v.","d":"to have clothing on your body","c":"穿著","s":"Students must wear their name tags during the entire school field trip.","t":"學生在整個校外教學期間都必須佩戴名牌。"},{"w":"fashionable","p":"adj.","d":"stylish; in keeping with current trends","c":"時尚的","s":"My older sister always knows which colors and styles are the most fashionable this season.","t":"我姐姐總是知道這個季節最流行的顏色和款式。"}]},{"unit":23,"theme":"Accessories / Colors (配件/顏色)","cards":[{"w":"pocket","p":"n.","d":"a small pouch sewn into clothing for carrying small items","c":"口袋","s":"He kept his bus ticket safe in his jacket pocket the whole way home.","t":"他整路回家都把公車票安全地放在外套口袋裡。"},{"w":"backpack","p":"n.","d":"a bag carried on the back, held by straps over the shoulders","c":"後背包","s":"She packed her textbooks neatly into her backpack before leaving for school.","t":"她出門上學前把課本整齊地裝進後背包裡。"},{"w":"bag","p":"n.","d":"a flexible container used for carrying things","c":"袋子","s":"He carried his lunch in a small paper bag every day.","t":"他每天都用一個小紙袋裝午餐。"},{"w":"purse","p":"n.","d":"a small bag, usually carried by women, for money and personal items","c":"錢包","s":"She searched through her purse looking for her house keys.","t":"她在錢包裡翻找家裡的鑰匙。"},{"w":"wallet","p":"n.","d":"a small flat case for carrying money and cards","c":"皮夾","s":"He checked his back pocket twice to make sure his wallet was still there.","t":"他檢查了兩次後口袋，確認皮夾還在裡面。"},{"w":"belt","p":"n.","d":"a strip of leather or cloth worn around the waist","c":"皮帶","s":"He tightened his belt after losing a little weight last month.","t":"他上個月瘦了一點後把皮帶束緊了一些。"},{"w":"button","p":"n.","d":"a small round object used to fasten clothing","c":"鈕扣","s":"One button fell off his shirt while he was getting dressed this morning.","t":"他今天早上穿衣服時，襯衫上的一顆鈕扣掉了。"},{"w":"cap","p":"n.","d":"a soft hat with a brim, often worn for sports","c":"鴨舌帽","s":"He wore his favorite baseball cap backward while skateboarding at the park.","t":"他在公園玩滑板時把他最喜歡的棒球帽反著戴。"},{"w":"hat","p":"n.","d":"a covering worn on the head","c":"帽子","s":"She wore a wide straw hat to protect her face from the sun.","t":"她戴了一頂寬邊草帽來保護臉部不被太陽曬到。"},{"w":"glove","p":"n.","d":"a piece of clothing that covers the hand and fingers","c":"手套","s":"He put on a thick winter glove before building a snowman outside.","t":"他出去堆雪人前先戴上一隻厚厚的冬季手套。"},{"w":"scarf","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth worn around the neck for warmth or style","c":"圍巾","s":"She wrapped a soft wool scarf around her neck before going outside.","t":"她出門前在脖子上圍了一條柔軟的羊毛圍巾。"},{"w":"tie","p":"n.","d":"a narrow piece of cloth worn around the neck, usually by men","c":"領帶","s":"He chose a blue tie to match his suit for the job interview.","t":"他為了面試挑了一條藍色領帶來搭配他的西裝。"},{"w":"glasses","p":"n.","d":"a pair of lenses worn over the eyes to help with seeing","c":"眼鏡","s":"She cannot read the whiteboard clearly without her glasses on.","t":"她沒戴眼鏡就看不清楚白板上的字。"},{"w":"contact lens","p":"n.","d":"a thin curved piece of plastic worn directly on the eye to help vision","c":"隱形眼鏡","s":"She prefers wearing a contact lens instead of glasses when she plays sports.","t":"她打球時比較喜歡戴隱形眼鏡而不是眼鏡。"},{"w":"earrings","p":"n.","d":"jewelry worn on the ears","c":"耳環","s":"Her grandmother gave her a pair of pearl earrings for her sixteenth birthday.","t":"她奶奶在她十六歲生日時送了她一對珍珠耳環。"},{"w":"necklace","p":"n.","d":"a piece of jewelry worn around the neck","c":"項鍊","s":"She wore a gold necklace with a small heart-shaped pendant.","t":"她戴了一條墜著小愛心吊飾的金色項鍊。"},{"w":"ring","p":"n.","d":"a piece of jewelry worn on a finger","c":"戒指","s":"He proposed to her with a beautiful diamond ring at the beach.","t":"他在海邊用一枚美麗的鑽石戒指向她求婚。"},{"w":"watch","p":"n.","d":"a small device worn on the wrist to tell time","c":"手錶","s":"He checked his watch nervously while waiting for the train to arrive.","t":"他緊張地看著手錶等待火車到來。"},{"w":"handkerchief","p":"n.","d":"a small square piece of cloth used for wiping the nose or face","c":"手帕","s":"He offered his clean handkerchief when she started crying at the sad movie.","t":"當她在那部悲傷的電影裡哭起來時，他遞給她一條乾淨的手帕。"},{"w":"mask","p":"n.","d":"a covering worn over the face or mouth and nose","c":"口罩","s":"He wore a mask while cleaning the dusty old attic.","t":"他清理那個滿是灰塵的舊閣樓時戴著口罩。"},{"w":"hanger","p":"n.","d":"a curved piece of plastic or wood used to hang clothes","c":"衣架","s":"She hung her new coat carefully on a wooden hanger in the closet.","t":"她把新買的大衣小心地掛在衣櫃裡的木製衣架上。"},{"w":"color","p":"n.","d":"the quality that makes something look red, blue, green, and so on","c":"顏色","s":"She could not decide which color to paint her bedroom walls.","t":"她無法決定要把臥室的牆漆成什麼顏色。"},{"w":"colorful","p":"adj.","d":"full of bright colors","c":"色彩鮮豔的","s":"The festival parade was full of colorful costumes and decorations.","t":"這場節日遊行充滿了色彩鮮豔的服裝和裝飾。"},{"w":"black","p":"adj.","d":"having the darkest color, like the night sky","c":"黑色的","s":"He wore a black suit to his grandfather's funeral.","t":"他穿了一套黑色西裝去參加爺爺的喪禮。"},{"w":"white","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of snow or milk","c":"白色的","s":"She painted the kitchen walls a bright white to make the room feel larger.","t":"她把廚房的牆漆成明亮的白色，讓房間感覺更大。"},{"w":"gray","p":"adj.","d":"having a color between black and white","c":"灰色的","s":"The sky turned gray just before the heavy rain started.","t":"天空在大雨開始前變成了灰色。"},{"w":"red","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of blood or a ripe tomato","c":"紅色的","s":"She wore a bright red dress to stand out at the party.","t":"她穿了一件鮮紅色的洋裝，在派對上顯得格外亮眼。"},{"w":"pink","p":"adj.","d":"having a light reddish color","c":"粉紅色的","s":"My little sister's room is decorated entirely in pink.","t":"我妹妹的房間全部都用粉紅色裝飾。"},{"w":"yellow","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of a lemon or the sun","c":"黃色的","s":"The school bus stopped at the corner, its bright yellow paint easy to spot.","t":"那輛校車在轉角停下，鮮黃色的車身很容易就能看到。"},{"w":"green","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of grass or leaves","c":"綠色的","s":"The hills turned a deep green after weeks of steady rain.","t":"經過幾週的持續降雨，山丘變成了深綠色。"},{"w":"blue","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of a clear sky","c":"藍色的","s":"The ocean looked perfectly blue under the bright morning sun.","t":"在明亮的早晨陽光下，海洋看起來是完美的藍色。"},{"w":"purple","p":"adj.","d":"having a color made by mixing red and blue","c":"紫色的","s":"She picked a purple ribbon to match her new dress.","t":"她挑了一條紫色緞帶來搭配她的新洋裝。"},{"w":"brown","p":"adj.","d":"having the color of wood, soil, or coffee","c":"棕色的","s":"He has short brown hair and bright brown eyes like his father.","t":"他和他爸爸一樣留著棕色短髮和明亮的棕色眼睛。"},{"w":"golden","p":"adj.","d":"having a bright yellow color, like gold","c":"金色的","s":"The sunset painted the sky a warm golden shade that evening.","t":"那天晚上的日落把天空染成了溫暖的金色。"},{"w":"silver","p":"adj.","d":"having a shiny gray color, like the metal silver","c":"銀色的","s":"She wore a silver bracelet that matched her earrings perfectly.","t":"她戴了一條和耳環完美搭配的銀色手環。"}]},{"unit":24,"theme":"Physical Appearance / Age / Beauty (外貌/年齡/美貌)","cards":[{"w":"beautiful","p":"adj.","d":"very pleasing to look at","c":"漂亮的","s":"Everyone agreed that the sunset over the ocean looked absolutely beautiful that evening.","t":"大家都認為那天晚上海洋上的日落美得令人讚嘆。"},{"w":"pretty","p":"adj.","d":"attractive in a delicate or graceful way","c":"漂亮的","s":"She wore a pretty flower in her hair for the school dance.","t":"她在學校舞會上戴了一朵漂亮的花在頭髮上。"},{"w":"ugly","p":"adj.","d":"unpleasant to look at","c":"醜的","s":"The old, broken fence looked quite ugly next to the new garden.","t":"那座老舊破損的籬笆在新花園旁邊看起來相當醜陋。"},{"w":"chubby","p":"adj.","d":"slightly fat in a pleasant way, often used for babies","c":"圓胖的","s":"The baby's chubby cheeks made everyone want to give her a hug.","t":"這個寶寶圓胖的臉頰讓大家都想抱抱她。"},{"w":"fat","p":"adj.","d":"having a large amount of body weight","c":"胖的","s":"The fat cat napped lazily in a sunny spot by the window all afternoon.","t":"那隻胖貓整個下午都懶洋洋地在窗邊有陽光的地方睡覺。"},{"w":"cute","p":"adj.","d":"attractive in a charming or sweet way","c":"可愛的","s":"Everyone at the shelter thought the small puppy was incredibly cute.","t":"收容所裡的每個人都覺得那隻小狗非常可愛。"},{"w":"lovely","p":"adj.","d":"very pleasant or attractive","c":"可愛的；討人喜歡的","s":"We had a lovely afternoon picnic together under the cherry blossom trees.","t":"我們在櫻花樹下度過了一個愉快可愛的午後野餐時光。"},{"w":"handsome","p":"adj.","d":"good-looking, usually describing a man","c":"英俊的","s":"Everyone said the groom looked especially handsome in his new gray suit.","t":"大家都說新郎穿著他的新灰色西裝顯得特別英俊。"},{"w":"nice-looking","p":"adj.","d":"having a pleasant or attractive appearance","c":"外表好看的","s":"The new restaurant downtown has a nice-looking sign that catches everyone's eye.","t":"市中心那家新餐廳有一個吸引大家目光的好看招牌。"},{"w":"tall","p":"adj.","d":"having a greater than average height","c":"高的","s":"My older brother grew very tall during his last year of middle school.","t":"我哥哥在國中最後一年長得很高。"},{"w":"short","p":"adj.","d":"having a less than average height","c":"矮的","s":"Even though she is short, she is the fastest runner on the whole team.","t":"雖然她個子矮，但她是整個隊伍裡跑得最快的。"},{"w":"skinny","p":"adj.","d":"extremely thin, often in a way that is not healthy","c":"骨瘦如柴的","s":"After being sick for two weeks, he looked noticeably skinny when he returned to school.","t":"生病兩週後，他回到學校時看起來明顯瘦了很多。"},{"w":"slender","p":"adj.","d":"thin in an attractive or graceful way","c":"修長的","s":"The dancer's slender arms moved gracefully across the stage during the performance.","t":"那位舞者修長的手臂在表演中優雅地在舞台上揮動。"},{"w":"slim","p":"adj.","d":"thin in a pleasing or attractive way","c":"纖細的","s":"She has stayed slim for years by exercising and eating healthy meals every day.","t":"她多年來每天運動並健康飲食，一直保持纖細的身材。"},{"w":"thin","p":"adj.","d":"not fat; having little extra flesh on the body","c":"瘦的","s":"His grandfather looked much thiner after recovering from his long illness.","t":"他爺爺從長期的病痛中恢復後看起來瘦了許多。"},{"w":"elder","p":"adj.","d":"older, often used to describe the older of two siblings","c":"年長的","s":"His elder sister always helps him with his math homework after dinner.","t":"他年長的姐姐每天晚餐後都會幫他做數學作業。"},{"w":"young","p":"adj.","d":"having lived only a short time; not old","c":"年輕的","s":"The young couple just moved into the apartment down the hall from us.","t":"那對年輕夫妻剛搬進我們這條走廊盡頭的公寓。"},{"w":"beauty","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being pleasing to look at","c":"美貌；美麗","s":"Visitors travel from all over the world just to see the natural beauty of the mountains.","t":"遊客從世界各地前來，就是為了欣賞這些山脈的自然美景。"}]},{"unit":25,"theme":"Sports / Games / Outdoor Activities (運動/遊戲/戶外活動)","cards":[{"w":"baseball","p":"n.","d":"a sport played with a bat and ball between two teams","c":"棒球","s":"Every Saturday afternoon, my brother and his friends play baseball at the local park.","t":"每個星期六下午，我哥哥和他的朋友都會在當地的公園打棒球。"},{"w":"basketball","p":"n.","d":"a sport in which two teams try to throw a ball through a high hoop","c":"籃球","s":"He practices basketball in the school gym every day after class.","t":"他每天下課後都會在學校體育館練習打籃球。"},{"w":"bowling","p":"n.","d":"a game in which a heavy ball is rolled to knock down pins","c":"保齡球","s":"We went bowling together for my cousin's birthday party last weekend.","t":"我們上週末為了表哥的生日派對一起去打保齡球。"},{"w":"dodge ball","p":"n.","d":"a game where players try to avoid being hit by a thrown ball","c":"躲避球","s":"During PE class, the whole class played dodge ball in the gym today.","t":"今天的體育課上，全班在體育館裡玩了躲避球。"},{"w":"football","p":"n.","d":"a sport played with an oval ball, popular in the United States","c":"美式足球","s":"He watches football games with his father on television every Sunday.","t":"他每個星期天都會和爸爸一起在電視上看美式足球比賽。"},{"w":"golf","p":"n.","d":"a sport in which players hit a small ball into holes using clubs","c":"高爾夫球","s":"My grandfather still plays golf with his old friends every weekend.","t":"我爺爺每個週末還是會和他的老朋友一起打高爾夫球。"},{"w":"soccer","p":"n.","d":"a sport in which two teams try to kick a ball into a goal","c":"足球","s":"She joined the school soccer team after moving to her new school.","t":"她搬到新學校後加入了學校的足球隊。"},{"w":"table tennis","p":"n.","d":"a sport played on a table with small paddles and a light ball","c":"桌球","s":"We set up a table tennis table in the garage to play during the summer.","t":"我們在車庫裡擺了一張桌球桌，要在夏天玩。"},{"w":"tennis","p":"n.","d":"a sport played with rackets and a ball over a net","c":"網球","s":"My older sister takes tennis lessons at the community center twice a week.","t":"我姐姐每週兩次在社區中心上網球課。"},{"w":"volleyball","p":"n.","d":"a sport in which two teams hit a ball over a high net","c":"排球","s":"The students set up a net to play volleyball on the beach.","t":"學生們在海邊架了一個網子來打排球。"},{"w":"frisbee","p":"n.","d":"a flat plastic disk that is thrown and caught for fun","c":"飛盤","s":"He brought a frisbee to the park so we could play with his dog.","t":"他帶了一個飛盤去公園，這樣我們就能跟他的狗一起玩。"},{"w":"roller blade","p":"n.","d":"a boot with a single row of small wheels, used for skating","c":"直排輪","s":"She wore her new roller blade to skate around the smooth path by the river.","t":"她穿著新買的直排輪沿著河邊那條平滑的步道溜冰。"},{"w":"roller skate","p":"n.","d":"a shoe with small wheels attached to the bottom","c":"輪式溜冰鞋","s":"My little cousin got a pair of roller skate for her birthday this year.","t":"我的小表妹今年生日收到了一雙輪式溜冰鞋。"},{"w":"seesaw","p":"n.","d":"a long board balanced in the middle for children to ride up and down","c":"蹺蹺板","s":"The two children took turns going up and down on the seesaw.","t":"那兩個小孩輪流坐在蹺蹺板上一上一下地玩。"},{"w":"slide","p":"n.","d":"a smooth sloped surface that children climb up and slide down","c":"滑梯","s":"The toddler laughed happily every time she went down the slide.","t":"那個幼兒每次滑下滑梯時都笑得很開心。"},{"w":"softball","p":"n.","d":"a sport similar to baseball, played with a larger, softer ball","c":"壘球","s":"Our school's softball team won the regional championship this spring.","t":"我們學校的壘球隊在今年春天贏得了區域冠軍。"},{"w":"swim","p":"v.","d":"to move through water using your arms and legs","c":"游泳","s":"She learned to swim when she was only four years old.","t":"她在四歲的時候就學會了游泳。"},{"w":"jog","p":"v.","d":"to run slowly, usually for exercise","c":"慢跑","s":"He likes to jog around the neighborhood early every morning.","t":"他喜歡每天早上在社區附近慢跑。"},{"w":"skate","p":"v.","d":"to glide smoothly on ice or wheels","c":"溜冰","s":"They went to the indoor rink to skate during their winter vacation.","t":"他們在寒假期間去室內溜冰場溜冰。"},{"w":"ski","p":"v.","d":"to glide over snow using long narrow boards attached to the feet","c":"滑雪","s":"My family travels to the mountains every winter to ski together.","t":"我家每年冬天都會一起去山上滑雪。"},{"w":"surf","p":"v.","d":"to ride on ocean waves using a board","c":"衝浪","s":"He wakes up before sunrise to surf when the waves are the best.","t":"他會在日出前起床去衝浪，因為那時的海浪最棒。"}]},{"unit":26,"theme":"Music / Hobbies (音樂/愛好)","cards":[{"w":"band","p":"n.","d":"a group of musicians who play music together","c":"樂隊","s":"My older brother plays the drums in a rock band with his friends.","t":"我哥哥和他的朋友組了一個搖滾樂隊，他負責打鼓。"},{"w":"music","p":"n.","d":"sounds arranged in a pleasing way, often with rhythm and melody","c":"音樂","s":"She always listens to calm music while doing her homework in the evening.","t":"她晚上做作業時總是會聽一些輕柔的音樂。"},{"w":"jazz","p":"n.","d":"a style of music with a strong rhythm, often improvised","c":"爵士樂","s":"My grandfather loves jazz music and plays old records every Sunday afternoon.","t":"我爺爺很喜歡爵士樂，每個星期天下午都會播放老唱片。"},{"w":"pop music","p":"n.","d":"popular music that is widely enjoyed, especially by young people","c":"流行音樂","s":"My little sister only listens to pop music on her way to school.","t":"我妹妹上學路上只聽流行音樂。"},{"w":"instrument","p":"n.","d":"an object used to produce musical sounds","c":"樂器","s":"Before joining the school band, every student must choose one instrument to learn.","t":"在加入校隊樂團之前，每位學生都必須選擇一種樂器來學習。"},{"w":"drum","p":"n.","d":"a musical instrument played by hitting it with hands or sticks","c":"鼓","s":"He practices the drum in the garage so he won't disturb the neighbors.","t":"他在車庫裡練鼓，這樣就不會打擾到鄰居。"},{"w":"flute","p":"n.","d":"a thin metal musical instrument played by blowing across a hole","c":"長笛","s":"She has played the flute in the school orchestra since fifth grade.","t":"她從五年級開始就在學校管弦樂團裡吹長笛。"},{"w":"guitar","p":"n.","d":"a musical instrument with strings that is played by plucking or strumming","c":"吉他","s":"He taught himself to play the guitar by watching videos online.","t":"他靠看網路上的影片自學彈吉他。"},{"w":"piano","p":"n.","d":"a large musical instrument with black and white keys","c":"鋼琴","s":"My cousin has taken piano lessons every Saturday morning for three years.","t":"我表姐三年來每個星期六早上都會去上鋼琴課。"},{"w":"trumpet","p":"n.","d":"a brass musical instrument played by blowing into a mouthpiece","c":"小喇叭","s":"The trumpet player led the marching band down the main street.","t":"那位吹小喇叭的人帶領遊行樂隊走在主要街道上。"},{"w":"violin","p":"n.","d":"a wooden musical instrument with strings, played with a bow","c":"小提琴","s":"She practices the violin for an hour every day after school.","t":"她每天放學後都會練習一個小時的小提琴。"},{"w":"string","p":"n.","d":"a thin tight wire or cord on a musical instrument","c":"弦","s":"One string on his guitar snapped right in the middle of the concert.","t":"他吉他上的一條弦在演唱會進行到一半時突然斷了。"},{"w":"play","p":"v.","d":"to perform music using an instrument","c":"演奏","s":"He learned to play the piano when he was only five years old.","t":"他在五歲時就學會了彈鋼琴。"},{"w":"hobby","p":"n.","d":"an activity done regularly for enjoyment in one's free time","c":"愛好","s":"Collecting old stamps has been his favorite hobby since he was a child.","t":"收集舊郵票是他從小就喜歡的愛好。"},{"w":"interest","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of wanting to learn more about something","c":"興趣","s":"She has always had a strong interest in painting and drawing.","t":"她一直對畫畫和繪圖有著強烈的興趣。"},{"w":"camp","p":"v.","d":"to stay outdoors in a tent for a short time","c":"露營","s":"Our whole family likes to camp near the lake every summer.","t":"我們全家每年夏天都喜歡在湖邊露營。"},{"w":"dance","p":"v.","d":"to move your body to music","c":"跳舞","s":"Everyone got up to dance as soon as the band started playing.","t":"樂隊一開始演奏，大家就站起來跳舞了。"},{"w":"draw","p":"v.","d":"to make a picture using a pencil or pen","c":"畫畫","s":"My little brother loves to draw dinosaurs in his notebook during class.","t":"我弟弟上課時喜歡在筆記本上畫恐龍。"},{"w":"hike","p":"v.","d":"to walk for a long time, often in nature","c":"健行","s":"We plan to hike up the mountain trail early this weekend.","t":"我們計畫這個週末一早就去爬山健行。"},{"w":"paint","p":"v.","d":"to create a picture using paint","c":"畫圖（用顏料）","s":"She likes to paint pictures of flowers in her backyard garden.","t":"她喜歡在自家後院的花園裡畫花的圖畫。"},{"w":"sing","p":"v.","d":"to make musical sounds with your voice","c":"唱歌","s":"The children love to sing their favorite songs during the long car ride.","t":"孩子們在長途車程中喜歡唱他們最喜歡的歌。"}]},{"unit":27,"theme":"Countries / Nationality / Government (國家/國籍/政府)","cards":[{"w":"country","p":"n.","d":"an area of land with its own government and people","c":"國家","s":"Every country has its own flag, language, and set of laws.","t":"每個國家都有自己的國旗、語言和法律。"},{"w":"nation","p":"n.","d":"a large group of people living in one area under one government","c":"國家","s":"Leaders from every nation gathered together to discuss the climate problem.","t":"來自每個國家的領導人聚在一起討論氣候問題。"},{"w":"U.S.A.","p":"n.","d":"an abbreviation for the United States of America","c":"美國","s":"Her cousin moved to the U.S.A. last year to study engineering.","t":"她的表姐去年搬到美國去學工程學。"},{"w":"America","p":"n.","d":"another common name for the United States","c":"美國","s":"Many tourists travel to America every summer to visit national parks.","t":"每年夏天，許多遊客會前往美國參觀國家公園。"},{"w":"American","p":"n.","d":"a person from the United States","c":"美國人","s":"My English teacher is American and grew up in California.","t":"我的英文老師是美國人，在加州長大。"},{"w":"China","p":"n.","d":"a large country in East Asia","c":"中國","s":"The Great Wall in China is one of the most famous landmarks in the world.","t":"中國的萬里長城是世界上最著名的地標之一。"},{"w":"R.O.C.","p":"n.","d":"an abbreviation for the Republic of China","c":"中華民國","s":"Students learn about the history of the R.O.C. in their social studies class.","t":"學生在社會課上學習中華民國的歷史。"},{"w":"Taiwan","p":"n.","d":"an island country in East Asia, also called the Republic of China","c":"臺灣","s":"My family has lived in Taiwan for three generations.","t":"我家三代都住在臺灣。"},{"w":"national","p":"adj.","d":"relating to a whole country, not just one area","c":"國家的","s":"The president gave a national speech that was broadcast on every channel.","t":"總統發表了一場在每個頻道都播出的全國演說。"},{"w":"foreigner","p":"n.","d":"a person who comes from a different country","c":"外國人","s":"The friendly foreigner asked a local shopkeeper for directions to the train station.","t":"那位友善的外國人向當地的店主問了去車站的方向。"},{"w":"foreign","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to or coming from a country other than your own","c":"外國的","s":"She enjoys trying new foreign foods whenever she travels abroad.","t":"她每次出國旅行時都喜歡嘗試新的外國美食。"},{"w":"local","p":"adj.","d":"relating to a particular area or neighborhood","c":"本地的","s":"We always buy fresh vegetables from the local farmers market on weekends.","t":"我們週末總是會去當地的農夫市集買新鮮蔬菜。"},{"w":"international","p":"adj.","d":"involving two or more countries","c":"國際的","s":"Students from many countries attend this international school in the city.","t":"許多國家的學生都就讀這所市內的國際學校。"},{"w":"overseas","p":"adj.","d":"located in or coming from a foreign country, across the sea","c":"海外的","s":"He received an overseas job offer that required moving to another continent.","t":"他收到了一份海外工作邀約，需要搬到另一個大陸去。"},{"w":"abroad","p":"adv.","d":"in or to a foreign country","c":"到國外","s":"She plans to study abroad for one semester during her final year of college.","t":"她計畫在大學最後一年出國留學一個學期。"},{"w":"elect","p":"v.","d":"to choose someone for a position by voting","c":"選舉","s":"Citizens will elect a new mayor for their city next month.","t":"市民們下個月將為他們的城市選出一位新市長。"},{"w":"vote","p":"v.","d":"to officially choose someone or something by marking a ballot","c":"投票","s":"Every adult citizen has the right to vote in the national election.","t":"每位成年公民都有權在全國選舉中投票。"},{"w":"government","p":"n.","d":"the group of people who officially run a country","c":"政府","s":"The local government announced a new plan to build more public parks.","t":"當地政府宣布了一項建造更多公共公園的新計畫。"}]},{"unit":28,"theme":"Town / Streets / Roads (城鎮/街道/道路)","cards":[{"w":"downtown","p":"n.","d":"the busy center of a city with many shops and offices","c":"市區；鬧區","s":"How do I get to downtown? Take the MRT and get off at Taipei Main Station.","t":"我要怎麼去市中心？ 搭捷運，在台北車站下車。"},{"w":"town","p":"n.","d":"a place with houses, shops, and streets, smaller than a city","c":"城鎮","s":"Where is the post office in this town? It's on Main Street, next to the bank.","t":"這個鎮上的郵局在哪裡？ 在大街上，銀行旁邊。"},{"w":"village","p":"n.","d":"a very small town in the country","c":"村落","s":"How do we get to the village? Walk along the river for ten minutes.","t":"我們要怎麼去那個村莊？ 沿著河走十分鐘。"},{"w":"block","p":"n.","d":"the area of a city between two streets","c":"街區","s":"Where is the bookstore? Go straight two blocks. It's on your right.","t":"書店在哪裡？ 直走兩個街區。它在你的右邊。"},{"w":"corner","p":"n.","d":"the place where two streets or two walls meet","c":"轉角；街角","s":"Where is the bank? Turn left at the corner. It's next to the park.","t":"銀行在哪裡？ 在轉角左轉。它在公園旁邊。"},{"w":"street","p":"n.","d":"a road in a town or city with buildings beside it","c":"街道","s":"Is it safe to walk across the street here? No. Use the crosswalk.","t":"在這裡穿越街道安全嗎？ 不安全。走斑馬線。"},{"w":"road","p":"n.","d":"a hard path that cars, buses, and bikes travel on","c":"道路","s":"Don't play on the road! OK, Mom. We'll play in the park.","t":"不要在馬路上玩！ 好的，媽媽。我們會去公園玩。"},{"w":"way","p":"n.","d":"the road or direction you take to get to a place","c":"路；方向","s":"Excuse me. Which is the way to the zoo? Go straight and turn right at the second street.","t":"不好意思，去動物園的路怎麼走？ 直走，在第二條街右轉。"},{"w":"highway","p":"n.","d":"a big, wide road for fast travel between cities","c":"公路；幹道","s":"Is the highway busy now? Yes. Don't drive there now. Take the small roads.","t":"現在公路很塞嗎？ 很塞。現在別走那裡。走小路吧。"},{"w":"sidewalk","p":"n.","d":"a path beside the street for people to walk on","c":"人行道","s":"Where should I ride my bike? Don't ride on the sidewalk. People walk there.","t":"我應該在哪裡騎腳踏車？ 不要在人行道上騎。那裡是給人走的。"},{"w":"underpass","p":"n.","d":"a path that goes under a road","c":"地下道","s":"How do I get to the other side of the road? Walk through the underpass.","t":"我要怎麼到馬路對面？ 走過地下道。"},{"w":"path","p":"n.","d":"a small road for people to walk on","c":"小徑；小路","s":"How do we get to the top of the hill? Walk along this small path.","t":"我們要怎麼到山頂？ 沿著這條小路走。"},{"w":"bridge","p":"n.","d":"something built over a river or road so people can cross it","c":"橋","s":"How do we get to the island? Drive across the bridge.","t":"我們要怎麼去那座島？ 開車過橋。"},{"w":"overpass","p":"n.","d":"a bridge that takes people or cars over a road","c":"天橋","s":"How can I cross this busy road? Please use the overpass.","t":"我要怎麼過這條繁忙的馬路？ 請走天橋。"},{"w":"tunnel","p":"n.","d":"a long hole under the ground or through a mountain for cars or trains","c":"隧道","s":"Why is it dark in the train? We're going through a long tunnel.","t":"火車裡為什麼這麼暗？ 我們正在穿過一條長隧道。"},{"w":"entrance","p":"n.","d":"the door or way you use to go into a place","c":"入口","s":"Where is the entrance of the museum? It's on the left side of the building.","t":"博物館的入口在哪裡？ 在大樓的左側。"},{"w":"exit","p":"n.","d":"the door or way you use to go out of a place","c":"出口","s":"How do I get to the night market from the MRT? Take Exit 1 and go straight. It's the nearest exit.","t":"從捷運站要怎麼去夜市？ 走一號出口然後直走。那是最近的出口。"},{"w":"ground","p":"n.","d":"the surface of the earth under your feet","c":"地面","s":"Don't sit on the ground. It's wet. OK. I'll sit on the bench.","t":"不要坐在地上。地是濕的。 好。我會坐在長椅上。"},{"w":"platform","p":"n.","d":"the place in a station where you get on and off a train","c":"月台；平台","s":"Where can I take the train to Taichung? Go to platform 2. It's on your right.","t":"我要在哪裡搭往台中的火車？ 到二號月台。在你的右邊。"},{"w":"sign","p":"n.","d":"a board with words or pictures that tells you something","c":"標誌；符號","s":"What does that sign say? It says, \"Don't park here.\"","t":"那個標誌寫什麼？ 上面寫著「這裡不能停車」。"},{"w":"sign","p":"v.","d":"to write your name on something","c":"簽名","s":"What should I do with this form? Please sign your name at the bottom.","t":"我應該怎麼處理這張表格？ 請在最下面簽上你的名字。"},{"w":"stop","p":"n.","d":"a place where a bus or train stops for people to get on or off","c":"公車站牌；站","s":"Where is the bus stop? It's across the street from the bank.","t":"公車站在哪裡？ 在銀行的對面。"},{"w":"stop","p":"v.","d":"to not move or not do something anymore","c":"停止","s":"The light is red! Stop! Don't cross the street now. You must stop here.","t":"紅燈了！ 停！現在別過馬路。你必須在這裡停下來。"},{"w":"traffic","p":"n.","d":"all the cars, buses, and trucks moving on the road","c":"交通","s":"Why are we so late? There was a lot of traffic. Don't drive at five o'clock.","t":"我們為什麼這麼晚？ 交通很塞。五點別開車。"}]},{"unit":29,"theme":"Transportation (交通工具)","cards":[{"w":"airplane","p":"n.","d":"a machine with wings that flies in the sky","c":"飛機","s":"How will you go to Japan? We'll go there by airplane.","t":"你們要怎麼去日本？ 我們要搭飛機去。"},{"w":"airlines","p":"n.","d":"a company that carries people by airplane","c":"航空公司；航線","s":"Which airlines will you fly with? EVA Air. It takes three hours to get to Tokyo.","t":"你要搭哪一家航空公司？ 長榮航空。到東京要三個小時。"},{"w":"flight","p":"n.","d":"a trip on an airplane","c":"飛機班次","s":"How long does the flight to Bangkok take? It takes about four hours.","t":"飛往曼谷的班機要多久？ 大約四個小時。"},{"w":"helicopter","p":"n.","d":"a flying machine with big blades that turn on top","c":"直昇機","s":"How did they get the sick man to the hospital? They took him there by helicopter.","t":"他們怎麼把病人送到醫院？ 他們用直升機送他去。"},{"w":"ship","p":"n.","d":"a very big boat that travels on the sea","c":"大船","s":"How long does it take to go to Penghu by ship? It takes about four hours.","t":"搭船去澎湖要多久？ 大約四個小時。"},{"w":"boat","p":"n.","d":"a small thing that carries people on water","c":"小船","s":"How do we get to Green Island? Get on the boat at Taitung.","t":"我們要怎麼去綠島？ 在台東上船。"},{"w":"train","p":"n.","d":"a line of cars that runs on rails","c":"火車","s":"How do you go to Taichung? I go there by train.","t":"你怎麼去台中？ 我搭火車去。"},{"w":"railroad","p":"n.","d":"the metal tracks that trains run on","c":"鐵路","s":"How long does it take to build a new railroad? It takes many years.","t":"蓋一條新鐵路要多久？ 要很多年。"},{"w":"railway","p":"n.","d":"the tracks and system that trains use","c":"鐵路","s":"How do you go to Hualien? I take the train. The railway goes along the coast.","t":"你怎麼去花蓮？ 我搭火車。鐵路沿著海岸走。"},{"w":"subway","p":"n.","d":"a train that runs under the ground in a city","c":"地鐵；地下道","s":"How do people go to work in New York? Many people go by subway.","t":"紐約人怎麼去上班？ 很多人搭地鐵。"},{"w":"metro","p":"n.","d":"a city train system, often under the ground","c":"地鐵","s":"How long does it take to get to the museum by metro? It takes fifteen minutes.","t":"搭地鐵到博物館要多久？ 要十五分鐘。"},{"w":"MRT","p":"n.","d":"the fast city train system in places like Taipei","c":"捷運","s":"Where should I get off the MRT? Get off at Taipei 101 Station.","t":"我應該在哪裡下捷運？ 在台北 101 站下車。"},{"w":"bus","p":"n.","d":"a big car that carries many people along a road","c":"公車","s":"Where do I get on the bus to the zoo? At the stop across the street.","t":"我要在哪裡搭往動物園的公車？ 在對街的站牌。"},{"w":"truck","p":"n.","d":"a big, strong car for carrying heavy things","c":"卡車","s":"What is the man doing? He's getting out of his truck.","t":"那個男人在做什麼？ 他正從他的卡車下來。"},{"w":"jeep","p":"n.","d":"a small, strong car that can drive on rough roads","c":"吉普車","s":"How did you go up the mountain? We went by jeep. The road was rough.","t":"你們怎麼上山的？ 我們搭吉普車上山。路很顛簸。"},{"w":"ambulance","p":"n.","d":"a special car that takes sick or hurt people to the hospital","c":"救護車","s":"How long did it take the ambulance to come? It took only five minutes.","t":"救護車花了多久才來？ 只花了五分鐘。"},{"w":"car","p":"n.","d":"a machine with four wheels that people drive","c":"汽車","s":"Can you help Grandma get out of the car? Sure. Be careful, Grandma.","t":"你可以幫奶奶下車嗎？ 當然。奶奶小心。"},{"w":"taxi","p":"n.","d":"a car with a driver that you pay to take you somewhere","c":"計程車","s":"How do I get to the airport fast? Get in a taxi. It's the fastest way.","t":"我要怎麼快速到機場？ 上一輛計程車。那是最快的方法。"},{"w":"motorcycle","p":"n.","d":"a fast machine with two wheels and an engine","c":"摩托車","s":"How does your uncle go to work? He goes to work by motorcycle.","t":"你叔叔怎麼去上班？ 他騎摩托車去上班。"},{"w":"scooter","p":"n.","d":"a small, light motorcycle","c":"機車","s":"How long does it take Mom to get to work by scooter? It takes her ten minutes.","t":"媽媽騎機車去上班要多久？ 要十分鐘。"},{"w":"bicycle","p":"n.","d":"a machine with two wheels that you ride by pushing with your feet","c":"單車；腳踏車","s":"How does Amy go to school? She rides her bicycle to school.","t":"艾咪怎麼去上學？ 她騎腳踏車上學。"},{"w":"board","p":"v.","d":"to get on a plane, ship, train, or bus","c":"上(交通工具)","s":"When can we board the plane? In ten minutes. Please get on the plane at Gate 5.","t":"我們什麼時候可以登機？ 十分鐘後。請在五號登機門上飛機。"},{"w":"board","p":"n.","d":"a flat piece of wood, or a flat thing on a wall that shows information","c":"木板；告示板","s":"Where can I see the train times? Look at the board on the wall.","t":"我在哪裡可以看到火車時刻？ 看牆上的看板。"},{"w":"drive","p":"v.","d":"to make a car or bus move and go where you want","c":"駕駛","s":"How long does it take to drive to Hsinchu? It takes about one hour.","t":"開車到新竹要多久？ 大約一個小時。"},{"w":"ride","p":"v.","d":"to sit on a bike, horse, or motorcycle and make it go","c":"騎","s":"How do you go to the park? I ride my bike there. It's faster than walking.","t":"你怎麼去公園？ 我騎腳踏車去。比走路快。"},{"w":"row","p":"v.","d":"to move a boat through water with long sticks","c":"划(船)","s":"How long did it take to row across the lake? It took us thirty minutes.","t":"划船橫越湖面花了多久？ 花了我們三十分鐘。"},{"w":"row","p":"n.","d":"a line of people or things next to each other","c":"排；列","s":"Where should we sit on the bus? Get on and sit in the back row.","t":"我們在公車上應該坐哪裡？ 上車後坐最後一排。"},{"w":"sail","p":"v.","d":"to travel on water in a boat or ship","c":"揚帆；航行","s":"How long does it take to sail to the island? It takes about two hours by boat.","t":"航行到那座島要多久？ 搭船大約兩個小時。"}]},{"unit":30,"theme":"Places / Buildings, Part 1 (地方/建築物 一)","cards":[{"w":"place","p":"n.","d":"a spot, building, or area","c":"地方","s":"Is there a good place to eat near here? Yes. There's a noodle shop next to the station.","t":"這附近有好吃東西的地方嗎？ 有。車站旁邊有一家麵店。"},{"w":"airport","p":"n.","d":"a place where airplanes take off and land","c":"機場","s":"Why is Dad going to the airport? He's going there to pick up Grandma.","t":"爸爸為什麼要去機場？ 他要去那裡接奶奶。"},{"w":"station","p":"n.","d":"a place where trains or buses stop for people","c":"車站","s":"Is there a train station near your school? Yes. It's across from the park.","t":"你們學校附近有火車站嗎？ 有。在公園對面。"},{"w":"bank","p":"n.","d":"a place where people keep and get their money","c":"銀行","s":"Where are you going? I'm going to the bank to get some money.","t":"你要去哪裡？ 我要去銀行領一些錢。"},{"w":"post office","p":"n.","d":"a place where you send letters and packages","c":"郵局","s":"Why did you go to the post office? I went there to send a letter to my pen pal.","t":"你為什麼去郵局？ 我去寄信給我的筆友。"},{"w":"department store","p":"n.","d":"a very big store that sells many kinds of things","c":"百貨公司","s":"Where is the department store? It's between the bank and the movie theater.","t":"百貨公司在哪裡？ 在銀行和電影院之間。"},{"w":"mall","p":"n.","d":"a big building with many shops inside","c":"購物中心；商場","s":"Why are you going to the mall? I'm going there to buy new shoes.","t":"你為什麼要去購物中心？ 我要去那裡買新鞋子。"},{"w":"market","p":"n.","d":"a place where people buy and sell food and other things","c":"市場；市集","s":"Why does Grandma go to the market every morning? She goes there to buy fresh vegetables.","t":"奶奶為什麼每天早上去市場？ 她去那裡買新鮮的蔬菜。"},{"w":"supermarket","p":"n.","d":"a big store that sells food and things for the home","c":"超市","s":"Is there a supermarket near your home? Yes. There's one in front of my building.","t":"你家附近有超市嗎？ 有。我住的大樓前面就有一家。"},{"w":"store","p":"n.","d":"a place where you can buy things","c":"商店","s":"Is there a shoe store near here? Yes. It's next to the bakery.","t":"這附近有鞋店嗎？ 有。在麵包店旁邊。"},{"w":"store","p":"v.","d":"to put something away and keep it to use later","c":"貯存","s":"Why are you going to the basement? I'm going there to store these old boxes. We store things down there.","t":"你為什麼要去地下室？ 我要去那裡放這些舊箱子。我們把東西存放在那裡。"},{"w":"shop","p":"n.","d":"a small place where you can buy things","c":"商店","s":"Is there a flower shop near the hospital? Yes. It's across from the hospital.","t":"醫院附近有花店嗎？ 有。在醫院對面。"},{"w":"convenience store","p":"n.","d":"a small store that is open for long hours and sells drinks, snacks, and daily things","c":"便利商店","s":"Why did you go to the convenience store? I went there to buy a drink.","t":"你為什麼去便利商店？ 我去那裡買飲料。"},{"w":"bakery","p":"n.","d":"a shop that makes and sells bread and cakes","c":"麵包店","s":"Where are you going, Mom? I'm going to the bakery to get some bread.","t":"媽，你要去哪裡？ 我要去麵包店買些麵包。"},{"w":"bookstore","p":"n.","d":"a shop that sells books","c":"書店","s":"Is there a bookstore near the MRT station? Yes. It's behind the station.","t":"捷運站附近有書店嗎？ 有。在車站後面。"},{"w":"drugstore","p":"n.","d":"a shop that sells medicine and things for your body","c":"藥妝店；藥房","s":"Why did you go to the drugstore? I went there to buy some cold medicine.","t":"你為什麼去藥妝店？ 我去那裡買感冒藥。"},{"w":"cafeteria","p":"n.","d":"a place in a school or office where you get food and carry it to a table","c":"自助餐館","s":"Is there a cafeteria in your school? Yes. It's next to the library.","t":"你們學校有自助餐廳嗎？ 有。在圖書館旁邊。"},{"w":"restaurant","p":"n.","d":"a place where you pay to sit and eat a meal","c":"餐廳","s":"Why did your family go to the restaurant? We went there to celebrate Dad's birthday.","t":"你們家為什麼去餐廳？ 我們去那裡慶祝爸爸的生日。"},{"w":"gym","p":"n.","d":"a room or building for exercise and sports","c":"體育館；健身房","s":"Why does Ben go to the gym every day? He goes there to exercise.","t":"班為什麼每天都去健身房？ 他去那裡運動。"}]},{"unit":31,"theme":"Places / Buildings, Part 2 (地方/建築物 二)","cards":[{"w":"hospital","p":"n.","d":"a place where sick or injured people receive medical care","c":"醫院","s":"The doctor checked on her patients at the hospital every morning before lunch.","t":"醫生每天早上午餐前都會去醫院探視她的病人。"},{"w":"hotel","p":"n.","d":"a building where travelers pay to sleep and eat","c":"旅館","s":"Our family booked a room at a comfortable hotel near the beach.","t":"我們全家在海邊附近訂了一間舒適的旅館房間。"},{"w":"library","p":"n.","d":"a building where books are kept for people to read or borrow","c":"圖書館","s":"I spend almost every Saturday afternoon studying quietly at the library.","t":"我幾乎每個星期六下午都在圖書館安靜地學習。"},{"w":"museum","p":"n.","d":"a building where interesting or historic objects are displayed","c":"博物館","s":"We saw ancient pottery and old paintings at the city museum.","t":"我們在市立博物館看到了古老的陶器和畫作。"},{"w":"park","p":"n.","d":"a public area with grass and trees for people to enjoy","c":"公園","s":"Children love to feed the ducks at the pond in the park.","t":"孩子們喜歡在公園的池塘邊餵鴨子。"},{"w":"square","p":"n.","d":"an open public space, often surrounded by buildings","c":"廣場","s":"Every evening, dozens of people gather in the city square to dance.","t":"每天晚上，數十人會聚集在市區廣場跳舞。"},{"w":"playground","p":"n.","d":"an outdoor area with equipment where children can play","c":"操場","s":"After lunch, the students ran outside to the playground to play basketball.","t":"午餐後，學生們跑到操場去打籃球。"},{"w":"parking lot","p":"n.","d":"an outdoor area where vehicles can be parked","c":"停車場","s":"We searched for an empty space in the crowded parking lot for ten minutes.","t":"我們在擁擠的停車場找了十分鐘才找到空位。"},{"w":"theater","p":"n.","d":"a building where movies or live performances are shown","c":"戲院","s":"My sister and I watched the new superhero film at the theater last night.","t":"我和姊姊昨晚在戲院看了新上映的超級英雄電影。"},{"w":"zoo","p":"n.","d":"a place where wild animals are kept for people to see","c":"動物園","s":"The little boy was thrilled to see real elephants at the zoo.","t":"小男孩在動物園看到真正的大象，興奮極了。"},{"w":"court","p":"n.","d":"a place where legal cases are decided by a judge","c":"法庭","s":"The lawyer presented her evidence carefully in front of the court.","t":"律師在法庭上小心地提出她的證據。"},{"w":"factory","p":"n.","d":"a building where goods are made by machines","c":"工廠","s":"My uncle has worked at the same shoe factory for over twenty years.","t":"我叔叔在同一家鞋廠工作了二十多年。"},{"w":"farm","p":"n.","d":"an area of land used for growing crops or raising animals","c":"農場","s":"Every summer, we visit my grandparents' farm to help pick fresh vegetables.","t":"每年夏天，我們都會去祖父母的農場幫忙採收新鮮蔬菜。"},{"w":"temple","p":"n.","d":"a building used for worship","c":"寺廟","s":"Tourists lit incense and bowed quietly inside the ancient temple.","t":"遊客在古老的寺廟裡點香並安靜地鞠躬。"},{"w":"company","p":"n.","d":"a business that makes or sells goods or services","c":"公司","s":"My father has worked at the same technology company since college.","t":"我爸爸從大學畢業後就一直在同一家科技公司工作。"},{"w":"apartment","p":"n.","d":"a set of rooms for living in, usually in a larger building","c":"公寓","s":"My cousin just moved into a small apartment near the train station.","t":"我表哥剛搬進火車站附近的一間小公寓。"},{"w":"castle","p":"n.","d":"a large, old building built for defense, often with thick stone walls","c":"城堡","s":"Tourists climbed the tall stone tower of the ancient castle for the view.","t":"遊客爬上那座古老城堡的高聳石塔欣賞風景。"},{"w":"beach","p":"n.","d":"an area of sand next to the sea","c":"海灘","s":"We built a tall sandcastle together on the beach all afternoon.","t":"我們整個下午都在海灘上一起堆一座高高的沙堡。"},{"w":"building","p":"n.","d":"a structure with a roof and walls, such as a house or office","c":"建築物","s":"That tall glass building downtown has over fifty floors.","t":"市區那棟高聳的玻璃建築物有超過五十層樓。"}]},{"unit":32,"theme":"Actions, Part 1 (動作 一)","cards":[{"w":"eat","p":"v.","d":"to put food in your mouth and swallow it","c":"吃","s":"We always eat dinner together as a family at seven o'clock.","t":"我們全家總是在七點一起吃晚餐。"},{"w":"accept","p":"v.","d":"to agree to take or receive something offered","c":"接受","s":"She happily decided to accept the invitation to her cousin's wedding.","t":"她很高興地決定接受去表姊婚禮的邀請。"},{"w":"refuse","p":"v.","d":"to say no to something offered or requested","c":"拒絕","s":"He chose to refuse the extra dessert because he was already full.","t":"他選擇拒絕額外的甜點，因為他已經吃飽了。"},{"w":"reject","p":"v.","d":"to refuse to accept, believe, or agree with something","c":"拒絕","s":"The committee decided to reject the plan after reviewing it carefully.","t":"委員會在仔細審核後決定拒絕這個計畫。"},{"w":"appear","p":"v.","d":"to become visible or come into sight","c":"出現","s":"A bright rainbow began to appear in the sky after the rain stopped.","t":"雨停後，天空開始出現一道明亮的彩虹。"},{"w":"disappear","p":"v.","d":"to stop being visible; to vanish","c":"消失","s":"The magician made the coin disappear right in front of our eyes.","t":"魔術師讓硬幣就在我們眼前消失了。"},{"w":"arrive","p":"v.","d":"to reach a place after a journey","c":"到達","s":"Our flight is scheduled to arrive at the airport around midnight.","t":"我們的班機預計在午夜左右抵達機場。"},{"w":"leave","p":"v.","d":"to go away from a place","c":"離開","s":"We need to leave the house early to avoid the morning traffic.","t":"我們需要早點離開家，以避免早上的交通堵塞。"},{"w":"stay","p":"v.","d":"to remain in the same place","c":"停留","s":"My grandparents always stay with us for the entire summer holiday.","t":"我祖父母總是整個暑假都跟我們住在一起。"},{"w":"borrow","p":"v.","d":"to take something with a promise to return it","c":"借（入）","s":"Could I borrow your pencil for a moment during the exam?","t":"考試時我可以借用一下你的鉛筆嗎？"},{"w":"lend","p":"v.","d":"to give something to someone for a while","c":"借（出）","s":"My brother agreed to lend me his bicycle for the weekend.","t":"我哥哥同意把他的自行車借給我用一個週末。"},{"w":"carry","p":"v.","d":"to hold and move something from one place to another","c":"運載","s":"She had to carry three heavy bags up the narrow staircase.","t":"她必須把三個沉重的袋子提上那狹窄的樓梯。"},{"w":"catch","p":"v.","d":"to take hold of something moving through the air","c":"抓住","s":"The outfielder ran quickly to catch the ball before it hit the ground.","t":"外野手快速跑去接住那顆球，免得它落地。"},{"w":"throw","p":"v.","d":"to send something through the air with your hand","c":"投擲","s":"He used all his strength to throw the ball across the field.","t":"他用盡全力把球扔過整個球場。"},{"w":"open","p":"v.","d":"to move something so it is no longer closed","c":"打開","s":"Please open the window a little so we can let in some fresh air.","t":"請把窗戶打開一點，讓新鮮空氣進來。"},{"w":"close","p":"v.","d":"to move something so it is no longer open","c":"關上","s":"Remember to close the door quietly so you don't wake the baby.","t":"記得輕輕地關門，以免吵醒寶寶。"},{"w":"go","p":"v.","d":"to move or travel from one place to another","c":"去","s":"We usually go to the night market every Friday evening together.","t":"我們通常每週五晚上一起去夜市。"},{"w":"come","p":"v.","d":"to move toward the person speaking","c":"來","s":"Please come to my birthday party this Saturday afternoon if you're free.","t":"如果你有空，請來參加我這週六下午的生日派對。"},{"w":"damage","p":"n.","d":"harm that reduces the value or quality of something","c":"損害","s":"The strong typhoon caused serious damage to several old buildings downtown.","t":"強烈的颱風對市區幾棟舊建築造成嚴重損害。"},{"w":"repair","p":"v.","d":"to fix something that is broken or damaged","c":"修理","s":"My father spent the whole weekend trying to repair the old bicycle.","t":"我爸爸花了整個週末試圖修理那台舊自行車。"},{"w":"decrease","p":"v.","d":"to become smaller in size, amount, or number","c":"減少","s":"The number of students in this small village school continues to decrease each year.","t":"這所小村莊學校的學生人數每年持續減少。"},{"w":"increase","p":"v.","d":"to become larger in size, amount, or number","c":"增加","s":"Ticket prices for the popular concert are expected to increase next month.","t":"這場熱門演唱會的票價預期下個月會增加。"},{"w":"upload","p":"v.","d":"to send data or files from a device to the internet","c":"上傳","s":"She plans to upload the vacation photos to her social media tonight.","t":"她打算今晚把假期照片上傳到她的社群媒體。"},{"w":"download","p":"v.","d":"to copy data or files from the internet to a device","c":"下載","s":"It only took a few seconds to download the new app onto my phone.","t":"把這個新應用程式下載到我手機上只花了幾秒鐘。"},{"w":"succeed","p":"v.","d":"to achieve a goal or do something successfully","c":"成功","s":"With years of hard work, she finally managed to succeed in her own business.","t":"經過多年的努力，她終於在自己的事業上成功了。"},{"w":"fail","p":"v.","d":"to not succeed in doing something","c":"失敗","s":"He was disappointed when he learned he would fail the math test.","t":"他得知自己數學考試會不及格時感到很失望。"},{"w":"remember","p":"v.","d":"to keep information in your mind or recall it","c":"記得","s":"I still remember the exact moment we first met at summer camp.","t":"我仍然記得我們在夏令營第一次見面的確切時刻。"},{"w":"forget","p":"v.","d":"to fail to remember something","c":"忘記","s":"Please don't forget to bring your umbrella since it might rain later.","t":"請別忘了帶傘，因為晚點可能會下雨。"},{"w":"gain","p":"v.","d":"to get or obtain something, often gradually","c":"獲得","s":"Through daily practice, she began to gain more confidence on stage.","t":"透過每天練習，她開始在台上獲得更多自信。"},{"w":"lose","p":"v.","d":"to no longer have something; to fail to win","c":"失去","s":"If our team plays carelessly tonight, we might lose the championship game.","t":"如果我們隊今晚打得不夠謹慎，可能會輸掉冠軍賽。"},{"w":"pull","p":"v.","d":"to use force to move something toward you","c":"拉回","s":"The children worked together to pull the heavy wagon up the hill.","t":"孩子們一起合作把那輛沉重的小推車拉上山。"},{"w":"push","p":"v.","d":"to use force to move something away from you","c":"推","s":"We had to push the stalled car off the busy road together.","t":"我們必須一起把那輛拋錨的車推離繁忙的道路。"},{"w":"send","p":"v.","d":"to cause something to go or be delivered somewhere","c":"發送","s":"I forgot to send the email before leaving the office yesterday.","t":"我昨天離開辦公室前忘了發送那封電子郵件。"},{"w":"receive","p":"v.","d":"to get or be given something","c":"收到","s":"She was thrilled to receive a handwritten letter from her old friend.","t":"她很興奮收到老朋友寄來的一封親筆信。"},{"w":"turn","p":"v.","d":"to move around a central point; to change direction","c":"轉動","s":"Please turn left at the next traffic light to reach the museum.","t":"請在下一個紅綠燈左轉以抵達博物館。"},{"w":"shut","p":"v.","d":"to close something firmly","c":"關閉","s":"The shopkeeper began to shut the store right at nine o'clock every night.","t":"店主每晚九點整就開始關店。"}]},{"unit":33,"theme":"Actions, Part 2 (動作 二)","cards":[{"w":"sit","p":"v.","d":"to rest your body with your weight on your bottom","c":"坐","s":"Please sit quietly until the teacher finishes explaining the lesson.","t":"請安靜地坐著，直到老師講解完這個課程。"},{"w":"stand","p":"v.","d":"to be on your feet in an upright position","c":"站","s":"Everyone had to stand for almost an hour during the crowded concert.","t":"在那場擁擠的演唱會上，每個人都必須站將近一個小時。"},{"w":"sleep","p":"v.","d":"to rest with your eyes closed and your mind unaware","c":"睡","s":"Most teenagers need at least eight hours of sleep every night.","t":"大多數青少年每晚至少需要八小時的睡眠。"},{"w":"wake","p":"v.","d":"to stop sleeping and become alert","c":"醒來","s":"I usually wake up before sunrise to go jogging with my dad.","t":"我通常在日出前就醒來，跟我爸爸一起去跑步。"},{"w":"act","p":"v.","d":"to perform a role in a play, movie, or show","c":"主演","s":"She was chosen to act the leading role in the school play.","t":"她被選為在學校戲劇中主演主角。"},{"w":"add","p":"v.","d":"to put something together with something else","c":"添加","s":"My mother always likes to add a little extra sugar to her tea.","t":"我媽媽總是喜歡在茶裡多加一點糖。"},{"w":"advise","p":"v.","d":"to give someone helpful suggestions about what to do","c":"建議","s":"The doctor decided to advise him to rest at home for a few days.","t":"醫生決定建議他在家休息幾天。"},{"w":"affect","p":"v.","d":"to have an influence on something or someone","c":"影響","s":"Too much noise at night can seriously affect how well you sleep.","t":"晚上太多噪音會嚴重影響你的睡眠品質。"},{"w":"agree","p":"v.","d":"to have the same opinion as someone else","c":"同意","s":"After a long discussion, both sides finally began to agree on a fair price.","t":"經過長時間討論後，雙方終於就一個公平的價格達成同意。"},{"w":"aim","p":"v.","d":"to point something carefully at a target","c":"瞄準","s":"He took a deep breath and tried to aim the arrow at the center.","t":"他深吸一口氣，試著把箭瞄準靶心。"},{"w":"allow","p":"v.","d":"to let someone do something or let something happen","c":"允許","s":"My parents finally decided to allow me to join the weekend hiking club.","t":"我父母終於決定允許我加入週末健行社。"},{"w":"apologize","p":"v.","d":"to say you are sorry for something you did","c":"道歉","s":"He called his friend right away to apologize for arriving so late.","t":"他立刻打電話給朋友，為了遲到道歉。"},{"w":"argue","p":"v.","d":"to talk angrily with someone because you disagree","c":"爭論","s":"The two brothers began to argue loudly over who would use the computer first.","t":"兩兄弟開始大聲爭論誰先用電腦。"},{"w":"arrange","p":"v.","d":"to plan or organize something carefully","c":"安排","s":"Our teacher helped us arrange the desks into small groups for the activity.","t":"我們的老師幫忙我們把桌子安排成小組，以便進行活動。"},{"w":"ask","p":"v.","d":"to put a question to someone","c":"問","s":"Feel free to ask the librarian if you can't find the book you need.","t":"如果你找不到需要的書，可以隨時問圖書館員。"},{"w":"attack","p":"v.","d":"to use violence or force against someone or something","c":"進攻","s":"The small village was once forced to attack by bandits long ago.","t":"這座小村莊很久以前曾被迫遭到強盜進攻。"},{"w":"avoid","p":"v.","d":"to stay away from something or someone","c":"避免","s":"We left the house very early to avoid the worst of the rush hour traffic.","t":"我們很早就出門，以避免最糟糕的尖峰時段交通。"},{"w":"bark","p":"v.","d":"to make the loud sound a dog makes","c":"吠","s":"Our neighbor's dog began to bark loudly the moment the mail carrier arrived.","t":"郵差一到，我們鄰居的狗就開始大聲吠叫。"},{"w":"base","p":"v.","d":"to use something as the foundation for a decision or idea","c":"以…為基礎、根據","s":"The director decided to base the new film on a popular novel.","t":"導演決定根據一本暢銷小說來拍攝這部新電影。"},{"w":"become","p":"v.","d":"to start to be something different","c":"成為","s":"After years of training, she finally managed to become a professional dancer.","t":"經過多年訓練，她終於成為了一名專業舞者。"},{"w":"behave","p":"v.","d":"to act in a particular way","c":"表現","s":"The children promised to behave themselves nicely during the long museum visit.","t":"孩子們承諾在這場漫長的博物館參觀中表現良好。"},{"w":"belong","p":"v.","d":"to be the property of someone or part of a group","c":"屬於","s":"This old leather suitcase used to belong to my great-grandfather.","t":"這個舊皮箱以前屬於我的曾祖父。"},{"w":"bite","p":"v.","d":"to use your teeth to cut or hold something","c":"咬","s":"Be careful, because that small dog might bite if you reach for its bone.","t":"小心，因為那隻小狗如果你伸手去拿牠的骨頭可能會咬你。"},{"w":"blame","p":"v.","d":"to say that someone is responsible for something bad","c":"責備","s":"The coach refused to blame any single player for the team's narrow loss.","t":"教練拒絕為球隊的小幅失利而責怪任何一位球員。"},{"w":"blow","p":"v.","d":"to push air out through your mouth","c":"吹","s":"She took a deep breath and tried to blow out all the birthday candles.","t":"她深吸一口氣，試著吹熄所有的生日蠟燭。"},{"w":"bother","p":"v.","d":"to disturb or annoy someone","c":"打擾","s":"Please don't bother your sister while she is busy studying for her exam.","t":"請不要在你姊姊忙著準備考試時打擾她。"},{"w":"bow","p":"v.","d":"to bend your body forward as a sign of respect","c":"鞠躬","s":"All the performers paused to bow politely after the curtain finally fell.","t":"所有表演者在幕布終於落下後，都停下來禮貌地鞠躬。"},{"w":"break","p":"v.","d":"to cause something to separate into pieces or stop working","c":"弄壞","s":"He was worried he might break the fragile vase while moving it across the room.","t":"他擔心搬動那個易碎花瓶穿過房間時可能會把它弄壞。"},{"w":"bring","p":"v.","d":"to carry something with you to a place","c":"帶來","s":"Don't forget to bring your swimsuit when we visit the beach this weekend.","t":"這個週末我們去海邊時，別忘了帶上你的泳衣。"},{"w":"build","p":"v.","d":"to make something by putting materials and parts together","c":"蓋(房子)","s":"The workers plan to build a new playground behind the elementary school.","t":"工人們計畫在小學後面蓋一座新的操場。"},{"w":"burn","p":"v.","d":"to be destroyed or damaged by fire","c":"燃燒","s":"We watched the dry autumn leaves slowly burn in the small backyard fire pit.","t":"我們看著乾燥的秋葉在後院小火坑裡慢慢燃燒。"},{"w":"burst","p":"v.","d":"to break open suddenly, often with force","c":"爆裂","s":"The colorful balloon began to burst the moment it touched the sharp branch.","t":"那個彩色氣球一碰到尖銳的樹枝就爆裂了。"},{"w":"calm","p":"v.","d":"to make someone or something quiet and relaxed","c":"使平靜","s":"The nurse spoke softly to calm the frightened little boy before his injection.","t":"護士輕聲說話，安撫那個害怕的小男孩，讓他在打針前平靜下來。"},{"w":"cancel","p":"v.","d":"to decide that a planned event will not happen","c":"取消","s":"The organizers had to cancel the outdoor concert because of the sudden storm.","t":"由於突如其來的暴風雨，主辦單位必須取消這場戶外演唱會。"},{"w":"change","p":"v.","d":"to make or become different","c":"改變","s":"Living abroad for a year really helped change the way she sees the world.","t":"在國外生活一年確實幫助改變了她看世界的方式。"},{"w":"chase","p":"v.","d":"to run after someone or something to catch them","c":"追逐","s":"Our excited puppy loves to chase the neighbor's cat around the backyard.","t":"我們興奮的小狗喜歡在後院追逐鄰居的貓。"}]},{"unit":34,"theme":"Actions, Part 3 (動作 三)","cards":[{"w":"cheat","p":"v.","d":"to act dishonestly in order to gain an advantage","c":"詐欺","s":"The teacher caught two students trying to cheat during the final exam.","t":"老師抓到兩名學生在期末考試中作弊。"},{"w":"check","p":"v.","d":"to examine something to make sure it is correct or safe","c":"檢查","s":"My father always likes to check the tires before a long road trip.","t":"我爸爸在長途旅行前總喜歡檢查輪胎。"},{"w":"climb","p":"v.","d":"to move upward, often using your hands and feet","c":"攀登","s":"It took the hikers nearly six hours to climb to the top of the hill.","t":"登山客花了將近六小時才攀登到山頂。"},{"w":"comment","p":"n.","d":"a remark expressing an opinion or reaction","c":"評論","s":"She left a kind comment under her friend's painting on social media.","t":"她在朋友的畫作下方的社群媒體留下了一則友善的評論。"},{"w":"compare","p":"v.","d":"to examine two or more things to see how they are similar or different","c":"比較","s":"The students were asked to compare the two short stories for homework.","t":"學生被要求比較這兩篇短篇故事作為作業。"},{"w":"complain","p":"v.","d":"to say that you are unhappy or dissatisfied about something","c":"抱怨","s":"Several customers began to complain loudly about the slow service at the restaurant.","t":"幾位顧客開始大聲抱怨餐廳的服務太慢。"},{"w":"complete","p":"v.","d":"to finish doing or making something","c":"完成","s":"She worked late into the night to complete her science project on time.","t":"她工作到深夜才把科學作業如期完成。"},{"w":"continue","p":"v.","d":"to keep doing something without stopping","c":"繼續","s":"Despite the heavy rain, the players decided to continue the soccer match.","t":"儘管下著大雨，球員們還是決定繼續進行足球比賽。"},{"w":"control","p":"v.","d":"to have power over something and direct how it works","c":"控制","s":"It took the new pilot several lessons to learn how to control the small plane.","t":"這位新飛行員花了好幾堂課才學會如何控制這架小飛機。"},{"w":"cover","p":"v.","d":"to put something over or on top of another thing","c":"覆蓋","s":"She used a soft blanket to cover her little brother while he slept.","t":"她用一條柔軟的毯子蓋住正在睡覺的弟弟。"},{"w":"create","p":"v.","d":"to make something new that did not exist before","c":"創造","s":"The young artist wanted to create a colorful mural for the school hallway.","t":"這位年輕藝術家想要為學校走廊創造一幅色彩繽紛的壁畫。"},{"w":"cross","p":"v.","d":"to go from one side of something to the other","c":"過(河、街)","s":"Always look both ways carefully before you cross the busy street.","t":"在過繁忙的街道前，務必仔細看清楚兩邊。"},{"w":"pass","p":"v.","d":"to go past or through something","c":"通過","s":"We watched the parade pass slowly in front of our favorite bakery.","t":"我們看著遊行隊伍慢慢地經過我們最喜歡的麵包店前。"},{"w":"cry","p":"v.","d":"to produce tears, usually because of sadness or pain","c":"哭泣","s":"The little girl began to cry after she dropped her favorite ice cream.","t":"小女孩在掉了她最喜歡的冰淇淋後開始哭泣。"},{"w":"cut","p":"v.","d":"to use a sharp tool to divide something into pieces","c":"切割","s":"Could you please cut the birthday cake into eight equal slices?","t":"你可以幫忙把生日蛋糕切成八等份嗎？"},{"w":"deal","p":"v.","d":"to handle or take care of a problem or situation","c":"處理","s":"The manager had to deal with several angry customers all afternoon.","t":"經理整個下午都得處理好幾位生氣的顧客。"},{"w":"debate","p":"v.","d":"to discuss a topic by giving different opinions","c":"辯論","s":"The two teams will debate about climate change in front of the whole school.","t":"這兩個隊伍將在全校面前就氣候變遷進行辯論。"},{"w":"decide","p":"v.","d":"to choose something after thinking carefully","c":"決定","s":"After visiting three different shops, she finally managed to decide on a birthday gift.","t":"在逛了三家不同的店之後，她終於決定好了一份生日禮物。"},{"w":"define","p":"v.","d":"to explain the exact meaning of a word or idea","c":"定義","s":"The teacher asked the class to define the word \"democracy\" in their own words.","t":"老師要求全班用自己的話來定義「民主」這個詞。"},{"w":"deliver","p":"v.","d":"to take something to a place or person","c":"遞送","s":"The driver promised to deliver the package before noon on Friday.","t":"送貨員承諾在星期五正午前把包裹遞送過來。"},{"w":"depend","p":"v.","d":"to rely on someone or something for help or support","c":"依賴","s":"Whether the picnic happens this weekend will depend entirely on the weather.","t":"這個週末野餐是否舉行完全取決於天氣。"},{"w":"detect","p":"v.","d":"to notice or discover something that is not obvious","c":"察覺","s":"A trained dog can easily detect the smell of certain foods hidden in luggage.","t":"訓練有素的狗能輕易察覺隱藏在行李裡的特定食物氣味。"},{"w":"develop","p":"v.","d":"to grow or change into something more advanced","c":"發展","s":"The small startup hopes to develop a useful new app for students.","t":"這家小型新創公司希望為學生開發一款實用的新應用程式。"},{"w":"die","p":"v.","d":"to stop living","c":"死","s":"Without enough water and sunlight, the small plant will eventually die.","t":"如果沒有足夠的水分和陽光，這株小植物最終會死掉。"},{"w":"dig","p":"v.","d":"to make a hole in the ground using a tool or your hands","c":"掘(土)","s":"The children used small plastic shovels to dig a hole in the sand.","t":"孩子們用小塑膠鏟在沙地上挖了一個洞。"},{"w":"direct","p":"v.","d":"to control or guide something, such as a movie or traffic","c":"指揮","s":"She has always dreamed of getting the chance to direct her own short film.","t":"她一直夢想著有機會能執導自己的短片。"},{"w":"discover","p":"v.","d":"to find or learn something for the first time","c":"發現","s":"Scientists were thrilled to discover a new species of frog deep in the rainforest.","t":"科學家們很興奮在雨林深處發現了一種新的青蛙物種。"},{"w":"discuss","p":"v.","d":"to talk about something with another person or group","c":"討論","s":"The committee gathered after school to discuss plans for the spring festival.","t":"委員會在放學後聚集討論春季園遊會的計畫。"},{"w":"doubt","p":"v.","d":"to feel unsure or not believe something","c":"懷疑","s":"Even with all the evidence presented, the jury continued to doubt his story.","t":"即使提出了所有證據，陪審團仍然懷疑他的說法。"},{"w":"dream","p":"v.","d":"to have thoughts and images in your mind while sleeping","c":"作夢","s":"Last night I had a strange dream about flying over my hometown.","t":"昨晚我夢到自己飛越家鄉的奇怪夢境。"},{"w":"dry","p":"v.","d":"to remove water or moisture from something","c":"曬乾","s":"We hung the wet towels outside on the line to dry in the sun.","t":"我們把濕毛巾掛在外面的繩子上曬乾。"},{"w":"earn","p":"v.","d":"to receive money or rewards for work you have done","c":"賺到","s":"She works two part-time jobs each summer to earn extra money for college.","t":"她每年夏天打兩份兼職工作，賺取額外的大學學費。"},{"w":"ease","p":"v.","d":"to make a feeling or problem less severe or painful","c":"使放鬆(舒緩)","s":"A warm cup of tea can sometimes ease a sore throat before bed.","t":"睡前喝一杯熱茶有時能舒緩喉嚨痛。"},{"w":"embarrass","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel ashamed or uncomfortable in front of others","c":"使困窘","s":"Tripping over his own shoelaces in front of the whole class began to embarrass him.","t":"在全班面前被自己的鞋帶絆倒讓他開始感到困窘。"},{"w":"emphasize","p":"v.","d":"to give special importance to something","c":"強調","s":"The coach likes to emphasize teamwork over individual scoring during practice.","t":"教練在訓練時喜歡強調團隊合作而非個人得分。"},{"w":"enjoy","p":"v.","d":"to take pleasure in something","c":"喜愛","s":"Most of the students seemed to enjoy the field trip to the science museum.","t":"大多數學生似乎都很喜愛這次去科學博物館的校外教學。"}]},{"unit":35,"theme":"Actions, Part 4 (動作 四)","cards":[{"w":"enter","p":"v.","d":"to come or go into a place","c":"進入","s":"Please remember to enter the building through the main front door.","t":"請記得從主要的前門進入這棟建築物。"},{"w":"equal","p":"v.","d":"to be exactly the same in amount or value","c":"等於","s":"Two plus two will always equal four no matter how you count it.","t":"無論怎麼算，二加二永遠等於四。"},{"w":"excite","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel very happy or eager","c":"使興奮","s":"The thought of the upcoming trip began to excite the whole family.","t":"想到即將到來的旅行讓全家人都感到興奮。"},{"w":"exist","p":"v.","d":"to be real or actually happen","c":"存在","s":"Many people doubt that such a friendly giant creature could really exist.","t":"許多人懷疑這麼友善的巨大生物是否真的存在。"},{"w":"fall","p":"v.","d":"to drop down from a higher place","c":"落下","s":"Bright orange leaves began to fall from the trees every October morning.","t":"每年十月的早晨，橙色的葉子開始從樹上落下。"},{"w":"feed","p":"v.","d":"to give food to a person or animal","c":"餵食","s":"My little sister loves to feed the ducks at the park on Sundays.","t":"我妹妹很喜歡星期天在公園餵鴨子。"},{"w":"fight","p":"v.","d":"to use physical force against someone in a struggle","c":"打架","s":"The two boys started to fight over who would get the last seat.","t":"兩個男孩為了搶最後一個座位而開始打架。"},{"w":"fill","p":"v.","d":"to make something full by putting things into it","c":"充滿","s":"She asked her son to fill the watering can before tending the garden.","t":"她要兒子在照顧花園前先把灑水壺裝滿水。"},{"w":"finish","p":"v.","d":"to come to the end of doing something","c":"結束","s":"We need to finish our homework before dinner is ready tonight.","t":"我們需要在今晚晚餐準備好之前完成作業。"},{"w":"fix","p":"v.","d":"to repair something that is broken","c":"固定","s":"My uncle promised to fix the leaking faucet sometime this weekend.","t":"我叔叔答應這個週末會修理那個漏水的水龍頭。"},{"w":"fly","p":"v.","d":"to move through the air, especially with wings","c":"飛","s":"Hundreds of geese fly south together every year before winter arrives.","t":"每年冬天來臨前，數百隻雁會一起向南飛。"},{"w":"focus","p":"v.","d":"to give all your attention to one thing","c":"專注","s":"It's hard to focus on homework when the television is so loud nearby.","t":"當電視聲音這麼大時，很難專注在作業上。"},{"w":"follow","p":"v.","d":"to obey or act according to a rule or instruction","c":"遵守","s":"All visitors to the museum must follow the posted safety rules.","t":"所有參觀博物館的訪客都必須遵守公告的安全規則。"},{"w":"frighten","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel afraid","c":"使害怕","s":"A sudden loud thunderclap began to frighten the sleeping puppy outside.","t":"突然一聲響亮的雷聲讓外面睡覺的小狗感到害怕。"},{"w":"get","p":"v.","d":"to receive or obtain something","c":"得到","s":"She was thrilled to get a new bicycle for her birthday this year.","t":"她很高興今年生日得到了一台新的自行車。"},{"w":"give","p":"v.","d":"to hand something to someone or provide it to them","c":"送給","s":"Every winter, our class likes to give warm blankets to the local shelter.","t":"每年冬天，我們班都喜歡送溫暖的毛毯給當地的收容所。"},{"w":"greet","p":"v.","d":"to say hello or welcome someone","c":"問候","s":"The shopkeeper always stops to greet every customer with a warm smile.","t":"店主總是會停下來用溫暖的笑容問候每位顧客。"},{"w":"guide","p":"v.","d":"to show someone the way or help direct them","c":"引導","s":"A friendly local offered to guide the lost tourists back to their hotel.","t":"一位友善的當地人主動引導迷路的遊客回到他們的旅館。"},{"w":"hammer","p":"v.","d":"to hit something repeatedly with a heavy tool","c":"敲打","s":"The carpenter began to hammer the nails carefully into the wooden frame.","t":"木匠開始小心地把釘子敲進木製框架裡。"},{"w":"handle","p":"v.","d":"to deal with or manage a situation or task","c":"處理","s":"The new manager seemed calm and ready to handle any sudden problem.","t":"這位新經理看起來很冷靜，準備好處理任何突發問題。"},{"w":"hang","p":"v.","d":"to attach something so it stays above the ground","c":"把…掛起","s":"We decided to hang the new painting right above the living room sofa.","t":"我們決定把新畫掛在客廳沙發上方。"},{"w":"happen","p":"v.","d":"to take place; to occur","c":"發生","s":"Nobody really knows what will happen at tomorrow's surprise school assembly.","t":"沒有人真正知道明天的驚喜全校集會會發生什麼事。"},{"w":"have","p":"v.","d":"to own, possess, or hold something","c":"有","s":"Most students in this class have at least one pet at home.","t":"這個班上大多數學生家裡都有至少一隻寵物。"},{"w":"help","p":"v.","d":"to make it easier for someone to do something","c":"幫助","s":"My older brother always offers to help me with my math homework.","t":"我哥哥總是主動幫我做數學作業。"},{"w":"hide","p":"v.","d":"to put something where it cannot be seen","c":"把…藏起來","s":"The children loved to hide behind the curtains during the noisy game.","t":"孩子們在這個吵鬧的遊戲中喜歡躲在窗簾後面。"},{"w":"hold","p":"v.","d":"to organize and carry out an event","c":"舉行","s":"Our school plans to hold the annual sports day next Friday afternoon.","t":"我們學校計畫下星期五下午舉行年度運動會。"},{"w":"hug","p":"v.","d":"to put your arms around someone closely","c":"擁抱","s":"She ran across the airport to hug her grandmother tightly after the long flight.","t":"她跑過機場，緊緊擁抱她那長途飛行後抵達的祖母。"},{"w":"hunt","p":"v.","d":"to chase and try to catch an animal for food","c":"狩獵","s":"Wild foxes often hunt small rabbits near the edge of the forest.","t":"野生狐狸經常在森林邊緣狩獵小兔子。"},{"w":"hurry","p":"v.","d":"to move or act quickly","c":"急忙","s":"We had to hurry to the station to catch the last train home.","t":"我們必須急忙趕到車站才能搭上最後一班回家的火車。"},{"w":"ignore","p":"v.","d":"to deliberately not pay attention to something","c":"忽視","s":"It's never a good idea to ignore a strange noise coming from your car.","t":"忽視車子發出的奇怪聲音絕對不是個好主意。"},{"w":"imagine","p":"v.","d":"to form a picture or idea in your mind","c":"想像","s":"Close your eyes and try to imagine a quiet beach at sunset.","t":"閉上眼睛，試著想像一個日落時寧靜的海灘。"},{"w":"improve","p":"v.","d":"to make something better than before","c":"改善","s":"Daily practice has really helped improve her confidence speaking in front of the class.","t":"每天練習確實幫助改善了她在全班面前說話的自信。"},{"w":"include","p":"v.","d":"to have something as a part of a whole","c":"包含","s":"Our weekend trip package will include two nights at a cozy mountain cabin.","t":"我們的週末旅遊套餐將包含兩晚舒適的山中小屋住宿。"},{"w":"indicate","p":"v.","d":"to point out or show information about something","c":"指出","s":"The flashing red light began to indicate a serious problem with the engine.","t":"閃爍的紅燈開始指出引擎有嚴重問題。"},{"w":"show","p":"v.","d":"to let someone see something","c":"顯示","s":"Could you please show me how to fold this paper crane correctly?","t":"你可以教我（顯示給我看）如何正確地折這隻紙鶴嗎？"},{"w":"insist","p":"v.","d":"to demand something firmly and refuse to change your mind","c":"堅持","s":"Despite her tiredness, she continued to insist on finishing the race herself.","t":"儘管她很疲憊，她仍堅持要自己完成這場比賽。"}]},{"unit":36,"theme":"Actions, Part 5 (動作 五)","cards":[{"w":"inspire","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel excited and want to do something","c":"激勵","s":"Her amazing story continued to inspire students for many years afterward.","t":"她驚人的故事多年來持續激勵著學生。"},{"w":"introduce","p":"v.","d":"to tell someone the name of another person when they meet","c":"介紹","s":"Let me introduce you to my new neighbor from across the street.","t":"讓我把你介紹給我住在對街的新鄰居認識。"},{"w":"invent","p":"v.","d":"to create something new that did not exist before","c":"發明","s":"Scientists are always trying to invent cleaner ways to produce electricity.","t":"科學家總是試圖發明更乾淨的發電方式。"},{"w":"invite","p":"v.","d":"to ask someone to come to an event or place","c":"邀請","s":"We decided to invite all our cousins to the summer barbecue.","t":"我們決定邀請所有的表親來參加夏季烤肉聚會。"},{"w":"join","p":"v.","d":"to become a member of a group or activity","c":"加入","s":"She finally worked up the courage to join the school debate team.","t":"她終於有勇氣加入學校的辯論隊。"},{"w":"kick","p":"v.","d":"to hit something with your foot","c":"踢","s":"He used all his strength to kick the ball into the goal.","t":"他用盡全力把球踢進球門。"},{"w":"keep","p":"v.","d":"to continue having or doing something","c":"保持","s":"Please keep your voice down while your baby sister is napping.","t":"你妹妹在睡覺時，請保持音量小聲一點。"},{"w":"kill","p":"v.","d":"to cause a person, animal, or plant to die","c":"殺害","s":"A sudden frost overnight can quickly kill young plants in the garden.","t":"一夜突來的霜凍可能很快就會殺死花園裡的幼苗。"},{"w":"lack","p":"n.","d":"the state of not having enough of something","c":"缺乏","s":"The team's loss was mostly due to a lack of practice this season.","t":"這支球隊的失敗主要是因為這個賽季缺乏練習。"},{"w":"lay","p":"v.","d":"to put something down carefully in a particular place","c":"放置","s":"She gently began to lay the sleeping baby down in the crib.","t":"她輕輕地把熟睡的寶寶放進嬰兒床裡。"},{"w":"lead","p":"v.","d":"to guide or direct a group of people","c":"領導","s":"The captain agreed to lead the team through the final difficult match.","t":"隊長同意在這場艱難的最後比賽中領導球隊。"},{"w":"let","p":"v.","d":"to allow something to happen or someone to do something","c":"讓","s":"My parents finally decided to let me stay up late on Friday.","t":"我父母終於決定讓我星期五晚上可以晚點睡。"},{"w":"lick","p":"v.","d":"to move your tongue across something","c":"舔","s":"The happy puppy began to lick the little boy's face affectionately.","t":"這隻開心的小狗開始親切地舔小男孩的臉。"},{"w":"lie","p":"v.","d":"to say something that is not true","c":"說謊","s":"He knew it was wrong to lie about breaking the window.","t":"他知道為打破窗戶這件事說謊是不對的。"},{"w":"lift","p":"v.","d":"to raise something to a higher position","c":"舉起","s":"It took two strong workers to lift the heavy wooden table.","t":"需要兩位強壯的工人才能舉起這張沉重的木桌。"},{"w":"limit","p":"v.","d":"to control or restrict the amount of something","c":"限制","s":"The doctor advised him to limit his screen time before bed.","t":"醫生建議他在睡前限制使用螢幕的時間。"},{"w":"lock","p":"v.","d":"to fasten something with a lock so it cannot open","c":"鎖住","s":"Remember to lock the front door before leaving for school today.","t":"今天出門上學前，記得鎖上前門。"},{"w":"make","p":"v.","d":"to create or produce something","c":"製做","s":"Every Sunday, my grandmother likes to make fresh dumplings for the family.","t":"每個星期天，我奶奶喜歡幫全家人做新鮮的水餃。"},{"w":"marry","p":"v.","d":"to become someone's husband or wife in a ceremony","c":"結婚","s":"They plan to marry next spring in a small garden ceremony.","t":"他們計畫明年春天在一個小花園裡舉行婚禮結婚。"},{"w":"master","p":"v.","d":"to become completely skilled at something","c":"精通","s":"It took years of daily practice to master the violin so well.","t":"花了好幾年每天練習才如此精通小提琴。"},{"w":"match","p":"v.","d":"to be similar to or go well with something else","c":"相配","s":"She chose a bright scarf that would match her new winter coat.","t":"她選了一條鮮豔的圍巾，要跟她的新冬季外套相配。"},{"w":"mean","p":"v.","d":"to have a particular meaning","c":"表示…的意思","s":"A red traffic light always mean that drivers must come to a stop.","t":"紅燈總是表示駕駛必須停下來。"},{"w":"meet","p":"v.","d":"to come together with someone, often for the first time","c":"遇見","s":"We are planning to meet our pen pals from Japan this summer.","t":"我們計畫今年夏天見到從日本來的筆友。"},{"w":"mind","p":"v.","d":"to be bothered or annoyed by something","c":"留意","s":"Would you mind turning down the music a little bit, please?","t":"你介意把音樂的音量調小一點嗎？"},{"w":"miss","p":"v.","d":"to fail to catch, see, or reach something","c":"錯過","s":"If we don't leave now, we might miss the early morning bus.","t":"如果我們現在不出發，可能會錯過早上的公車。"},{"w":"mix","p":"v.","d":"to combine different things together","c":"混合","s":"Could you please mix the flour and sugar before adding the eggs?","t":"你可以在加入蛋之前先把麵粉和糖混合嗎？"},{"w":"move","p":"v.","d":"to change position or location","c":"行動","s":"The sleepy cat refused to move from its warm spot by the window.","t":"這隻愛睏的貓不肯離開牠在窗邊的溫暖位置。"},{"w":"need","p":"v.","d":"to require something because it is necessary","c":"需要","s":"Plants need sunlight and water in order to grow properly.","t":"植物需要陽光和水才能正常生長。"},{"w":"nod","p":"v.","d":"to move your head up and down to show agreement","c":"點頭","s":"She simply began to nod her head in agreement with the plan.","t":"她只是點頭表示同意這個計畫。"},{"w":"notice","p":"v.","d":"to see or become aware of something","c":"注意到","s":"Did you notice the new poster hanging outside the classroom door?","t":"你注意到掛在教室門外的新海報了嗎？"},{"w":"obey","p":"v.","d":"to do what someone tells you or follow a rule","c":"服從","s":"Well-trained dogs usually obey simple commands like sit and stay.","t":"訓練良好的狗通常會服從像坐下和待命這樣的簡單指令。"},{"w":"object","p":"v.","d":"to express disagreement or opposition to something","c":"反對","s":"Several parents began to object to the new homework policy at school.","t":"好幾位家長開始反對學校新的作業政策。"},{"w":"omit","p":"v.","d":"to leave something out or not include it","c":"省略","s":"Please don't omit any important details from your science report.","t":"請不要在你的科學報告中省略任何重要細節。"},{"w":"own","p":"v.","d":"to have something that belongs to you","c":"擁有","s":"My cousin is lucky enough to own a small farm in the countryside.","t":"我表哥很幸運，在鄉間擁有一座小農場。"},{"w":"pack","p":"v.","d":"to put things into a bag or container for traveling","c":"打包","s":"She started to pack her suitcase the night before the big trip.","t":"她在這趟大旅行前一晚就開始打包行李箱。"},{"w":"pause","p":"v.","d":"to stop for a short time before continuing","c":"暫停","s":"He decided to pause the movie so he could answer the phone.","t":"他決定暫停電影，去接這通電話。"}]},{"unit":37,"theme":"Actions, Part 6 (動作 六)","cards":[{"w":"please","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel happy or satisfied","c":"取悅","s":"She baked cookies just to please her tired classmates after the test.","t":"她烤餅乾只是為了取悅考完試後疲累的同學。"},{"w":"pollute","p":"v.","d":"to make air, water, or soil dirty and harmful","c":"污染","s":"Factories that pollute the river were finally forced to close down.","t":"污染河流的工廠最終被迫關閉。"},{"w":"practice","p":"v.","d":"to do something repeatedly to improve a skill","c":"練習","s":"He likes to practice the piano for thirty minutes every evening.","t":"他喜歡每天晚上練習彈三十分鐘的鋼琴。"},{"w":"praise","p":"v.","d":"to say good things about someone's work or behavior","c":"讚美","s":"The coach stopped to praise the team after their hard-fought win.","t":"教練停下來讚美球隊辛苦贏得的勝利。"},{"w":"pray","p":"v.","d":"to speak to God or a god, often asking for help","c":"祈禱","s":"Many villagers gather at the temple to pray before the harvest.","t":"許多村民在收成前聚集到寺廟祈禱。"},{"w":"prepare","p":"v.","d":"to get something ready for use or for an event","c":"準備","s":"We stayed up late to prepare snacks for tomorrow's class party.","t":"我們熬夜準備明天班級派對的零食。"},{"w":"print","p":"v.","d":"to put words or pictures onto paper using a machine","c":"印刷","s":"Could you print two copies of this worksheet for me, please?","t":"你可以幫我印兩份這張練習卷嗎？"},{"w":"produce","p":"v.","d":"to make or create something, often in large amounts","c":"製造","s":"This small farm can produce enough eggs for the whole village.","t":"這座小農場能夠製造足夠全村食用的雞蛋。"},{"w":"promise","p":"v.","d":"to tell someone you will definitely do something","c":"承諾","s":"He had to promise his mother he would call when he arrived.","t":"他必須向媽媽承諾抵達時會打電話。"},{"w":"pronounce","p":"v.","d":"to say a word in a certain way using sounds","c":"發...音","s":"It took her weeks to pronounce that long French word correctly.","t":"她花了好幾週才能正確發出那個長法文單字的音。"},{"w":"protect","p":"v.","d":"to keep someone or something safe from harm","c":"保護","s":"A thick layer of fur helps protect the seal from the cold.","t":"厚厚的毛皮幫助保護海豹抵禦寒冷。"},{"w":"pump","p":"v.","d":"to push liquid or gas through a pipe or tube","c":"抽送","s":"The old machine still works to pump water up from the well.","t":"這台舊機器仍能把水從井裡抽送上來。"},{"w":"punish","p":"v.","d":"to make someone suffer for doing something wrong","c":"處罰","s":"The teacher chose not to punish the whole class for one mistake.","t":"老師選擇不因為一個錯誤就處罰全班。"},{"w":"put","p":"v.","d":"to move something into a certain place","c":"投入","s":"Please put your shoes neatly by the front door tonight.","t":"請今晚把你的鞋子整齊地放在前門旁。"},{"w":"puzzle","p":"v.","d":"to confuse someone because something is hard to understand","c":"使困惑","s":"The strange noise from the engine began to puzzle the mechanic.","t":"引擎發出的奇怪聲音讓技師感到困惑。"},{"w":"reach","p":"v.","d":"to arrive at a place after traveling","c":"抵達","s":"We hope to reach the summit before the sun sets tonight.","t":"我們希望今晚在太陽下山前抵達山頂。"},{"w":"read","p":"v.","d":"to look at words and understand their meaning","c":"閱讀","s":"She likes to read a short story before going to sleep.","t":"她喜歡睡前閱讀一篇短篇故事。"},{"w":"recover","p":"v.","d":"to get better after being sick or hurt","c":"恢復","s":"It took him two full weeks to recover from the flu.","t":"他花了整整兩週才從流感中恢復。"},{"w":"recycle","p":"v.","d":"to treat used items so they can be used again","c":"回收","s":"Our class learned how to recycle old paper and plastic bottles.","t":"我們班學到如何回收舊紙張和塑膠瓶。"},{"w":"remind","p":"v.","d":"to help someone remember something","c":"提醒","s":"Could you remind me to bring my umbrella tomorrow morning?","t":"你可以提醒我明天早上帶傘嗎？"},{"w":"repeat","p":"v.","d":"to say or do something again","c":"重複","s":"The teacher had to repeat the instructions one more time.","t":"老師必須再重複一次指示。"},{"w":"rest","p":"v.","d":"to relax or stop working for a while","c":"休息","s":"After the long hike, we decided to rest by the river.","t":"經過長途健行後，我們決定在河邊休息。"},{"w":"return","p":"v.","d":"to go back to a place","c":"返回","s":"She promised to return the library book before it was due.","t":"她答應在到期前把圖書館的書還回去。"},{"w":"revise","p":"v.","d":"to change and improve something you have written","c":"修訂","s":"He had to revise his essay after his teacher's feedback.","t":"他在老師給予回饋後必須修訂他的文章。"},{"w":"rob","p":"v.","d":"to steal money or property from someone","c":"搶劫","s":"Two masked men tried to rob the small corner store.","t":"兩名戴口罩的男子試圖搶劫這間小型雜貨店。"},{"w":"roll","p":"v.","d":"to move by turning over and over","c":"滾動","s":"The ball began to roll slowly down the grassy hill.","t":"球開始緩緩地滾下這片草地斜坡。"},{"w":"rub","p":"v.","d":"to press and move your hand over a surface","c":"磨擦","s":"She began to rub her cold hands together near the fire.","t":"她開始在火堆旁磨擦她冰冷的雙手。"},{"w":"ruin","p":"v.","d":"to spoil or destroy something completely","c":"毀壞(滅)","s":"Heavy rain almost began to ruin our outdoor birthday party.","t":"大雨幾乎要毀掉我們的戶外生日派對。"},{"w":"run","p":"v.","d":"to move quickly using your legs and feet","c":"跑","s":"The children love to run around the park after school.","t":"孩子們放學後喜歡在公園裡到處跑。"},{"w":"walk","p":"v.","d":"to move on foot at a normal speed","c":"走路","s":"Every morning, my grandfather likes to walk around the block.","t":"我爺爺每天早上喜歡在街區附近走路。"},{"w":"rush","p":"v.","d":"to do something very quickly, often because of little time","c":"催促","s":"Please don't rush me while I finish my homework.","t":"請別在我寫完作業前催促我。"},{"w":"satisfy","p":"v.","d":"to make someone pleased by meeting their needs","c":"使滿意","s":"The new menu seemed to satisfy even the pickiest customers.","t":"這份新菜單似乎讓最挑剔的顧客都感到滿意。"},{"w":"save","p":"v.","d":"to keep money instead of spending it","c":"節省","s":"She tries to save a little money from her allowance each week.","t":"她每週都試著從零用錢裡節省一點錢。"},{"w":"score","p":"v.","d":"to earn points in a game or test","c":"得分","s":"Our striker managed to score two goals in the final match.","t":"我們的前鋒在決賽中成功得了兩分。"},{"w":"seem","p":"v.","d":"to give the impression of being a certain way","c":"似乎","s":"The new student didn't seem nervous on her very first day.","t":"這位新生在第一天似乎並不緊張。"},{"w":"set","p":"v.","d":"to put something in a particular place or position","c":"設置","s":"Could you please set the table before dinner is ready?","t":"你可以在晚餐準備好之前先擺好餐桌嗎？"}]},{"unit":38,"theme":"Actions, Part 7 (動作 七)","cards":[{"w":"shake","p":"v.","d":"to move quickly up and down or side to side","c":"握(手)","s":"The two leaders stopped to shake hands before the meeting began.","t":"兩位領導人在會議開始前停下來握手。"},{"w":"share","p":"v.","d":"to have or use something together with others","c":"分擔","s":"She decided to share her lunch with her hungry classmate.","t":"她決定和飢餓的同學分擔她的午餐。"},{"w":"shoot","p":"v.","d":"to give an injection using a needle","c":"注射","s":"The nurse had to shoot the patient with a small dose of medicine.","t":"護士必須給病人注射一小劑藥物。"},{"w":"solve","p":"v.","d":"to find the answer to a problem","c":"解決","s":"It took the class an hour to solve the tricky math puzzle.","t":"全班花了一個小時才解決這道棘手的數學謎題。"},{"w":"spell","p":"v.","d":"to say or write the letters of a word in order","c":"拼寫","s":"Can you spell your last name for the school records?","t":"你可以為了學校紀錄拼寫一下你的姓嗎？"},{"w":"spot","p":"v.","d":"to suddenly see or notice something","c":"看到","s":"She was the first to spot the rare bird in the tree.","t":"她是第一個看到樹上那隻稀有鳥的人。"},{"w":"spread","p":"v.","d":"to become larger or move over a wider area","c":"蔓延","s":"The wildfire began to spread quickly across the dry hillside.","t":"野火開始迅速地蔓延到乾燥的山坡上。"},{"w":"state","p":"v.","d":"to say something clearly and formally","c":"陳述","s":"The judge asked him to state his name for the court record.","t":"法官要求他陳述自己的姓名供法庭紀錄。"},{"w":"steal","p":"v.","d":"to take something that belongs to someone else","c":"偷竊","s":"Someone tried to steal a bike from outside the library.","t":"有人試圖偷竊圖書館外面的一台自行車。"},{"w":"strike","p":"v.","d":"to hit someone or something forcefully","c":"打擊","s":"Lightning can strike tall trees during a powerful summer storm.","t":"閃電在強烈的夏季暴風雨中可能打擊高大的樹木。"},{"w":"suggest","p":"v.","d":"to offer an idea or plan for someone to consider","c":"建議","s":"My friend decided to suggest a new restaurant for dinner tonight.","t":"我朋友決定建議今晚去一家新餐廳吃晚餐。"},{"w":"support","p":"v.","d":"to help or encourage someone","c":"支持","s":"Her whole family came to support her during the big race.","t":"她全家人都來支持她參加這場重要的比賽。"},{"w":"surprise","p":"v.","d":"to cause someone to feel sudden wonder","c":"令…驚訝","s":"Her classmates planned to surprise her with a small birthday cake.","t":"她的同學計畫用一個小蛋糕讓她驚訝。"},{"w":"survive","p":"v.","d":"to continue to live after a difficult or dangerous event","c":"倖存","s":"The small plant managed to survive the long, cold winter.","t":"這株小植物挺過了漫長寒冷的冬天而倖存下來。"},{"w":"take","p":"v.","d":"to carry or move something from one place to another","c":"拿取","s":"Please take your umbrella with you because it might rain.","t":"請帶上你的雨傘，因為可能會下雨。"},{"w":"teach","p":"v.","d":"to help someone learn a skill or subject","c":"教","s":"My older sister offered to teach me how to ride a bike.","t":"我姊姊主動提議教我如何騎自行車。"},{"w":"tear","p":"v.","d":"to pull something apart so it rips","c":"撕裂","s":"Be careful not to tear the thin wrapping paper.","t":"請小心別撕破這張薄薄的包裝紙。"},{"w":"think","p":"v.","d":"to have an opinion or belief about something","c":"認為","s":"Most students think the new gym schedule is much better.","t":"大多數學生認為新的體育館時間表好多了。"},{"w":"trace","p":"v.","d":"to follow or find the origin of something","c":"追蹤","s":"Detectives worked hard to trace the missing package's exact route.","t":"警探努力追蹤這個遺失包裹的確切路線。"},{"w":"trap","p":"v.","d":"to catch an animal or person using a device or trick","c":"設陷阱","s":"The hunter set a wire cage to trap the wild rabbit.","t":"獵人設置了一個鐵絲籠來捕捉野兔。"},{"w":"travel","p":"n.","d":"the act of going from one place to another","c":"旅行","s":"Her job requires a lot of travel between different countries.","t":"她的工作需要在不同國家之間頻繁旅行。"},{"w":"treasure","p":"v.","d":"to value something very highly","c":"珍愛","s":"She will always treasure the old photo of her grandmother.","t":"她會永遠珍愛這張祖母的舊照片。"},{"w":"underline","p":"v.","d":"to draw a line under a word or sentence","c":"在…畫底線","s":"Please underline every new vocabulary word in your textbook.","t":"請在課本裡的每個新單字下方畫底線。"},{"w":"use","p":"v.","d":"to do something with a tool or object for a purpose","c":"使用","s":"You may use my pencil if you forgot to bring one.","t":"如果你忘了帶筆，可以使用我的鉛筆。"},{"w":"visit","p":"v.","d":"to go and see a person or place","c":"拜訪","s":"We plan to visit our grandparents during the winter holiday.","t":"我們計畫在寒假期間拜訪祖父母。"},{"w":"wait","p":"v.","d":"to stay somewhere until something happens","c":"等待","s":"We had to wait almost an hour for the next bus.","t":"我們必須等待將近一小時才能搭上下一班公車。"},{"w":"want","p":"v.","d":"to have a desire for something","c":"想要","s":"Most kids want a puppy at some point during childhood.","t":"大多數孩子在童年時期都曾想要一隻小狗。"},{"w":"wash","p":"v.","d":"to clean something using water","c":"洗","s":"Please remember to wash your hands before dinner tonight.","t":"請記得在今晚晚餐前洗手。"},{"w":"waste","p":"v.","d":"to use something carelessly without a good result","c":"浪費","s":"Try not to waste too much paper while printing your essay.","t":"印你的文章時，盡量別浪費太多紙張。"},{"w":"water","p":"v.","d":"to give water to plants so they can grow","c":"澆水","s":"She goes outside every morning to water the small garden.","t":"她每天早上都會出去幫小花園澆水。"},{"w":"wave","p":"v.","d":"to move your hand side to side as a greeting","c":"揮舞","s":"The children began to wave happily at the passing train.","t":"孩子們開心地對經過的火車揮手。"},{"w":"win","p":"v.","d":"to be the best or first in a competition","c":"獲勝","s":"Our class hopes to win the sports day relay this year.","t":"我們班希望今年能在運動會接力賽中獲勝。"},{"w":"write","p":"v.","d":"to put words on paper or a screen","c":"寫","s":"She likes to write a short note in her diary every night.","t":"她喜歡每天晚上在日記裡寫一段短短的文字。"},{"w":"try","p":"v.","d":"to make an effort to do something","c":"嘗試","s":"He decided to try the new recipe his mother suggested.","t":"他決定嘗試他媽媽建議的新食譜。"},{"w":"were","p":"v.","d":"the past tense of \"are,\" used with plural subjects","c":"是","s":"All the students were excited about the upcoming field trip.","t":"所有學生對即將到來的校外教學都感到興奮。"},{"w":"actually","p":"adv.","d":"used to say what is really true","c":"事實上","s":"He looked nervous, but he was actually quite calm inside.","t":"他看起來很緊張，但事實上內心相當平靜。"}]},{"unit":39,"theme":"Home / Household, Part 1 (居家環境 一)","cards":[{"w":"house","p":"n.","d":"a building where people live","c":"房子","s":"Our new house has a small garden in the back.","t":"我們的新房子後面有一個小花園。"},{"w":"gate","p":"n.","d":"a movable barrier in a fence or wall","c":"大門","s":"Please remember to close the gate after you come inside.","t":"進來後請記得關上大門。"},{"w":"hall","p":"n.","d":"a passage inside a building that leads to other rooms","c":"大廳","s":"Her bedroom is just down the hall from the kitchen.","t":"她的臥室就在廚房旁邊的大廳走道過去。"},{"w":"garden","p":"n.","d":"an area where flowers or vegetables are grown","c":"花園","s":"My grandmother grows roses in her small garden every spring.","t":"我奶奶每年春天都在她的小花園裡種玫瑰。"},{"w":"yard","p":"n.","d":"an outdoor area of land next to a house","c":"庭院","s":"The children love to play catch in the front yard.","t":"孩子們喜歡在前院玩接球遊戲。"},{"w":"garage","p":"n.","d":"a building or room where a car is kept","c":"車庫","s":"He parked his bicycle in the garage next to the car.","t":"他把自行車停在車庫裡，就在汽車旁邊。"},{"w":"room","p":"n.","d":"a part of a building enclosed by walls","c":"房間","s":"She decorated her room with photos of her favorite singer.","t":"她用她最喜歡歌手的照片裝飾她的房間。"},{"w":"living room","p":"n.","d":"a room in a house where people relax together","c":"客廳","s":"Every evening, the family watches TV together in the living room.","t":"每天晚上，全家人會一起在客廳看電視。"},{"w":"dining room","p":"n.","d":"a room used for eating meals","c":"飯廳","s":"We set the table in the dining room for the holiday dinner.","t":"我們在飯廳擺好桌子準備節日晚餐。"},{"w":"kitchen","p":"n.","d":"a room used for cooking food","c":"廚房","s":"The smell of fresh bread filled the whole kitchen this morning.","t":"今天早上新鮮麵包的香味充滿了整個廚房。"},{"w":"bedroom","p":"n.","d":"a room used mainly for sleeping","c":"臥室","s":"He keeps his books neatly stacked beside his bedroom window.","t":"他把書整齊地疊放在臥室窗邊。"},{"w":"bathroom","p":"n.","d":"a room with a bathtub or shower and a toilet","c":"浴室","s":"She left a clean towel hanging in the bathroom for her guest.","t":"她在浴室裡留了一條乾淨的毛巾給客人用。"},{"w":"restroom","p":"n.","d":"a public toilet for general use","c":"洗手間","s":"Excuse me, could you tell me where the restroom is?","t":"不好意思，你可以告訴我洗手間在哪裡嗎？"},{"w":"basement","p":"n.","d":"the part of a building that is below ground level","c":"地下室","s":"Old boxes and tools are usually stored in the basement.","t":"舊的箱子和工具通常存放在地下室。"},{"w":"balcony","p":"n.","d":"a platform attached to the outside of a building","c":"陽台","s":"She likes to drink her coffee on the balcony every morning.","t":"她每天早上喜歡在陽台上喝咖啡。"},{"w":"roof","p":"n.","d":"the covering on top of a building","c":"屋頂","s":"A strong wind blew several tiles off the old roof.","t":"強風把這座老屋頂的幾片瓦片吹落了。"},{"w":"ceiling","p":"n.","d":"the inside surface at the top of a room","c":"天花板","s":"A small spider was slowly crawling across the ceiling.","t":"一隻小蜘蛛正緩緩爬過天花板。"},{"w":"floor","p":"n.","d":"the surface of a room that you walk on","c":"地板","s":"Please take off your shoes before stepping on the wooden floor.","t":"踩上木地板前請先脫鞋。"},{"w":"stairs","p":"n.","d":"a set of steps leading from one floor to another","c":"樓梯","s":"He ran quickly up the stairs to grab his forgotten bag.","t":"他快速跑上樓梯去拿他忘記的包包。"},{"w":"wall","p":"n.","d":"an upright structure that divides or encloses a space","c":"牆壁","s":"They hung a large painting on the living room wall.","t":"他們在客廳的牆上掛了一幅大畫。"},{"w":"window","p":"n.","d":"an opening in a wall, usually covered with glass","c":"窗戶","s":"Sunlight streamed through the open window every morning.","t":"每天早上陽光都會透過敞開的窗戶照進來。"},{"w":"fence","p":"n.","d":"a barrier built around an area of land","c":"柵欄","s":"The dog likes to bark at people walking past the fence.","t":"這隻狗喜歡對著經過柵欄的路人吠叫。"},{"w":"home","p":"n.","d":"the place where a person lives","c":"家","s":"After a long trip, it felt wonderful to finally be home.","t":"經過一場長途旅行，終於回到家的感覺真好。"},{"w":"furniture","p":"n.","d":"movable items such as tables, chairs, and beds","c":"家具","s":"They bought new furniture for their apartment last weekend.","t":"他們上週末為公寓買了新家具。"},{"w":"armchair","p":"n.","d":"a comfortable chair with supports for the arms","c":"扶手椅","s":"Grandpa always falls asleep in his favorite armchair after lunch.","t":"爺爺午餐後總是在他最喜歡的扶手椅上睡著。"},{"w":"basket","p":"n.","d":"a container made of woven material, often with handles","c":"籃子","s":"She filled the basket with fresh fruit from the market.","t":"她用從市場買來的新鮮水果裝滿了籃子。"},{"w":"bed","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture used for sleeping","c":"床","s":"He jumped straight into bed after his long, tiring day.","t":"他度過漫長疲憊的一天後就直接跳上床。"},{"w":"bench","p":"n.","d":"a long seat for more than one person","c":"長椅","s":"They sat together on a bench and watched the sunset.","t":"他們一起坐在長椅上看夕陽。"},{"w":"blanket","p":"n.","d":"a covering used to keep warm in bed","c":"毯子","s":"She pulled the warm blanket up to her chin and fell asleep.","t":"她把溫暖的毯子拉到下巴然後就睡著了。"},{"w":"bookcase","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with shelves for books","c":"書架","s":"His bookcase was filled with comic books and old novels.","t":"他的書架擺滿了漫畫書和舊小說。"},{"w":"shelf","p":"n.","d":"a flat surface used for holding objects","c":"架子","s":"She placed the photo frame neatly on the top shelf.","t":"她把相框整齊地放在最上面的架子上。"},{"w":"carpet","p":"n.","d":"a thick fabric covering used on floors","c":"地毯","s":"The cat loves to sleep on the soft, warm carpet.","t":"這隻貓喜歡睡在又軟又暖的地毯上。"},{"w":"closet","p":"n.","d":"a small room or cabinet used for storage","c":"衣櫥","s":"She hung her winter coats neatly inside the bedroom closet.","t":"她把冬天的外套整齊地掛在臥室衣櫥裡。"},{"w":"couch","p":"n.","d":"a long, soft seat for more than one person","c":"沙發","s":"He fell asleep on the couch while watching a movie.","t":"他在看電影時在沙發上睡著了。"},{"w":"sofa","p":"n.","d":"another word for couch, a long soft seat","c":"沙發","s":"They bought a new gray sofa for the living room.","t":"他們為客廳買了一張新的灰色沙發。"},{"w":"curtain","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth hung over a window","c":"窗簾","s":"She closed the curtain so the room would stay cool.","t":"她拉上窗簾讓房間保持涼爽。"}]},{"unit":40,"theme":"Home / Household, Part 2 (居家環境 二)","cards":[{"w":"desk","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture used for writing or working","c":"桌子","s":"She keeps her pencils neatly arranged on her desk.","t":"她把鉛筆整齊地排放在書桌上。"},{"w":"table","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with a flat top and legs","c":"桌子","s":"We placed the birthday cake in the middle of the table.","t":"我們把生日蛋糕放在桌子中間。"},{"w":"door","p":"n.","d":"a barrier used to open or close an entrance","c":"門","s":"He knocked twice on the door before walking inside.","t":"他在進去之前在門上敲了兩次。"},{"w":"drawer","p":"n.","d":"a sliding storage box built into furniture","c":"抽屜","s":"She keeps her socks folded neatly in the top drawer.","t":"她把襪子整齊地折好放在最上層的抽屜裡。"},{"w":"dresser","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with drawers for clothes","c":"梳妝台","s":"He set his keys and wallet on the dresser every night.","t":"他每晚都把鑰匙和錢包放在梳妝台上。"},{"w":"comb","p":"n.","d":"a flat object with teeth used to arrange hair","c":"梳子","s":"She always carries a small comb inside her school bag.","t":"她的書包裡總是放著一把小梳子。"},{"w":"conditioner","p":"n.","d":"a machine that cools the air in a room","c":"冷氣機","s":"We turned on the conditioner because the afternoon was so hot.","t":"因為下午太熱了，我們打開了冷氣機。"},{"w":"heater","p":"n.","d":"a device that makes a room warmer","c":"暖氣機","s":"She turned on the heater as soon as winter began.","t":"冬天一開始她就打開了暖氣機。"},{"w":"fan","p":"n.","d":"a device that moves air to keep you cool","c":"電扇","s":"He pointed the small fan toward his desk while studying.","t":"他唸書時把小電扇對著書桌吹。"},{"w":"alarm","p":"n.","d":"a device that makes a sound to wake you up","c":"鬧鐘","s":"She forgot to set her alarm and woke up late.","t":"她忘了設定鬧鐘，結果起床晚了。"},{"w":"clock","p":"n.","d":"a device that shows the time","c":"時鐘","s":"The clock on the wall said it was almost midnight.","t":"牆上的時鐘顯示快到午夜了。"},{"w":"lamp","p":"n.","d":"a light that sits on a desk or table","c":"檯燈","s":"She turned on the lamp to read her book in bed.","t":"她打開檯燈在床上看書。"},{"w":"mirror","p":"n.","d":"a glass surface that shows your reflection","c":"鏡子","s":"He checked his hair in the mirror before leaving the house.","t":"他出門前在鏡子前檢查了一下頭髮。"},{"w":"pillow","p":"n.","d":"a soft cushion used to support your head while sleeping","c":"枕頭","s":"She hugged her favorite pillow as she fell asleep.","t":"她抱著最喜歡的枕頭就睡著了。"},{"w":"radio","p":"n.","d":"a device used to listen to broadcast sound","c":"收音機","s":"My father likes to listen to the radio while driving.","t":"我爸爸開車時喜歡聽收音機。"},{"w":"telephone","p":"n.","d":"a device used to talk to someone far away","c":"電話","s":"The telephone rang loudly just as we sat down for dinner.","t":"我們剛坐下吃晚餐時電話就響了。"},{"w":"TV","p":"n.","d":"a device used to watch shows and movies","c":"電視","s":"They gathered around the TV to watch the big game.","t":"他們聚在電視機前看這場重要的比賽。"},{"w":"decorate","p":"v.","d":"to make something look nicer by adding things","c":"裝飾","s":"We spent the afternoon helping decorate the classroom for the party.","t":"我們整個下午都在幫忙裝飾教室準備派對。"},{"w":"design","p":"v.","d":"to plan how something will look or work","c":"設計","s":"She wants to design her own clothes someday.","t":"她希望有一天能設計自己的衣服。"},{"w":"bath","p":"n.","d":"the act of washing your whole body in water","c":"沐浴","s":"She likes to take a warm bath before going to bed.","t":"她喜歡睡前洗一個溫暖的澡。"},{"w":"faucet","p":"n.","d":"a device used to control water flow from a pipe","c":"水龍頭","s":"He forgot to turn off the faucet after washing his hands.","t":"他洗完手後忘了關水龍頭。"},{"w":"toilet","p":"n.","d":"a bathroom fixture used for waste removal","c":"馬桶","s":"Please remember to flush the toilet after you use it.","t":"使用馬桶後請記得沖水。"},{"w":"tub","p":"n.","d":"a large container filled with water for bathing","c":"浴缸","s":"She filled the tub with warm water and bubbles.","t":"她在浴缸裡裝滿溫水和泡泡。"},{"w":"toothbrush","p":"n.","d":"a small brush used to clean teeth","c":"牙刷","s":"He keeps his toothbrush in a cup by the sink.","t":"他把牙刷放在水槽旁的杯子裡。"},{"w":"towel","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth used to dry yourself","c":"毛巾","s":"She wrapped a soft towel around her wet hair.","t":"她用一條柔軟的毛巾包住濕頭髮。"},{"w":"soap","p":"n.","d":"a substance used with water to clean your skin","c":"肥皂","s":"Please wash your hands with soap before dinner tonight.","t":"今晚晚餐前請用肥皂洗手。"},{"w":"dryer","p":"n.","d":"a machine that removes moisture from wet clothes","c":"烘乾機","s":"She put the wet towels straight into the dryer.","t":"她把濕毛巾直接放進烘乾機裡。"},{"w":"shower","p":"n.","d":"a device that sprays water for washing your body","c":"陣雨","s":"He takes a quick shower every morning before school.","t":"他每天早上上學前都會快速沖個澡。"},{"w":"bathe","p":"v.","d":"to wash your whole body in water","c":"把…浸入","s":"The mother carefully began to bathe her tiny newborn baby.","t":"媽媽小心地開始幫她剛出生的小寶寶洗澡。"},{"w":"bottle","p":"n.","d":"a container used for holding liquids","c":"瓶子","s":"She carries a reusable water bottle to school every day.","t":"她每天都帶著一個可重複使用的水瓶去上學。"},{"w":"lid","p":"n.","d":"a cover that fits over the top of a container","c":"蓋子","s":"He twisted the lid off the jar of jam.","t":"他把果醬罐子的蓋子扭開了。"},{"w":"bowl","p":"n.","d":"a round, deep dish used for food","c":"碗","s":"She poured cereal and milk into a clean bowl.","t":"她把麥片和牛奶倒進一個乾淨的碗裡。"},{"w":"chopsticks","p":"n.","d":"a pair of thin sticks used for eating food","c":"筷子","s":"My grandfather taught me how to use chopsticks when I was young.","t":"我小時候，爺爺教我怎麼用筷子。"},{"w":"cup","p":"n.","d":"a small container used for drinking","c":"杯子","s":"He poured hot tea into his favorite cup.","t":"他把熱茶倒進他最喜歡的杯子裡。"},{"w":"glass","p":"n.","d":"a drinking container made of clear material","c":"玻璃杯","s":"She filled a tall glass with cold lemonade.","t":"她把一個高玻璃杯裝滿冰涼的檸檬水。"},{"w":"dish","p":"n.","d":"a shallow container used for serving food","c":"盤子","s":"He carefully washed every dish after the big dinner.","t":"他在這場盛大的晚餐後仔細洗了每一個盤子。"}]},{"unit":41,"theme":"Home / Household, Part 3 (居家環境 三)","cards":[{"w":"plate","p":"n.","d":"a flat dish used for serving food","c":"盤子","s":"She placed a slice of cake on a small plate.","t":"她把一片蛋糕放在一個小盤子上。"},{"w":"fork","p":"n.","d":"a tool with prongs used for eating food","c":"叉子","s":"He used a fork to pick up the noodles.","t":"他用叉子夾起麵條。"},{"w":"knife","p":"n.","d":"a tool with a sharp blade used for cutting","c":"刀子","s":"Be careful when you use a sharp knife in the kitchen.","t":"在廚房使用鋒利的刀子時要小心。"},{"w":"spoon","p":"n.","d":"a tool with a small bowl shape used for eating soup","c":"湯匙","s":"She stirred her tea slowly with a small spoon.","t":"她用一把小湯匙慢慢攪拌她的茶。"},{"w":"saucer","p":"n.","d":"a small, round plate placed under a cup","c":"醬料碟","s":"He set the teacup carefully onto its matching saucer.","t":"他小心地把茶杯放在配套的碟子上。"},{"w":"can","p":"n.","d":"a sealed metal container for food or drink","c":"罐頭","s":"She opened a can of soup for a quick lunch.","t":"她打開一罐湯，當作快速的午餐。"},{"w":"straw","p":"n.","d":"a thin tube used for drinking liquids","c":"吸管","s":"He sipped his juice slowly through a colorful straw.","t":"他用一根色彩鮮豔的吸管慢慢喝果汁。"},{"w":"napkin","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth or paper used to wipe your mouth","c":"餐巾紙","s":"She wiped her hands with a clean napkin after the meal.","t":"她用餐後用一張乾淨的餐巾紙擦手。"},{"w":"pan","p":"n.","d":"a wide, flat cooking container","c":"平底鍋","s":"He cracked two eggs into the hot pan.","t":"他把兩顆蛋打進熱平底鍋裡。"},{"w":"pot","p":"n.","d":"a deep, round container used for cooking","c":"鍋子","s":"She filled the pot with water to boil the pasta.","t":"她把鍋子裝滿水來煮義大利麵。"},{"w":"wok","p":"n.","d":"a round-bottomed pan used in Chinese cooking","c":"(帶把的中國)炒菜鍋","s":"My mother stir-fries vegetables quickly in a hot wok.","t":"我媽媽用熱炒菜鍋快速地炒蔬菜。"},{"w":"teapot","p":"n.","d":"a container used for brewing and pouring tea","c":"茶壺","s":"She poured hot water into the teapot to make tea.","t":"她把熱水倒進茶壺裡泡茶。"},{"w":"freezer","p":"n.","d":"a device used to store food at very cold temperatures","c":"冰箱","s":"He kept a box of ice cream in the freezer.","t":"他把一盒冰淇淋放在冰箱的冷凍庫裡。"},{"w":"refrigerator","p":"n.","d":"an appliance used to keep food cold and fresh","c":"冰箱","s":"She put the leftover soup in the refrigerator for later.","t":"她把剩下的湯放進冰箱裡，之後再吃。"},{"w":"microwave","p":"n.","d":"an appliance that heats food quickly using waves","c":"微波爐","s":"He warmed up his lunch in the microwave for two minutes.","t":"他把午餐放進微波爐加熱兩分鐘。"},{"w":"oven","p":"n.","d":"an appliance used for baking or roasting food","c":"烤箱","s":"She placed the cookies in the oven to bake.","t":"她把餅乾放進烤箱裡烤。"},{"w":"gas","p":"n.","d":"a fuel used for cooking or heating","c":"瓦斯","s":"The stove in their kitchen runs on natural gas.","t":"他們廚房裡的爐子是用天然瓦斯運作的。"},{"w":"stove","p":"n.","d":"an appliance used for cooking food on top","c":"爐灶","s":"She turned on the stove to heat the soup.","t":"她打開爐灶來加熱湯。"},{"w":"sink","p":"n.","d":"a basin with a faucet used for washing dishes or hands","c":"水槽","s":"He left a pile of dirty dishes in the sink.","t":"他把一堆髒碗盤留在水槽裡。"},{"w":"bake","p":"v.","d":"to cook food in an oven","c":"烤","s":"She likes to bake cookies on rainy weekends.","t":"她喜歡在下雨的週末烤餅乾。"},{"w":"boil","p":"v.","d":"to heat a liquid until it bubbles","c":"沸騰","s":"He waited for the water to boil before adding the noodles.","t":"他等水沸騰後才加入麵條。"},{"w":"cook","p":"v.","d":"to prepare food by heating it","c":"煮","s":"My father loves to cook dinner for the whole family.","t":"我爸爸喜歡為全家人煮晚餐。"},{"w":"fry","p":"v.","d":"to cook food in hot oil","c":"油煎","s":"She likes to fry an egg every morning for breakfast.","t":"她每天早上喜歡煎一顆蛋當早餐。"},{"w":"steam","p":"v.","d":"to cook food using hot water vapor","c":"蒸","s":"He prefers to steam his vegetables instead of frying them.","t":"他比較喜歡蒸蔬菜而不是用油煎。"},{"w":"slice","p":"v.","d":"to cut something into thin pieces","c":"切成薄片","s":"She asked her brother to slice the bread for sandwiches.","t":"她要哥哥把麵包切成薄片來做三明治。"},{"w":"housework","p":"n.","d":"tasks done to keep a home clean and tidy","c":"家事","s":"Every Saturday, the whole family helps with the housework.","t":"每個星期六，全家人都會一起幫忙做家事。"},{"w":"brush","p":"n.","d":"a tool with bristles used for cleaning or painting","c":"刷子","s":"She used a small brush to clean the dusty shelf.","t":"她用一把小刷子清潔佈滿灰塵的架子。"},{"w":"bucket","p":"n.","d":"a round container with a handle used to carry liquid","c":"水桶","s":"He filled the bucket with soapy water to wash the car.","t":"他把水桶裝滿肥皂水來洗車。"},{"w":"mop","p":"n.","d":"a tool with a long handle used to clean floors","c":"拖把","s":"She used a mop to clean up the spilled juice.","t":"她用拖把清理灑出來的果汁。"},{"w":"garbage","p":"n.","d":"waste material that is thrown away","c":"垃圾","s":"He took the garbage out before leaving for school.","t":"他出門上學前先把垃圾拿出去。"},{"w":"trash","p":"n.","d":"another word for garbage; waste material","c":"垃圾","s":"Please put your trash in the bin, not on the ground.","t":"請把垃圾丟進垃圾桶，不要丟在地上。"},{"w":"dirty","p":"adj.","d":"covered with dirt; not clean","c":"骯髒的","s":"His shoes were completely dirty after the rainy hike.","t":"他的鞋子在這場雨中健行後變得非常骯髒。"},{"w":"sweep","p":"v.","d":"to clean a floor using a broom","c":"清掃","s":"She asked her brother to sweep the kitchen floor.","t":"她要哥哥清掃廚房地板。"},{"w":"album","p":"n.","d":"a book used to hold photographs","c":"相簿","s":"She keeps all her vacation photos in a thick album.","t":"她把所有的旅遊照片都放在一本厚厚的相簿裡。"},{"w":"book","p":"n.","d":"a set of printed pages bound together","c":"書本","s":"He borrowed an interesting book from the school library.","t":"他從學校圖書館借了一本有趣的書。"},{"w":"calendar","p":"n.","d":"a chart showing the days, weeks, and months of a year","c":"日(月)曆","s":"She circled her birthday on the kitchen calendar.","t":"她在廚房的日曆上圈出她的生日。"}]},{"unit":42,"theme":"Home / Household, Part 4 (居家環境 四)","cards":[{"w":"comic","p":"n.","d":"a magazine with stories told through drawings","c":"漫畫","s":"He spent his allowance on a new comic every Friday.","t":"他每個星期五都把零用錢花在一本新漫畫上。"},{"w":"diary","p":"n.","d":"a book where you write about your daily life","c":"日記","s":"She writes in her diary every night before bed.","t":"她每天晚上睡前都會寫日記。"},{"w":"dictionary","p":"n.","d":"a book that explains the meanings of words","c":"字典","s":"He looked up the new word in his dictionary.","t":"他在字典裡查了這個新單字。"},{"w":"magazine","p":"n.","d":"a publication with articles and pictures, printed regularly","c":"雜誌","s":"She bought a fashion magazine to read on the train.","t":"她買了一本時尚雜誌在火車上看。"},{"w":"map","p":"n.","d":"a drawing that shows the layout of a place","c":"地圖","s":"He unfolded the map to find the quickest route.","t":"他打開地圖尋找最快的路線。"},{"w":"newspaper","p":"n.","d":"printed pages with news, published daily or weekly","c":"報紙","s":"My grandfather reads the newspaper every morning with his tea.","t":"我爺爺每天早上都會邊喝茶邊看報紙。"},{"w":"note","p":"n.","d":"a short piece of writing to remember something","c":"筆記","s":"She left a quick note for her roommate on the fridge.","t":"她在冰箱上留了一張給室友的簡短筆記。"},{"w":"novel","p":"n.","d":"a long written story about made-up characters","c":"小說","s":"He finished reading the entire novel in just two days.","t":"他只花了兩天就讀完了整本小說。"},{"w":"page","p":"n.","d":"one side of a sheet of paper in a book","c":"頁","s":"She marked her place with a bookmark on page fifty.","t":"她用書籤標記了第五十頁的位置。"},{"w":"paper","p":"n.","d":"thin material used for writing or printing","c":"紙張","s":"He folded a piece of paper into a paper airplane.","t":"他把一張紙折成紙飛機。"},{"w":"postcard","p":"n.","d":"a card sent through the mail without an envelope","c":"明信片","s":"She sent a postcard to her friend from her vacation.","t":"她從度假地寄了一張明信片給朋友。"},{"w":"sheet","p":"n.","d":"a single flat piece of paper","c":"一張(紙)","s":"He grabbed a clean sheet of paper to start his essay.","t":"他拿了一張乾淨的紙開始寫文章。"},{"w":"stationery","p":"n.","d":"writing materials such as paper, pens, and envelopes","c":"文具","s":"She organized her stationery neatly inside her desk drawer.","t":"她把文具整齊地收進書桌的抽屜裡。"},{"w":"pen","p":"n.","d":"a tool used for writing with ink","c":"筆","s":"He borrowed a blue pen to sign the form.","t":"他借了一支藍色的筆來簽表格。"},{"w":"pencil","p":"n.","d":"a tool used for writing or drawing with graphite","c":"鉛筆","s":"She sharpened her pencil before starting the math test.","t":"她在開始數學考試前削尖了鉛筆。"},{"w":"eraser","p":"n.","d":"a tool used to remove pencil marks","c":"橡皮擦","s":"He used an eraser to fix his mistake on the worksheet.","t":"他用橡皮擦修正了練習卷上的錯誤。"},{"w":"ruler","p":"n.","d":"a flat tool used for measuring or drawing straight lines","c":"尺","s":"She used a ruler to draw a straight line in her notebook.","t":"她用尺在筆記本上畫了一條直線。"},{"w":"crayon","p":"n.","d":"a colored wax stick used for drawing","c":"蠟筆","s":"The little boy colored the picture with a red crayon.","t":"小男孩用紅色蠟筆畫這幅圖。"},{"w":"marker","p":"n.","d":"a pen with a thick tip used for writing or coloring","c":"麥克筆","s":"She wrote her name in big letters with a black marker.","t":"她用黑色麥克筆把自己的名字寫得很大。"},{"w":"envelope","p":"n.","d":"a paper cover used to hold a letter","c":"信封","s":"He sealed the letter inside a plain white envelope.","t":"他把信封進一個普通的白色信封裡。"},{"w":"glue","p":"n.","d":"a sticky substance used to join things together","c":"膠水","s":"She used glue to attach the photos to her poster.","t":"她用膠水把照片貼在海報上。"},{"w":"ink","p":"n.","d":"a colored liquid used for writing or printing","c":"墨水","s":"The pen ran out of ink halfway through the letter.","t":"這支筆寫信寫到一半就沒墨水了。"},{"w":"paste","p":"n.","d":"a soft, sticky substance used for sticking paper","c":"漿糊","s":"He used a bit of paste to stick the cutout onto the card.","t":"他用了一點漿糊把剪下來的圖貼在卡片上。"},{"w":"notebook","p":"n.","d":"a small book with blank or lined pages for writing","c":"筆記本","s":"She carries a small notebook to jot down her ideas.","t":"她隨身帶著一本小筆記本來記下她的想法。"},{"w":"pin","p":"n.","d":"a small, thin, pointed piece of metal","c":"大頭針","s":"She used a pin to hold the papers together.","t":"她用一根大頭針把文件固定在一起。"},{"w":"stamp","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of paper stuck on mail to pay for postage","c":"郵票","s":"He licked the stamp and stuck it on the envelope.","t":"他舔了郵票後貼在信封上。"},{"w":"thing","p":"n.","d":"an object whose exact name is not given","c":"東西","s":"She forgot to bring an important thing to school today.","t":"她今天忘了帶一個重要的東西去學校。"},{"w":"box","p":"n.","d":"a container with stiff sides, usually square or rectangular","c":"盒子","s":"He stored his old toys in a cardboard box.","t":"他把舊玩具收在一個紙箱裡。"},{"w":"cage","p":"n.","d":"a structure made of bars used to keep animals inside","c":"籠子","s":"The pet shop kept the rabbits in a clean cage.","t":"寵物店把兔子養在一個乾淨的籠子裡。"},{"w":"cellphone","p":"n.","d":"a small wireless phone you can carry with you","c":"手機","s":"She accidentally left her cellphone at home this morning.","t":"她今天早上不小心把手機忘在家裡了。"},{"w":"chess","p":"n.","d":"a board game played with pieces on a checkered board","c":"西洋棋","s":"My grandfather taught me how to play chess last summer.","t":"我爺爺去年夏天教我怎麼下西洋棋。"},{"w":"diamond","p":"n.","d":"a hard, clear, valuable gemstone","c":"鑽石","s":"Her ring sparkled with a small diamond in the sunlight.","t":"她的戒指上鑲著一顆小鑽石，在陽光下閃閃發光。"},{"w":"doll","p":"n.","d":"a toy made to look like a small person","c":"洋娃娃","s":"The little girl carried her favorite doll everywhere she went.","t":"小女孩走到哪裡都帶著她最喜歡的洋娃娃。"},{"w":"flag","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth with a design, used as a symbol","c":"旗子","s":"The students raised the school flag every Monday morning.","t":"學生們每週一早上都會升起學校的旗子。"},{"w":"flashlight","p":"n.","d":"a small light powered by batteries that you can carry","c":"手電筒","s":"He used a flashlight to find his way during the blackout.","t":"停電時他用手電筒找路。"},{"w":"gun","p":"n.","d":"a weapon that shoots bullets","c":"槍","s":"The museum displayed an old gun from a historical battle.","t":"博物館展示了一把來自歷史戰役的舊槍。"}]},{"unit":43,"theme":"Home / Household, Part 5 (居家環境 五)","cards":[{"w":"key","p":"n.","d":"a metal tool used to lock or unlock something","c":"鑰匙","s":"He searched his pockets for the key to the front door.","t":"他在口袋裡找前門的鑰匙。"},{"w":"kite","p":"n.","d":"a light toy flown in the wind on a string","c":"風箏","s":"The children ran across the field flying a colorful kite.","t":"孩子們在田野間奔跑放著一個色彩鮮豔的風箏。"},{"w":"lantern","p":"n.","d":"a light that can be carried or hung up","c":"燈籠","s":"They hung a glowing paper lantern outside the front door.","t":"他們在門外掛了一個發亮的紙燈籠。"},{"w":"mat","p":"n.","d":"a thick flat covering placed on a floor","c":"草蓆","s":"She wiped her shoes on the mat before entering the house.","t":"她在進屋前先在草蓆上擦了擦鞋子。"},{"w":"needle","p":"n.","d":"a thin, sharp tool used for sewing","c":"針","s":"She threaded the needle carefully to fix the torn shirt.","t":"她小心地把線穿過針來修補破掉的襯衫。"},{"w":"net","p":"n.","d":"a material with open spaces, used to catch things","c":"網子","s":"He used a small net to scoop the goldfish from the tank.","t":"他用一個小網子把金魚從魚缸裡撈出來。"},{"w":"package","p":"n.","d":"a wrapped or boxed item sent through the mail","c":"包裹","s":"She was excited to receive a package from her grandmother.","t":"她很興奮收到奶奶寄來的一個包裹。"},{"w":"pipe","p":"n.","d":"a long, hollow tube used to carry liquid or gas","c":"管子","s":"Water dripped from a small crack in the old pipe.","t":"水從這條老舊管子的一個小裂縫滴落。"},{"w":"raincoat","p":"n.","d":"a coat worn to stay dry in the rain","c":"雨衣","s":"She put on her yellow raincoat before walking to school.","t":"她在走去學校前穿上了她的黃色雨衣。"},{"w":"rope","p":"n.","d":"a strong, thick cord used for tying or pulling","c":"繩索","s":"The sailors used a thick rope to tie the boat to the dock.","t":"水手們用一條粗繩把船綁在碼頭上。"},{"w":"ticket","p":"n.","d":"a piece of paper that allows you to enter or travel","c":"票券","s":"He showed his ticket to the guard before entering the stadium.","t":"他在進入體育場前向警衛出示了他的票券。"},{"w":"toy","p":"n.","d":"an object made for children to play with","c":"玩具","s":"The little boy hugged his favorite toy before falling asleep.","t":"小男孩抱著他最喜歡的玩具就睡著了。"},{"w":"tube","p":"n.","d":"a long, hollow cylinder used to hold or carry things","c":"管子","s":"She squeezed the last bit of toothpaste from the tube.","t":"她把牙膏管裡最後一點牙膏擠了出來。"},{"w":"umbrella","p":"n.","d":"a device used to protect yourself from rain","c":"雨傘","s":"He opened his umbrella as soon as the rain started to fall.","t":"雨一開始下他就打開了雨傘。"},{"w":"wheel","p":"n.","d":"a round object that turns to allow a vehicle to move","c":"輪胎","s":"He checked the air in every wheel before the long drive.","t":"他在長途開車前檢查了每個輪胎的氣壓。"},{"w":"festival","p":"n.","d":"a special day or time of celebration","c":"節日","s":"The whole town gathers for the lantern festival every year.","t":"全鎮的人每年都會聚集參加燈籠節。"},{"w":"Easter","p":"n.","d":"a spring holiday celebrated by Christians","c":"復活節","s":"The children searched the garden for colorful Easter eggs.","t":"孩子們在花園裡尋找色彩鮮豔的復活節彩蛋。"},{"w":"Halloween","p":"n.","d":"a holiday in October when people wear costumes","c":"萬聖節","s":"She dressed up as a witch for the Halloween party.","t":"她在萬聖節派對上裝扮成女巫。"},{"w":"birthday","p":"n.","d":"the day of the year when a person was born","c":"生日","s":"We baked a chocolate cake for her birthday this weekend.","t":"我們這個週末為她的生日烤了一個巧克力蛋糕。"},{"w":"balloon","p":"n.","d":"a colorful bag filled with air, used for decoration","c":"汽球","s":"She tied a bright red balloon to the back of her chair.","t":"她把一個鮮紅色的氣球綁在她椅子的後面。"},{"w":"candle","p":"n.","d":"a stick of wax with a wick, burned to give light","c":"蠟燭","s":"She blew out every candle on her birthday cake.","t":"她吹熄了生日蛋糕上的每一根蠟燭。"},{"w":"card","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of stiff paper with a message or picture","c":"卡片","s":"He wrote a kind card for his teacher's retirement.","t":"他為老師的退休寫了一張溫馨的卡片。"},{"w":"gift","p":"n.","d":"something given to someone without payment","c":"禮物","s":"She wrapped the gift carefully in shiny paper.","t":"她小心地用閃亮的紙包好禮物。"},{"w":"party","p":"n.","d":"a social event where people gather to celebrate","c":"派對","s":"They decorated the whole room for the surprise party.","t":"他們把整個房間都裝飾好來辦這場驚喜派對。"},{"w":"bless","p":"v.","d":"to wish someone well or ask for divine favor","c":"祝福","s":"The grandmother stopped to bless her grandchildren before they left.","t":"奶奶在孫子們離開前停下來祝福他們。"},{"w":"celebrate","p":"v.","d":"to do something special to mark an important event","c":"慶祝","s":"Our whole family gathered to celebrate my grandfather's birthday.","t":"我們全家聚在一起慶祝爺爺的生日。"},{"w":"cheer","p":"v.","d":"to shout with joy or encouragement","c":"為…歡呼、鼓舞","s":"The crowd began to cheer loudly when the team scored.","t":"球隊得分時，觀眾開始大聲歡呼。"},{"w":"education","p":"n.","d":"the process of teaching and learning","c":"教育","s":"She believes a good education can change a person's future.","t":"她相信良好的教育能改變一個人的未來。"},{"w":"university","p":"n.","d":"a school for higher learning after high school","c":"大學","s":"He hopes to study engineering at a top university.","t":"他希望能在一所頂尖的大學學習工程學。"},{"w":"college","p":"n.","d":"a school for education beyond high school","c":"學院","s":"She is excited to start college this coming fall.","t":"她很期待今年秋天開始上大學。"},{"w":"senior high school","p":"n.","d":"a school for students in grades ten through twelve","c":"高中","s":"My older brother just started his first year of senior high school.","t":"我哥哥剛開始讀高中一年級。"},{"w":"junior high school","p":"n.","d":"a school for students in grades seven through nine","c":"國中","s":"All the students in junior high school take the same basic subjects.","t":"所有國中學生都修讀相同的基礎科目。"},{"w":"elementary school","p":"n.","d":"a school for young children, usually grades one through six","c":"小學","s":"She still remembers her favorite teacher from elementary school.","t":"她仍然記得小學時最喜歡的老師。"},{"w":"kindergarten","p":"n.","d":"a school for very young children before elementary school","c":"幼稚園","s":"He cried on his very first day of kindergarten.","t":"他幼稚園的第一天哭了。"}]},{"unit":44,"theme":"Time / Numbers, Part 1 (時間與數字 一)","cards":[{"w":"future","p":"n.","d":"the time that has not happened yet","c":"未來","s":"She often dreams about her future as a famous doctor.","t":"她常常夢想自己未來成為一名知名的醫生。"},{"w":"a.m.","p":"adv.","d":"used to describe the time before noon","c":"上午","s":"The first class begins at eight a.m. every weekday.","t":"每個工作日的第一堂課在上午八點開始。"},{"w":"p.m.","p":"adv.","d":"used to describe the time between noon and midnight","c":"午後","s":"Our movie starts at seven thirty p.m. tonight.","t":"我們今晚的電影在下午七點半開始。"},{"w":"morning","p":"n.","d":"the early part of the day before noon","c":"早上","s":"She always drinks a cup of tea in the morning.","t":"她早上總是喝一杯茶。"},{"w":"noon","p":"n.","d":"twelve o'clock in the middle of the day","c":"中午","s":"We usually eat lunch together at noon on weekdays.","t":"我們平常工作日的中午會一起吃午餐。"},{"w":"afternoon","p":"n.","d":"the part of the day between noon and evening","c":"下午","s":"He takes a short nap every afternoon after school.","t":"他放學後每天下午都會小睡一下。"},{"w":"eve","p":"n.","d":"the evening or day before a special event","c":"前夕","s":"The whole family gathers together on Christmas eve.","t":"全家人會在聖誕節前夕聚在一起。"},{"w":"evening","p":"n.","d":"the part of the day between afternoon and night","c":"傍晚","s":"They like to take a quiet walk in the evening.","t":"他們喜歡在傍晚散步。"},{"w":"night","p":"n.","d":"the time when it is dark outside","c":"晚上","s":"She studies for her exams late into the night.","t":"她常常很晚還在熬夜準備考試。"},{"w":"midnight","p":"n.","d":"twelve o'clock at night","c":"午夜","s":"The party didn't end until well past midnight.","t":"派對一直到午夜過後很久才結束。"},{"w":"dawn","p":"n.","d":"the first light of the day","c":"黎明","s":"The fishermen leave the harbor before dawn every morning.","t":"漁夫每天早上都在黎明前就離開港口。"},{"w":"today","p":"adv.","d":"on this present day","c":"今天","s":"We have a big science test today after lunch.","t":"我們今天午餐後有一場重要的科學考試。"},{"w":"yesterday","p":"adv.","d":"on the day before today","c":"昨天","s":"She lost her favorite scarf somewhere yesterday afternoon.","t":"她昨天下午在某處丟了她最喜歡的圍巾。"},{"w":"tomorrow","p":"n.","d":"the day after today","c":"明天","s":"He promised to call his grandmother tomorrow morning.","t":"他答應明天早上要打電話給奶奶。"},{"w":"tonight","p":"adv.","d":"during the night of the present day","c":"今晚","s":"We plan to watch the meteor shower tonight together.","t":"我們計畫今晚一起看流星雨。"},{"w":"year","p":"n.","d":"a period of twelve months","c":"年","s":"My family always visits my grandparents once a year.","t":"我們家每年都會去探望祖父母一次。"},{"w":"month","p":"n.","d":"one of the twelve parts of a year","c":"月","s":"She started her new job just one month ago.","t":"她開始新工作才剛一個月。"},{"w":"day","p":"n.","d":"a period of twenty-four hours","c":"天","s":"He counted down every day until summer vacation began.","t":"他每天倒數計算著暑假開始前的日子。"},{"w":"daily","p":"adj.","d":"happening every day","c":"每日的","s":"Walking the dog has become part of her daily routine.","t":"遛狗已經成為她每日的固定習慣。"},{"w":"date","p":"n.","d":"the specific day, month, and year of an event","c":"日期","s":"She forgot to write the date at the top of her test.","t":"她忘了在考卷最上面寫上日期。"},{"w":"time","p":"n.","d":"the ongoing flow of events measured in hours and minutes","c":"時間","s":"Do you have enough time to help me with my homework?","t":"你有足夠的時間幫我做作業嗎？"},{"w":"o'clock","p":"adv.","d":"used after a number to say the exact hour","c":"點鐘","s":"We agreed to meet at the station at six o'clock.","t":"我們約好六點鐘在車站見面。"},{"w":"hour","p":"n.","d":"a unit of time equal to sixty minutes","c":"小時","s":"The flight to Tokyo takes about three hours.","t":"飛往東京的班機大約需要三個小時。"},{"w":"minute","p":"n.","d":"a unit of time equal to sixty seconds","c":"分鐘","s":"Please wait just one minute while I find my keys.","t":"請等我一分鐘，我去找鑰匙。"},{"w":"amount","p":"n.","d":"a quantity of something","c":"總數","s":"She was surprised by the large amount of homework tonight.","t":"她對今晚的大量作業感到驚訝。"},{"w":"number","p":"n.","d":"a word or symbol used for counting","c":"號碼","s":"He wrote his phone number on a small piece of paper.","t":"他把他的電話號碼寫在一張小紙片上。"},{"w":"zero","p":"n.","d":"the number that means nothing or none","c":"零（0）","s":"The thermometer outside showed exactly zero degrees this morning.","t":"今天早上外面的溫度計顯示正好零度。"},{"w":"one","p":"n.","d":"the number 1","c":"一（1）","s":"She only needed one more sticker to finish her collection.","t":"她只需要再一張貼紙就能完成她的收藏。"},{"w":"two","p":"n.","d":"the number 2","c":"二（2）","s":"He has two younger sisters who both love to dance.","t":"他有兩個妹妹，她們都很喜歡跳舞。"},{"w":"three","p":"n.","d":"the number 3","c":"三（3）","s":"The recipe calls for three cups of flour and two eggs.","t":"這個食譜需要三杯麵粉和兩顆蛋。"},{"w":"four","p":"n.","d":"the number 4","c":"四（4）","s":"We waited in line for almost four hours at the theme park.","t":"我們在主題樂園排隊等了將近四個小時。"}]},{"unit":45,"theme":"Time / Numbers, Part 2 (時間與數字 二)","cards":[{"w":"five","p":"n.","d":"the number 5","c":"五（5）","s":"She practices the piano for five hours every week.","t":"她每週練習彈鋼琴五個小時。"},{"w":"six","p":"n.","d":"the number 6","c":"六（6）","s":"The bakery sells a box of six fresh donuts each morning.","t":"這家麵包店每天早上賣一盒六個的新鮮甜甜圈。"},{"w":"seven","p":"n.","d":"the number 7","c":"七（7）","s":"There are seven days in a single week.","t":"一個星期裡有七天。"},{"w":"eight","p":"n.","d":"the number 8","c":"八（8）","s":"He set his alarm for eight o'clock every school morning.","t":"他每個上學日早上都把鬧鐘設在八點。"},{"w":"nine","p":"n.","d":"the number 9","c":"九（9）","s":"Our team scored nine points in the final round.","t":"我們隊在最後一輪得了九分。"},{"w":"ten","p":"n.","d":"the number 10","c":"十（10）","s":"She counted ten coins hidden inside the old jar.","t":"她數出舊罐子裡藏著十枚硬幣。"},{"w":"eleven","p":"n.","d":"the number 11","c":"十一（11）","s":"A soccer team needs exactly eleven players on the field.","t":"一支足球隊在場上正好需要十一名球員。"},{"w":"twelve","p":"n.","d":"the number 12","c":"十二（12）","s":"There are twelve months in every calendar year.","t":"每個日曆年都有十二個月。"},{"w":"thirteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 13","c":"十三（13）","s":"She turned thirteen years old at her birthday party last week.","t":"她上週的生日派對滿十三歲。"},{"w":"fourteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 14","c":"十四（14）","s":"The recipe says to bake the cookies for fourteen minutes.","t":"食譜上說要把餅乾烤十四分鐘。"},{"w":"fifteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 15","c":"十五（15）","s":"It only took us fifteen minutes to walk to the station.","t":"我們只花了十五分鐘就走到車站。"},{"w":"sixteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 16","c":"十六(16)","s":"He will be old enough to get his license at sixteen.","t":"他到十六歲就有資格考駕照了。"},{"w":"seventeen","p":"n.","d":"the number 17","c":"十七(17)","s":"She just turned seventeen and started her junior year.","t":"她剛滿十七歲，開始升上高二。"},{"w":"eighteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 18","c":"十八(18)","s":"Most students graduate from high school around the age of eighteen.","t":"大多數學生在十八歲左右從高中畢業。"},{"w":"nineteen","p":"n.","d":"the number 19","c":"十九(19)","s":"He scored nineteen points in last night's basketball game.","t":"他昨晚的籃球比賽得了十九分。"},{"w":"twenty","p":"n.","d":"the number 20","c":"二十(20)","s":"Our class has exactly twenty students this semester.","t":"我們班這學期正好有二十個學生。"},{"w":"thirty","p":"n.","d":"the number 30","c":"三十(30)","s":"The bus ride to the museum took about thirty minutes.","t":"搭公車到博物館大約花了三十分鐘。"},{"w":"forty","p":"n.","d":"the number 40","c":"四十(40)","s":"Grandma has been baking bread for over forty years.","t":"奶奶已經烤麵包超過四十年了。"},{"w":"fifty","p":"n.","d":"the number 50","c":"五十(50)","s":"He saved fifty dollars from his allowance this month.","t":"他這個月從零用錢裡存了五十元。"},{"w":"sixty","p":"n.","d":"the number 60","c":"六十(60)","s":"There are sixty seconds in exactly one minute.","t":"一分鐘正好有六十秒。"},{"w":"seventy","p":"n.","d":"the number 70","c":"七十(70)","s":"Grandpa just celebrated his seventyth birthday with the whole family.","t":"爺爺剛和全家人一起慶祝了他的七十歲生日。"},{"w":"eighty","p":"n.","d":"the number 80","c":"八十(80)","s":"The old bridge has stood for more than eighty years.","t":"這座老橋已經屹立超過八十年了。"},{"w":"ninety","p":"n.","d":"the number 90","c":"九十(90)","s":"She scored ninety percent on her final science exam.","t":"她在期末科學考試中得到九十分。"},{"w":"count","p":"v.","d":"to find the total number of something","c":"計算","s":"The teacher asked the students to count all the chairs in the room.","t":"老師要學生計算房間裡所有的椅子數量。"},{"w":"divide","p":"v.","d":"to separate something into smaller parts","c":"分配","s":"She decided to divide the pizza evenly among her four friends.","t":"她決定把披薩平均分配給她的四個朋友。"},{"w":"minus","p":"prep.","d":"used to show subtraction between numbers","c":"減（去）","s":"Ten minus four equals six, the teacher explained.","t":"老師解釋說十減四等於六。"},{"w":"plus","p":"prep.","d":"used to show addition between numbers","c":"加(數學)","s":"Two plus three equals five, the young boy answered proudly.","t":"小男孩驕傲地回答二加三等於五。"},{"w":"first","p":"adj.","d":"coming before all others in order","c":"第一的","s":"She was so nervous on her first day at the new school.","t":"她在新學校的第一天非常緊張。"},{"w":"second","p":"adj.","d":"coming right after the first","c":"第二的","s":"He finished in second place during the school running race.","t":"他在學校的賽跑比賽中得到第二名。"},{"w":"third","p":"adj.","d":"coming right after the second","c":"第三的","s":"This is already her third attempt to pass the driving test.","t":"這已經是她第三次嘗試通過駕照考試了。"},{"w":"angle","p":"n.","d":"the space between two lines that meet at a point","c":"角度","s":"He measured the angle of the roof with a special tool.","t":"他用一個特殊工具測量了屋頂的角度。"}]},{"unit":46,"theme":"Time / Numbers, Part 3 (時間與數字 三)","cards":[{"w":"size","p":"n.","d":"how big or small something is","c":"尺寸","s":"She asked the clerk for a smaller size of the same shoes.","t":"她請店員幫她找同款但較小尺寸的鞋子。"},{"w":"centimeter","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of length equal to one hundredth of a meter","c":"公分","s":"The ruler showed the pencil was exactly fifteen centimeters long.","t":"尺顯示這支鉛筆正好十五公分長。"},{"w":"inch","p":"n.","d":"a unit of length equal to one twelfth of a foot","c":"英吋","s":"The new phone screen measures about six inches across.","t":"這款新手機的螢幕大約有六英吋寬。"},{"w":"meter","p":"n.","d":"the basic metric unit of length","c":"公尺","s":"The swimming pool at school is twenty-five meters long.","t":"學校的游泳池長二十五公尺。"},{"w":"kilometer","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of length equal to 1,000 meters","c":"公里","s":"Her house is about three kilometers away from the school.","t":"她家距離學校大約三公里。"},{"w":"mile","p":"n.","d":"a unit of length equal to about 1.6 kilometers","c":"英哩","s":"He runs about two miles every morning before breakfast.","t":"他每天早餐前都會跑大約兩英哩。"},{"w":"gram","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of weight equal to one thousandth of a kilogram","c":"公克","s":"The recipe calls for two hundred grams of flour.","t":"這個食譜需要兩百公克的麵粉。"},{"w":"kilogram","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of weight equal to one thousand grams","c":"公斤","s":"The baby weighed about three kilograms at birth.","t":"這個寶寶出生時大約三公斤重。"},{"w":"liter","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit used to measure liquid","c":"公升","s":"She bought a two-liter bottle of orange juice at the store.","t":"她在店裡買了一瓶兩公升的橘子汁。"},{"w":"hundred","p":"n.","d":"the number 100","c":"百","s":"Over one hundred students signed up for the school trip.","t":"超過一百名學生報名參加這次校外教學。"},{"w":"thousand","p":"n.","d":"the number 1,000","c":"千","s":"The stadium can hold more than ten thousand fans.","t":"這座體育場可以容納超過一萬名觀眾。"},{"w":"million","p":"n.","d":"the number 1,000,000","c":"百萬","s":"The popular video reached over one million views in a week.","t":"這部熱門影片在一週內就突破了一百萬次觀看。"},{"w":"quarter","p":"n.","d":"one of four equal parts of something","c":"四分之一","s":"She cut the apple pie into a quarter and shared the rest.","t":"她把蘋果派切了四分之一，剩下的拿去分享。"},{"w":"measure","p":"v.","d":"to find the size or amount of something","c":"測量","s":"He used a tape to measure the length of the table.","t":"他用一條尺帶來測量桌子的長度。"},{"w":"heat","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being hot","c":"熱度","s":"Everyone stayed indoors because of the extreme summer heat.","t":"由於夏天酷熱，大家都待在室內。"},{"w":"height","p":"n.","d":"how tall a person or thing is","c":"高度","s":"The nurse checked her height during the yearly checkup.","t":"護士在每年的健康檢查中測量了她的身高。"},{"w":"weight","p":"n.","d":"how heavy a person or thing is","c":"重量","s":"The doctor recorded his weight before the appointment ended.","t":"醫生在看診結束前記錄了他的體重。"},{"w":"heavy","p":"adj.","d":"weighing a lot","c":"重的","s":"The heavy backpack made it hard for him to climb the stairs.","t":"這個沉重的背包讓他爬樓梯變得很困難。"},{"w":"over-weight","p":"adj.","d":"weighing more than is healthy or allowed","c":"超(過)重的","s":"The airline charged extra for the over-weight suitcase.","t":"這家航空公司對超重的行李箱收取額外費用。"},{"w":"high","p":"adj.","d":"having a great distance from top to bottom","c":"高的","s":"The climbers reached the highest point on the mountain by noon.","t":"登山客在中午前抵達了這座山的最高點。"},{"w":"low","p":"adj.","d":"not loud; quiet in volume","c":"小聲的","s":"She spoke in a low voice so she wouldn't wake the baby.","t":"她說話聲音很小，以免吵醒寶寶。"},{"w":"shape","p":"n.","d":"the outer form or outline of something","c":"形狀","s":"The cookie cutter pressed the dough into a star shape.","t":"餅乾模把麵團壓成星星的形狀。"},{"w":"rectangle","p":"n.","d":"a shape with four sides and four right angles","c":"長方形","s":"She drew a large rectangle to represent the classroom on the map.","t":"她畫了一個大長方形來代表地圖上的教室。"},{"w":"triangle","p":"n.","d":"a shape with three straight sides","c":"三角形","s":"He folded the paper twice to make a small triangle.","t":"他把紙對折兩次做成一個小三角形。"},{"w":"round","p":"adj.","d":"shaped like a circle","c":"圓形的","s":"The table in the kitchen is small and perfectly round.","t":"廚房裡的桌子又小又非常圓。"},{"w":"a/an","p":"art.","d":"used before a noun to mean one of something","c":"一個","s":"She wanted to buy a/an umbrella before the rain started.","t":"她想在下雨前買一把雨傘。"},{"w":"a few","p":"adv.","d":"a small number of something","c":"一些","s":"He only needed a few more minutes to finish his homework.","t":"他只需要再幾分鐘就能完成作業。"},{"w":"a little","p":"adv.","d":"a small amount of something","c":"少量","s":"She added a little salt to the soup before serving it.","t":"她在端出湯之前加了一點點鹽。"},{"w":"a lot","p":"adv.","d":"a large amount of something","c":"大量","s":"He learned a lot about history during his trip to the museum.","t":"他在這次博物館之旅中學到了很多歷史知識。"},{"w":"few","p":"adj.","d":"not many; a small number","c":"一些","s":"Very few students stayed after class to ask questions.","t":"下課後留下來問問題的學生很少。"},{"w":"less","p":"adj.","d":"a smaller amount of something","c":"較少的","s":"She tried to spend less time on her phone this week.","t":"她這個星期試著少花一點時間看手機。"}]},{"unit":47,"theme":"Time / Numbers, Part 4 (時間與數字 四)","cards":[{"w":"more","p":"adj.","d":"a greater amount of something","c":"更多的","s":"She asked for more time to finish her art project.","t":"她要求更多時間來完成她的美術作品。"},{"w":"many","p":"adj.","d":"a large number of something","c":"許多","s":"There were many students waiting outside the classroom door.","t":"教室門外有許多學生在等待。"},{"w":"much","p":"adj.","d":"a large amount of something","c":"許多的","s":"He didn't have much time left before the movie started.","t":"他在電影開始前沒剩多少時間了。"},{"w":"most","p":"adj.","d":"the largest amount or number of something","c":"大部份的","s":"most of the students passed the difficult math test.","t":"大部份的學生都通過了這次困難的數學考試。"},{"w":"several","p":"adj.","d":"more than two or three, but not very many","c":"幾個的","s":"She tried several different colors before choosing the right one.","t":"她嘗試了幾種不同的顏色才選出對的那一個。"},{"w":"some","p":"det.","d":"an unspecified number or amount of something","c":"一些","s":"Would you like some more juice with your breakfast?","t":"你早餐想再喝一些果汁嗎？"},{"w":"couple","p":"n.","d":"two people or things together","c":"對","s":"A couple of birds landed gently on the windowsill.","t":"一對鳥輕輕地降落在窗台上。"},{"w":"pair","p":"n.","d":"two things of the same kind used together","c":"一對","s":"He bought a new pair of shoes for the school dance.","t":"他為了學校舞會買了一雙新鞋。"},{"w":"dozen","p":"n.","d":"a group of twelve","c":"一打","s":"She ordered a dozen fresh eggs from the local farm.","t":"她向當地農場訂了一打新鮮的雞蛋。"},{"w":"drop","p":"n.","d":"a small amount of liquid","c":"一滴","s":"Just one drop of rain fell before the sky cleared up.","t":"天空放晴前只下了一滴雨。"},{"w":"piece","p":"n.","d":"a part of something larger","c":"一張(片、塊)","s":"She tore off a small piece of paper for her note.","t":"她撕下一小張紙來寫她的便條。"},{"w":"pile","p":"v.","d":"to put things in a stack on top of each other","c":"堆起","s":"He began to pile his old textbooks onto the desk.","t":"他開始把他的舊課本堆在書桌上。"},{"w":"loaf","p":"n.","d":"a shaped mass of baked bread","c":"條(吐司)","s":"She bought a fresh loaf of bread from the bakery.","t":"她從麵包店買了一條新鮮的麵包。"},{"w":"bundle","p":"n.","d":"a group of things tied or wrapped together","c":"捆","s":"He carried a bundle of old newspapers out to the recycling bin.","t":"他拿著一捆舊報紙到回收桶。"},{"w":"any","p":"adj.","d":"used to refer to one or some of a thing, no matter which","c":"任何一個","s":"Do you have any questions about tonight's homework?","t":"你對今晚的作業有任何問題嗎？"},{"w":"anyone","p":"n.","d":"any person at all","c":"任何人","s":"Could anyone help me carry these heavy boxes upstairs?","t":"有任何人可以幫我把這些沉重的箱子搬上樓嗎？"},{"w":"anything","p":"n.","d":"any thing at all","c":"任何事情","s":"She didn't say anything during the entire bus ride home.","t":"她整段搭公車回家的路上什麼都沒說。"},{"w":"anywhere","p":"adv.","d":"in or to any place at all","c":"任何地方","s":"He couldn't find his missing glasses anywhere in the house.","t":"他在家裡任何地方都找不到他遺失的眼鏡。"},{"w":"each","p":"det.","d":"used to refer to every individual thing in a group","c":"每個","s":"The teacher gave each student a small gift before vacation.","t":"老師在放假前給每個學生一份小禮物。"},{"w":"every","p":"det.","d":"used to refer to all members of a group without exception","c":"每一個","s":"She checks her homework every single night before bed.","t":"她每天晚上睡前都會檢查她的作業。"},{"w":"everyone","p":"n.","d":"every person in a group","c":"每個人","s":"everyone cheered loudly when the home team scored the winning goal.","t":"主隊得到致勝球時每個人都大聲歡呼。"},{"w":"everything","p":"n.","d":"all things; every single thing","c":"每件事情","s":"She packed everything she needed for the weekend trip.","t":"她把週末旅行需要的每件東西都打包好了。"},{"w":"everywhere","p":"adv.","d":"in or to every place","c":"到處","s":"Colorful autumn leaves had fallen everywhere across the quiet park.","t":"色彩鮮豔的秋葉飄落在這座安靜公園的到處。"},{"w":"nobody","p":"pron.","d":"not anybody; no person","c":"沒有人","s":"nobody answered when she knocked on the old front door.","t":"她敲了那扇老舊前門時，沒有人回應。"},{"w":"none","p":"pron.","d":"not one of a group of people or things","c":"沒有一個(人或 物)","s":"none of the answers on the quiz seemed correct to him.","t":"這次小考的答案他覺得沒有一個是對的。"},{"w":"nothing","p":"n.","d":"not anything; no single thing","c":"沒什麼","s":"There was nothing left in the fridge except an old apple.","t":"冰箱裡除了一顆舊蘋果以外什麼都沒有。"},{"w":"someone","p":"n.","d":"an unspecified or unknown person","c":"某人","s":"someone left a warm jacket hanging by the classroom door.","t":"某人把一件溫暖的外套留在教室門邊。"},{"w":"something","p":"n.","d":"an unspecified or unknown thing","c":"某事","s":"She could smell something delicious coming from the kitchen.","t":"她可以聞到廚房裡飄來某種美味的味道。"},{"w":"sometimes","p":"adv.","d":"on certain occasions, but not always","c":"有時候","s":"He sometimes walks to school when the weather is nice.","t":"天氣好的時候他有時候會走路去上學。"},{"w":"somewhere","p":"adv.","d":"in, at, or to an unspecified place","c":"某處","s":"She hid the birthday gift somewhere inside the closet.","t":"她把生日禮物藏在衣櫥裡的某處。"}]},{"unit":48,"theme":"Function Words, Part 1 (功能詞 一)","cards":[{"w":"what","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask for information about something","c":"什麼","s":"what is your favorite subject at school this year?","t":"你今年在學校最喜歡的科目是什麼？"},{"w":"when","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask about the time something happens","c":"何時","s":"when does the school bus usually arrive in the morning?","t":"校車通常什麼時候在早上抵達？"},{"w":"where","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask about a place or location","c":"在哪裡","s":"where did you leave your umbrella this afternoon?","t":"你今天下午把雨傘放在哪裡了？"},{"w":"whether","p":"interrog.","d":"used to express a choice between two possibilities","c":"是否","s":"She couldn't decide whether to take the bus or walk home.","t":"她無法決定是否要搭公車還是走路回家。"},{"w":"which","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask someone to choose from a set of things","c":"哪個","s":"which jacket do you want to wear to the party tonight?","t":"你今晚要穿哪件外套去派對？"},{"w":"who","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask about the identity of a person","c":"誰","s":"who is going to lead the class project this semester?","t":"這學期誰要帶領班級的專題報告？"},{"w":"whose","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask who owns something","c":"誰的","s":"whose backpack is this sitting by the classroom door?","t":"教室門邊的這個背包是誰的？"},{"w":"why","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask the reason for something","c":"為什麼","s":"why did the teacher cancel today's science experiment?","t":"老師為什麼取消了今天的科學實驗？"},{"w":"how","p":"interrog.","d":"used to ask about the way something is done","c":"如何","s":"how did she manage to finish all her homework so fast?","t":"她是如何那麼快完成所有作業的？"},{"w":"we","p":"pron.","d":"used by a speaker to refer to themselves and others","c":"我們","s":"we are planning a surprise party for our teacher.","t":"我們正在為老師計畫一場驚喜派對。"},{"w":"you","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer to the person being spoken to","c":"你（們）","s":"Did you remember to bring your gym clothes today?","t":"你今天記得帶體育服了嗎？"},{"w":"he","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer to a male person already mentioned","c":"他","s":"My brother said he would help me with my math homework.","t":"我哥哥說他會幫我做數學作業。"},{"w":"she","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer to a female person already mentioned","c":"她","s":"My sister told me she would be late for dinner tonight.","t":"我姊姊告訴我她今晚晚餐會遲到。"},{"w":"it","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer to a thing already mentioned","c":"它(牠)","s":"The cat was hungry, so it meowed loudly by the door.","t":"這隻貓很餓，所以牠在門邊大聲地叫。"},{"w":"they","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer to two or more people or things","c":"他們","s":"My cousins called to say they would visit next weekend.","t":"我的表親們打電話來說他們下週末會來拜訪。"},{"w":"myself","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer back to the speaker","c":"我自己","s":"I made this birthday card all by myself last night.","t":"我昨晚自己一個人做了這張生日卡片。"},{"w":"themselves","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer back to the people already mentioned","c":"他們自己","s":"The twins cleaned their messy room all by themselves.","t":"這對雙胞胎自己把凌亂的房間打掃乾淨了。"},{"w":"oneself","p":"pron.","d":"used to refer back to a person in general","c":"自己","s":"Learning to solve a problem by oneself builds real confidence.","t":"學會自己解決問題能建立真正的自信。"},{"w":"her","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a female already mentioned","c":"她的","s":"She forgot to bring her lunch box to school today.","t":"她今天忘了帶她的便當盒去學校。"},{"w":"his","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a male already mentioned","c":"他的","s":"He left his bicycle parked outside the library entrance.","t":"他把他的自行車停在圖書館入口外面。"},{"w":"its","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a thing or animal already mentioned","c":"它的","s":"The little bird built its nest high in the old tree.","t":"這隻小鳥把牠的巢築在那棵老樹的高處。"},{"w":"my","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the speaker","c":"我的","s":"I left my jacket on the chair by the front door.","t":"我把我的外套留在前門旁的椅子上。"},{"w":"our","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the speaker and others","c":"我們的","s":"We decorated our classroom with colorful paper lanterns.","t":"我們用色彩鮮豔的紙燈籠裝飾了我們的教室。"},{"w":"their","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to people or things already mentioned","c":"他們的","s":"The students packed their bags before the field trip.","t":"學生們在校外教學前打包好他們的背包。"},{"w":"your","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the person being spoken to","c":"你的","s":"Please remember to bring your permission slip tomorrow.","t":"請記得明天帶你的家長同意書。"},{"w":"do","p":"aux.","d":"used with another verb to form questions or negatives","c":"做（助動詞）","s":"do you usually walk to school or take the bus?","t":"你通常是走路去上學還是搭公車？"},{"w":"may","p":"aux.","d":"used to ask for or give permission","c":"可以","s":"may I borrow your pencil for a moment, please?","t":"我可以借用一下你的鉛筆嗎？"},{"w":"must","p":"aux.","d":"used to say something is necessary","c":"必須","s":"Students must hand in their reports by Friday afternoon.","t":"學生必須在星期五下午前交報告。"},{"w":"shall","p":"aux.","d":"used to talk about the future or to make a suggestion","c":"將要","s":"shall we begin the meeting now that everyone has arrived?","t":"既然大家都到了，我們現在開始開會好嗎？"},{"w":"should","p":"aux.","d":"used to say what is the right or expected thing to do","c":"應該","s":"You should finish your vegetables before having any dessert.","t":"你應該先吃完蔬菜才能吃甜點。"}]},{"unit":49,"theme":"Function Words, Part 2 (功能詞 二)","cards":[{"w":"and","p":"conj.","d":"used to connect words or ideas of equal importance","c":"和","s":"She packed her lunch and her water bottle before leaving.","t":"她在出門前打包了午餐和水壺。"},{"w":"although","p":"conj.","d":"used to introduce a contrasting idea","c":"雖然","s":"although it was raining, the team still practiced outside.","t":"雖然下著雨，這支隊伍仍然在戶外練習。"},{"w":"but","p":"conj.","d":"used to introduce something that contrasts with what was just said","c":"但是","s":"He wanted to join the trip, but he had too much homework.","t":"他想參加這次旅行，但是他有太多作業要做。"},{"w":"because","p":"conj.","d":"used to give a reason for something","c":"因為","s":"She stayed inside because the weather was too cold.","t":"她待在室內，因為天氣太冷了。"},{"w":"if","p":"conj.","d":"used to talk about something that might happen","c":"假如","s":"if it stops raining, we can play outside later.","t":"假如雨停了，我們稍後就可以去外面玩。"},{"w":"neither","p":"conj.","d":"used with nor to say not one and not the other","c":"兩者都不","s":"neither of the two answers seemed correct to the students.","t":"這兩個答案在學生看來都不對。"},{"w":"nor","p":"conj.","d":"used after neither to introduce a second negative choice","c":"也不","s":"She likes neither coffee nor tea in the morning.","t":"她早上既不喜歡咖啡也不喜歡茶。"},{"w":"or","p":"conj.","d":"used to connect two possible choices","c":"或","s":"Would you rather have pizza or pasta for dinner tonight?","t":"你今晚晚餐想吃披薩還是義大利麵？"},{"w":"than","p":"conj.","d":"used to compare two things","c":"比","s":"Her brother is much taller than she is this year.","t":"她哥哥今年比她高很多。"},{"w":"while","p":"conj.","d":"used to say that two things happen at the same time","c":"當…時","s":"She read a book while waiting for the bus to arrive.","t":"她在等公車的時候看了一本書。"},{"w":"command","p":"n.","d":"an order given by someone in authority","c":"命令","s":"The soldiers followed every command given by their captain.","t":"士兵們服從隊長下達的每一個命令。"},{"w":"order","p":"n.","d":"an instruction that must be obeyed","c":"命令","s":"The teacher gave a clear order to line up quietly.","t":"老師下達了明確的命令，要大家安靜排隊。"},{"w":"fact","p":"n.","d":"a piece of information that is true","c":"事實","s":"It is a fact that the earth orbits the sun.","t":"地球繞著太陽運行是一個事實。"},{"w":"truth","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being true or factual","c":"事實","s":"She finally told her parents the whole truth about the broken vase.","t":"她終於把打破花瓶的整件事實告訴了父母。"},{"w":"idea","p":"n.","d":"a thought or plan formed in the mind","c":"主意","s":"She had a great idea for the class art project.","t":"她對班級美術作業有一個很棒的主意。"},{"w":"thought","p":"n.","d":"something that someone thinks; an idea","c":"想法","s":"He shared his thought about the new school schedule.","t":"他分享了他對新課表的想法。"},{"w":"opinion","p":"n.","d":"a personal belief or view about something","c":"意見","s":"The teacher asked each student to share an opinion on the topic.","t":"老師要求每位學生對這個主題發表意見。"},{"w":"topic","p":"n.","d":"the subject being discussed or written about","c":"主題","s":"Our group chose pollution as the topic for our report.","t":"我們這組選了污染當作報告的主題。"},{"w":"title","p":"n.","d":"the name given to a book, movie, or piece of work","c":"標題","s":"She couldn't remember the title of her favorite childhood book.","t":"她想不起來她最喜歡的童年書籍的標題。"},{"w":"beginning","p":"n.","d":"the point where something starts","c":"開始","s":"The story felt a little slow at the beginning.","t":"這個故事在開始的時候感覺有點慢。"},{"w":"end","p":"n.","d":"the final part of something","c":"末端","s":"Everyone cheered loudly at the end of the exciting race.","t":"在這場刺激的比賽結束時，大家都大聲歡呼。"},{"w":"cause","p":"n.","d":"something that makes an event happen","c":"原因","s":"Doctors are still trying to find the cause of his illness.","t":"醫生仍在試圖找出他生病的原因。"},{"w":"reason","p":"n.","d":"an explanation for why something happens","c":"原因","s":"She gave a good reason for missing class yesterday.","t":"她對昨天缺課給了一個很好的理由。"},{"w":"result","p":"n.","d":"something that happens because of an earlier action","c":"結果","s":"The result of the experiment surprised everyone in class.","t":"這個實驗的結果讓全班都感到驚訝。"},{"w":"loser","p":"n.","d":"a person who does not win a contest or game","c":"輸家","s":"Even the loser of the match received a small medal.","t":"即使是這場比賽的輸家也得到了一個小獎牌。"},{"w":"winner","p":"n.","d":"a person who wins a contest or game","c":"贏家","s":"The winner of the spelling bee received a shiny trophy.","t":"拼字比賽的贏家得到了一個閃亮的獎盃。"},{"w":"men's room","p":"n.","d":"a public restroom for men","c":"男廁","s":"He asked the waiter where to find the men's room.","t":"他問服務生男廁在哪裡。"},{"w":"women's room","p":"n.","d":"a public restroom for women","c":"女廁","s":"She waited in line outside the women's room at the theater.","t":"她在劇院的女廁外排隊等候。"},{"w":"noise","p":"n.","d":"a loud or unpleasant sound","c":"噪音","s":"A strange noise came from the basement late at night.","t":"深夜時地下室傳出一個奇怪的噪音。"},{"w":"silence","p":"n.","d":"the complete absence of sound","c":"寂靜","s":"The library was filled with quiet silence during exam week.","t":"考試週期間，圖書館裡一片寂靜。"}]},{"unit":50,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 1 (常見名詞 一)","cards":[{"w":"top","p":"n.","d":"the highest part of something","c":"頂部；頭頂","s":"What was at the top of the mountain? There was a small temple.","t":"山頂上有什麼？ 有一座小廟。"},{"w":"bottom","p":"n.","d":"the lowest part of something","c":"底部","s":"What was at the bottom of the box? There were some old photos.","t":"箱子底部有什麼？ 有一些舊照片。"},{"w":"accident","p":"n.","d":"something bad that happens when nobody plans it","c":"車禍；意外事件","s":"Why were you late? There was a car accident on the road.","t":"你為什麼遲到？ 路上發生了一場車禍。"},{"w":"action","p":"n.","d":"something that you do","c":"行動；活動","s":"What should we do about the trash on the beach? We should take action and pay attention to the problem.","t":"海灘上的垃圾我們該怎麼辦？ 我們應該採取行動並關注這個問題。"},{"w":"activity","p":"n.","d":"something you do for fun or to learn","c":"活動","s":"What was your favorite activity at camp? There were many, but I liked swimming best.","t":"夏令營裡你最喜歡的活動是什麼？ 活動很多，但我最喜歡游泳。"},{"w":"address","p":"n.","d":"the number and street name of the place where someone lives","c":"地址；演講","s":"Did you write the address on the envelope? Yes. I paid attention to every word.","t":"你在信封上寫地址了嗎？ 寫了。我每個字都很注意。"},{"w":"advice","p":"n.","d":"words that tell someone what they should do","c":"忠告；勸告","s":"Can you give me some advice? Sure. Here's a piece of advice: study a little every day.","t":"你可以給我一些建議嗎？ 當然。給你一個建議：每天念一點書。"},{"w":"age","p":"n.","d":"how old a person or thing is","c":"年齡","s":"What was the age of the oldest person at the party? There was a man who was ninety-five.","t":"派對上年紀最大的人幾歲？ 有一位九十五歲的男士。"},{"w":"all","p":"n.","d":"every one, or the whole amount","c":"全部","s":"Did you eat the cake? Yes, I ate it all. There isn't any left.","t":"你吃了蛋糕嗎？ 對，我全部吃完了。一點都不剩。"},{"w":"all","p":"adj.","d":"every one of; the whole of","c":"全部的","s":"Were there many students at the meeting? Yes. All the students were there.","t":"會議上有很多學生嗎？ 有。所有的學生都在。"},{"w":"alphabet","p":"n.","d":"all the letters of a language in order, like A to Z","c":"字母","s":"How many letters are there in the English alphabet? There are twenty-six.","t":"英文字母有幾個字母？ 有二十六個。"},{"w":"answer","p":"n.","d":"what you say or write when someone asks a question","c":"回答；答案","s":"Do you know the answer? Yes. I paid attention to the teacher.","t":"你知道答案嗎？ 知道。我有專心聽老師說話。"},{"w":"area","p":"n.","d":"a part of a place","c":"區域","s":"What was in this area before? There was a big farm here.","t":"這個區域以前有什麼？ 這裡以前有一座大農場。"},{"w":"army","p":"n.","d":"a large group of soldiers who fight on land","c":"軍隊；大群","s":"Were there many soldiers in the army? Yes. There were thousands of them.","t":"那支軍隊裡有很多士兵嗎？ 有。有好幾千人。"},{"w":"attention","p":"n.","d":"the act of watching or listening carefully","c":"注意；專心","s":"Why did the teacher stop the class? Nobody was paying attention. She needed some quiet.","t":"老師為什麼停課？ 沒有人在注意聽。她需要一點安靜。"},{"w":"bomb","p":"n.","d":"a thing that blows up and can hurt people","c":"炸彈","s":"What happened at the airport? There was a bomb in a bag, but the police found it.","t":"機場發生了什麼事？ 有一個包包裡有炸彈，但警察發現了。"},{"w":"both","p":"n.","d":"the two; one and also the other","c":"兩方；兩者","s":"Do you want tea or coffee? Both, please. I want some tea and some coffee.","t":"你要茶還是咖啡？ 兩個都要，謝謝。我要一些茶和一些咖啡。"},{"w":"branch","p":"n.","d":"a part of a tree that grows out from the main part","c":"樹枝；分店","s":"What was on the branch of the tree? There was a bird's nest.","t":"樹枝上有什麼？ 有一個鳥巢。"},{"w":"brick","p":"n.","d":"a hard block used to build walls and houses","c":"磚頭","s":"What were the old houses made of? They were made of bricks.","t":"那些老房子是用什麼做的？ 是用磚頭蓋的。"},{"w":"care","p":"n.","d":"the act of looking after someone or something","c":"關心；照顧","s":"Who will take care of your dog? My neighbor will.","t":"誰會照顧你的狗？ 我的鄰居會。"},{"w":"case","p":"n.","d":"a problem or crime that the police try to solve","c":"案件","s":"What did the police find in the case? There were many clues.","t":"警察在這個案件中發現了什麼？ 有很多線索。"},{"w":"center","p":"n.","d":"the middle of something","c":"中心；中央","s":"What was in the center of the park? There was a big fountain.","t":"公園的中央有什麼？ 有一座大噴水池。"},{"w":"chance","p":"n.","d":"a time when you can do something; luck","c":"運氣；機會","s":"Did you have a chance to meet the singer? Yes. I had a chance to take a photo with her.","t":"你有機會見到那位歌手嗎？ 有。我有機會和她合照。"},{"w":"choice","p":"n.","d":"the thing you pick from two or more things","c":"抉擇；選擇","s":"Which school will you go to? It's a hard choice. I have to make a choice soon.","t":"你會去哪一所學校？ 這是個困難的選擇。我很快就得做選擇。"},{"w":"conversation","p":"n.","d":"a talk between two or more people","c":"對話","s":"Was there a long conversation at dinner? Yes. There was lots of laughing, too.","t":"晚餐時有很長的對話嗎？ 有。也有很多笑聲。"},{"w":"courage","p":"n.","d":"the feeling that lets you do something even when you are afraid","c":"勇氣","s":"Why is the firefighter a hero? He has a lot of courage. He isn't afraid of fire.","t":"那位消防員為什麼是英雄？ 他很有勇氣。他不怕火。"},{"w":"crime","p":"n.","d":"something bad that is against the law","c":"罪；犯罪行為","s":"Was there a crime in the town last night? Yes. There was a robbery at the bank.","t":"昨晚鎮上發生了犯罪事件嗎？ 有。銀行發生了搶案。"},{"w":"crowd","p":"n.","d":"a large group of people in one place","c":"群眾","s":"Why couldn't you see the show? There was a big crowd in front of me.","t":"你為什麼看不到表演？ 我前面有一大群人。"},{"w":"culture","p":"n.","d":"the way of life, ideas, and art of a group of people","c":"文化","s":"What do you like about Japanese culture? I like the food and the festivals.","t":"你喜歡日本文化的什麼？ 我喜歡那裡的食物和節慶。"},{"w":"curve","p":"n.","d":"a line or road that bends","c":"曲線；彎道","s":"Why should we drive slowly here? There's a sharp curve. Pay attention to the road.","t":"我們為什麼要在這裡開慢一點？ 這裡有個急彎。注意路況。"},{"w":"custom","p":"n.","d":"something people in a place have done for a long time","c":"習俗","s":"What is a Taiwanese New Year custom? Children get some lucky money in red envelopes.","t":"台灣過年有什麼習俗？ 小孩會拿到裝在紅包裡的壓歲錢。"},{"w":"danger","p":"n.","d":"something that may hurt you","c":"危險","s":"Was there any danger on the hike? Yes. There were some snakes on the path.","t":"健行時有任何危險嗎？ 有。路上有一些蛇。"}]},{"unit":51,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 2 (常見名詞 二)","cards":[{"w":"death","p":"n.","d":"the end of life","c":"死亡","s":"Have you ever read a story about the death of a pet? Yes. It was very sad.","t":"你讀過關於寵物死亡的故事嗎？ 讀過。非常悲傷。"},{"w":"decision","p":"n.","d":"a choice you make after thinking","c":"決定","s":"Which club will you join? I haven't made a decision yet.","t":"你要參加哪個社團？ 我還沒做決定。"},{"w":"desire","p":"n.","d":"a strong feeling of wanting something","c":"渴望","s":"Have you ever had a strong desire to travel? Yes. I really want to visit Europe.","t":"你曾經有過強烈的旅行渴望嗎？ 有。我真的很想去歐洲。"},{"w":"difference","p":"n.","d":"the way two things are not the same","c":"差別","s":"What's the difference between a frog and a toad? A frog has smooth skin.","t":"青蛙和蟾蜍之間有什麼差別？ 青蛙的皮膚是光滑的。"},{"w":"difficulty","p":"n.","d":"a problem; something that is hard to do","c":"難處；困難","s":"Have you ever had any difficulty with math? Yes. Fractions were hard for me.","t":"你在數學上曾經遇過任何困難嗎？ 有。分數對我來說很難。"},{"w":"discussion","p":"n.","d":"a talk about something with other people","c":"討論","s":"What did your class do today? We had a discussion about the school trip.","t":"你們班今天做了什麼？ 我們針對校外旅行進行了討論。"},{"w":"distance","p":"n.","d":"how far it is between two places","c":"距離","s":"What's the distance between Taipei and Kaohsiung? It's about 350 kilometers.","t":"台北和高雄之間的距離是多少？ 大約三百五十公里。"},{"w":"dot","p":"n.","d":"a very small round mark","c":"點","s":"What's between the two words in an e-mail address? There's a dot, like \"gmail dot com.\"","t":"電子郵件地址中兩個字之間是什麼？ 有一個點，像是「gmail dot com」。"},{"w":"earthquake","p":"n.","d":"a sudden strong shaking of the ground","c":"地震","s":"Have you ever felt an earthquake? Yes. Many times. Taiwan has a lot of them.","t":"你曾經感受過地震嗎？ 有。很多次。台灣常常地震。"},{"w":"edge","p":"n.","d":"the outside end or side of something","c":"邊緣","s":"Where did you put the cup? Between the plate and the edge of the table. Don't knock it off.","t":"你把杯子放在哪裡？ 在盤子和桌子邊緣之間。別把它撞掉了。"},{"w":"effort","p":"n.","d":"the hard work you do to try to do something","c":"努力","s":"How did you pass the test? I made a big effort. I studied every day.","t":"你是怎麼通過考試的？ 我付出了很大的努力。我每天都讀書。"},{"w":"energy","p":"n.","d":"the power to be active and do things","c":"精力；能量","s":"Have you ever seen a kid with so much energy? No! He runs all day.","t":"你曾經看過這麼有精力的小孩嗎？ 沒有！他整天都在跑。"},{"w":"engine","p":"n.","d":"the part of a car or machine that makes it move","c":"引擎","s":"Has the car engine ever stopped on the highway? Yes, once. It was scary.","t":"這輛車的引擎曾經在高速公路上熄火過嗎？ 有，一次。很可怕。"},{"w":"environment","p":"n.","d":"the air, water, and land around us","c":"環境","s":"How can we help the environment? We can make an effort to recycle.","t":"我們要怎麼幫助環境？ 我們可以努力做回收。"},{"w":"error","p":"n.","d":"something that is wrong; a mistake","c":"錯誤；差錯","s":"Why did your computer stop? It had an error. I need to restart it.","t":"你的電腦為什麼停了？ 它出現錯誤。我需要重新開機。"},{"w":"event","p":"n.","d":"something important that happens","c":"事件；活動","s":"Have you ever joined a big sports event? Yes. I ran in a marathon last year.","t":"你曾經參加過大型運動賽事嗎？ 參加過。我去年跑了一場馬拉松。"},{"w":"example","p":"n.","d":"one thing that shows what others are like","c":"例子","s":"Can you give me an example of the difference between \"a\" and \"an\"? Sure. \"A cat\" and \"an apple.\"","t":"你可以舉個例子說明 a 和 an 之間的差別嗎？ 當然。「a cat」和「an apple」。"},{"w":"excuse","p":"n.","d":"a reason you give for doing something wrong","c":"藉口","s":"Why was Ben late again? He made an excuse. He said his clock was broken.","t":"班為什麼又遲到了？ 他找了個藉口。他說他的時鐘壞了。"},{"w":"experience","p":"n.","d":"something that happens to you","c":"經驗","s":"Have you ever had a scary experience? Yes. I got lost in the mountains once.","t":"你曾經有過可怕的經驗嗎？ 有。我曾經在山裡迷路。"},{"w":"fault","p":"n.","d":"a mistake that someone is to blame for","c":"過錯","s":"Who broke the vase? It was my fault. I made a mistake.","t":"誰打破了花瓶？ 是我的錯。我犯了一個錯。"},{"w":"flat tire","p":"n.","d":"a tire with no air in it","c":"爆胎","s":"Have you ever had a flat tire? Yes. My bike had one last week.","t":"你曾經爆胎過嗎？ 有。我的腳踏車上週爆胎了。"},{"w":"freedom","p":"n.","d":"being able to do what you want","c":"自由","s":"What's the difference between a pet bird and a wild bird? A wild bird has freedom. It can fly anywhere.","t":"寵物鳥和野鳥之間有什麼差別？ 野鳥有自由。牠可以飛到任何地方。"},{"w":"friendship","p":"n.","d":"the feeling between people who are friends","c":"友誼","s":"Have you ever lost a friendship? Yes. My best friend moved away.","t":"你曾經失去過一段友誼嗎？ 有。我最好的朋友搬走了。"},{"w":"front","p":"n.","d":"the part of something that faces forward","c":"前面；正面","s":"Where are you sitting? I'm sitting between Amy and Ben in the front row.","t":"你坐在哪裡？ 我坐在前排艾咪和班的中間。"},{"w":"fun","p":"n.","d":"a good time; something you enjoy","c":"樂趣；娛樂","s":"How was the party? We had a lot of fun.","t":"派對怎麼樣？ 我們玩得很開心。"},{"w":"game","p":"n.","d":"something you play, often with rules","c":"遊戲","s":"What did you do at the party? We played a game and had fun.","t":"你們在派對上做了什麼？ 我們玩了一個遊戲，玩得很開心。"},{"w":"gesture","p":"n.","d":"a move of your hand or body that shows what you mean","c":"姿勢；手勢","s":"What's the difference between these two gestures? One means \"OK,\" and the other means \"good.\"","t":"這兩個手勢之間有什麼差別？ 一個代表「OK」，另一個代表「很好」。"},{"w":"goal","p":"n.","d":"something you want to do; a point in soccer","c":"目標；球門","s":"Have you ever scored a goal in soccer? Yes. I scored two last week.","t":"你曾經在足球比賽中射進過球嗎？ 有。我上週進了兩球。"},{"w":"guy","p":"n.","d":"a man or boy","c":"傢伙；人(口語)","s":"Who is the guy between Ben and Tom? That's Mike, our new classmate.","t":"站在班和湯姆中間的那個傢伙是誰？ 那是麥克，我們的新同學。"},{"w":"habit","p":"n.","d":"something you do again and again","c":"習慣","s":"Do you exercise every day? Yes. I have a good habit of jogging every morning.","t":"你每天運動嗎？ 對。我有每天早上慢跑的好習慣。"},{"w":"haircut","p":"n.","d":"the act of cutting your hair","c":"理髮","s":"Have you had a haircut? You look different! Yes. I went to the barber yesterday.","t":"你剪頭髮了嗎？你看起來不一樣了！ 剪了。我昨天去了理髮店。"},{"w":"half","p":"n.","d":"one of two equal parts of something","c":"一半","s":"How should we share the cake? Let's cut it between us. You take one half.","t":"我們該怎麼分蛋糕？ 我們兩個人分。你拿一半。"},{"w":"hole","p":"n.","d":"an empty space or opening in something","c":"洞","s":"Has your sock ever had a hole in it? Yes. My toe came out!","t":"你的襪子曾經破洞嗎？ 有。我的腳趾跑出來了！"},{"w":"holiday","p":"n.","d":"a day when people do not go to work or school","c":"假日","s":"What did you do during the holiday? I took a trip to Kenting.","t":"你假期期間做了什麼？ 我去墾丁旅行。"}]},{"unit":52,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 3 (常見名詞 三)","cards":[{"w":"hunger","p":"n.","d":"the feeling of needing food","c":"饑餓","s":"Why do some children need help? Their hunger is a big problem. It's important to give them food.","t":"為什麼有些孩子需要幫助？ 他們的饑餓是很大的問題。給他們食物很重要。"},{"w":"importance","p":"n.","d":"how important something is","c":"重要性","s":"What did the teacher talk about? The importance of sleep. It's important to sleep eight hours.","t":"老師講了什麼？ 睡眠的重要性。睡八小時很重要。"},{"w":"influence","p":"n.","d":"the power to change how people think or act","c":"影響","s":"What does \"influence\" mean? It means the power to change people or things.","t":"influence 是什麼意思？ 意思是改變人或事物的力量（影響）。"},{"w":"invitation","p":"n.","d":"words or a card asking someone to come to something","c":"邀請","s":"Did you get an invitation to Amy's party? Yes. It's fun to go to parties.","t":"你收到艾咪派對的邀請了嗎？ 收到了。參加派對很好玩。"},{"w":"item","p":"n.","d":"one thing in a list or group","c":"項目","s":"How many items did you buy? Ten. We had to wait in line for a long time.","t":"你買了幾件商品？ 十件。我們排隊排了很久。"},{"w":"joke","p":"n.","d":"something you say to make people laugh","c":"笑話","s":"Why is everyone laughing? Ben told a funny joke.","t":"大家為什麼在笑？ 班說了一個好笑的笑話。"},{"w":"kingdom","p":"n.","d":"a country that has a king or queen","c":"王國","s":"What does \"kingdom\" mean? It means a country with a king or queen.","t":"kingdom 是什麼意思？ 意思是有國王或女王的國家（王國）。"},{"w":"kiss","p":"n.","d":"a touch with the lips to show love","c":"親吻","s":"What did Mom do before you left? She gave me a kiss on the cheek.","t":"你出門前媽媽做了什麼？ 她在我臉頰上親了一下。"},{"w":"language","p":"n.","d":"the words people in a country speak and write","c":"語言","s":"Why do you study Japanese? It's fun to learn a new language.","t":"你為什麼學日文？ 學一種新語言很有趣。"},{"w":"law","p":"n.","d":"a rule that everyone in a country must follow","c":"法律","s":"Is it OK to ride a scooter without a helmet? No. It's against the law. It's important to wear one.","t":"騎機車不戴安全帽可以嗎？ 不行。那違反法律。戴安全帽很重要。"},{"w":"level","p":"n.","d":"how high or how good something is; one part of a game","c":"程度；關卡","s":"What does \"level 3\" mean in this game? It means you're in the third part.","t":"這個遊戲的「第三關」是什麼意思？ 意思是你在第三個階段。"},{"w":"life","p":"n.","d":"the time when a person is alive; the way someone lives","c":"生活；人生","s":"What do you want in your life? It's important to be happy and healthy.","t":"你在人生中想要什麼？ 快樂和健康很重要。"},{"w":"light","p":"n.","d":"something that lets you see, like the sun or a lamp","c":"燈光；光線","s":"It's dark in here. Please turn on the light.","t":"這裡好暗。 請把燈打開。"},{"w":"line","p":"n.","d":"a long thin mark; a row of people waiting","c":"線；隊伍","s":"Where should we stand? Please wait in line behind the yellow mark.","t":"我們應該站在哪裡？ 請在黃色記號後面排隊等候。"},{"w":"liquid","p":"n.","d":"something that flows like water","c":"液體","s":"What does \"liquid\" mean? It means something like water or milk.","t":"liquid 是什麼意思？ 意思是像水或牛奶那樣的東西（液體）。"},{"w":"locker","p":"n.","d":"a small metal closet with a lock for keeping your things","c":"(加鎖的)置物櫃","s":"Where do you keep your books? In my locker. It's easy to find them there.","t":"你把書放在哪裡？ 放在我的置物櫃裡。在那裡很容易找到。"},{"w":"love","p":"n.","d":"a very strong feeling of liking someone","c":"愛","s":"What does \"puppy love\" mean? It means young love, like a first crush.","t":"puppy love 是什麼意思？ 意思是年輕時的愛，像是初戀。"},{"w":"machine","p":"n.","d":"a thing with moving parts that does work","c":"機器","s":"How do you use this machine? It's easy to use. Just press this button.","t":"這台機器怎麼用？ 很容易用。只要按這個按鈕。"},{"w":"manner","p":"n.","d":"the way you do something; polite ways of acting","c":"方法；態度；禮貌","s":"Why do people like Lucy? She has good manners. She thinks it's important to be polite.","t":"大家為什麼喜歡露西？ 她很有禮貌。她認為有禮貌很重要。"},{"w":"mark","p":"n.","d":"a small sign or spot on something","c":"記號","s":"What did you make on the map? I made a red mark on our school.","t":"你在地圖上做了什麼？ 我在我們學校的位置做了紅色記號。"},{"w":"meaning","p":"n.","d":"what a word or sign tells you","c":"意思；意涵","s":"What's the meaning of this word? What does it mean? It means \"happy.\"","t":"這個字的意思是什麼？它是什麼意思？ 意思是「快樂」。"},{"w":"medicine","p":"n.","d":"something you take to get well when you are sick","c":"藥物","s":"Is it OK to take this medicine after lunch? Yes. But it's important to drink water with it.","t":"午餐後吃這個藥可以嗎？ 可以。但配水吃很重要。"},{"w":"memory","p":"n.","d":"something you remember from the past","c":"記憶","s":"What's your best memory of elementary school? The school trip. It was fun to camp with friends.","t":"你對小學最美好的回憶是什麼？ 校外旅行。和朋友一起露營很好玩。"},{"w":"metal","p":"n.","d":"a hard material like iron or gold","c":"金屬","s":"What does \"metal\" mean? It means hard things like iron or gold.","t":"metal 是什麼意思？ 意思是像鐵或金那樣堅硬的東西（金屬）。"},{"w":"mistake","p":"n.","d":"something you do that is wrong","c":"錯誤；過失","s":"Why did you get a low grade? I made many mistakes on the test.","t":"你為什麼分數很低？ 我考試犯了很多錯誤。"}]},{"unit":53,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 4 (常見名詞 四)","cards":[{"w":"moment","p":"n.","d":"a very short period of time","c":"瞬間","s":"She paused for a moment before answering the difficult question.","t":"她在回答這個困難的問題前停頓了一瞬間。"},{"w":"motion","p":"n.","d":"the act or process of moving","c":"動作","s":"He made a quick motion with his hand to call the waiter over.","t":"他用手做了一個快速的動作叫服務生過來。"},{"w":"movement","p":"n.","d":"an act of changing position or location","c":"運動","s":"The dancer's smooth movement impressed the entire audience.","t":"這位舞者流暢的運動讓全場觀眾印象深刻。"},{"w":"mud","p":"n.","d":"soft, wet earth","c":"泥漿","s":"Her boots were covered in mud after the rainy hike.","t":"經過這場雨中健行後，她的靴子上沾滿了泥漿。"},{"w":"name","p":"n.","d":"what a person or thing is called","c":"名字","s":"She wrote her name neatly at the top of the test paper.","t":"她在考卷最上面整齊地寫上她的名字。"},{"w":"nest","p":"n.","d":"a structure built by a bird to lay its eggs in","c":"巢","s":"A pair of sparrows built a small nest under the roof.","t":"一對麻雀在屋頂下築了一個小巢。"},{"w":"owner","p":"n.","d":"a person who possesses something","c":"擁有者","s":"The owner of the small bakery greeted every customer warmly.","t":"這家小麵包店的擁有者熱情地問候每位顧客。"},{"w":"part","p":"n.","d":"a piece or section of something larger","c":"一部份","s":"She finished the hardest part of her homework first.","t":"她先完成了作業中最難的部分。"},{"w":"pattern","p":"n.","d":"a regularly repeated arrangement or design","c":"格式","s":"The fabric had a colorful pattern of stripes and dots.","t":"這塊布料有色彩鮮豔的條紋與點點圖案。"},{"w":"peace","p":"n.","d":"a state of calm without war or conflict","c":"和平","s":"After the long argument, the two friends finally made peace.","t":"經過長時間的爭吵後，這兩位朋友終於和解了。"},{"w":"picnic","p":"n.","d":"an outdoor meal eaten on the ground or grass","c":"野餐","s":"They packed sandwiches and fruit for a picnic in the park.","t":"他們準備了三明治和水果，要在公園野餐。"},{"w":"poem","p":"n.","d":"a piece of writing arranged in lines, often with rhythm","c":"詩","s":"She wrote a short poem about the changing seasons.","t":"她寫了一首關於季節變化的短詩。"},{"w":"point","p":"n.","d":"an opinion or idea expressed","c":"看法","s":"He made a strong point during the class debate.","t":"他在班級辯論中表達了一個有力的看法。"},{"w":"poison","p":"n.","d":"a substance that can cause illness or death","c":"毒藥","s":"The label warned that the chemical was a dangerous poison.","t":"標籤警告這種化學物質是危險的毒藥。"},{"w":"pollution","p":"n.","d":"harmful substances that damage the environment","c":"污染","s":"The city worked hard to reduce air pollution downtown.","t":"這座城市努力減少市區的空氣污染。"},{"w":"population","p":"n.","d":"the number of people living in a place","c":"人口","s":"The small town's population grew quickly after the new factory opened.","t":"這座小鎮的人口在新工廠開設後迅速增長。"},{"w":"position","p":"n.","d":"the place where something is located","c":"位置","s":"The coach asked him to switch to a new position on the field.","t":"教練要求他在球場上換到一個新的位置。"},{"w":"powder","p":"n.","d":"a substance made of fine, dry particles","c":"粉","s":"She sprinkled a little powder of sugar on top of the cake.","t":"她在蛋糕上撒了一點糖粉。"},{"w":"power","p":"n.","d":"the ability to control or influence","c":"力量","s":"The mayor has the power to approve new park projects.","t":"市長有權力批准新的公園計畫。"},{"w":"pressure","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of stress, or a physical force pushing on something","c":"壓力","s":"She felt a lot of pressure before the final exam this week.","t":"她在這週的期末考試前感到很大的壓力。"},{"w":"principle","p":"n.","d":"a basic rule or belief that guides behavior","c":"原則","s":"Honesty is an important principle that her parents taught her.","t":"誠實是她父母教給她的一個重要原則。"},{"w":"prize","p":"n.","d":"something given to a winner","c":"獎賞","s":"She won a small prize for the best science project.","t":"她因為最佳科學作業而贏得了一個小獎賞。"},{"w":"production","p":"n.","d":"the process of making goods","c":"產品","s":"The factory increased its production of bicycles this year.","t":"這家工廠今年增加了自行車的產量。"},{"w":"progress","p":"n.","d":"forward movement toward a goal","c":"進步","s":"She made great progress in math after weeks of extra practice.","t":"經過幾週的額外練習後，她在數學上有了很大的進步。"},{"w":"purpose","p":"n.","d":"the reason something is done","c":"目的","s":"The main purpose of the meeting was to plan the school trip.","t":"這次會議的主要目的是規劃校外教學。"},{"w":"question","p":"n.","d":"something asked to get information","c":"問題","s":"She raised her hand to ask an important question in class.","t":"她舉手在課堂上問了一個重要的問題。"},{"w":"race","p":"n.","d":"a competition to see who is fastest","c":"賽跑","s":"He trained every morning before the big school race.","t":"他在這場學校重要的賽跑前每天早上都訓練。"},{"w":"robot","p":"n.","d":"a machine that can move and perform tasks automatically","c":"機器人","s":"The students built a small robot for the science fair.","t":"學生們為科展製作了一個小機器人。"},{"w":"rubber","p":"n.","d":"a stretchy material used to make tires and other products","c":"橡膠","s":"The shoes had a thick rubber sole for extra grip.","t":"這雙鞋有厚厚的橡膠鞋底，能增加抓地力。"},{"w":"rule","p":"n.","d":"an official instruction that tells people what to do","c":"規則","s":"The teacher reminded the class about the new library rule.","t":"老師提醒全班關於新的圖書館規則。"}]},{"unit":54,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 5 (常見名詞 五)","cards":[{"w":"safety","p":"n.","d":"the state of being free from harm or danger","c":"安全性","s":"The coach reminded everyone about safety before the swim meet began.","t":"教練在游泳比賽開始前提醒大家注意安全。"},{"w":"sale","p":"n.","d":"the act of selling something","c":"出售","s":"The shop held a big sale on winter coats last weekend.","t":"這家店上週末舉行了冬季外套的大特賣。"},{"w":"sample","p":"n.","d":"a small part used to show what something is like","c":"樣本","s":"She tried a free sample of cheese at the grocery store.","t":"她在雜貨店試吃了一塊免費的起司樣本。"},{"w":"scenery","p":"n.","d":"the natural features of a landscape","c":"風景","s":"They stopped the car to admire the beautiful mountain scenery.","t":"他們停下車欣賞美麗的山中風景。"},{"w":"seat","p":"n.","d":"a place where someone can sit","c":"座位","s":"He saved a seat for his friend near the front of the bus.","t":"他在公車前面幫朋友留了一個座位。"},{"w":"secret","p":"n.","d":"something kept hidden from others","c":"秘密","s":"She promised never to tell anyone his secret.","t":"她答應永遠不告訴任何人他的秘密。"},{"w":"section","p":"n.","d":"a part of something larger","c":"節","s":"The library has a special section just for comic books.","t":"圖書館有一個專門放漫畫書的區域。"},{"w":"sentence","p":"n.","d":"a group of words that expresses a complete thought","c":"句子","s":"She underlined the most important sentence in the paragraph.","t":"她在段落中畫線標出最重要的句子。"},{"w":"service","p":"n.","d":"help or work done for someone else","c":"服務","s":"The restaurant was known for its fast, friendly service.","t":"這家餐廳以快速又友善的服務聞名。"},{"w":"shore","p":"n.","d":"the land along the edge of the sea or a lake","c":"岸邊","s":"They walked slowly along the shore collecting seashells.","t":"他們沿著岸邊慢慢散步並收集貝殼。"},{"w":"side","p":"n.","d":"a position next to or part of something","c":"旁邊","s":"She placed her backpack on the side of her desk.","t":"她把背包放在書桌的旁邊。"},{"w":"skill","p":"n.","d":"the ability to do something well","c":"技能","s":"Playing the violin well takes years of practice and skill.","t":"把小提琴拉好需要多年的練習和技能。"},{"w":"smoke","p":"n.","d":"the gray or black cloud produced by something burning","c":"煙霧","s":"Thick smoke rose from the campfire into the evening sky.","t":"濃濃的煙霧從營火升起，飄向夜空。"},{"w":"society","p":"n.","d":"a large group of people living together with shared customs","c":"社會","s":"The teacher discussed how technology has changed modern society.","t":"老師討論了科技如何改變了現代社會。"},{"w":"song","p":"n.","d":"a piece of music with words that is sung","c":"歌曲","s":"She hummed her favorite song while doing the dishes.","t":"她在洗碗時哼著她最喜歡的歌曲。"},{"w":"soul","p":"n.","d":"the spiritual part of a person","c":"靈魂","s":"The old folk tale spoke of a brave warrior's soul.","t":"這個古老的民間故事講述了一位勇敢戰士的靈魂。"},{"w":"sound","p":"n.","d":"something that can be heard","c":"聲音","s":"A strange sound came from the attic late at night.","t":"深夜時閣樓傳出一個奇怪的聲音。"},{"w":"space","p":"n.","d":"an empty area or amount of room","c":"空間","s":"They cleared a space in the garage for the new bicycles.","t":"他們在車庫裡清出一個空間放新的自行車。"},{"w":"speaker","p":"n.","d":"a person who gives a speech","c":"演講者","s":"The school invited a guest speaker to talk about careers.","t":"學校邀請了一位嘉賓演講者來談論職業生涯。"},{"w":"speech","p":"n.","d":"a formal talk given to an audience","c":"演講","s":"She practiced her graduation speech in front of the mirror.","t":"她在鏡子前練習她的畢業演講。"},{"w":"speed","p":"n.","d":"how fast something moves","c":"速度","s":"The cyclist increased her speed as she neared the finish line.","t":"這位自行車手在接近終點線時加快了她的速度。"},{"w":"spirit","p":"n.","d":"a person's mood or attitude","c":"精神","s":"The whole team showed great spirit despite the difficult loss.","t":"儘管輸了一場艱難的比賽，全隊仍展現出極佳的精神。"},{"w":"step","p":"n.","d":"a movement made by lifting the foot and putting it down","c":"步","s":"She took a careful step onto the icy sidewalk.","t":"她小心地踏出一步走上結冰的人行道。"},{"w":"story","p":"n.","d":"an account of events, real or imagined","c":"故事","s":"Grandpa told the same funny story every holiday dinner.","t":"爺爺每年節日晚餐都講同一個有趣的故事。"},{"w":"style","p":"n.","d":"a particular way of doing or making something","c":"風格","s":"Her painting style changed a lot after studying abroad.","t":"她的繪畫風格在出國留學後改變了很多。"},{"w":"success","p":"n.","d":"the achievement of a goal or aim","c":"成功","s":"Her hard work finally led to success on the final exam.","t":"她的努力最終讓她在期末考試上取得成功。"},{"w":"swing","p":"n.","d":"a seat hung by ropes or chains for swinging back and forth","c":"鞦韆","s":"The children took turns on the old wooden swing in the yard.","t":"孩子們輪流玩院子裡那個老舊的木製鞦韆。"},{"w":"symbol","p":"n.","d":"a sign or mark that represents something else","c":"符號","s":"A red heart is often used as a symbol of love.","t":"紅心常常被用作愛的符號。"},{"w":"system","p":"n.","d":"a set of connected parts working together","c":"系統","s":"The school installed a new system to track student attendance.","t":"學校安裝了一套新系統來追蹤學生的出席狀況。"},{"w":"tail","p":"n.","d":"the part at the back of an animal's body","c":"尾巴","s":"The puppy wagged its tail excitedly when she came home.","t":"她回家時，小狗興奮地搖著尾巴。"}]},{"unit":55,"theme":"Common Nouns, Part 6 (常見名詞 六)","cards":[{"w":"talent","p":"n.","d":"a natural ability to do something well","c":"天份","s":"She showed real talent for drawing at a very young age.","t":"她從很小的時候就展現出真正的繪畫天份。"},{"w":"tank","p":"n.","d":"a large container used to hold liquid or gas","c":"槽","s":"He cleaned the glass tank before adding new fish to it.","t":"他在放入新魚之前先清洗了玻璃水槽。"},{"w":"tent","p":"n.","d":"a portable shelter made of cloth","c":"帳篷","s":"They set up their tent near the edge of the campsite.","t":"他們在營地邊緣搭起了帳篷。"},{"w":"term","p":"n.","d":"a fixed period of time","c":"期限","s":"Her library book loan term ends at the end of this week.","t":"她借閱圖書館書籍的期限將在這週結束。"},{"w":"tip","p":"n.","d":"a small amount of money given for good service","c":"小費","s":"She left a generous tip for the friendly waiter.","t":"她給了這位友善的服務生一筆豐厚的小費。"},{"w":"tool","p":"n.","d":"an object used to help complete a task","c":"工具","s":"He grabbed the right tool to fix the wobbly chair leg.","t":"他拿了對的工具來修理搖晃的椅腳。"},{"w":"tower","p":"n.","d":"a tall, narrow building or structure","c":"塔","s":"They climbed to the top of the old stone tower for the view.","t":"他們爬到這座古老石塔的頂端去看風景。"},{"w":"tradition","p":"n.","d":"a custom passed down through generations","c":"傳統","s":"Baking cookies together every December is a family tradition.","t":"每年十二月一起烤餅乾是一個家族傳統。"},{"w":"trick","p":"n.","d":"a clever act meant to deceive or surprise someone","c":"詭計","s":"The magician performed an amazing trick with playing cards.","t":"這位魔術師用撲克牌表演了一個驚人的詭計。"},{"w":"trip","p":"n.","d":"a journey to a place and back","c":"旅程","s":"Their trip to the mountains lasted exactly one week.","t":"他們的山中旅程正好持續了一個星期。"},{"w":"trouble","p":"n.","d":"a problem or difficulty","c":"麻煩","s":"He got into trouble for forgetting his homework again.","t":"他又忘了帶作業，因此遇上了麻煩。"},{"w":"type","p":"n.","d":"a category of similar things","c":"類型","s":"She prefers this type of music over loud, fast songs.","t":"她比較喜歡這種類型的音樂，而不是吵鬧快節奏的歌曲。"},{"w":"vacation","p":"n.","d":"a period of rest or travel away from work or school","c":"假期","s":"They planned a relaxing vacation at the beach this summer.","t":"他們計畫今年夏天在海邊度過一個輕鬆的假期。"},{"w":"value","p":"n.","d":"the importance or worth of something","c":"價值","s":"The old painting increased in value over the years.","t":"這幅老畫的價值隨著時間增加了。"},{"w":"victory","p":"n.","d":"a successful result in a contest or battle","c":"勝利","s":"The team celebrated their victory with a big pizza party.","t":"球隊用一場盛大的披薩派對來慶祝他們的勝利。"},{"w":"vocabulary","p":"n.","d":"the set of words known and used by a person","c":"字彙","s":"Reading every night helped improve her English vocabulary.","t":"每天晚上閱讀幫助她提升了她的英語字彙。"},{"w":"war","p":"n.","d":"armed fighting between countries or groups","c":"戰爭","s":"The museum displayed old letters written during the war.","t":"博物館展示了戰爭期間寫的舊信件。"},{"w":"wedding","p":"n.","d":"a ceremony where two people get married","c":"婚禮","s":"She wore a beautiful dress to her cousin's wedding.","t":"她穿了一件漂亮的洋裝去參加表姊的婚禮。"},{"w":"will","p":"n.","d":"the determination to do something","c":"意志","s":"Her strong will helped her finish the marathon despite the pain.","t":"她堅強的意志幫助她在疼痛中仍完成了馬拉松比賽。"},{"w":"wing","p":"n.","d":"the part of a bird or insect used for flying","c":"翅膀","s":"The injured bird could not move its wing properly.","t":"這隻受傷的鳥無法正常移動牠的翅膀。"},{"w":"wood","p":"n.","d":"the hard material that trees are made of","c":"木材","s":"He used soft wood to carve a small wooden bird.","t":"他用軟木材雕刻了一隻小木鳥。"},{"w":"word","p":"n.","d":"a single unit of language with meaning","c":"字","s":"She looked up the unfamiliar word in her dictionary.","t":"她在字典裡查了這個不熟悉的字。"},{"w":"alike","p":"adj.","d":"similar to each other","c":"相似的","s":"The twins dressed alike for their first day of school.","t":"這對雙胞胎在開學第一天穿得很相似。"},{"w":"similar","p":"adj.","d":"having a resemblance to something else","c":"相似的","s":"Her new bike looked very similar to her old one.","t":"她的新自行車看起來和她的舊自行車非常相似。"},{"w":"alone","p":"adj.","d":"without other people present","c":"單獨的","s":"She likes to study alone in the quiet library upstairs.","t":"她喜歡獨自在樓上安靜的圖書館裡學習。"},{"w":"single","p":"adj.","d":"only one; not multiple","c":"單一的","s":"He answered every question with just a single word.","t":"他每個問題都只用一個字回答。"},{"w":"blank","p":"adj.","d":"having nothing written or marked on it","c":"空白的","s":"She handed in a blank page by mistake during the test.","t":"她在考試時不小心交了一張空白的紙。"},{"w":"empty","p":"adj.","d":"containing nothing inside","c":"空的","s":"The classroom looked strangely empty after everyone went home.","t":"大家回家後，教室看起來異常地空蕩蕩。"},{"w":"else","p":"adj.","d":"used to refer to something additional or different","c":"另外的","s":"Is there anything else you need before we leave?","t":"在我們離開前，你還需要其他什麼東西嗎？"},{"w":"another","p":"adj.","d":"one more; a different one","c":"另一個","s":"She asked the waiter for another glass of water.","t":"她向服務生要了另一杯水。"}]},{"unit":56,"theme":"Descriptive Adjectives, Part 9 FINAL (形容詞 九，完結)","cards":[{"w":"other","p":"adj.","d":"not the one already mentioned","c":"其他的","s":"I only have one pen left; can I borrow your other one?","t":"我只剩一支筆了，可以借用你另一支嗎？"},{"w":"excellent","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good","c":"傑出的","s":"The chef cooked an excellent meal that everyone at the table enjoyed.","t":"主廚做了一頓非常出色的餐點，餐桌上的每個人都很喜歡。"},{"w":"marvelous","p":"adj.","d":"amazing and wonderful","c":"了不起的","s":"We had a marvelous time at the beach during our summer vacation.","t":"我們在暑假去海邊玩得非常開心。"},{"w":"important","p":"adj.","d":"having great value or meaning","c":"重要的","s":"Getting enough sleep before the exam is just as important as studying.","t":"考試前睡眠充足跟讀書一樣重要。"},{"w":"main","p":"adj.","d":"the most important one","c":"主要的","s":"The main reason she joined the club was to make new friends.","t":"她加入這個社團的主要原因是想交新朋友。"},{"w":"necessary","p":"adj.","d":"needed in order to do something","c":"必要的","s":"A passport is necessary if you want to travel to another country.","t":"如果你想去其他國家旅行，護照是必要的。"},{"w":"interested","p":"adj.","d":"wanting to know more about something","c":"感興趣的","s":"My brother is very interested in space and reads about planets every night.","t":"我弟弟對太空非常感興趣，每天晚上都會讀關於行星的書。"},{"w":"interesting","p":"adj.","d":"making you want to pay attention","c":"有趣的","s":"The museum guide told us an interesting story about an ancient queen.","t":"博物館的導覽員跟我們講了一個關於古代皇后的有趣故事。"},{"w":"pop","p":"adj.","d":"popular, especially in music","c":"流行的","s":"She listens to pop music on the bus every morning before school.","t":"她每天早上上學前在公車上都聽流行音樂。"},{"w":"popular","p":"adj.","d":"liked by a lot of people","c":"受歡迎的","s":"That new bubble tea shop near our school is incredibly popular right now.","t":"我們學校附近那家新的珍珠奶茶店現在非常受歡迎。"},{"w":"asleep","p":"adj.","d":"in a state of sleeping","c":"睡著的","s":"The baby finally fell asleep after her mother sang a soft song.","t":"媽媽唱了一首輕柔的歌之後，寶寶終於睡著了。"},{"w":"sleepy","p":"adj.","d":"feeling like you want to sleep","c":"想睡的","s":"He felt too sleepy to finish his homework after the long soccer practice.","t":"經過漫長的足球練習後，他覺得太想睡了，無法完成作業。"},{"w":"tired","p":"adj.","d":"needing rest because you used a lot of energy","c":"疲倦的","s":"After climbing all those stairs, my legs felt completely tired and weak.","t":"爬完那些樓梯之後，我的腿感覺非常疲倦無力。"},{"w":"total","p":"adj.","d":"complete; including everything","c":"全部的","s":"The total cost of the class trip was higher than the teacher expected.","t":"班遊的全部費用比老師預期的還高。"},{"w":"whole","p":"adj.","d":"complete; with no part missing","c":"完整的","s":"My little sister ate the whole cake before anyone else even got a slice.","t":"我妹妹在其他人吃到一片之前就把整個蛋糕吃光了。"},{"w":"helpful","p":"adj.","d":"willing or able to help","c":"有幫助的","s":"Our new classmate is always helpful when someone forgets their textbook.","t":"我們的新同學在有人忘記帶課本時總是很樂於幫忙。"},{"w":"useful","p":"adj.","d":"able to be used for something good","c":"有用的","s":"This dictionary app is really useful when I don't know a word's meaning.","t":"當我不知道一個單字的意思時，這個字典應用程式真的很有用。"},{"w":"broad","p":"adj.","d":"wide from one side to the other","c":"寬闊的","s":"The hiking trail crossed a broad river with a small wooden bridge.","t":"登山步道經過一條寬闊的河流，上面有一座小木橋。"},{"w":"wide","p":"adj.","d":"having a large distance between two sides","c":"寬的","s":"The new highway has a much wide road than the old one.","t":"新的高速公路比舊的那條路寬得多。"},{"w":"narrow","p":"adj.","d":"not wide","c":"窄的","s":"Our car barely fit through the narrow street near the old market.","t":"我們的車勉強才能通過舊市場附近那條窄窄的街道。"},{"w":"basic","p":"adj.","d":"simple and forming the starting point","c":"基本的","s":"Before learning grammar, students should master some basic vocabulary first.","t":"在學習文法之前，學生應該先掌握一些基本的單字。"},{"w":"common","p":"adj.","d":"happening often; not unusual","c":"普通的","s":"Forgetting an umbrella on a rainy day is a common mistake here.","t":"在這裡，下雨天忘記帶雨傘是一個常見的錯誤。"},{"w":"usual","p":"adj.","d":"happening most of the time; normal","c":"通常的","s":"He took his usual seat by the window before the bus left.","t":"公車出發前，他坐到了他平常坐的窗邊座位。"},{"w":"general","p":"adj.","d":"true for most people or things, not specific","c":"一般的","s":"The teacher gave a general introduction before explaining each topic in detail.","t":"老師在詳細解釋每個主題之前先做了一個大致的介紹。"},{"w":"ordinary","p":"adj.","d":"not special; normal","c":"平常的","s":"It seemed like an ordinary Monday until our teacher announced a surprise trip.","t":"原本看起來是個平凡的星期一，直到老師宣布了一個驚喜旅行。"},{"w":"regular","p":"adj.","d":"happening again and again at fixed times","c":"定期的","s":"My doctor said regular exercise would help me feel healthier and stronger.","t":"我的醫生說定期運動會讓我感覺更健康、更強壯。"},{"w":"rare","p":"adj.","d":"not common; not often found","c":"稀有的","s":"Snow is extremely rare in our city, so everyone got excited last winter.","t":"雪在我們城市非常罕見，所以去年冬天大家都很興奮。"},{"w":"special","p":"adj.","d":"different from what is normal, in a good way","c":"特別的","s":"Grandma always bakes something special for us on the first day of school.","t":"奶奶總是在開學第一天為我們烤一些特別的點心。"},{"w":"unique","p":"adj.","d":"the only one of its kind","c":"獨特的","s":"Every snowflake has a unique shape that no other snowflake shares exactly.","t":"每片雪花都有一個獨特的形狀，沒有其他雪花會完全一樣。"}]}];
